e innkeeper\'s daughter as he had suspected.'),(5000724,'<99 Billion Woman(99억의 여자)>In the 2nd round (overall 1st round), Kang Tae-woo (Kim Kang-woo) appears tied to a temporary cross.'),(5000725,'<99 Billion Women(99억의 여자)>In episode 1, Jung Se-yeon (Cho Yeo-jeong) comes to this hotel to secretly meet with Yoon Hee-joo\'s (Oh Na-ra) husband, Lee Jae-hoon (Lee Ji-hoon).'),(5000726,'<9th inning, 2 outs(9회말 2아웃)>In Episode 1, Hong Nanhee (played by Soo Ae) and Byun Hyuntae (played by Lee Jungjin) come to jog.'),(5000727,'<9 End 2 Outs(9회말 2아웃)>Hong Nan-hee (Soo Ae) and Byun Hyung-tae (Lee Jung-jin), who have been lifelong friends, promised to spend a special day together at this place before turning thirty. In Episode 1, Nan-hee discovers themselves at N Seoul Tower and tells Hyung-tae to marry her here.'),(5000728,'<9th Inning 2 Outs(9회말 2아웃)>In episode 21 (out of 11 episodes total), Kwon Woo-young (played by Kim Mi-soo) and Kim Min-jae (played by Han Jun-woo) meet outside the city council building and head to this cafe to join Ma-won Credit Cooperative.'),(5000729,'<9th inning, 2 outs(9회말 2아웃)>In the first inning, a scene where Hong Nanhee (played by Su Ae) sends Byun Hyeongtae (played by Lee Jeongjin) to this place appeared.'),(5000730,'<Episode 9, Final Inning, 2 Outs(9회말 2아웃)> After the game was interrupted, gangster Jang Deok-su (played by Heo Sung-tae) meets a acquaintance outside this amusement park.'),(5000731,'<TV Show(가면)>In the last 20 episodes, you can see Seo Eunha (Soo Ae) and Choi Minwoo (Ju Ji-hoon) with your daughter.'),(5000732,'<Photo(가면)>This is the swimming pool where Choi Min-woo (Joo Ji Hoon) came out as a fiancé Seo Eun-ha (So Eun) fell into the water.'),(5000733,'<Drama(가면)>In episode 9, Choi Min-woo (played by Ju Ji-hoon) brings Byun Ji-sook (played by Soo Ae) here. He explains to her how listening to the sound of the wind and the birds can clear one\'s mind, and asks about Ji-sook\'s future plans and dreams.'),(5000734,'<Mask(가면)> In episodes 5, In-young and Song Seol-hee (Park Jun-geum) have a meal.'),(5000736,'<Drama(가면)>Bae Ji-sook\'s (played by Soo Ae) mother was admitted here for a liver transplant surgery. In episode 17, she dies in front of Choi Mi-yeon (played by Uhm In-young) after being unable to receive the transplant in time due to her interference.'),(5000737,'<Drama(가면)>Appears as Kang Dong-ha\'s (played by Lee Hyun-jin) workplace in Episode 1.'),(5000738,'<Mask(가면)>Minwoo confesses that she feels guilty for her mother\'s death when crossing the river and cannot cross water since then. She suggests that they take one step at a time together and try.'),(5000739,'<Drama(가면)>In episode 14, Byeon Ji-sook (Soo Ae) and Choi Min-soo (Ju Ji-hoon) pass by this place while traveling to the outskirts of Seoul.'),(5000740,'<Drama(가면)>In episode 4, Beon Jisuk (Soo-ae) and Choi Minsu (Joo Jihun) come to take a walk.'),(5000741,'<Drama(가면)>Soon-to-be engaged Hwang Hee-tae (played by Lee Do-hyun) and Lee Soo-ryun (played by Geum Sae-rok) are led by their aunt (played by Kim Hyun) to go shopping.'),(5000742,'<Gossip Girl(가시리잇고)>I came to look for a evening date at 8 o\'clock, but I have to leave because it\'s a full moon, and soon disappears in front of her eyes.'),(5000743,'<Kashiriitgo(가시리잇고)>Min Yoo-jeong (Park Jeong-yeon) plays the harp at this location for a private event in episode 1.'),(5000744,'<The most common love(가장 보통의 연애)>The place where they ate sundae-guk in the movie \"The Most Common Love\"'),(5000745,'<The Most Ordinary Romance(가장 보통의 연애)>A meat restaurant where Gong Hyojin\'s refreshing revenge scene was filmed'),(5000746,'<The Most Ordinary Romance(가장 보통의 연애)>The filming location for a dinner scene in the movie \"The Most Ordinary Romance\"'),(5000747,'<The Most Ordinary Romance(가장 보통의 연애)>A pork belly barbecue restaurant where Kim Rae-won and Gong Hyo-jin tilt their soju glasses'),(5000748,'<The Most Ordinary Romance(가장 보통의 연애)>The house featured in the movie \"The Most Ordinary Roma