 her friends Choi Sookyung (Park Kyung Hye) and Do Jaejin (Kim Do Wan).'),(5000780,'<My Love, My Bride(간 떨어지는 동거)>It is a scene from the past life of Shin Woo-yeo (Jang Ki-yong) in the historical period.'),(5000781,'<Gap of Living Together(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 1, Shin Woo-yeo (Jang Ki-yong) drives down this road passing by Trade Tower and COEX.'),(5000782,'<Living Apart Together(간 떨어지는 동거)>In \"My Holo Love,\" Shin Woo-yeo (Yoon Hyun-min) drinks alone here in episode 1.'),(5000783,'<Roommate Separation(간 떨어지는 동거)>While looking for books at the bookstore, I coincidentally encountered a mysterious white man (special guest). He warns me to be careful of Go Kyung-pyo. Right at that moment, Shin Woo-yeo (Jang Ki-yong) appears but the man is nowhere to be seen.'),(5000784,'<Love with Flaws(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 1, Idam (Hyeri) appears at the \'SeoulTech\' campus where she is a university student.'),(5000785,'<Roommate is Falling(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 6, Lee Dam (Girls\' Day\'s Hyeri), Choi Soo-kyung (Pak Kyung-hye), and Do Jae-jin (Kim Do-wan) came here to have a meal to listen to a story about Lee Dam\'s blind date.'),(5000786,'<Living Together(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 13, Lee Dam tries to cut the \'red string\' connecting herself and Gye Seon-woo (played by Baek In-hyuk) by walking around this park. Suddenly, she moves to a different location and meets San Shin (played by Ko Gyeong-pyo).'),(5000787,'<\"Seperating Together\"(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 5, Eden (Hyeri) and Shinyou (Jang Ki Yong) discover a tent bar on this street, and Shinyou suggests they drink together and boost their spirits.'),(5000788,'<Love Alarm(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 15, Lee Dam (Hyeri of Girl’s Day) and Hwang Sun-oh (Jung Ga-ram) walk to the end of Wowasan-ro 35-gil, wondering what to eat.'),(5000789,'<Roommate is Falling in Love(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 4, Lee Dam (played by Girl\'s Day\'s Hyeri) and Choi Soo-kyung (played by Park Kyung-hye) meet at this cafe.'),(5000790,'<Gap Ddeol-eojineun Donggeo(간 떨어지는 