ong the Han River near this bridge.'),(5000799,'<A Love Triangle(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 1, Lee Daam (Girl\'s Day Hyeri), Choi Sookyung (Park Kyunghye), and Dojaejin (Kim Dowan) meet at a bar. They have dinner together and talk about Jaejin\'s story of his girlfriend cheating.'),(5000800,'<Gap Ddeolneun Donggeo(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 4, the rooftop of a shopping mall appears.'),(5000801,'<Live-in Lover(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 4, Deokmi (Girl\'s Day Hyeri) discovers Ryan (Jang Ki-yong) at this cafe. It is also a simulation date location from episode 3. Unable to hold back her emotions, Deokmi approaches and sits at his table, expressing her desire to communicate with Ryan comfortably like before.'),(5000802,'<A Sweet Morsel of Co-habitation(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 3, Dam (Girls\' Day Hye-ri) and Shin Woo-yeo (Jang Ki-yong) head to this café. Gae Seon-woo (Baek In-hyuk) followed behind them. When Sunwoo reaches out to Dam, Woo-yeo instinctively pulls him back to protect him.'),(5000803,'<Gapdong(간 떨어지는 동거)>The drama shows Shin Woo-yeo (played by Jang Ki-yong) and Kim Dam (played by Girl\'s Day Hye-ri) skipping school to go on an underground date.'),(5000804,'<Gap Ddeoreojineun Donggeo (A Sweet Home)(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 6, Lee Eun\'s mother (Oh Hyun-kyung) contacts Lee Eun (Girl\'s Day Hyeri) after arriving in the US.'),(5000805,'<Gap Dole Living Together(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 5, Lee Dam (Girl\'s Day Hyeri) and Shin Woo-yeo (Jang Ki-yong) walk along the tree-lined street.'),(5000806,'<A Love So Beautiful(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 1, Lee Dam (Hyeri) and Choi Su-kyung (Park Gyeong-hye) visit this place for a school project. They dress in hanbok and sit on the bridge in front of Kwanghanru to reenact a scene from a historical drama.'),(5000807,'< falling into temptation(간 떨어지는 동거)>In episode 1, Lee Dam (Hyeri of Girl\'s Day) discovers the drunk Jung Jae-jin (Kim Do-wan) passed out on a red Porsche located just outside this street photography studio.'),(5000808,'<Gap Ddeol-eo-neun 