n Lee Soo gets into a traffic accident.'),(5001064,'<Encounter(경우의 수)>In episode 5, Kwon Yeon (played by Shin Ye-eun) and Lee Soo (played by Wanna One\'s Ong Seong-wu) visit this cafe.'),(5001065,'<Drama(경우의 수)>In episodes 8, Gwak Eun (played by Shin Ye-eun) and Lee Soo (played by Wanna One\'s Ong Seong-wu) discuss the book \"Stories of Seoul\".'),(5001066,'<Event(경우의 수)>At this spot, Choi Soo (played by Ohn Seong-woo) will hold an exhibition for the final episode 16, where he finally reunites with Gooyeon (played by Shin Ye-eun).'),(5001067,'<Possibility(경우의 수)>In episode 10, Lee Suh (Wanna One\'s Ong Seong-wu) had dinner with his parents at this restaurant.'),(5001068,'<Case of You(경우의 수)>In episodes 9-10, after Lee Soo (Wanna One\'s Ong Seong-wu) and Jung Woo-yeon (Shin Ye-eun) complete their calligraphy and photo book in Seoul, Oh Jun-soo (ZE:A\'s Kim Dong-jun) invites the staff, including the two artists, to this restaurant in episode 10.'),(5001069,'<Scenario(경우의 수)>In Episode 1, prior to boarding a flight to the United States, Caseyeon (played by Shin Ye-eun) goes to the airport to see off Issu (played by Ong Seong-wu from Wanna One).'),(5001070,'<The Best Moment(경우의 수)>While on Jeju Island, Lee Su (Wanna One\'s Ong Seongwu) meets at this bookstore cafe.'),(5001071,'<Suspicion(경우의 수)>In \'Suspicion\', Goo Yeon (played by Shin Ye-eun) works part-time at this hostel for two weeks. This place is also where Lee Su (played by Ong Seong-wu) stayed while filming a pictorial in Jeju Island. The owner is a long-time friend of Lee Su.'),(5001072,'<possibility(경우의 수)>When Lee Su (Wanna One\'s Ong Seongwoo) and his companion Go Eun (Shin Ye-eun) went together, they inquired at the bookstore about exhibiting and selling their calligraphy postcards in episode 2.'),(5001073,'<Drama(경우의 수)>In the second to third year after the incident, Goo Seoyeon (Shin Ye Eun) and Lee Su (Ong Seongwu of Wanna One) meet on this hill while exploring Jeju Island by chance.'),(5001074,'<drama(경우의 수)>In episode 2, when Isu (Wanna One\'s Ong Seong-wu) sprains his ankle while traveling in Jeju, he appears at a place where he meets Hwaran (Shin Ye-eun).'),(5001075,'<Drama(경우의 수)>In the drama \"Bookstore Rumor,\" Koo Yeon (played by Shin Yeeun) inquired about selling her calligraphy postcards at a bookstore in episode 2, only to be caught by the rude owner. As she left, she ran into On Joonsoo (played by Kim Dongjoon of ZE:A). By chance, Koo saw one of her postcards on the floor being stepped on by the owner, so she went back into the store to retrieve it.'),(5001076,'<Cases(경우의 수)>In episodes 2 and 3, Isu (Ong Seong-wu) and Gyeo-yeon (Shin Ye-eun) visit the store. They leave Gyeo-yeon\'s calligraphy postcards at another bookstore for display.'),(5001077,'<Unknown(경우의 수)>In Episode 14 of the drama \"More Than Friends,\" (starring Shin Ye Eun), after breaking up with Lee Soo (from Wanna One), Lee Soo dumbly waits for the bus on her way to the bus stop. Unnoticed by her, On Jun Soo (played by Kim Dong Joon) follows her and comes to this place.'),(5001078,'<drama(경우의 수)>On the 100th day of dating, Gwageoyeon (played by Shin Ye-eun) breaks up with her boyfriend here and increases her ex-boyfriends to 12.'),(5001079,'<Amazing rumor(경이로운 소문)>It is known as the place where Choi Jang-mul (late Chang Cheol-jeong) came to offer condolences during the funeral of An Chang-hwan (late Ahn Seok-hwan), who was the representative of Gohyangmun.'),(5001080,'<Mysterious Rumors(경이로운 소문)>This is where Mayor Shin Myeong-hee (Choi Kwang-il) in episode 4 informs the press of Jinjin City\'s future development direction.'),(5001081,'<Incredible Rumors(경이로운 소문)>It frequently appears as the office of Jeon Taeshin Group Chairman, who is murdered by a devil in the drama.'),(5001082,'<Incredible Rumor(경이로운 소문)>In episode 7, Mayor Shin Myung-hwi (played by Choi Kwang-il) and Representative Kim Gwi-seon (played by Kim Gwi-seon) met at this restaurant.'),(5001083,'<Exciting Rumors(경이로운 소문)>In episode 11, Kamo Tak (Yoo Jun-sang) reminisces about 7 years ago when Detective So Gwon (Jeon Seok-ho) joined him at his table at this restaurant and told him about the relationship between Mayor Shin and Kim Young-nim.'),(5001084,'<Exciting Rumors(경이로운 소문)>In episode 1, close friends Cho Byeong-gyu, Im Ju-yeon, and Kim Woong-min pass by this house on their way to school.'),(5001085,'<Police lesson(경찰수업)>Appears as a pub \'Gosi Beer\' located near the police academy campus. It is popular among both students and faculty members at the academy.'),(5001086,'<Police Class(경찰수업)>In episode 1, Kang Seon-ho (played by B1A4\'s Jung Jin-young) and his two brothers Yoon Seung-beom (played by Choi Woo-sung) and Yoon Taek-il (played by Oh Man-seok) finish their meal and return home.'),(5001087,'<Police Class(경찰수업)>In episode 7, after attending Kang Hee\'s mother\'s trial, Oh Kang Hee (played by Jung Soo Jung) and Kang Sun Ho (played by Jung Jin Young) sit in this \'garden\' and have a heart-to-heart conversation.'),(5001088,'<Police Class(경찰수업)>In the drama, Yoo Dong-man (played by Cha Tae-hyun) finds traces of an illegal casino organization in the first episode and goes undercover here to gamble.'),(5001089,'<Police Training(경찰수업)>In episode 2, this is where Kang Sun-ho (formerly known as Jung Jin-young from B1A4) and his colleagues train for the entrance exam to the Police University.'),(5001090,'<Dae Jang Geum: Jang Geum\'s Dream(계룡선녀전)>In episode 1, Jung Ihyun (Yoon Hyunmin) and Kim Geum (Seo Jihoon) coincidentally meet Sun Oknam (Go Dusim/Moon Chaewon).'),(5001091,'<Kyeongryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In the final episode 16, Lee Hamsuk (played by Jeon Soojin) comes to buy a coat for Jung Ihyun (played by Yoon Hyunmin). She tells the clerk that it is extravagant but uncomfortable and embarrassing to wear in the countryside.'),(5001092,'<The Legend of Galyong Fairy(계룡선녀전)>I was a little surprised to learn that the publisher wants to publish her erotic novel after the \'Dotun Tiger\' article came out. The publisher contacted Geum after the \'Dotun Tiger\' article received a positive response, asking if they have any intention to do marketing activities.'),(5001093,'<Legend of the Kye-ryong Fairy(계룡선녀전)>In episode 3, three characters - Teacher Oh (played by Ahn Gil-sang), Mountain God/Magician Park (Kim Min-kyu), and Fairy Oh (Hwang Young-hee) - appear at \"Kye-ryong Station\".'),(5001094,'<Gyeryongseonyeojeon(계룡선녀전)>This pavilion appears as part of the fairy kingdom. The mountain god/magician Park (Kim Mingyu) is caught singing the fairy\'s serenade behind the back of other fairies and is banished to the human world by the owner of the North Star.'),(5001095,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>This is where Seo-oknam (played by Moon Chae-won) and her woodcutter husband lived in the human world.'),(5001096,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>This is where Mama Yeong and the Gyeryeong \'Fairy Cafe\' are located. In Episode 1, Jung Yi-hyun (Yoon Hyun-min) and Kim Geum (Seo Ji-hoon) accidentally discover a cafe hidden in the forest and meet Seon Ok-nam (Ko Du-sim/Moon Chae).'),(5001098,'<Legend of the Ghost Bride(계룡선녀전)>She comes to the academy to receive lessons in episode 12. She is so scared that she wants to skip class and leave school when she suddenly encounters Cho Bong-dae (Ahn Yeong-mi) during her school days.'),(5001099,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In episode 12, Um Kyung-sool (Yoo Jung-woo) leaves the academy and comes to this place. After being shocked by Jo Bong-dae (Ahn Young-mi), he eats sausages in the store. Kyung-sool screams and runs out to entertain Bong-dae.'),(5001100,'<Tale of Goryeo Shrine Maiden(계룡선녀전)>This is the background of the place where Jung Ihyun (played by Yoon Hyunmin) teaches and where Sun Oknam (played by Go Dusim/Moon Chaewon) works, the \"Mom Fairy and Woodcutter\" location at Eommayojeong and NaMuKkun. In episode 2, Oknam and her daughter Jeon Seom (played by Kang Mina of Gugudan) finish their hair appointment and walk towards the university entrance to return to the cafe.'),(5001101,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In episode 9, Jung Ihyun (Yoon Hyunmin) and Kim Geum (Seo Jihun) appear. At the request of the drunk Lee Hamsuk (Jeon Sujin), Geum buys cola. When the gruff Geum invites Sun Oknam (Moon Chaewon) without prior notice to Ihyun, Ihyun ignores it due to his feelings.'),(5001102,'<The Legend of Gyeoryong Fairy(계룡선녀전)>In episodes 7-8, Seon-ok Nam (played by Moon Chae-won) and Yi Ham-sook (played by Jeon Soo-jin) meet Kim Geum several times outside their house on their way to meet Yi Hyun.'),(5001104,'<Daejeon Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>Jeong I-hyeon (Yoon Hyeon-min) and Kim Geum (Seo Ji-hoon), who barely escaped after paying the bill for overeating in episode 3, seek refuge in this park.'),(5001105,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In episodes 2, Sunoknam (Ko Doo-sim) and her daughter Jeon Seom (Gugudan\'s Kang Mina) walk down this street with a curious gaze.'),(5001106,'<Lovers of the Red Sky(계룡선녀전)>In episode 11, Jinsun (former member of girl group Gugudan, Kang Mina) goes on a date overlooking Sebit Island. In the final episode 16, Kim Geum (Seo Ji-hoon) visits this place to meet Jinsun, who has finally maintained a human form by giving up eating meat. Gyeongsul approaches Jinsun and apologizes while buying sausages from a food truck. Kim Geum reunites with Sun-oknam (Moon Chae-won), who has returned from heaven to earth.'),(5001107,'<Korean Drama \"Gyeryong Fairy Tale\"(계룡선녀전)> In episode 14, Guseon (played by Ahn Gil-sang) and Mountain God/Park Magesu (played by Kim Min-gyu) wait for the train back to Gyeryong at this station.'),(5001108,'<Gyorong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In episode 3, the fairy observes people out of curiosity about how they live in the human realm and may not even know their own identity.'),(5001109,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In Episode 3, the trio of fairies Gusu-bu (Ahn Gil-sang), San-shin Park (Kim Min-gyu), and Oyojung (Hwang Young-hee) appear cheerfully at the station in a comedy of errors that has yet to be realized.'),(5001110,'<Gyeryong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>In episode 5, Gusabu (Ahn Gilsang), Mountain God/Wizard Park (Kim Mingyu), and Oyojeong (Hwang Yeonghee) come to \'Empathy Employment Empathy\' to find the husband of the trio fairy Oh (Jeon).'),(5001111,'<Gyeryong Fairytale(계룡선녀전)>This is where Jung Yi-hyun (Yoon Hyun-min) and Kim Geum (Seo Ji-hoon) attend the village party in episode 1.'),(5001112,'<Galyong Fairy Tale(계룡선녀전)>This pavilion appears in episode 4 when the head fairy informs the fairy\'s death.'),(5001113,'<Gyebaek(계백)>Main filming location of the drama'),(5001114,'<High School Three Kings(고교처세왕)>In episode 9, Lee Min-seok (played by Seo In-guk) and Jung Su-yeong (played by Lee Ha-na) head to Namiseom as their date spot.'),(5001115,'<High School Chosawang(고교처세왕)>In episode 13, the two siblings, Jung Soo-young (Lee Hana) and Jung Yu-ah (Lee Yeoraum), buy ice cream at this market and eat while waiting for the rain to stop. Later in the episode, Lee Min-seok (Seo In-guk) and Soo-young pass by this place when he takes her home at night.'),(5001116,'<High School Cheosewang(고교처세왕)>This is the high school that Im Siwan (Seo In-guk) attended.'),(5001117,'<Gobaek Couple(고백부부)>A street with the father\'s restaurant of Gohokjae (Yi Igyeong).'),(5001118,'<Confession Couple(고백부부)>The scene of the two new doppelgangers, Marginju (Jang Nara) and Choe Bando (Son Ho-jun), fighting at Sky Garden in Episode 12 is right here.'),(5001119,'<Confession Couple(고백부부)>This is the restaurant where Majinju (played by Jang Nara) and Choe Bando (played by Son Ho-jun) dined with their son and parents in the final episode 12 of the drama.'),(5001120,'< Confession Couple(고백부부)> This is the school where Chae Ban-do (Son Ho-jun) and Ma Jin-joo (Jang Na-ra) attended in the drama, appearing as \"Korea University\" after time traveling back to 1999.'),(5001121,'<Kobaek Couple(고백부부)> Son Ho-jun, who attended the time-travel themed show \"The Return o