lk.'),(5001251,'<Gu-kyung-i(구경이)> In episode 1, Na Je-hee (played by Kwak Seon-yeong) takes Gu-kyung-i (played by Lee Young-ae) from the apartment to this restaurant.'),(5001252,'<Kugyeong-i(구경이)>In episode 4, Kugyeong-i (played by Lee Young-ae) is shown spending time in a cafe.'),(5001253,'<Gukyeongyi(구경이)>In episode 7, Manager Kim (Jeong Seok-yong) comes to eat anchovy noodles and take-out food from the food cart.'),(5001254,'<TV show(구경이)>In episode 3, Geon-wook (Lee Hong-nae) meets his colleague Dae-ho (Park Kang-seop) here when he takes his dog for a walk. In episode 4, Santa (Baek Sung-chul) chases K/Song Yi-kyung (Kim Hye-jun) through this walking path.'),(5001255,'<The Great Show(구경이)>At this location, K (Song Yijung) is held hostage by Yongsook (Kim Hyesook) but the young girl eventually learns that once again K (Lee Youngae) has ruined her plans. The exterior building can be seen in the final 12th episode where K escapes from the auditorium and heads towards street level. Afterwards, Na Jehui (Kwak Sunyoung) and Oh Kyungsue (Cho Hyunsoo) rush to the scene upon hearing news of a bomb exploding.'),(5001256,'<Kyung-i(구경이)>While preventing sexual harasser Park Gyu-il (Shin Yoon-seob), her friend Geon-wook (Lee Hong-nae) works as a security office employee and eavesdrops on the system.'),(5001257,'<K-Myeongdong(구경이)>In episodes 4, Gugyeong (played by Lee Young-ae) and Santa (played by Baek Sung-chul) walk along this street following Yoon Ji-young (played by Park Ye-young) and granting the request of Ko Song-i (played by Kim Hye-jun).'),(5001258,'<TV Drama(구경이)>In episode 4 of \'Kugyong-i,\' Kugyong-i (played by Lee Young-ae) follows Yoon Jae-young (played by Park Ye-young) to this amusement park to fulfill a request from K/Song Yi-kyung (played by Kim Hye-jun).'),(5001259,'<Kyeong-i(구경이)>In episode 4, Kyeong-i (Lee Young-ae) and the rest of the Investigation Team B are shown staking out the exterior of the subway station.'),(5001260,'<Gugudan(구구단)>A hot spot in