light Drawn by Clouds(구르미 그린 달빛)>Teaser video location for Moonlight Drawn by Clouds'),(5001281,'<Gurumi Green Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)>A place trapped in a pitfall in Gurumi Green Moonlight'),(5001282,'<Gurumi Green Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)>Place where Cha Tae-hyun and Jo Yeo-jung made special appearances'),(5001283,'<Moonlight Drawn by Clouds(구르미 그린 달빛)>The favorite hiding place of Kim Yoon-sung (Jung Jin-young) is under the ancient pine tree at this location. It is also a place where he goes when he needs to think deeply, such as showing it to Hong Ra-on (Kim Yoo-jung) in episode 3 and visiting her to give her a gift in episode 7.'),(5001284,'<Love in the Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)>In the first teaser, Crown Prince Hyomyeong (Park Bo-gum) was filmed dancing a boom-bastic dance at this location.'),(5001285,'<Love in the Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)>In episode 2, eavesdrop on the conversation between the king (Park Bo-gum) and the court ladies.'),(5001286,'<Love in the Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)>In episode 1, Prince Hyomyeong (Park Bo-gum) pretends to study at the Yeongjugak in the Bongraeseom of this garden when his father the king passes by. In episode 5, Princess Myeong (Jung Hye-sung) asks Hong Ra-on (Kim Yoo-jung) to ride a boat on the lake in the garden. Prince Hyomyeong observes the scene and jumps into the water to save her when Ra-on falls into the lake.'),(5001287,'<Love in the Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)> The king\'s birthday celebration is held in episode 4. When soloist lead dancer Ae-shim (played by Chae Soo-bin) goes missing, Hong Ra-on (played by Kim Yoo-jung) steps in to save the celebration and ultimately Prince Lee Yeong/Hyomyung (played by Park Bo-gum) falls under a spell.'),(5001288,'<Love in the Moonlight(구르미 그린 달빛)>It appears as part of a drama background.'),(5001289,'<Moonlight Drawn by Clouds(구르미 그린 달빛)>In episode 1, there is a scene where young Jung Jiwon (Ko Won-rim) chases after young Damyi (Choi Myung-bin) right in front of the library.'),(5001290,'< \"Moonlight Drawn by Clouds\"(구르미 그린 달빛)>It appeared as the dating place for Lee Young (played by Park Bo-gum) and Hong Ra-on (played by Kim Yoo-jung) in episode 19.'),(5001291,'<Moonlight Drawn by Clouds(구르미 그린 달빛)>In \"Moonlight Drawn by Clouds,\" Lee Young/Hyomyeong Crown Prince (Park Bo-gum) meets Jung Yak-yong (Park Bo-gum).'),(5001292,'<Gumi Hodyeon(구미호뎐)>In episode 1, Yi-yeon (played by Lee Dong-wook) watches families spending time together on the benches at this park, while contemplating about first love. He takes out a balloon for a young girl and sits on a bench with the cute and cheeky Kim Soo-oh (played by Jung Si-yul), who questions Yi-yeon\'s life choices of wanting to become friends. In episode 14, Pyo Jae-hwan (played by Kim Kang-min) and Kim Sae-rom (played by Jung Yi-seo) meet at the park to celebrate her birthday, bringing her a bouquet of dahlia flowers and a cake, quickly noticing a rash on her neck.'),(5001293,'<Gumiho Tale(구미호뎐)>A drama inspired by Venice.'),(5001294,'<Gumiho Tale(구미호뎐)>In episode 5, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) and Nam Ji Ah (Jo Bo Ah) talk about things they like and prefer more than beer.'),(5001295,'<Gumiho Chronicles(구미호뎐)>In episode 11, Gumiho Lee Rang (played by Kim Beom) invites Yi Yeon (played by Lee Dong Wook) to this place to have coffee. As Yi Yeon becomes addicted to the coffee and loses consciousness, Kwon Hae-Ryong (played by Uhm Hyo-Seop) watches everything through a camera connected to his car parked in the parking lot.'),(5001296,'<Gumiho Chronicles(구미호뎐)>In \"Gumiho Chronicles,\" Yiyeon (played by Lee Dong-wook) takes Namjia (played by Jo Bo-ah) to Baekdusan, which was ruled by the mountain deity and wind god 600 years ago when it was the mountain of the mountain gods. This is the place where the story of Yeon and Aum begins and ends. When they arrive at this waterfall, the story transforms into many myths of betrayal in past lives, and love and loss related to the waterfall. In the latter part of the episode, we see Yeon leaving a rhododendron branch for his brother, which seems to have been the real reason for the journey.'),(5001297,'<Gumiho Chronicles(구미호뎐)>In episode 5, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong-wook) and Nam Ji-ah (Jo Bo-ah) visit the Korean Folk Village together. Ji-ah, who sees hanbok (traditional Korean clothing) in a store, decides to wear it. When Yeon finds her and sees Ji-ah in hanbok, it triggers a memory of his past with Ah-eum. He notices that she\'s standing on a wooden bridge and runs towards her to kiss her.'),(5001298,'<Gumiho Tale(구미호뎐)>In episode 2, after Lee Yeon\'s (Lee Dong-wook) first love leaves the world, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong-wook) sets out to find her reincarnation for centuries. And in this park, he sees someone who resembles her but is disappointed again.'),(5001299,'<Gumiho\'s Tale(구미호뎐)>A man who lost his parents in a bus accident caused by Ilrang (Kim Beom) in the second episode flashbacks meets him at a wishing well after failing at coin tossing.'),(5001300,'<Gumiho\'s Lament(구미호뎐)>Irang (played by Kim Beom) and Giyuri (played by Kim Yong-ji) attend the funeral of two people who died in a bus accident.'),(5001301,'<The Tale of Gumiho(구미호뎐)>In episodes 1 and 2 of The Tale of Gumiho, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) and Nam Ji Ah (Jo Bo Ah) arrive at Haegumgang Village (renamed as \'Eohwado\') by boat.'),(5001302,'<Gumiho Chronicles(구미호뎐)>In the second episode, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong-wook) and Nam Ji-ah (Jo Bo-ah) travel to \'Eohwa Island\' to investigate the mystery of the severed head found by a fisherman. Ji-ah is also looking for answers as to why her parents visited this island before she was born, carrying photos of her parents in front of a sea cave. In the forest, they encounter forgotten spirits and Ji-ah hears that she will find her answers in a cave on the north side of the island where they discover the Jangsan Temple cave. Ji-ah realizes that the cave is the same as in the old photos.'),(5001303,'<Gumiho Chronicles(구미호뎐)> Nine-year-old Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) from the ninth tail comes to this wedding venue to chase after a nine-tailed fox (Lee Jung Min) who is about to get married. Meanwhile, Nam Ji Ah (played by Jo Bo Ah) arrives at this place for a story and recognizes Yeon when she walks down the hallway.'),(5001304,'<Gumiho Yeondan(구미호뎐)>In episode 5, the wicked Gumiho Lee Rang (played by Kim Bum) visited the Breitling boutique (referred to as \'Brenattano\') to purchase an expensive watch in order to enjoy the pleasures of long earthly life.'),(5001305,'<Gumiho: Tale of the Fox\'s Child(구미호뎐)>In episodes 5 and 8, \'Woojin University Hospital\' is shown, and Nam Ji-ah (Jo Bo-ah) meets Yi Yeon (Lee Dong) here.'),(5001306,'<Kumiho Biography(구미호뎐)>The university featured in episode 5.'),(5001307,'<Gumiho\'s Whispers(구미호뎐)>In episode 4, Lee Yeon (played by Lee Dong Wook) was shown engaging in a showdown on the rooftop with his younger brother Lee Rang (played by Kim Bum).'),(5001308,'<Tale of the Nine-Tailed(구미호뎐)>In episode 2, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) wants to forever part ways with Nam Ji Ah (Jo Bo Ah) but in front of the building, he wants to introduce her to his world.'),(5001309,'<Gumiho Tale(구미호뎐)>In episode 14, Ki Yuri (Kim Yongji) asks detective Baek Siu (Jang Wonhyeong) to meet at this children\'s park. He is heartbroken to realize that she used him as bait.'),(5001310,'<Gumiho: The Tale of the Fox\'s Child(구미호뎐)>In episode 15, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) and Nam Ji Ah (Jo Bo Ah) plan to meet at the park and have a date like a normal couple. To become the perfect boyfriend, Yeon walks Ji Ah on the street to protect her. Later, they test their skills at the game arcade and eat ice cream.'),(5001311,'<Gumiho: Tale of the Fox\'s Child(구미호뎐)>In episode 15, Lee Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) and Nam Ji Ah (Jo Bo Ah) finish their date by sitting in the Han River Park next to the bridge. They hope that the final battle with the wicked Imugi will be in their favor and promise to wait for each other in their next lives if something happens.'),(5001312,'<Gumiho Myth(구미호뎐)> I will go to this place, which is marked as \'Myeose Churibguk Management Office\' in Episode 1.'),(5001313,'<Gumiho\'s Story(구미호뎐)>Lee Yeon (played by Lee Dong-wook) is a regular at this teahouse, known for his role in \'Tale of the Nine-Tailed\'. In episode 1, he eats traditional lunch boxes here and visits this place with his close friend and colleague, the gumiho spirit, Gu Shin-joo (played by Hwang Hee). The owner, Bok Hye-ja (played by Kim Soo-jin), warns him to be careful around the crime drama director, Nam Ji-ah (played by Jo Bo-ah).'),(5001314,'<Nine-tailed fox(구미호뎐)>In episode 14, Nam Jia (Nam Boa) and Lee Yeon (Lee Dong Wook) have a meal at this pork belly restaurant at night before their final showdown to kill Lee Rang.'),(5001315,'<Korean Drama(구여친클럽)>In episode 5, Jang Hwa-yeong (Lee Yoon-ji), Na Jia (Jang Ji-eun), and Lara (Ryu Hwa-yeong) all imagine different possibilities for the meeting between Bang Myeong-soo (Byun Yo-han) and Kim Soo-jin (Song Ji-hyo). All these fantasies unfold in this rural area.'),(5001316,'<Kugye Chun Club(구여친클럽)>When Kim Soo-jin (played by Song Ji-hyo) visits Naja (played by Jang Ji-eun) at this hospital, she discovers that she is a colleague too close to Bang Myung-soo (played by Byun Yo-han) in episode 9. When she leaves the place and is stopped by Myung-soo outside the hospital, he asks her who she really loves, and she answers with a kiss.'),(5001317,'<Kuyeo Chin Club(구여친클럽)>This park is where the secret meeting spot is near Seongsan Bridge of the river where Byun Yo-han\'s character Bang Myung-soo and Song Ji-hyo\'s character Kim Soo-jin regularly have heart-to-heart conversations. It is also the place where Myung-soo confesses his love to Soo-jin, and where they kiss by the end of episode 12.'),(5001318,'<Goyeochin Club(구여친클럽)>This is where Najia (played by Jang Ji-eun) works, just like in episode 1.'),(5001319,'<Couple Club(구여친클럽)>In episode 7, Bae Myung-soo (Byun Yo-han) promises to confess his feelings for Kim Soo-jin (Song Ji-hyo) to Do Sang-woo (Jo Kwon) at this café.'),(5001320,'<Kuyeocheon Club(구여친클럽)>A bar where Bang Myeong-su (Byun Yo-han) from 7th Avenue finds a drunken Jang Hwa-yeong (Lee Yoon-ji). He finally succeeds in persuading her to stop drinking and sending her home.'),(5001321,'<Girlfriend Club(구여친클럽)>In episode 11, Lara (Ryu Hwayoung) films at this park.'),(5001322,'<Kyuyeon Club(구여친클럽)>When it starts raining, Bangmyeong-soo (Byun Yo-han) recalls the moment when he waited for a bus with Kim Soo-jin (Song Ji-hyo) under the rain at this bus stop bench without taking the bus.'),(5001323,'<Guye Chingu Club(구여친클럽)>In the drama, the current CEO of Hemia Group Kang Hyeon-cheol (played by Park Yeong-gyu) crosses this bridge in episode 2. In the final episode 16, Kang Min-ho (played by Jung Kyung-ho) drives across this bridge.'),(5001324,'<Gooyeo-chin Club(구여친클럽)>This museum appears as the home of Bang Myung-soo (Byun Yo-han) in episode 2.'),(5001325,'<Guye Chink Club(구여친클럽)>In episode 7, Bang Myung-soo (played by Byun Yo-han) finds Jang Hwa-young (played by Lee Yoon-ji) drunk and takes her home.'),(5001326,'<Girlfriend Club(구여친클럽)>In episode 8, Kim Soo-jin (played by Song Ji-hyo) was depicted stopping on this street to take a picture.'),(5001327,'<Guye Chic Club(구여친클럽)>It appears as Jang Hwa-young\'s (Lee Yoon-ji) workplace \'Oz Corporation Investment\'. For example, in episode 4, you can see Bang Myung-soo (Byun Yo-han) looking for her.'),(5001328,'<Find me(구해줘)>One of the restaurants where Han Sang-hwan (Ok Taecyeon) and his friends go to.'),(5001329,'<find(구해줘)>A place where Han Sang-hwan (played by Ok Taecyeon) and his friends go to watch bullfighting in the first episode. It is referred to as the \"unmanned bullfighting arena.\"'),(5001330,'<For the people of the nation!(국민 여러분!)> A motel with Yang Sichul hidden in it'),(5001331,'<National People!(국민 여러분!)>In the 15th episode, Sangjin publicly reveals his motivation to run for Congress and inspires Jung-guk.'),(5001332,'<National Audience!(국민 여러분!)>In episodes 19/20, the various members of the Yangjeonguk (played by Choi Siwon) team come here to campaign for him. Charles (played by Yang Donggeun) conducts a prize event that actually violates election laws, and Kim Miyoung (played by Lee Yoo Young) gives a speech. She eventually discovers a pickpocket in the crowd and chases him down.'),(5001333,'<People of the nation!(국민 여러분!)>Yang Jeong-guk (played by Choi Si-won), who bought coffee at this cafe, curses schemer Gang Hyeon-tae (played by Jung Seong-ho) and Kim Mi-young (played by Lee Yoo-young) for their marriage in Episode 2.'),(5001334,'<People of the country!(국민 여러분!)>After overpowering Miyoung\'s playboy and throwing a pair of shoes across the room, Jungkook finally closes his eyes after hitting his neck for the first time.'),(5001335,'<The people of the nation!(국민 여러분!)>In episode 6, Yang Jung-gook (played by Choi Si-won) comes to Kim Mi-young (played by Lee Yoo-young) in an attempt to harm her, in order to give a piece of his heart to her after being kidnapped.'),(5001336,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)>In episodes 21 and 22, Parkhooja (played by Kim Minjeong) invites Yangjeonguk (played by Choi Siwon) to this restaurant for a meal (ribeye steak and octopus salad, as described by the hotel). When Jungkook expresses discomfort with Hooja being too \'considerate\', she straightforwardly tells him that she would like him to change his attitude and stop interfering in the by-election for the National Assembly.'),(5001337,'<People of the nation!(국민 여러분!)>Kim Mi-young (Lee Yoo-young) and her team guard this sauna (appearing as \'Wolchul Sauna\') to catch Oh Sung-taek, a collaborator of Park Hu-ja (Kim Min-jung).'),(5001338,'<Korean people!(국민 여러분!)>Han Sang-jin (Taehin-ho) will hold a press conference to expose the fact that the latter forged his university qualifications.'),(5001339,'<Citizens!(국민 여러분!)>Paying respects at the 12th memorial service at the War Memorial (Hyunchungtab).'),(5001340,'<Everyone, citizens!(국민 여러분!)>A place where Detective Lee (played by Choi Dae-cheol), who receives bribes from Park Hu-ja (played by Kim Min-jung) he met at the real estate site, confesses to being the mole of the team.'),(5001341,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)>Knowing that Park Hoo-ja (Kim Min-jeong) and her younger sister Park Gwi-nam (Ahn Eun-jin) were urgently dragged to Yangjeong-guk (Choi Si-won), they headed to this building.'),(5001342,'<KBS(국민 여러분!)>In the drama \"National Folk Village,\" Park Hu-ja (Kim Min-jeong) meets Congressman Kim Joo-myung (Kim Ui-sung) for the first time here in episode 8, and returns to this place in episode 13 to meet Congressman Kim or wallow in sadness alone.'),(5001343,'<KBS(국민 여러분!)>National star! Businessman Yang Jung-guk (played by Choi Si-won) pretending to work in Venezuela meets Chairman Park Sang-pil (played by Kim Jong-gu) here to discuss financial transactions. After the deal is done, one of Chairman Park\'s subordinates arrives at the bar to tell him that he was cheated out of millions of dollars.'),(5001344,'<People of the nation!(국민 여러분!)>They are almost unaware of the fact that Jungkook is watching from across the street. An elderly couple who answered Jungkook\'s phone call enter the subway station and detectives chase after them.'),(5001345,'<Citizens of the Nation!(국민 여러분!)>In episode 8, Yang Jung-guk (played by Choi Siwon) watches over elderly buyers waiting on this street as the Intelligence Crime Team monitors from the restaurant on the 2nd floor. After receiving a call from Jung-guk about the whereabouts, Kim Mi-young (played by Lee Yoo-young) the elderly buyer answers the phone and starts to head in a different direction than planned. Mi-young and her partner also follow behind.'),(5001346,'<Hey, everyone!(국민 여러분!)>This is where you can find the \'One Day Bar\' at the Department of Chemical Engineering, Sejin University in Episode 2.'),(5001347,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)> In episode 7, Jungkook comes to this place with his fellow swindlers Charles (Yang Dong-geun) and Hwang Seung-i (Lee Joo-myeong) to convince them to help with his campaign.'),(5001348,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)>Miyeong at the station realizes that the documents she was holding when the buyer first entered are no longer there. She approaches him and is shocked to learn that he had already signed the contract the day before.'),(5001349,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)>In episode 19, you can see Yang Jung-guk (Choi Siwon) and Charles (Yang Dong-geun) jogging in the background.'),(5001350,'<People of the country!(국민 여러분!)>Kim Joo-myeong (played by Kim Eui-sung) eats with his friend who is a member of the National Assembly at this place in episode 21. Joo-myeong makes a pointed remark about it.'),(5001351,'<Hey, citizens of Korea!(국민 여러분!)>While Yang Jeong-guk (played by Choi Si-won) is on the phone with Charles (played by Yang Dong-geun), Choi Pil-joo (played by Heo Jae-ho), the bodyguard of Park Hoo-ja (played by Kim Min-jung), is about to cross this bridge from the opposite end and attempt to hit him with a hammer from behind.'),(5001352,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)>In episode 9, Jungkook parks on the street and steps outside of the building to call Charles (played by Yang Dong-geun) to inform him about his situation.'),(5001353,'<National people!(국민 여러분!)>In the first scam, Yang Jung-guk (Choi Siwon)\'s girlfriend Yoo Hee-jin (Im Ji-hyun) deceived him and headed to the airport to flee overseas after tricking him with a marriage proposal ring.'),(5001354,'<Dear citizens!(국민 여러분!)>Yang Jeong-guk (Choi Si-won) comes to this building to confront Sung Dae-cheol, who was scammed in episode 26 of Real Estate Fraud.'),(5001355,'<Military Prosecutor Doberman(군검사 도베르만)> Cha Woo-in (Jo Bo-ah) drives down this road while heading to the military base in Episode 1.'),(5001356,'<Military prosecutor Do Beom-man(군검사 도베르만)>In episode 6, No Tae-nam (played by Kim Woo-seok) arrives at the air