in-seong (Kim Bum) and Moon Hee-sun (Jung Eun-ji) who deliver flowers.'),(5001435,'<The winter wind blows(그 겨울, 바람이 분다)>O Young (Song Hye-kyo) comes to this cafe'),(5001436,'<When the Winter Wind Blows(그 겨울, 바람이 분다)>In episode 2, So Yong (played by Song Hye Kyo), a visually impaired friend of Oh Young, convinces Osu (played by Jo In Sung) to take care of her. While he buys a necklace for Young, she waits for Mira and is pushed to the ground by her angry mother. While struggling to find her cane, she barely gets up and falls into the fountain at this department store. This is where the rescue team is coming for her.'),(5001437,'<That Winter, the Wind Blows(그 겨울, 바람이 분다)>In episode 5, Myung-ho (played by Kim Young-hoon) comes here to meet Mu-cheol (played by Kim Tae-woo) in order to find Osu (played by Jo In-sung).'),(5001438,'<The Wind Blows in That Winter(그 겨울, 바람이 분다)>In the drama, the character Oh Young (Song Hye-kyo) meets Oh Soo (Lee Jae-woo) at this location, where he also encounters the gambler Oh Soo (Jo In-sung).'),(5001439,'<The Way of Memory(그 남자의 기억법)> Fan signing event of Yuri Han (Moon Ga-young) will be held at episode 12.'),(5001440,'<The man\'s memory(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 6, Lee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Dong-wook) accompanies Yeo Ha-jin (played by Moon Ga-young) to \'Sujeongdae Hospital\' and sees his father coming out of the building by coincidence. He follows him into the connected funeral home and is deeply shocked when he sees a portrait of his mother\'s funeral in one of the rooms.'),(5001441,'<That Man\'s Memory(그 남자의 기억법)>After finishing filming, Yeon Ha-jin (Moon Ga-young) waits for her sister and manager Ha Kyung (Kim Seul-gi) to come pick her up with the company director.'),(5001442,'<That Guy\'s Memory(그 남자의 기억법)>Lee Jung-hoon (Kim Dong-wook), Yeo Ha-jin (Moon Ga-young), and Yoo Tae-eun (Yoon Jong-hoon) awkwardly have lunch together in episode 11 they met at the broadcasting station.'),(5001443,'<The Way of Remembering Him(그 남자의 기억법)>In ep