ung (Kim Seul-gi), came to this park when they played hooky during high school while reading the common diaries of girl students.'),(5001454,'<Memory of that Man(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 6 (out of total 3 episodes), Yeo Ha-jin (Moon Ga-young) and Yeo Ha-kyung (Kim Seul-gi) climb to this observatory to see this night view when Ha-jin can\'t sleep.'),(5001455,'<The Guy\'s Memory(그 남자의 기억법)>This building appears as the office of the artist Yeohajin (Moongayoung) affiliated with the agency Angelo'),(5001456,'<The Way He Remembers(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 5 of \"The Way He Remembers,\" Yeo Hajiin (played by Moon Ga) reads Yeo Hagyeong\'s (played by Kim Seulgi) diary. While reminiscing about their high school days, they take a bus with Jeong Seoyeon (played by Lee Joobin) at this bus stop. \"The Way He Remembers\" (MBC, 2020) Episode 3.'),(5001457,'<That Man\'s Memory(그 남자의 기억법)> In episode 9 (total of 5 episodes), Lee Jeong-hoon (Kim Dong-wook) walks down this alley to investigate the stalker photo sent by him.'),(5001458,'<drama(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 9 of \"That Man\'s Memory,\" Lee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Dong-wook) passes by this place.'),(5001459,'<The Way to the House of That Man(그 남자의 기억법)>When it starts snowing and Jung-hoon suddenly parks his car in front of the stairs. He asks Ha-jin to take the bus home and they both ask her if she knows about his ex-girlfriend, to which she denies.'),(5001460,'<That Man\'s Memory Method(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 6 (out of 3 total episodes), Yeo-hajin (Moon Gayoung) and Lee Junghoon (Kim Dongwook) meet at this cafe on the 2nd floor.'),(5001461,'<That Memory of Him(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 6, Lee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Dong-wook) and Yeo Ha-jin (played by Moon Ga-young) walk down the alley next to this building after finishing dinner with the production team. Ha-jin, drunk, kisses Jung-hoon and he later tells her that she will regret putting a rift between them.'),(5001462,'<Memories of that Man(그 남자의 기억법)>After finishing a visit with inmate Moon Sung-ho (Joo Seung-tae), Lee Jung-hoon (Kim Dong-wook) comes out of this bridge and sighs in relief, and in episode 9 he calls Yeo Ha-jin (Moon Ga-young).'),(5001463,'<\"That Man\'s Memory\"(그 남자의 기억법)> This is where Yeo Hajin (played by Moon Gayoung) lives.'),(5001464,'<The Way of Memory(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 31 (total 16 episodes) Ha Kyung (Kim Seul-gi) came to this cafe with Yeohagyeong to meet her boss from the agency.'),(5001465,'<The Guy\'s Memory Method(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 2, Director Choi (Jang Young-nam) arranged for Yeo-ha Jin (Moon Ga-young) and Lee Jung-hoon (Kim Dong-wook) to meet at this pub.'),(5001466,'<\"That Man\'s Memory Method\"(그 남자의 기억법)>In the final episode 32 (out of 16 total episodes), they walk along Cheonggyecheon for a late-night date.'),(5001467,'<The Way of Memory of That Man(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 31 (out of 16 total episodes), Yeoha-jin (Moon Ga-young) is approached by a passing couple who ask if she is actress Yeoha-jin. She denies it, saying that many people have mistaken her for being the same person because they look alike.'),(5001468,'<That Man\'s Memory(그 남자의 기억법)>Yeo Ha-jin (played by Moon Ga-young) heads out to the street after meeting at the bookstore.'),(5001469,'<That Man\'s Memory(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 31 (out of 16 episodes total), Lee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Dong-wook) and Yeo Ha-jin (played by Moon Ga-young) coincidentally bump into each other at this bookstore.'),(5001470,'<The way she remembers(그 남자의 기억법)>In the final episode 32, Lee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Dong-wook) and Yeo Ha-jin (played by Moon Ga-young) come here for a date, and she asks him for his opinion on which movie project she should choose next.'),(5001471,'<The Way He Remembers(그 남자의 기억법)>Episode 9 \nLee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Dong-wook) and Yeo Ha-jin (played by Moon Ga-young) stroll down this street, with the cherry blossom trees lit up.'),(5001472,'<The Way He Remembers(그 남자의 기억법)>In episode 12 (out of 6), Lee Jung-hoon (played by Kim Do