ng complex in order to catch the bus she was taking to work.'),(5001507,'<In that year, we(그 해 우리는)>In episode 3, Gukyeonsoo (Kim Da-mi) carries a drunk Choi Woong (Choi Woo-shik) and comes down this alley. In episode 5, Choi Woong and Kim Ji-woong (Kim Sung-chul) ride bicycles here. Additionally, in episode 16, this alley leads to the place where Choi Woong first confesses his love to Gukyeonsoo.'),(5001508,'<We are(그 해 우리는)>In front of this grocery store, where Guksu (played by Kim Da-mi) surprises Choi Woong (played by Choi Woo-shik) by pouring cherry blossom petals all over him to make up for not going to see the cherry blossoms together on a date.\''),(5001509,'<In that year(그 해 우리는)>In episode 3, the creative agency RUN is introduced as having their office in the \'Super Creative Center\'.'),(5001510,'<In That Year, We(그 해 우리는)>appeared in the drama as a neighborhood street.'),(5001511,'<That year we(그 해 우리는)>In episode 1, a part of the school was filmed as Choi Woong (Choi Woo-sik) and Kook Yeon-soo\'s (Kim Da-mi) high school.'),(5001512,'<We are in that year(그 해 우리는)>In the scene where Yeonsu waits for her grandmother to walk home in front of this place in the 6th episode, the first moment is shown recalling.'),(5001513,'<On that year we(그 해 우리는)>Choi Woong (Choi Woo-shik) and Guk Yeon-soo (Kim Da-mi) had a dinner date here.'),(5001514,'<Instagram(그 해 우리는)>The café and restaurant where Choi Woosik and Kim Dami ate steak that year'),(5001515,'<We Are the Champions(그 해 우리는)>The restaurant operated by Choi Woong\'s (Choi Woo-shik) parents appears in episode 1.'),(5001516,'<We Were(그 해 우리는)>In episode 1, Choi Woong (Choi Woosik) rides a scooter and passes by this street in front of a hardware store in Seoul.'),(5001517,'<We Are(그 해 우리는)>A university where Choi Woosik and Kim Dami enjoyed a campus date'),(5001518,'<그 해 우리는(그 해 우리는)> <That year we were'),(5001519,'<On that year, we(그 해 우리는)>filmed part of the documentary with Gu Yeon-su (Kim Da-mi) next to this abandoned farm.'),(5001520,'<That summer we(그 해 우리는)>Beautiful barley field where Choi Woo-sik and Kim Da-mi kissed'),(5001521,'<We(그 해 우리는)>While on a one-night trip to continue filming a documentary about life, Kim Dami (Guk Yeonsu) and her high school friend and PD Kim Jiwung (Kim Seongcheol) embark on a bicycle trip and come to this village. He films her riding a bicycle first to take a rest on a bench under the eucalyptus tree in this village.'),(5001522,'<A Lilac Left There(그곳에 두고 온 라일락)>La Sin-hye (played by Jung Yoo-min) works as a docent at this gallery.'),(5001523,'<Man of Men(그남자 오수)>This is where Osu (CNBLUE\'s Jonghyun) lives with his grandfather Oman-soo (Park Geun-hyung).'),(5001524,'<That Man Oh Soo(그남자 오수)>In episode 5, Oh Soo (played by CNBLUE\'s Lee JongHyun) and Yoo Ri (played by Kim So-eun) pass by this flower shop at night. Yoo Ri stops on the street and tends to a plant with a scarf on it in a flowerpot.'),(5001525,'<Just Between Lovers(그냥 사랑하는 사이)>Han Mu-su (Won Jin-ah) and Lee Kang-doo (Lee Jun-ho) meet in front of this museum for their final date.'),(5001526,'<She loves lies too much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>This is where Kang In-woo (Choi Min-soo) and Yoo Hyun-jung (Park Ji-young) make a phone call to meet in episode 16.'),(5001527,'<She Loves Lies Too Much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>The graffiti tunnel appeared as one of the background settings where Yoon Soo-rim (Red Velvet\'s Joy) called out to Kang Han-gyeol (Lee Hyun-woo) while searching for Yeowoo.'),(5001528,'<She Loves Lies Too Much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>In episode 1, Yoon Solim (Joy) falls in love at first sight with Kang Han-gyeol (Lee Hyun-woo) in front of this complex. In episode 2, she returns to this place with her band, hoping to meet him again.'),(5001529,'<She Loves Lies Too Much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>This is a direct question asked by Kang Hanyul (Lee Hyunwoo) to Yoon Solim (Joy) when he catches up with her in episode 2. He only focused on the fact that she had a recording of his song and requested her number to convince her to delete it in a short period of time. He replied, \"Because I believe in love at first sight,\" and so their relationship began with lies.'),(5001530,'<She loves lying too much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>It is the venue where the concert of Mush & Co. and Crude Play will be held in the final episode 16.'),(5001531,'<She Loves Lies Too Much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>Appearing as the imaginary \'Happy Fruits,\' it is the grandmother\'s store of Yoon So-rim.'),(5001532,'<She loves lies too much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>Mush&Co attended this school.'),(5001533,'<She Loves Lies Too Much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>In episodes 9 and 10, after Yoon Soo-rim (Park Soo-young) debuts at the MUSH&Co showcase, she chases after Kang Han-gyeol (Lee Hyun-woo) who confesses his feelings for her on this bridge.'),(5001534,'<She loves lying too much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>In episode 2, Kang Han-gyeol (Lee Hyun-woo) and Yoon Soo-rim (Joy) met at this shopping mall.'),(5001535,'<She loves lies too much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>Cafe background where Yoon Su-rim (Joy) happily informed Kang Han-gyeol (Lee Hyun-woo) about being scouted by Solo N Music Agency in episode 5.'),(5001536,'<She Loves Lying Too Much(그녀는 거짓말을 너무 사랑해)>In episode 3, this place appears as \'Soln Music Studio\' in the drama.'),(5001537,'<She Was Beautiful(그녀는 예뻤다)>The place where Hwang Jung-eum and Park Seo-joon drank tea in the drama.'),(5001538,'<She Was Pretty(그녀는 예뻤다)>The place where Park Seo-joon and Hwang Jung-eum went on a business trip together'),(5001539,'<She Was Pretty(그녀는 예뻤다)>This is where Hwang Jung-eum, Choi Siwon, and Park Seo-joon drank beer.'),(5001540,'<She Was Pretty(그녀는 예뻤다)>In the final episode 16, Kim Hye Jin (Hwang Jung Eum) and Ji Sung Joon (Park Seo Joon) go on a picnic to this garden.'),(5001541,'<She was Pretty(그녀는 예뻤다)>Filming location for Hwang Jung-eum and Park Seo-joon\'s kiss scene'),(5001542,'<She was pretty(그녀는 예뻤다)>After finishing a picnic in episodes 13 and 14, Jiseongjun (Park Seo-joon) confesses his etern