은 날)> 1416th episode of a black pig restaurant on a Feel-Good Day'),(5001764,'<On a Pleasant Day(기분좋은 날)>A famous garlic dish restaurant with 2750 positive reviews'),(5001765,'<happy day(기분좋은 날)>famous for So-mae-ri pork bone soup and delicious food'),(5001766,'<Happy day(기분좋은 날)>Popular restaurant for garlic dishes'),(5001767,'<People of the Weather: Cruel History of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 1, when deciding whether to announce heavy rain forecast for the capital region, Jin Ha-kyung (played by Park Min-young) zooms in on the map to check for areas with possible heavy rain.'),(5001768,'<People of KMA: Cruel Romance of Office Workers(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 3, Lee Si-woo (Song Kang) crosses this street between the Na Hyun Building and Best Western Cheongdam on his way to work.'),(5001769,'<Weather People: Cruel History of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 7, Lee Shi-woo (Song Kang) and Jin Ha-kyung (Park Min-young) walk down this street after work and continue their conversation about living together.'),(5001770,'<People at the Meteorological Agency: Cruel Tales of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>On the 11th episode, the day before leaving for Jeju Island, Ishu (Song Kang) has dinner at this restaurant with Jin Ha-kyeong (Park Min-young) and her mother Bae Su-ja (Kim Mi-kyung).'),(5001771,'<People at the Meteorological Administration: Cruel tales of office romances(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>This is the location that serves as the background for the entire drama.'),(5001772,'<People at the Meteorological Office: The Cruel Story of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)> In episode 4, colleagues Eom Dong-han (Lee Sung-wook) and Go Bong-chan (Kwon Hae-hyo) drink at this bar.'),(5001773,'<People at the Weather Bureau: Cruel Story of Office Romance Part 1(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 1, Jina Kyeong (Park Min-young) and Hangu Jun (Park Yoon) meet to negotiate the partition of an apartment.'),(5001774,'<People of the Meteorological Agency: Cruel Stories of Office Romance Episode 9(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 9, Shin Seok-ho (played by Moon Tae-yoo) and the bartender come on a weekend to claim the coupon they had left here previously, insisting on paying the full amount. This scene shows Jin Tae-gyeong (played by Jung Woonsun) coming to pay the price for Jin Ha-kyeong (played by Park Min-young).'),(5001775,'<KBS Drama \"The Cruel History of Office Romance\" Episode 4(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In Episode 4, Jin Ha-kyung (Park Min-young) is jogging across this bridge.'),(5001776,'<People of the Weather: Cruel Stories of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 3, Lee Siwoo (played by Song Kang) passes by this restaurant on his way to work.'),(5001777,'<People of the Meteorological Institute: Cruel Love Stories Inside the Company(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 3, Lee Si-woo (played by Song Kang) and Jin Ha-kyung (played by Park Min-young) came to have dinner.'),(5001778,'<Weather Agency People: Cruel Story of Office Romance Part 2(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)> On the second episode, on the first day of being appointed as the harsh weather forecast team leader, Lee Si-woo (played by Song Kang) is crossing this bridge.'),(5001779,'<Weather People: The Cruel History of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 2, Ishiu (Song Gang) and Jin Ha-kyung (Park Min-young) come to this bar separately to have drinks.'),(5001780,'<Weather agency website: Cruel Tales of Office Romance (Episode)(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>Jinha Kyung (Park Min Young)\'s mother Baesooja (Kim Mi Kyung) and sister Jin Taekyung (Jeong Woon Sun) live together. Hakyung reunites with them shortly for a brief period (up to 4 episodes) after breaking up with Han Kijun (Yoon Bak).'),(5001781,'<KBS People: Cruel History of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 7, Lee Si-woo (played by Song Kang) reminisces about his childhood when his father brought him to this guest house, where his father appeared as a motel owner. In his childhood, his father told him to wait outside. After a long wait, young Si-woo finally decides to find his father and discovers him gambling inside.'),(5001782,'<Meteorological Office People: Cruel Love Story Episode(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>The place where the main characters confirm their complicated feelings for each other again, swayed by cruel love story.'),(5001783,'<People of the Meteorological Administration: Cruel Stories of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 3 of \"The Symphonic Poem,\" Lee Siwoo (played by Song Kang) walks to this meteorological observatory to control the visibility of the nearby mountain\'s thorns in preparation for the upcoming weather changes.'),(5001784,'<People of the Meteorological Agency: Cruel Histories of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>Ha-kyung (Park Min-young) who is late for work, tries to call a taxi on this street in front of the clothing store.'),(5001785,'<KBS \"Weather Agency\" People: Cruel Histories of Office Romance(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)> In episode 1, Lee Si-woo (played by Song Kang) brings his girlfriend Chae Yu-jin (played by Kim Ah-young/ Girls\' Day Yura) to this restaurant.'),(5001786,'<People of the Meteorological Agency: Cruel Tales of Office Romance Episode 9(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 9, Ishiu (Song Kang) and Jin Hagyeong (Park Minyoung) walk along Manrijaero and make weekend plans in front of this restaurant.'),(5001787,'<Weather Agency People: Cruel story of office romance Part 2(기상청 사람들: 사내연애 잔혹사 편)>In episode 2, people can be seen briefly walking to this gate.'),(5001788,'<Kim Director(김과장)>In episode 8, Manager TQ\'s two managers are planning to terminate their contract with CEO Park Hyun-do (Park Young-gyu) and wait at this restaurant. However, instead, Seo Yul (Lee Jun-ho) arrives and threatens them to extend the contract for another 3 years.'),(5001789,'<Kim Gwajang(김과장)>In episode 4, Hakyung (Nam Sang-mi) visits a restaurant asking Director Chu (Kim Won-hae) about his concerns after founding TQ Group. When asked by Haksiljang (Kwon Hyuk), the director simply forgets and says he is rational and realistic.'),(5001790,'<Kim Manager(김과장)>In episode 4, Chinese customers heading to TQ Company cross this bridge.'),(5001791,'<Kim Manager(김과장)>In episode 18, Kim Sung-ryong (Namgoong Min) met Seo Yool (Lee Joon-ho), who had just been released from prison, here.'),(5001792,'<Kim Secretary(김과장)>In episode 5, Kim Sung-ryong (Namgoong Min) returning his accounting book to Seo Yul (Lee Jun-ho) happens right under this bridge.'),(5001793,'<Kim Gwajang(김과장)>In episode 18, Kim Sung-ryong (played by Namgoong Min) meets Seo Yul (played by Lee Junho) and convinces Yul to switch sides.'),(5001794,'<Manager Kim(김과장)>This is a building operated by TQ Corporation where everyone works.'),(5001795,'<Why is Secretary Kim like this?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 7, Kim Miso (Park Min-young) and the rest of the management team stay at this pension after work.'),(5001796,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Park Seo-joon, Park Min-young visit the resort in Why Secretary Kim'),(5001797,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Park Min-young and her colleagues visited the rest area in \"Why Secretary Kim\"'),(5001798,'<\"Why Secretary Kim\"(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>The restaurant Park Seo-joon visited in \"Why Secretary Kim\"'),(5001799,'<Why is Secretary Kim like that?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 16, the exterior of this restaurant appears as the location where Kim Miso (Park Min-young) has her first official dinner with her mother-in-law (Kim Hye-ok).'),(5001800,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Park Min-young meets a friend at a café in Why Secretary Kim'),(5001801,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 6, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) finds himself at this bus stop in the afternoon when he follows Kim Mi-so\'s (Park Min-young) plan. Mi-so teases him that she won\'t take the bus anyway since she planned for a Seoul City Circle Bus route which doesn\'t go through the city.'),(5001802,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In the drama, this mansion appears as the family estate of Lee Young-joon (played by Park Seo-joon). In episode 4, he has dinner with his parents here and eventually confronts his older brother Lee Sung-yeon (played by Lee Tae-hwan).'),(5001803,'<Kim Biso\'s Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>The location where Park Seo-joon\'s house was filmed in Why Secretary Kim'),(5001804,'<Why is Secretary Kim acting that way?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>A popular flower crab restaurant visited by Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young in Why Secretary Kim'),(5001805,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In \"Why Secretary Kim,\" Park Min Young and Park Byung Eun visit a cafe.'),(5001806,'<Why Did Secretary Kim Do That?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 2, Kim Miso (played by Park Min-young) came to this place in the evening to meet with Park Yusik (played by Kang Ki-young). However, the meeting was ultimately canceled, and everything was part of a sudden plan for Lee Young-joon (played by Park Seo-joon) to suddenly appear in front of her to win her heart.'),(5001807,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 3, Kim Miso (Park Min-young) comes to pick up Lee Sung-yeon (Lee Tae-hwan) on this road. It is said to resemble a place abandoned like the one she was kidnapped in her childhood, hoping to retrieve her memories.'),(5001808,'<Why is Secretary Kim Like That(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>The house of Yeongmisu (KIm Jiyu) and kidnapped house of young Lee Youngjun (Moon Woojin) in episodes 11-12.'),(5001809,'<Why is Secretary Kim Like That?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>A scene from the drama teaser was filmed here.'),(5001810,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 12, Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) and Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) come here for \'Soul Food\'.'),(5001811,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 5, Lee Sung-yeon (Lee Tae-hwan) and Kim Miso (Park Min-young) ate at this restaurant.'),(5001812,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 7, Kim Miso (played by Park Min Young) meets Lee Sung Yeon (played by Lee Tae Hwan) here for lunch, and Lee Young Joon (played by Park Seo Joon) hears an excuse that his brother spends more time than necessary.'),(5001813,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 4, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) and Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) look around the library when the power goes out. They sit for a moment and she reads her favorite book. Young-joon holds up a fake flashlight to his face and asks her, \"Have I ever told you that you\'re pretty?\"'),(5001814,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 3, Yeongjun\'s mother (Kim Hyeok) meets Kim Miso (Park Minyoung) at this gallery cafe to ask about her son\'s schedule.'),(5001815,'<\"Why is Secretary Kim like that?\"(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 12 of \"Why is Secretary Kim like that?\", Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) brings Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) to a competitor to buy a new cup for him. When the salesperson unexpectedly asks the newlyweds to buy household items in bulk, Mi-so is surprised, but Young-joon seems to really like the idea. In episode 16, Young-joon comes with Mi-so again, this time actually purchasing a newlywed set.'),(5001816,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>The observation deck where Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young visited in What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim'),(5001817,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Stairs visited by Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young in \"Why Secretary Kim\"'),(5001818,'<Kim Secretary, Why Is She Like That?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young visit a traditional market in \"Why Secretary Kim\".'),(5001819,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Kim Miso (Park Min-young) and Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) pass by this building to have lunch.'),(5001820,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 2, this place appears as \'Valencia\' karaoke in Cheongdam-dong. Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) reserved the karaoke for the team.'),(5001821,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>The location of the party attended by Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) and Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) in episode 1. In episode 16, part of the building is shown as the exterior of Master Designer (special guest Lee Byung-joon)\'s fashion design studio, where Young-joon and Mi-so had a wedding dress fitting appointment. However, Mi-so had to work overtime, leaving Young-joon waiting for her. When she finished work and rushed there, everything was already closed.'),(5001822,'<Why is Secretary Kim like that(김비서가 왜 그럴까)> In the final episode, Kim Miso (Park Min-young) has her first official lunch with her future mother-in-law (Kim Hye-ok) at this place in episode 16.'),(5001823,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>A pub where Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young had a company dinner in Why Secretary Kim'),(5001824,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 14, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) takes Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) to this pasta restaurant (You & Me Pasta) to cheer on their mutual friend Jung Yu-mi (special guest Jung Yu-mi).'),(5001825,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 6, Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) walks through this park while Park Yoo-sik (Kang Ki-young) stops her to ride in the car next to him. In episode 7, Mi-so catches a glimpse of Yoo-sik meeting Lee Sung-yeon (Lee Tae-hwan) around the park while riding with Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) in the car. Yoo-sik covers Young-joon\'s eyes to prevent him from seeing something, making Young-joon curious.'),(5001826,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 3, Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) met her blind date Park Byeong-hun (Park Byeong-eun) on this street.'),(5001827,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Japanese restaurant visited by Park Min-young and Park Byung-eun in Why Secretary Kim'),(5001828,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) and Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) come for a night walk in episode 11 and end up sitting down to eat freeze (first) ice cream. Mi-so is worried that she might have nightmares and suffer from insomnia, so she suggests staying overnight at her place to recover her memory. Like recovering her memory. They sit in front of one of the trees planted on the east side of THE Sculpture opposite the side entrance of the CJ E&M Building.'),(5001829,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 11, Lee Sung-yeon (Lee Tae-hwan) stops and stands on this street. The victim of the abduction case learns that it was not himself, but his younger brother Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon).'),(5001830,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 7, Kim Miso (Park Minyoung) meets Lee Sungyeon (Lee Taehwan) outside. The sight of Park Yusik (Kang Kiyoung) riding in a car with Lee Youngjun is captured.'),(5001831,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 11, Park Yoo Shik (played by Kang Ki Young) comes to this restaurant alone on his ex-wife\'s birthday, recalling the good times he had here as a couple. His ex-wife Seo Jin (played by Seo Hyo Rim) also comes to the restaurant, but gets angry at her when she is with another man and tells her that the man she is with is his cousin until she corrects herself.'),(5001832,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 1, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) and Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) drive across this bridge after completing their duties at the Spanish embassy. In the latter part of the scene, Mi-so tells Young-joon about her plans to resign from the company.'),(5001833,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 5, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) and Park Yoo-sik (Kang Ki-young) come here to have lunch.'),(5001834,'<Why did Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 3, Lee Sung-yeon (played by Lee Tae-hwan), the younger brother of Lee Young-joon (played by Park Seo-joon), calls his parents as soon as he returns home.'),(5001835,'<Why is Secretary Kim like that?(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 3, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) took Kim Mi-so (Park Min-young) onboard this ship and enjoyed a blockbuster-level date.'),(5001836,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young visit the museum in What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim'),(5001837,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>This is the meeting place of Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) and Park Yoo-sik (Kang Ki-young). Yoo-sik comes here to have a drink while explaining to Young-joon in episodes 4 and 8 that relationships should always be honest and transparent.'),(5001838,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>The place where Park Seo-joon and Kang Ki-young went in \'What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim\''),(5001839,'<Why does Secretary Kim do that(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>This place is Kim Miso\'s (Park Min Young) house. In episode 1, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) comes to her house to persuade her to quit her job and instead marry him, but Miso feels unjust.'),(5001840,'<What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>A restaurant visited by Park Seo-joon and Kang Ki-young in What\'s Wrong with Secretary Kim'),(5001841,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 1, Lee Young Joon (Park Seo Joon) comes here with his friends (and his \'girlfriend\') to throw a party.'),(5001842,'<Why is Secretary Kim like that(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>This is where Kim Miso (Park Min-young) was hospitalized after fainting due to the shock of regaining her memory in episode 11.'),(5001843,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 2, this place appears as the American hotel suite where Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) stayed during his business trip.'),(5001844,'<Why is Secretary Kim like that(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 13, Lee Young-joon (Park Seo-joon) and Park Yoo-shik (Kang Ki-young) arrived at Terminal 2.'),(5001845,'<kim secretary why(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>In episode 11, Kim Miso (Park Min-young) visited the famous Illusion Hotel Spa to take a break, assuming that she would give feedback on the spa service with her colleagues Kim Jia (Pyo Ye-jin) and Bong Sera (Hwang Bo-ra).'),(5001846,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>Park Seo-joon and Park Min-young visit a grill restaurant in \"Why Secretary Kim\"'),(5001847,'<Why Secretary Kim(김비서가 왜 그럴까)>This place is where Kim Miso (Park Min Young) and her sisters visit annually to celebrate their mother\'s birthday in episode 10. This is also the place where Lee Youngjoon (Park Seo Jun) comes.'),(5001848,'<Kim Yohan(김요한)>Location for X1 emergency album jacket photoshoot'),(5001849,'<Kim Yohan(김요한)>Kim Yohan\'s Wonder K Suit Dance filming location'),(5001850,'<Kim Jaehwan(김재환)>Kim Jaehwan\'s visit to a snack bar where Jaehwan\'s signature dish is served. Kim Young Cheol\'s Neighborhood Tour.'),(5001851,'<Kim Jaehwan(김재환)>The place where Kim Jaehwan worked part-time before his debut with Wanna One'),(5001852,'<Kim Jaehwan(김재환)>The place where Kim Jaehwan was surprised while drinking a decaffeinated Americano'),(5001853,'<Kkondae Intern(꼰대인턴)>In episode 4, Nam Goong Jun-soo (played by Park Ki-woong) meets the new intern Lee Man-sik (played by Kim Eung-soo) at this place. Nam Goong Jun-soo promises Lee Man-sik a full-time position if he does everything to disrupt the work of Gaeolchan (played by Park Hae-jin), essentially saying \"if you do nothing.\"'),(5001854,'<Grumpy intern(꼰대인턴)>A building that appears as the headquarters of \'Onggol Foods\' in episode 1. The place where Gaeul Chan (played by Park Hae-jin) was an intern in 2015.'),(5001855,'<Kkondae Intern(꼰대인턴)>In the second episode (total 1 episode), this garden appears as the background for the Mumbai food CF \'Spicy Chicken Noodles\' starring Park Hae-jin.'),(5001856,'<꼰대인턴(꼰대인턴)>The exterior of this building appears to be the venue for the \'62nd Trade Day\' of the Korea International Trade Association, as seen in the episode.'),(5001857,'<Kon-dae Intern(꼰대인턴)>In episode 16, Ju Yoon-soo (played by No Jong-hyeon) witnesses Tak Jeong-eun (played by Park Ah-in) drinking alone at the window seat of this cafe (Grand Mama Cafe). He approaches her to join and as they talk about work, he reaches out his hand to kiss her and she responds.'),(5001858,'<Kkondae Intern(꼰대인턴)>In the 5th episode (out of a total 