to spend time together with Ji-hoo\'s grandfather.'),(5001869,'<Drama \"Boys Over Flowers\"(꽃보다 남자)>The dry cleaning delivery service \'Jandi Total Cleaning\', operated by Guem Il-bong (played by An Seok-hwan) and Na Gong-ju (played by Im Ye-jin), the parents of Geum Jan-di (played by Gu Hye-sun), is located in this building.'),(5001870,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>Geum Jandee (Koo Hye-sun) appears at the neighborhood park in front of her house. While a competition over Geum Jandee\'s dropout status was going on, Gu Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) unexpectedly arrives in front of her house. They talk and he hugs her at this playground. In episode 9, Jun-pyo decorates the entire playground and prepares an event. The two grow closer and finally share their first kiss. In episode 12, Jan-di has a heartfelt conversation with her father here.'),(5001871,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 10, after Jun-pyo\'s (Lee Min-ho) mother, Kang Hee-soo (Lee Hye-young), closes down the dry cleaning business in Gu Jun-pyo\'s household, they start selling rice cakes under this overpass. In the same episode, it is also the place where Jun-pyo\'s mother instructs her chauffeur to pass by so that Jun-pyo, who is at her company, can see Gu Jun-pyo (Goo Hye-sun) working here with his family. Jun-pyo gets out of the car to kiss Jan-di in order to join her. Shortly after, the two promise not to break up because of his mother while crossing this overpass.'),(5001872,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 15, Geum Jan-di (Gu Hye-sun) passes by this intersection and sees Gu Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho). Their recent breakup really hits home when the screen of a store on one side of this intersection displays it. Here, Jun-pyo\'s younger sister recognizes Jan-di while driving a car, stops, and invites her to her house.'),(5001873,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episodes 22 and 23, Geum Jan-di (played by Gu Hye-sun) accepts the neighbor boy Chan\'s offer to take care of him and suggests to Gu Jun-pyo (played by Lee Min-ho) to go on a date at the zoo.'),(5001874,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>A dramatic showdown unfolds to prevent Goo Hye-sun (Jan Di) from getting expelled. Geum Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) will lose his horse Jupiter even if he wins this competition.'),(5001875,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>Appears as the background of Shinwa High.'),(5001876,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>SoiJeong (Kim Beom) appears as a pottery workshop, receiving love calls from F4 members and Goo Junpyo (Kim Soeun). Goo Junpyo (Kim Soeun) frequently visits. In Episode 23, a kissing scene between Yi Jung and Ga Eul is shown.'),(5001877,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 4, this hotel is featured as the place where Geum Jan-di (Gu Hye-sun) is brought after losing consciousness from taking medicine. Jan-di\'s best friend, Oh Min-ji (Lee Si-young), also arranged for photos of Jan-di with an unknown man in bed to be shown at school the next day. Goo Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) comes here to confront Min-ji.'),(5001878,'<Flower Namja(꽃보다 남자)>In episodes 2 and 3, this resort is the location where a party for the Shinhwa High School math trip is held. Jealous of the well-dressed Geum Jan-di (Koo Hye-sun) dancing with someone else, Goo Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) storms out and ends up falling into the pool outside the resort.'),(5001879,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>This hotel appears in episode 17.'),(5001880,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>Dongseo Cultural Center (Kyungpook National University Daemyung Campus) serves as the hiding place for Geum Jan-di (Goo Hye-sun) in front of Shinhwa High School. Goo Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) is studying in the main building.'),(5001881,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 18, Geum Jan-di (Goo Hye-sun) moves to the rooftop of this building with her brother Geum Kang-san (Park Ji-bin) and stays until episode 19. In episode 18, Goo Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) moves to the rooftop right next door. In episode 19, the building collapses and they leave without notice.'),(5001882,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 9, Ga-eul (Kim So-eun) and Jan-di (Koo Hye-sun) coincidentally run into Ga-eul\'s ex-boyfriend on this street during autumn.'),(5001883,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>Episodes 2 and 3 The school trip\'s masquerade ball at Shinhwa High School is held in the hotel\'s Emerald Room. Geum Jan-di (played by Gu Hye-sun) dresses up in a Superwoman costume after hearing the term \"costume ball,\" only to realize that she looks a mess. Min Seo-hyun (played by Han Chae-young) extends a helping hand by dressing her in appropriate attire for the event.'),(5001884,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In Seonyudo Park, Geum Jan Di (Goo Hye Sun) and Yoon Ji Hoo (Kim Hyun Joong) meet as Ji Hoo\'s grandfather plans to spend time together. After witnessing the couple wedding photoshoot contest in the park, Jan Di decides to participate and wins the second prize (Hanwoo set) with Ji Hoo as the most beautiful couple.'),(5001885,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 18, Song Woo-bin (played by Kim Joon) stops at this bridge and recalls the moment when So Yi-jung (played by Kim Bum) expressed his feelings for him, suspecting the friendship of F4.'),(5001886,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 9, Goo Jun-pyo (Lee Min-ho) and Geum Jan-di (Goo Hye-sun) visited this restaurant for a double date with Yoo Joo (Kim So-eun) and her current boyfriend. It was the first time Jun-pyo had witnessed someone eating intestines, and Jan-di\'s boyfriend constantly challenged Jun-pyo until he left in the fall.'),(5001887,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 12, Gu Jun-pyo\'s (Lee Min-ho) father\'s serious condition is revealed through this screen.'),(5001888,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 24, So Yi-jeong (Kim Beom) and Chu Ga-eul (Kim So-eun) have a conversation at the top of these stairs, where Ga-eul tells Yi-jeong that even though he wants to run away, she won\'t search for him anymore.'),(5001889,'<Boys Over Flowers(꽃보다 남자)>In episode 2, Geum Jan-di (played by Gu Hye-sun) stops in front 