ove(끝에서 두번째 사랑)>In episode 13, Kang Min-joo (Kim Hee-ae) and Go Sang-sik (Ji Jin-hee) take a walk here.'),(5001899,'<Me Alone You(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 4, Han So-yeon (played by Go Sung-hee) and housemate Yoo-ram (played by Kang Seung-hyun) go on a short trip. They come to this cafe, socialize, and take photos.'),(5001900,'<Me Alone You(나 홀로 그대)>During Episode 1, while Go Yoo-jin (played by Choi Ye-jin) is being chased by the men who won the award, AI hologram Hollo (played by Yoon Hyun-min) notices Han So-yeon (played by Go Sung-hee) passing by them.'),(5001901,'<Me Alone(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 6, Han So-yeon (played by Go Sung-hee) visits this garden with the AI hologram \'Holo\' (played by Yoon Hyun-min) for a \'date\'.'),(5001902,'<I’m Alone(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 3, this place is the headquarters of the artificial intelligence company Magic Mirror, led by Baek Chan-sung (Hwang Chan-sung of 2PM).'),(5001903,'<I Am Alone(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 11, Go Nando (Yoon Hyun-min) is caught while attempting to ambush, and a chase ensues inside the terminal.'),(5001904,'<Me, You(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 3, Han So-yeon (played by Ko Sung-hee) appears here to meet her crush and senior manager, Yeon Kang-woo (played by Lee Ki-chan).'),(5001905,'<Alone with You(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 1, Han So-yeon (played by Ko Sung-hee) finds her glasses in her bag and comes to this cafe to buy coffee.'),(5001906,'<나 홀로 그대(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 11, Han So-yeon (Go Sung-hee) brings Go Nanddo (Yoon Hyun-min) to So-yeon\'s mother\'s restaurant for a meal. There, he reunites with the mother who took care of him when he was young.'),(5001907,'<My Holo Love(나 홀로 그대)>Han So-yeon (Go Sung-hee) works in the marketing department of an eyewear company. In Episode 1, she is seen walking towards the building with AI hologram Holo (Yoon Hyun-min).'),(5001908,'<Alone in Love(나 홀로 그대)>In episode 2, Yeon Kang-woo (played by Lee Ki-chan) gives Han So-yeon (played by Go Sung-hee) a ride home after work and they cross this bridge. 