) reminisce about their college and school days with Won Jin-ah (played by Go Mi-ran).'),(5002040,'<Melts me(날 녹여주오)>Appears as the headquarters of TBO Broadcasting Station.'),(5002041,'<Melt Me Now(날 녹여주오)>In episode 8, Gomi-ran (Won Jin-ah) and Hwang Ji-hoon (Choi Bo-min) visit this street for a \'date\'.'),(5002042,'<Melt Me(날 녹여주오)>In episode 6 where Yeong-seon\'s husband Hwang Byeong-sim (Shim Hyeong-tak) investigates, his close friends Oh Yeong-seon (Seo Jeong-yeon) and Park Gyeong-ja (Park Hee-jin) cross the park on their way to the police station. In episode 12, Son Hyeon-gi (Im Won-hee) and Park Gyeong-ja (Park Hee-jin) meet and have a date in this park.'),(5002043,'<Melt the sky(날 녹여주오)>Gomiran (Won Jin-ah) and her family are grilling fish near the park.'),(5002044,'<Melt Me(날 녹여주오)>After spreading the news that Ma Dong-chan (played by Ji Chang-wook) participated in a cryogenic experiment, politicians discuss inviting Ma Dong-chan (played by Ji Chang-wook) to a party in episode 6.'),(5002045,'<Melt me(날 녹여주오)>In episode 4, Go Mi-ran\'s younger brother Go Nam-tae brings her to the top of this tower and shows her how much Seoul has changed in the past 20 years.'),(5002046,'<Melt me away(날 녹여주오)>  In episode 10, Chairman Eun Sung (Kim Beom-rae) receives the information that Professor Hwang Gap-soo is still alive on the rooftop of this building.'),(5002047,'<Melt me(날 녹여주오)>In episode 1 of the director Ma Dong-chan (Ji Chang-wook)\'s entertainment show \'Can You Fly with Balloons?\', Go Mi-ran (Won Jin-ah) appeared as a guinea pig hanging from multiple balloons, which was filmed in this park.'),(5002048,'<Melt the day(날 녹여주오)>Kim Won-hae\'s 59th birthday party will be held at this restaurant in the 2nd district.'),(5002049,'<Fly Me to the Moon(날 녹여주오)>This is the place where Ma Dong-chan (played by Ji Chang-wook) and Go Mi-ran (played by Won Jin-ah) rediscovered Seoul for the first time in 2019 on a walkway in front of this park.'),(5002050,'<Melt the Day(날 녹여