 weather is good(날씨가 좋으면 찾아가겠어요)>Former classmates from Hyecheon High School, such as Mok Hye-won (Park Min-young), Im Eun-seop (Seo Kang-jun), and Lee Jang-woo (Lee Jae-wook), reunite here. This is also where Eun-seop confesses that he liked Hye-won during high school.'),(5002060,'< If the weather is nice, I will go visit (날씨가 좋으면 찾아가겠어요)> In episode 11, Im Eun-seop (played by Seo Kang-jun) and Mok Hae-won (played by Park Min-young) come to the park together and she tells him about her past.'),(5002062,'<I will go there if the weather is nice(날씨가 좋으면 찾아가겠어요)>While reminiscing about the incident of September 4, 2010 in Episode 14, Imo Shim Myeong-yeo (played by Moon Jung-hee) comes out of subway exit 1 to meet her younger sister Shim Myeong-joo (played by Jin Hee-kyung).'),(5002063,'<If the weather is nice, I will visit(날씨가 좋으면 찾아가겠어요)>In episode 5, Mok Haewon (Park Minyoung) recalls the reason why she came to this restaurant with her mother, Shim Myungju (Jin Heekyung), when talking about her relationship with Im Eunsup (Seo Kangjoon)'),(5002064,'<If the weather is nice, I will go there(날씨가 좋으면 찾아가겠어요)> In episode 13, adult Sim Myeong-yeo (Moon Jung-hee) completely breaks up with Cha Yun-taek (Hwang Geon) in this alley.'),(5002065,'<I would visit when the weather is nice(날씨가 좋으면 찾아가겠어요)>Lee Jang-woo (Lee Jae-wook) and his colleagues go hiking to this pavilion to welcome the new year in 2020. It is also the place where Im Eun-seop (Seo Kang-joon) and Mok Hae-won (Park Min-young) kiss for the first time in episode 8.'),(5002066,'<Boyfriend(남자친구)>In the drama \"Boyfriend,\" Park Bo Gum visited the port alone.'),(5002067,'<Boyfriend(남자친구)>In episode 9, Cha Soo-hyun (Song Hye-kyo) escapes the gossips and intrusive gaze about Kim Jin-hyuk (Park Bo-gum) by running along this coastal road to meet him after hearing the lament of a tea house owner missing her deceased husband. Soo-hyun parks her car on this road and discovers Jin-hyuk reading a book at Simgok Harbor.'),(5002