aranoia of celebrating the successful end of missions with mojitos at Namsan Tower. He had already proposed this to his ex-girlfriend, who died during a mission. Now, he makes the same proposal to Go Ae-rin (Jung In-Sun).'),(5002167,'<My Secret Terrius(내 뒤에 테리우스)>In episode 7, Kim Bon (So Ji Sub) and his former National Intelligence Service colleague Yoo Ji Yeon (Im Se Mi) meet in front of this building.'),(5002168,'< My Daughter, Geum Sa Wol(내 딸, 금사월)>\n\nIn episode 3, Oh Hye-sang (Park Se-young) and Joo Se-hoon (Dasom Woo) get married here.'),(5002169,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 20, Jang Jun-ha (Namgoong Min) brings his step-sister Bonguri (Hwang Jung-eum) along. He unexpectedly appears before us at Bongmaru for the last time and unknowingly has our last date together.'),(5002170,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>Cha Dong-joo (Kim Jae-won) lives in this mansion with his mother Tae-hyun-suk (Lee Hye-young) and his stepfather Choi Jin-cheol (Song Seung).'),(5002171,'<Can you hear my heart?(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 5, this botanical garden appears as the \'Art Garden\' where Bong Yeong-gyu (Jung In-seok) works.'),(5002172,'<My Heart Can Hear You(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 5, Cha Dong-joo (played by Kim Jae-won) finishes his overseas trip and rides his bike through this café while exploring Seoul.'),(5002173,'<My Heart Can Hear(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 5, as adult Bongwoo (Hwang Jung Eum) walks with Lee Kyuhan (Lee Gyu-han), they see their \"brother\" Jang Jun-ha (Namgoong Min) at the Rodeo Hyundai Apartment shopping center, giving them a feeling of familiarity.'),(5002174,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>This building appears as the headquarters of the Ugyeong Group, operated by Cha Dong-joo (Kim Jae-won)’s father.'),(5002175,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>In the drama \"Can You Hear My Heart,\" Cha Dong-joo (played by Kim Jae-won) parks his car at this park near Seongsan Bridge at night and listens to Beethoven\'s Symphony No. 2 in episode 14.'),(5002176,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 16, Jang Jun-ha (Namgoong Min) brings his step-sister Bong-uri (Hwang Jung-eum) to the park. She does not know that he is her step-brother, as they parted ways years ago and she shares memories of her older brother with him, leading him to believe she is looking for her step-sibling.'),(5002177,'<Can you hear my heart?(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 16, Jang Jun-ha (played by Namkoong Min) brings his step-sister Bonguri (played by Hwang Jung-eum) and expresses his wish to ride this cable car. Holding the ticket in his hand, he returns but notices that Yuri is distracted. When he asks if Yuri has already bought the ticket, he denies it, knowing that she will soon leave.'),(5002178,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>A celebration party will be held at this hotel in episode 6.'),(5002179,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>In episodes 6, Jang Joon-ha (Namkoong Min) starts working at this hospital.'),(5002180,'<Can You Hear My Heart(내 마음이 들리니)>In episode 15, Bonguri (played by Hwang Jung-eum) brings Namisuk (played by Kim Ye-jin) to this place.'),(5002181,'<In My Spring Days(내 생애 봄날)>It appears as Gang Dong-ha\'s (played by Gam Woo-sung) ranch. In episode 4, when Lee Bom-i (played by Choi Soo-young) came to him to sign a contract, he showed her his land.'),(5002182,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>Orientation for first-year students in the Department of Chemistry at Korea University will be held in episodes 1 and 2.'),(5002183,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>Berlin Bar, run by Do Kyung-seok\'s close friend Woo-jin (Lee Tae-sun), appears at the entrance.'),(5002184,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>This is where Kang Mi-rae (played by Lim Soo-hyang), Do Kyung-seok (played by Cha Eun-woo from Astro), and Hyun Soo-ah (played by Jo Woo-ri) are registered as chemistry majors, and where Yeon Woo-young (played by Kwak Dong-yeon) works as a teaching assistant.'),(5002185,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 6, Kang Mi-rae (played by Im Soo-hyang) recalls her high school days when she confessed her feelings to her friend Yong-chul at this place. However, he rejects her, calling her \'Gang Hulk\' or \'Gang Orc\' and finding her repulsive.'),(5002186,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episodes 1 and 6, Kang Mi-rae (Im Soo-hyang), a high school student, confesses her feelings to her friend Yeong-chul. However, he rejects her claiming that everyone calls her \"average-looking\" rather than the \"Gang Hong\" or \"Gang Ok\" that he did.'),(5002187,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 4, Do Kyung-seok (Cha Eun-woo of ASTRO) visits this place with his father Do Sang-won (Park Sung-keun) and sister Do Kyung-hee (Kim Ji-min) ahead of a by-election.'),(5002188,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In the drama, this place appears as \"Korea University\". The drama\'s main characters, Kang Mi-rae (played by Im Soo-hyang), Do Kyung-seok (played by Cha Eun-woo of ASTRO), and Hyun Soo-ah (played by Jo Woo-ri), are shown registering as chemistry majors at the university. There is also a scene where Yeon Woo-young (played by Kwak Dong-yeon) is a teaching assistant. In episode 2, Mi-rae and Kyung-seok have a conversation in front of the law school building.'),(5002189,'<My ID Is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 3, Hyun Soo-A (Jo Woo Ri) is working part-time at this cafe.'),(5002190,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>This location is where the Kelun Perfume Event is held in episode 4.'),(5002191,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 12, Do Kyung-seok (Cha Eun-woo from ASTRO) passes by without acknowledging Kang Mi-rae (Im Soo-hyang) who was waiting for the bus at this place.'),(5002192,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 14, Do Kyung-seok (Cha Eun-woo) invites Kang Mi-rae (Im Soo-hyang) to this restaurant for dinner. She feels scared being in a public place with him and their two classmates do not find eating here helpful; Mi-rae leaves to go for a run.'),(5002193,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>Episode 1 depicts Kang Mi-rae (Im Soo-hyang) searching for Atelier Cologne Gangnam branch.'),(5002194,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 9, Do Kyung-seok (Cha Eun-woo) comes to buy breakfast.'),(5002195,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>These stairs are located on the way home of roommates Kang Mi-rae (played by Im Soo-hyang) and Oh Hyun-jung (played by Min Do-hee), as well as neighbors Yeo Woo-young (played by Kwak Dong-yeon) and Do Kyung-seok (played by Cha Eun-woo from ASTRO). You can see them in episodes 8, 9, and 10.'),(5002196,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 6, Yeonwoo (Kwak Dong-yeon) moves to this rooftop apartment.'),(5002197,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 15, Cha Eun Woo (Do Kyung Suk) and Im Soo Hyang (Kang Mi Rae) walk along this street during lunchtime after finishing the summer program at the worm because they don\'t want to make Jeong Woo Ri (Hyun Soo Ah) uncomfortable.'),(5002198,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 3, Na Hye-sung (Park Joo-mi), the mother of Do Kyung-seok (Cha Eun-woo from ASTRO), passes by this place while taking a taxi back to Korea.'),(5002199,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(내 아이디는 강남미인)>In episode 3, Cha Eun-woo (played by Do Kyung-seok) of ASTRO\'s mother, Na Hye-sung (played by Park Joo-mi), arrives at this place.'),(5002201,'<My Girlfriend is a Gumiho(내 여자친구는 구미호)>This is where Cha Dae Woong (Lee Seung Gi) first meets Gumiho (Shin Min Ah).'),(5002202,'<My Girlfriend is a Gumiho(내 여자친구는 구미호)>This university is portrayed as \'International University\'. Cha Dae-woong (Lee Seung-gi) attends this university and the school and its gym [Central University] appear as part of the Action School.'),(5002203,'<My Girlfriend is a Gumiho(내 여자친구는 구미호)> My girlfriend appears in the lobby of this building from My Girlfriend is a Gumiho.'),(5002204,'<My Girlfriend is a Gumiho(내 여자친구는 구미호)>In episode 3, Gumiho 