ji (played by Lim Soo-hyang) and Seo-hwan (played by Ji Soo) ride bicycles along this road for a one-night trip.'),(5002215,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 16, Oh Ye-ji (Lim Soo-hyang) comes to this lighthouse to reminisce about her life.'),(5002216,'<When I was most beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>The scene where Seo Jin (Ha Suk-jin) proposes to Oh Ye-ji (Lim Soo-hyang) appears in episode 4.'),(5002217,'<When I was the most beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 11, Kim Yeon-chul (Kwon Hyeok) and Bang Yeong-geun (Lee Jae-yong) meet for dinner at this restaurant to discuss Jin Hwan Construction\'s hostile takeover plan.'),(5002218,'<I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 4, Oh Ye-ji (played by Im Soo-hyang) and Seo Jin (played by Ha Seok-jin) hold a wedding ceremony.'),(5002219,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 1, Oh Ye-ji (Im Soo-hyang) brings her class to this place for outdoor drawing class.'),(5002220,'<When I was the most beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 13, Sehwan (Jisoo) and Amber (Stephanie Lee) break up in this cafe.'),(5002221,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 2, Carrie Jung (played by Hwang Seung-eon) meets her friends at this bar.'),(5002222,'<When I was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 6, Oh Ye-ji (Im Soo-hyang) is attending the pottery exhibition \'Seo Sung-gon, Memory of Earth\'.'),(5002223,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 8, Sehwan (Jisoo) crosses this bridge with Oyeji (Im Soo-hyang) in a younger sibling\'s car. As they cross the bridge, their conversation becomes more heated and Sehwan (Jisoo) approaches Oyeji (Im Soo-hyang) closely in the café and asks her to understand him a little more.'),(5002224,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 5, after Seo-jin (Ha Seok-jin) marries Oh Ye-ji (Im Soo-hyang), his ex-girlfriend Carrie Jung (Hwang Seung-eon) tries to win him back at this penthouse.'),(5002225,'<When I was the most beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>This hotel is where Carrie, played by Kim Tae-kyem, was stabbed by Kang Ki-seok in episode 14.'),(5002226,'<When I was the prettiest(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 7, Seo-hwan (Jisoo) arrives at the airport after taking a break from studying abroad in the United States to find Oh Ye-ji (Lim Soo-hyang).'),(5002227,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>After her husband Seojin (Ha Seok-jin) went missing for three years, Oh Ye-ji (Im Soo-hyang) returns to Jeju Island, their honeymoon destination, in episodes 6-7 and visits this church along with all the places they were together. Sehwan (Ji Soo) flies in from the USA and worries about his sister-in-law, leading him to find her here.'),(5002228,'<When I was most beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 6, Oh Yeon-joo (Lim Soo-hyang) walks along this forest path.'),(5002229,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episodes 6 and 7, the appearance of Oh Ye-ji (Im Soo-hyang) returning to Jeju Island for her honeymoon three years after her husband Seo Jin (Ha Seok-jin) went missing was portrayed.'),(5002230,'<When I Was Most Beautiful(내가 가장 예뻤을 때)>In episode 6, Oh Ye-ji (Im Soo-hyang) visits the tourist attraction \"Oh Ye-ji\" walking path during her stay in Jeju-do and reminisces about the time she spent with her missing husband here. In episode 7, Seo-hwan (Ji Soo) pays a surprise visit to Ye-ji in Jeju-do and suggests fishing, leading them to this beach.'),(5002231,'<Lie to Me(내게 거짓말을 해봐)>In Season 3, Hyun Ki-joon (Kang Ji-hwan) visits this building to find genius lawyer Jae-bum Chun (Ryu Seung-soo).'),(5002232,'<Lie to me(내게 거짓말을 해봐)>This hotel appears as \'World Hotel\' operated by current standards (Kang Ji-hwan).'),(5002233,'<Try lying to me(내게 거짓말을 해봐)>Hyun Ki-joon (played by Kang Ji-hwan) had lunch with his mother Hyun Myung-jin (played by Oh Mi-hee) at this restaurant.'),(5002234,'<Tell Me Lies(내게 거짓말을 해봐)>In episode 2, Gong Ah-jung (Yoon Eun-hye) stops Hyun Sang-hee (Song Jun) in his tracks as he follows her walking down this street.'),(5002236,'<Try lying to me(내게 거짓말을 해봐)>In episode 1, Hyun Sang-hee (Sung Jun) appears here.'),(5002237,'<My Lovely Girl(내겐 너무 사랑스러운 그녀)>Yoon Se-na (Jeong Su-jeong) works part-time here.'),(5002238,'<Interior People(내부자들)>A restaurant where Woo Jang-hoon and Gogi chef have a conversation.'),(5002239,'<Internal Affairs(내부자들)>Place where the scene of reporter Woo Jang-hoon\'s press conference was filmed'),(5002240,'<The Insiders(내부자들)>The place where An Sang-gu ate ramen on the rooftop'),(5002241,'<Interior Affairs(내부자들)>Place where Ansanggu was released from prison.'),(5002242,'<Inside Men(내부자들)>Location where party scenes from Inside Men were filmed'),(5002243,'<Inside Men(내부자들)>The place where An Sang-gu was attacked by Jang Sang-moo'),(5002244,'<Reserve Boss(내성적인 보스)> In episode 5, Kang Woo-il (Yoon Bak) and his fiancée Eun Yi-soo (Gong Seung-yeon) have dinner on Christmas Eve here, even though they may not stay here for long.'),(5002245,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>In episodes 2 and 3, Eun Hwan Ki (played by Yeon Woo-jin) becomes a fashion deliveryman against his will while walking through the metasequoia alley.'),(5002246,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>The space used by the Silent Monster team for an event in episode 11. While preparing the space, everyone gets food poisoning and Eun Hwan-ki (Yeon Woo-jin) takes them to the hospital.'),(5002247,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>In this place, Eun Hwan-ki (Yeon Woo-jin) practices dating with his secretary Chae Ji-hye (Han Chae-ah) in episode 5. It is also a place where he is supposed to confess his feelings to her in the later part of the same episode, but things take a different turn. In episode 13, Cha Ro-woon (Park Hye-soo) comes to this place for an exhibition and meets Kang Woo-il (Yoon Park).'),(5002248,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>He takes Cha Ro-woon (Park Hye-soo) to this center that appears as an orphanage in episode 6.'),(5002249,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>In episode 13, Kang Woo-il (Yeon Park) cuts ties with his fiancée\'s parents. Cha Ro-woon (Hyesu Park) hears this and approaches her clearly, while Eun Hwan-ki (Woojin Yeon) listens to this.'),(5002250,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>In the 7th episode, Eun Hwan-ki (Yeon Woo-jin) decides that it is time for his daughter Eun Yi-soo (Gong Seung-yeon) to get married to Kang Woo-il (Yoon Park), and urgently asks everyone to come to the wedding venue. Despite being criticized and falsely accused, Woo-il ignores Yi-soo\'s pleas and runs away.'),(5002251,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>In episode 10, Eun Hwan Ki (Yeon Woo-jin) and Chae Ro Woon (Park Hye-soo) came to practice their eloquence.'),(5002252,'<Introverted boss(내성적인 보스)>In episode 1, Eun Hwan Ki (played by Yeon Woo Jin) is swimming.'),(5002253,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>In episode 2, Eun Ho-gu (Yeon Woo-jin) comes to this place to apologize to the former employee who committed suicide.'),(5002254,'<Introverted Boss(내성적인 보스)>This place appears as \'New York Barber Shop\'. It is where Cha Ro-wun (Park Hye-soo) and her family live.'),(5002255,'<Tomorrow(내일)>A short scene in which Guryeon (Kim Hee-sun), Park Jung-gil (Lee Su-hyuk), and Im Ryung-gu (Yoon Ji-won) appear in the palace area wearing traditional attire in Episode 11.'),(5002256,'<Tomorrow(내일)>This house is where Korean War veteran Lee Young-cheon (Jeon Mu-song) lives.'),(5002257,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In the 2nd episode, Choi Jun-woong (played by Kim Seok-woo/SF9 Rowoon) and Guryeon (played by Kim Hee-sun) will give a briefing in front of the studio and join in.'),(5002258,'<Tomorrow(내일)>The exterior appears as the NBS building of tomorrow.'),(5002259,'<Tomorrow(내일)>Choi Jun-woong (Roun) will visit the cafe in episode 9.'),(5002260,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In episode 1, there is a scene where Ok Hwang Sang-je (Kim Hae-sook) passes by this place during his morning routine inspection.'),(5002261,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In episode 6 of Gu-ryeon (starring Kim Hee-sun), she taps this place with her finger to make him die comfortably.'),(5002262,'<Tomorrow(내일)> In the 4th episode, Choi Jun-woong (Kim Seok-woo/SF9 Rowoon) and Im Ryung-gu (Yoon Ji-on) come one after another to solve Kang Woo-jin\'s case.'),(5002263,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In episode 4, Ro Woon and Yun Ji On continue to search for Kang Woo Jin\'s whereabouts in order to solve his case, as he lives with singer-songwriters Kang Seung Yoon and Lee Noah.'),(5002264,'<Tomorrow(내일)>This is where singer-songwriter Kang Woo-jin (Kang Seung-yoon) and Heo Na-young (Inoa) live. In Episode 4, Choi Jun-woong (Rowoon) and Im Ryoung-goo (Yoon Ji-on) come here one after another to solve Kang Woo-jin\'s case.'),(5002265,'<Tomorrow(내일)> In episode 4, Mayor Lee Sang-yeop and his team are walking down these stairs in search of Hana (Inoa).'),(5002266,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In episode 1, Choi Jun-woong (Roun) comes to this bridge to save someone who is trying to commit suicide, but they both fall into the Han River together. The whole incident is witnessed by the Angel of Death Guryeon (Kim Hee-sun) and Lim Ryung-gu (Yoon Ji-on).'),(5002267,'<tomorrow(내일)>In episode 6 of Epilogue, Choi Jun-woong (Rowoon) comes out with Korean War veteran Lee Young-cheon (Jeon Moosong) to this studio and takes a photo.'),(5002268,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In episode 4, Guryeon (Kim Hee-sun) sends a message to Choe Jun-ung (Kim Seok-woo/SF9 Rowoon) to come have coffee.'),(5002269,'<Tomorrow(내일)>It is a scene where Yoon Ji-on, the Reaper Lee Ryung-gu in the 9th round, watches over a pregnant woman from across the street.'),(5002270,'<Tomorrow(내일)>While carrying out missions in the present and past, Choi Jun-woong (played by Kim Seok-woo/SF9 Rowoon) and Guryeon (played by Kim Hee-sun) search for this chicken restaurant.'),(5002271,'<Tomorrow(내일)>In the cafe, Guryeon (played by Kim Hee-sun) and Limryeonggu (played by Yoon Ji-on) meet Kim Hoon (played by Cha Hak-yeon).'),(5002272,'<Next Entertainment Television(내일)>In the drama series, Choi Jun-woong (played by Kim Seok-woo/SF9 Rowoon) and Guryeon (played by Kim Hee-sun) appear in a portal to the past to solve a case in episodes 3 and 4.'),(5002273,'<Tomorrow With You(내일 그대와)>Yoo So Joon (Lee Je Hoon) invited Song Ma Rin (Shin Min Ah) to a luxurious meal in episode 4.'),(5002274,'<Tomorrow With You(내일 그대와)>In episode 1, Yoo So-joon (Lee Je-hoon) comes out to the headquarters of the investment company Myrits, where he is the chairman.'),(5002275,'<Tomorrow With You(내일 그대와)>In episode 2, Song Ma-rin (played by Shin Min-a) reluctantly rushes to this place with Yoo So-joon (played by Lee Je-hoon) after receiving a last-minute notice to replace the photographer for an online shopping mall photoshoot.'),(5002276,'<With You Tomorrow(내일 그대와)>Located where Song Marin\'s (Shin Min-a) solo exhibition is held in 2019. The 15th exhibition captures the appearance of Yoo So-jun (Lee Jae-hoon). He travels back in time to the present to personally view the exhibition. So-jun, who is also Marin\'s father at the entrance of the gallery, shares stories with Dusik (Cho Han-chul), the \'master\' of time travel, on the opposite stairs.'),(5002277,'<Tomorrow With You(내일 그대와)>In episode 2, Song Ma Rin (played by Shin Min-a) leaves Café Comma after meeting Yoo So Joon (played by Lee Je-hoon), and comes here to call So Joon and tell him that she couldn\'t make it.'),(5002278,'<Tomorrow With You(내일 그대와)>Yoo So-joon (Lee Je-hoon) takes a time travel trip on the subway. In the first episode, he enters Seoul Station from Exit 9 and boards Line 1 to travel to the year 2018.'),(5002279,'<Tomorrow I wish the world would end(내일 지구가 망해버렸으면 좋겠어)>In Episode 1, Park Sewan (Park Sewan) and Jamie (Shin Hyun-seung) walk down this bustling street early in the morning.'),(5002280,'<Clear tomorrow as well(내일도 맑음)>In episode 27, Kang Hani (played by Seo In-a) meets Lee Han-gyeol (played by Jin Ju-hyung) and Hwang Ji-eun (played by Ha Seung-ri) at this pub to have a conversation. Hani drinks too much and starts arguing with Han-gyeol as soon as Park Do-kyung (played by Lee Chang-wook) arrives.'),(5002281,'<Naildo Cantabile(내일도 칸타빌레)>This is where the music boot camp takes place in episodes 6 and 7.'),(5002282,'<Tomorrow Cantabile(내일도 칸타빌레)>It is a place where Cha Yoo-jin (played by Joo Won) grew up.'),(5002283,'<Tomorrow\'s Cantabile(내일도 칸타빌레)>This is where Seol Naeil (Shim Eun-kyung), Cha Yoojin (Joowon), and Yoon Hoo (Park Bogum) live.'),(5002284,'<Tomorrow Cantabile(내일도 칸타빌레)>It is one of the concert halls at Hanumum University. In episodes 12 and 13, Seol Nae-il (Shim Eun Kyung) advanced to the semi-finals and finals of the piano recital held in this hall, with Yoo Jin (Joo Won) and Yoon Hoo (Park Bo Gum) coming to cheer her on.'),(5002285,'<Tomorrow also Cantabile(내일도 칸타빌레)>The background of Eugene (Ju-won)\'s mom cafe. The exterior is the original look of the store, but the interior was filmed on a set.'),(5002286,'<Queen of Internal Affairs(내조의 여왕)>Operated by Eun So-hyun (Seon Woo-seon) in episode 8.'),(5002287,'<My Country: The New Age(내조의 여왕)>It is the house of Cheon Ji-ae (played by Kim Nam-joo).'),(5002288,'<Smell Girl(냄새를 보는 소녀)>In the last scene of episode 16, Choe Mugak (Park Yoochun) and Oh Cho-rim (Shin Se-kyung) ride bicycles together here.'),(5002289,'<The Girl Who Sees Smells(냄새를 보는 소녀)>In episodes 2, Choi Moo-gak (Park Yoo-chun) tests Oh Cho-rim\'s (Shin Se-kyung) ability to see smells here.'),(5002290,'<The Girl Who Sees Smells(냄새를 보는 소녀)>In episode 15, Choi Moo-gak (played by Park Yoo-chun) plans to propose to Oh Cho-rim (played by Shin Se-kyung) at the fountain in front of this building. However, he decides to oppose the idea after seeing a man proposing to his girlfriend, and Cho-rim expresses her dislike for such public proposals.'),(5002291,'<The Girl Who Sees Smells(냄새를 보는 소녀)>In episode 3, Choi Mu-gak (Park Yoo-chun) and Oh Cho-rim (Shin Se-kyung) are watching an extreme audition.'),(5002292,'<The Girl Who Sees Smells(냄새를 보는 소녀)>Choi Moo-gak (Park Yoo-chun) and Choi Eun-seol (Shin Se-kyung) go on a date here.'),(5002293,'<You are my spring(너는 나의 봄)>A scene where a damaged car with a body in it and a black cat parked in this spot was witnessed.'),(5002294,'<You Are My Spring(너는 나의 봄)>In episode 2, Kang Da-jeong (Seo Hyun-jin) finds a note with \"Yongsan Station, 99, 7641\" written on a rose patterned napkin that Chae-jun (Yoon Park) left at the café and heads to this station.'),(5002295,'<You Are My Spring(너는 나의 봄)>After episode 6, Kang Da-jeong (played by Seo Hyun-jin) and Joo Young-do (played by Kim Dong-wook) think that wearing traditional Korean hanbok will give them an excuse to do crazy things in public.'),(5002296,'<You Are My Spring(너는 나의 봄)>In episode 6, Kang Dajeong and Ju Young-do stroll down this street dressed as a grim reaper and a virgin ghost.'),(5002297,'<You Are My Spring(너는 나의 봄)>The drama\'s main character, Kang Da-jeong (played by Seo Hyun-jin), works as the concierge manager at this hotel.'),(5002298,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 30, Nam Shin meets Seo Jong-gil (Yoo Oh-sung) here, and the director hands him the recording of the chairman and his father.'),(5002299,'<Are You Human?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 25, Nam Shin III (played by Seo Kang-jun) and the human Nam Shin (also played by Seo Kang-jun) meet outside the cafe \"Chae So\". Kang So-bong (played by Gong Seung-yeon) is seen waiting inside. Nam Shin III then captivates So-bong\'s gaze and she approaches him on the cafe balcony to speak to him.'),(5002300,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>This is the place where the wedding of Seo Ye Na (Park Hwan-hee) and Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) will take place in episodes 18-19. It is also where Nam Shin III leaves to rescue Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon).'),(5002301,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>This hospital appeared as \'PK Medical Center\' where the robot Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) was in charge of the ward in episode 5, and in episode 6, Nam Shin (Seo Kang-joon) moves in when he arrives in Korea from the Czech Republic. In episode 19, Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) also moved her ward to this place.'),(5002302,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In this cafe, Kang So Bong\'s (Gong Seung Yeon) father Kang Jae Shik (Kim Won Hae) and his two trainees question their relationship with Nam Shin III (Seo Kang Joon) in episode 21 of Are You Human Too? (KBS2, 2018)///? New tenant in place ?///'),(5002303,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 4, Ji Young-hoon (played by Lee Joon-hyuk) and Nam Shin III (played by Seo Kang-joon) brought reporter Jo to this bar.'),(5002304,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)> The M-Car launching after-party of PK Motors was held here in episode 4.'),(5002305,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>This is where Seo Ye-na (played by Park Hwan-hee) and Nam Shin III (played by Seo Kang-jun) come to see wedding dresses in episode 15.'),(5002306,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 15, Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) and Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) take a walk here after their bridal shop failure with Seo Ye-na (Park Hwan-hee).'),(5002307,'<You\'re Human Too(너도 인간이니)> In episode 13, Geonho Chairman (Young-gyu) and Ji Yeong-hoon (Lee Jun-hyuk) agree to meet Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) at the restaurant Umae (Umae). And they realize that a real Nam Shin has taken their place.'),(5002308,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 33, Reporter Jo (Kim Hyun-sook) stands confidently in the middle of this square. She watches as Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) appears on the screens of surrounding buildings in a news story about artificial intelligence robots.'),(5002309,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 18, Kang Sobong (Gong Seungyeon) and Nam Shin III (Seo Kangjoon) ride bicycles to this place. He tells her that he doesn\'t need to hide the fact that he is a robot when he is around her.'),(5002310,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 11, Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) eats a meal while looking at Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon). The ajumma asks So-bong to invite Nam Shin III, but she continues eating. As it starts raining, So-bong tries to run away but Nam Shin III comes back with an umbrella to protect her. Outside the restaurant, So-bong says she will become his \"robot slave,\" and So-bong agrees because she helped him reject a proposal earlier.'),(5002311,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 17, Seo Jong-gil (played by Yu Oh-seong) meets his informant under this bridge and receives information from his spy. Jong-gil suspects that his informant, Kang So-bong (played by Gong Seung-yeon), is hiding something from them.'),(5002312,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 8, Robot Namshin 3 (Seo Kang-joon) crosses this bridge riding a motorcycle.'),(5002313,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)> Kang So-bong (played by Gong Seung-yeon) meets Ji Young-hoon (played by Lee Joon-hyuk) here. She tells her that the chairman knows the true identity of Nam Shin III (played by Seo Kang-joon) as a robot.'),(5002314,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 18, Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) and Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) ride bicycles up the stairs in front of this house.'),(5002315,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>A shelter where Aurora (Kim Sung-ryoung) and David (Choi Deok-moon) stay to take care of the human Nam Shin (Seo Kang-joon) who is in a coma'),(5002316,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 3, PK Group conducts a large-scale presentation on the Maha autonomous driving car (or M-Car) at this venue. Seo Jun-gil (Yoo Seung-ho) takes the lead in place of Nam Shin (Seo Kang-joon) who couldn\'t be there due to \'business\', but Nam Shin\'s sudden appearance as Robot Nam Shin III surprises everyone as they were unaware of him standing in for Nam Shin. Outside the auditorium, Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) protests against the injustice she faced, but later she walks her own path after realizing that Nam Shin was there all along.'),(5002317,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In the first episode, scientist Aurora (Kim Sung-ryung) gives a lecture on the future of artificial intelligence at this venue. During the lecture, she is interrupted by her 7-year-old son Nam Shin (Oh Han-kyul).'),(5002318,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 10, a marriage meeting between Nam Shin (Seo Kang Joon) and Seo Ye Na (Park Hwan Hee) unfolds. It is also a place where Nam Shin III kisses Kang So Bong (Gong Seung Yeon) to reject the marriage.'),(5002319,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 29, Nam Shin (Seo Kang-joon) is lured to the rooftop/helipad of this building by Ji-Young Hoon (Lee Joon-hyuk). However, what he wanted to meet was Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon). Nam Shin III convinces Ji-Young Hoon to leave him alone and tries to throw himself off the rooftop, but the latter shows him that he is being controlled by a responsible person in manual mode. Episode 30 also sees a confrontation between manual mode Nam Shin III and Nam Chairman (Park Young-kyu). During the argument, Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) arrives and Nam Shin III turns the tables by using her as a decoy.'),(5002320,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) crosses this bridge on a motorcycle to rescue kidnapped Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) and then pursues Seo Jong-gil\'s agent (Choi Byung-mo).'),(5002321,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 19, Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) chased Agent Seo (Choi Byung-mo) and ended up on the street right in front of this university.'),(5002322,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 28, Nam Sin 3 (Seo Kang Joon) and Kang So Bong (Gong Seung Yeon) come here for a date. The area where they take a walk is at Gaeuldae, and the piano scene is right in front of Smoothie King. In episode 29, it is revealed that the human Nam Sin (Seo Kang Joon) followed them all the way to this place.'),(5002323,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>After saving Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon), who was kidnapped in episode 19, Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) chases Agent Seo Jong-gil (Choi Byung-mo) on this street.'),(5002324,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>The lobby and exterior of this building both appear to be the headquarters of \'PK Group\'.'),(5002325,'<Are You Human(너도 인간이니)>This hotel is where Aurora (Kim Sungryoung) stays in episode 17. Ji Yonghoon (Lee Junhyuk) comes to talk about Namshin III\'s actions without knowing that he was followed by Seo Jonggil\'s spy all the way to the hotel. Later, Laura takes a taxi to leave the hotel to meet Kang Sobong (Kong Seungyeon).'),(5002326,'<Are You Human Too(너도 인간이니)>In episode 18, after riding a bicycle, Gong Seung-yeon (Kang So-bong) is on the phone with Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon). After hearing Ji Young-hoon (Lee Joon-hyuk) and Aurora (Kim Sung-ryung) tell her to return as a slave, she says she will never meet them again. Shortly after, Nam Shin III hands Kang So-bong her mother\'s necklace and crosses the busy street to say a final farewell to her.'),(5002327,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 36 of the final episode, Kang So-bong (Gong Seung-yeon) bids a final farewell to Nam Shin III (Seo Kang-joon) with the robot, Maibo.'),(5002328,'<Are You Human Too?(너도 인간이니)>In episode 1, Nam Shin (Seo Kang-jun) arrives at this place receiving security guards\' escort at the terminal.'),(5002329,'<Remember You(너를 기억해)>In the drama \"Remember You,\" Cha Ji-an (Jang Nara) follows Lee Hyun (Seo In-guk) who takes a taxi along this street.'),(5002330,'<Remember You(너를 기억해)>In one recollection scene, there is a scene of Lee Hyun\'s (Seo In-guk) father visiting a prisoner (cameo by EXO\'s D.O.) here.'),(5002331,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>Featured as \'Taerim Hospital\' led by Director Park Young-seon (played by Kim Bo-yeon). Her daughter Ahn Minseo (played by Jang Hye-jin) is the director of the neurosurgery department, Jung Hee-joo (played by Go Hyun-jung) is a physical therapist, and Jung Sun-woo (played by Shin Dong-wook) is also seen as a physical therapist. Episode 1 shows Hee-joo and Sun-woo having a conversation while drinking coffee.'),(5002332,'<Person Who Resemble You(너를 닮은 사람)>It is a cafe where Juyeong (Shin Hye-ji) works. In episode 4, Heeju (Go Hyeon-jeong) meets Juyeong in episode 7 after her phone breaks and gifts her a new one.'),(5002333,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)> The entrance to this complex appears as part of the \"Sanjeong\" residential complex where Ahn Hyun-seong\'s family home is located in the drama. In episode 3, you can see the scene where Hee-jeong (Go Hyeon-joo) and Hae-won (Shin Hyeon-bin) have an argument.'),(5002334,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>In episode 1, Haewon (played by Shin Hyun Bin) is checking her reflection in the bus stop glass. The scene transitions to the bus stop where Heeju\'s (played by Go Hyun Jung) solo exhibition poster is being advertised until the conversation unfolds.'),(5002335,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>In the second episode, the scene of Haewon (played by Shin Hyun-bin) and Seonwoo (played by Shin Dong-wook) having lunch at a restaurant after coincidentally meeting at a church was depicted.'),(5002336,'<Resemblance to You(너를 닮은 사람)>In episode 1, Jeong Seon-woo (played by Shin Dong-wook) and his niece Anri-sa (played by Kim Soo-an) meet at this restaurant.'),(5002337,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>In the 5th episode of \"When I Was Most Beautiful,\" Haewon (Shin Hyun-bin) received a call from an unknown number, only to find out it was actually Woojae (Kim Jae-young).'),(5002338,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>In the third episode, the scene of Hee-joo (Go Hyun-jung) and Woo-jae (Kim Jae-young) on a date on this walking path is shown.'),(5002339,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>In episode 2, Jeong Seon-woo (played by Shin Dong-wook), who was about to receive repentance at Gohaesungsa, sees a patient named Gu Hae-won (played by Shin Hyeon-bin) sitting in the church pew.'),(5002341,'<People Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>This is a bar operated by Yoon Sang-ho (played by Kim Sang-ho). For example, in episode 1, there is a scene where Gu Hae-won (played by Shin Hyun-bin) mistakenly thinks of this place as a restaurant. It is explained that they have not changed the sign yet and also provide food.'),(5002342,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>In episode 1, Haewon (played by Shin Hyun-bin) is seen walking through the tunnel on her way back home'),(5002343,'<Someone Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>Appearing as Taerim Foundation Taerim Girls\' Junior High School run by the Ahn family, it is the school that An Ri-sa (Kim Soo-an) used to attend and where Go Hae-won (Shin Hyun-bin) was a former art teacher.'),(5002344,'<People Like You(너를 닮은 사람)>An art gallery called \'Fine Gallery\' showcasing the works of Hee-ju (Go Hyeonjeong) and Woo-joo (Kim Jaeyoung) seen in episode 6.'),(5002345,'<Time when I loved you(너를 사랑한 시간)>In episode 1, Oh Ha-na (Ha Ji-won) walks along this street passing by Jill Sander (442) and Gucci (462) stores.'),(5002346,'<Time I Loved You(너를 사랑한 시간)>Appears as the exterior of SS Home Shopping. In episode 1, Marketing Manager Oh Hana (Ha Ji-won) visits here to persuade the staff to continue airing the product.'),(5002347,'<Time I Loved You(너를 사랑한 시간)>Appears as Tendi headquarters in drama.'),(5002348,'<Time I Loved You(너를 사랑한 시간)>Choi Won (Lee Jin-wook) frequently passes through this airport as a flight attendant for AriA Airlines.'),(5002349,'<How to hate you(너를 싫어하는 방법)>In episode 1, Ida Som (Kim Yujin) and her boyfriend Goeun-tae (Lee Jong-won) went on a double date with Omi-ri (Kim Ji-in) and fake boyfriend Han Dae-kang (Jae-min) at the chain store branch.'),(5002350,'<How to hate you(너를 싫어하는 방법)>NC Soft restaurant appears as a Seojungdae restaurant.'),(5002351,'<How to Hate You(너를 싫어하는 방법)>In episode 13, Han Dae-kang (NCT Dream\'s Jaemin) ends his fake relationship with Lee Mi-ri (Kim Ji-in) in this way.'),(5002352,'<How to Hate You(너를 싫어하는 방법)>This university is portrayed as \'Seojung University\' attended by Daeomi Lee (IZ*ONE\'s Jang Wonyoung) and Handaegang (NCT Dream\'s Jaemin).'),(5002353,'<How to Dislike You(너를 싫어하는 방법)>In the first episode, group members Omiri (Kim Ji-in), Handaegang (NCT Dream Jaemin), and senior Taemin brainstorm for a webtoon group project at this restaurant.'),(5002354,'<493km speed to get to you(너에게 가는 속도 493km)> In episode 6, Yook Sung-hwan (Kim Moo-jun) invited Lee Yoo-min (Seo Ji-hye) to this restaurant.'),(5002355,'<Speed to You 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 6, Junis\' couple and professional badminton players Yang Sung-sil (Jeon Hye-won) and Lee Ji-ho (Lee Chae-min) walk through this park after ordering takeout burgers for their team.'),(5002356,'<Speed to you 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 11, siblings Park Taejoon (Chae Jonghyup) and Park Junyoung (Park Jihyun) were depicted coming to this restaurant to drink.'),(5002357,'<Speed to You 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>After coach Lee Taesang (played by Cho Hanchul) stops Park Taeyoung, he walks this distance in the early stages of the 6th round.'),(5002358,'<Traveling speed to you 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 12, Yook Sung-hwan (Kim Moo-jun) invites Lee Yoo-min (Seo Ji-hye) to this restaurant and asks her to wait until spring.'),(5002359,'<493km in the speed of reaching you(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>The place where Park Taeyang (Park Joo-hyeon) is about to renew his contract with Kim Hee-chang, the coach of Hope Bank badminton team.'),(5002360,'<Speed to You: 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 15, Yeon Seung-woo (Choi Seung-yoon) is sharing samples of the family company\'s new product.'),(5002361,'<Speed to You: 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 5 of You Are My Spring, Yook Jeong-hwan (played by Kim Moo-joon) and Lee Yoo-min (played by Seo Ji-hye) are shown eating ramen at this restaurant.'),(5002362,'<Speed to get to you is 493km/hr(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 1, Park Tae-yang (Park Ju-hyun) is seen riding his bicycle across this bridge at night on his way back home.'),(5002363,'<Speed of 493km to you(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>During the 2nd lap, Park Taeyang (Park Juhyun) hears from teammates that he will start the marathon in front of this center holding a start point.'),(5002364,'<Speeding towards you at 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 2, Park Tae-yang (played by Park Ju-hyun) stops under the south side of the bridge while running her marathon in Banpo Han River Park. In episode 5, Park Tae-hwan (played by Park Ju-hyun) and his father Park Man-soo (played by Jeon Bae-soo) cross this bridge after completing contract negotiations with the coach of Hope Bank Badminton Team, Kim Hee-chang.'),(5002365,'<Speed to you 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>Kang Yoo-sung (played by Yoon Jong-hoon) and Han Dae-soo (played by Kim Dae-gon) have a drink at this restaurant in episode 5.'),(5002366,'<Speed to reach you 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 1, Park Tae-jun (Chae Jong-hyup) drinks at this bar.'),(5002367,'<Speed of going to you 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>To prevent meeting his mother in the 12th episode, he runs to this street along Gyeonghuigung 3-gil.'),(5002368,'<Speed to get to you 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>Appears as the accommodation for Unis badminton players in episodes 3 and 4.'),(5002369,'<Speeding towards you at 493km/h(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>In episode 8, Park Tae-joon (played by Chae Jong-hyeop), Park Tae-yang (played by Park Joo-hyun), and Yook Jeong-hwan (played by Kim Moo-joon) hurry down this street carrying a cake to attend a last-minute surprise birthday party for one of their team members.'),(5002370,'<Speed to Reach You 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>After falling into the water, Park Tae-yang (played by Park Ju-hyun) and Park Tae-jun (played by Chae Jong-hyeop) seek refuge under the roof of this cafe.'),(5002371,'<Speed to You 493km(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>This is the cafe where Park Tae-yang (Park Ju-hyun) in Episode 4 of \"To You\" tells Park Tae-joon (Chae Jong-hyup) that she might leave the team.'),(5002372,'<Traveling at a speed of 493km to you(너에게 가는 속도 493km)>During a quarrel, Park Taeyang (Park Ju-hyeon) and Park Taejun (Chae Jong-hyeop) walk through this stadium once again, renewing their friendship. While arguing, they see the fountain in front of the building starting and playing in the water for a while.'),(5002373,'<You and Me Police Academy(너와 나의 경찰수업)>In episode 11, new recruits drive along this road when they go on a backpacking trip to Gangneung.'),(5002374,'<You and My Police Class(너와 나의 경찰수업)>In episode 11, Yoo Dae-il (played by Park Sung-joon) plans a backpacking trip to Gangneung, attracting freshmen to this place.'),(5002375,'<You and Me Police Class(너와 나의 경찰수업)>In episode 11, Min Hanji (played by Lee Se-mi) appears at \'Club Alto\' threatening Jo Hansol (played by Kim Kwon).'),(5002376,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>The sea where love was confirmed at your wedding'),(5002377,'<Your Wedding Ceremony(너의 결혼식)>A cafe where Kim Youngkwang took Park Boyoung for your wedding ceremony.'),(5002378,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>A barbecue restaurant where Kim Young-gwang ate with his college friends at your wedding.'),(5002379,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>The place where Kim Youngkwang went fishing with friends at your wedding.'),(5002380,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>The park where Kim Young-kwang and Park Bo-young broke up at your wedding'),(5002381,'<\"Your Wedding\"(너의 결혼식)>The place where Kim Young-kwang and Park Bo-young went on a date in \"Your Wedding\"'),(5002382,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>The place where Park Bo-young filmed catching fish in \"Your Wedding\"'),(5002383,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>The place where Park Bo-young and Kim Young-kwang ate meat at your wedding'),(5002384,'<Your Wedding(너의 결혼식)>The place where Park Bo-young\'s school background was featured in your wedding.'),(5002385,'<Sing Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>Hong Yi-young (Kim Se-jung) comes to buy bread at the 8th meeting when she encounters Wang Mi-hyang (Hwang Hye-eun), a flutist at Shin Young Philharmonic Orchestra. After Mi-hyang leaves the bakery, she gets robbed by a pickpocket, and Yi-young chases after her without hesitation.'),(5002386,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>The \'Shin Young Philharmonic\' appears at the \'SY Art Center\' practicing in episodes 1, 4, and 7.'),(5002387,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 4, there is a scene where Hong Yi-young (played by Kim Se-jung) is sitting in this café (Caffé Bene) waiting to see her ex-boyfriend Moon Jae-hyung (played by Kim Sang-kyun) dance.'),(5002388,'<Play Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>Hong Yi-young\'s uncle took her to a marine rescue parade held in this park when she was young, which captivated her with drums and later led her to make it her profession.'),(5002389,'<Play Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 12 (main episode 6), Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin) and Hong Yi-young (Kim Se-jeong) visited this store in the shopping mall for their \'ordinary date\'.'),(5002390,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 13, Hong Yi-young (played by Kim Se-jeong) and Ha Eun-joo (played by Park Ji-yeon) meet at this cafe.'),(5002391,'<Tell me your song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 10, Nam Ju-wan (Song Jae-lim) meets Professor Kang Myeong-seok (Song Young-kyu) at this bar and a suspicious man joins them afterwards.'),(5002392,'<Listen to Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 12 (6), Jang Yoon (played by Yeo Jin-goo) meets his lawyer friend Choi Ki-sang (played by Kim Chang-hoi) at this bar.'),(5002393,'<Show Me Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 3, Haeunju (T-ara\'s Park Jiyeon) takes Nam Juwan (Song Jaerim) to this bridge to enjoy the Rainbow Bridge together.'),(5002394,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>Meeting of Shin Young Philharmonic Director Kang Myung-seok (played by Song Young-kyu) and Yoon Mi-rae (played by Yoon Ju-hee). Joining them is Jang Yoon\'s father and chairman Jang Seok-hyun (played by Jung Sung-mo) in this restaurant.'),(5002395,'<Listen to Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 13 (episode 7), Seo Su-hyang (Jo Mi-ryeong) invited Yoon Mi-rae (Yoon Ju-hee) to this restaurant.'),(5002396,'<Listen to Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 2 (entire episode 1) of \"Meow, the Boyfriend,\" after breaking up with her boyfriend Moon Jun-hyung (Kim Sang-kyun) after a fight, Hong Yi-young (Kim Se-jeong) crosses the bridge in tears. In episode 6, Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin) recalls the moment he met his lawyer friend Choi Ki-sang (Kim Chang-hoe) on the bridge to discuss the death of his younger brother and Hong Yi-young\'s death.'),(5002397,'<Listen to Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 10 (out of 5 episodes total), Ha Eun-joo (Park Ji-yeon of T-ara) meets someone under this bridge.'),(5002398,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 4 (out of 2 total episodes), Jang Yoon (played by Yeon Woo Jin) approaches a fearful Hong Yi Young (played by Kim Sejeong of gugudan) with the tower in the background on this hiking trail.'),(5002399,'<Listen to Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>It is a convenience store frequently visited by Hong Yi-young (Kim Se-jeong of Gugudan). Like in episode 1 (all previous episodes), she went to buy an umbrella in the rain, but it was too expensive so she ultimately did not buy it. It is where she first met Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin), who handed her an umbrella and saved her from a minor accident there.'),(5002400,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 4, Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin) brings Hong Yi-young (Kim Sejeong) to this park and asks her if he can kiss her. Yoon seems hesitant to respond to her emotions and awkwardness until he leans in for the kiss.'),(5002401,'<Play Me Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>This is a restaurant that Hong E-young (former member of girl group Gugudan, Kim Se-jeong) often passes by. In episode 2 (part 1), when the memory of buying food for her boyfriend, Moon Jae-in (Kim Sang-kyun), came to mind, when she didn\'t have enough food. Drunk, she stages a scene outside, and ultimately gets dragged over to Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin), who was passing by.'),(5002402,'<Bring Your Song to Me(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 18 (out of total 9 episodes), Haeun (Park Ji-yeon) suggests meeting at this cafe to Jangyoon (Yeon Woo-jin). Jangyoon finds out in that episode that his younger brother was murdered.'),(5002403,'<Listen to Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 4, Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin) gives a ride to Hong Yi-young (Kim Se-jeong from Gugudan) on his motorcycle and they climb the stairs together. Before this happened, he sent her to a friend\'s studio and told her she would see a unique Tiffany set that is one of only two in Korea.'),(5002404,'<Bring Me Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 2, Jang Yoon (Yeon Woo-jin) and Hong Yi-young (Kim Se-jeong) finally reach the summit station of the cable car after climbing many stairs and steep paths. Yi-young becomes even angrier when she finds out that Yoon knew this fact from the beginning. As she leaves, he requests her to ride the cable car together tomorrow, and this line suddenly triggers a flash of memory.'),(5002405,'<Let me hear your song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>This is the headquarters of Shin Young Philharmonic Orchestra, and it is where Hong Eun-young (former member of Gugudan and I.O.I) holds the Team Panhi audition.'),(5002406,'<Let Me Hear Your Song(너의 노래를 들려줘)>In episode 7 (out of 4 episodes total), Yoon Mi-rae (played by Yoon Joo-hee) is shown preparing while receiving a phone call in a hotel room.'),(5002407,'<I Hear Your Voice(너의 목소리가 들려)>The office of lawyer Jang Hyesung (Lee Bo-young) and her colleague Cha Gwan-woo (Yoon Sang-hyun) is located right across the street from the court.'),(5002408,'<Your Voice is Heard(너의 목소리가 들려)>A chicken restaurant featured in \"Your Voice is Heard\" as Hyeseong Chicken'),(5002409,'<Heard Your Voice(너의 목소리가 들려)>Aquarium featured in Heard Your Voice'),(5002410,'<I Hear Your Voice(너의 목소리가 들려)>Jang Hye-sung (Lee Bo-young) lives in this house with Park Soo-ha (Lee Jong-suk).'),(5002411,'<Can You Hear My Voice(너의 목소리가 들려)>It is the place where most of the court scenes in the play take place.'),(5002412,'<I Can Hear Your Voice(너의 목소리가 들려)>Park Soo-ha (played by Lee Jong-suk) and Ko Sung-bin (played by Kim Ga-eun) attend this school.'),(5002413,'<Hear Your Voice(너의 목소리가 들려)>In episode 2, Go Sung-bin (Kim Ga-eun) is unable to convince 