use, takes Young-in for an evening walk around this park near their home. They grow closer here and he even sings and dances for her.'),(5002695,'< Who are you? (누구세요?)> Kim Young-ae (Park Ji-young) appears as the owner of a cross-stitch shop.'),(5002696,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>Kim Bora (played by Sung Yu-ri) and Han Deok-gu (played by Hyun Bin) attend the university. Firstly, Deok-gu roams the campus as Bora\'s driver until a mathematics professor (played by Kim Beol-lae) takes an interest in him, leading to him being brought in for private tutoring.'),(5002697,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In the drama, \'Memories of the Alhambra,\' Han Tae-woong (Hyun Bin) and young Kim Bo-ra (Go Joo-yeon) gather at this amusement park. They ride the ferris wheel together. When they take a taxi to go home, she asks why he hasn\'t asked for her name yet.'),(5002698,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>Appears as part of \'Gwakga High School\' in episode 1.'),(5002699,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In episode 13, Kim Bora (played by Sung Yuri) and Han Deok-gu (played by Hyun Bin) walk to exit 11 of this station on their way to her house.'),(5002700,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>The place where Han Deok-goo\'s (played by Hyun Bin) mother\'s street vendor is located in episode 1.'),(5002701,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>Seo Geon-ho (Lim Ju-hwan) and Kim Bo-ra (Seong Yu-ri) met twice at this café. In episode 7, Bora unexpectedly meets her mother here, and in episode 9, Geon-ho says goodbye to his mother at this café.'),(5002702,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>Tae-woong (Hyun Bin) sees off his mother at this bus terminal as she decides to leave Seoul to commute to Daejeon.'),(5002703,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In episode 3, Han Deok-gu (Hyun Bin) brings the drunk Kim Bo-ra (Seong Yoo-ri) to the park after a drinking session with Lee Seung-ri (Seong Yoo-ri).'),(5002704,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>Kim Bora (Seong Yuri) lives in this mansion with her father, Kim Jang-soo (Chun Ho-jin).'),(5002705,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In episode 3, Seo Geon-woo (played by Im Ju-hwan) brings Kim Bo-ra (played by Sung Yuri).'),(5002706,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In episode 6, Kim Bora (Seongyuri) and Seo Geon-woo (Im Ju-hwan) visited this park and exchanged gifts.'),(5002707,'<The Penthouse(눈의 여왕)>In episode 5, Kim Bo-ri (portrayed by Eugene) and Han Deok-gu (portrayed by Hyun Bin) take the bus to cross this bridge on their way back to her house. He compliments her saying \"pretty,\" she believes he genuinely cares for her, but he dismisses it as simply referring to the night view he mentioned.'),(5002708,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In episode 4, a fashion show attended by Kim Boro (Seong Yoo-ri) is held here. This is also where Han Deok-gu (Hyun Bin) tracks her down and saves her from an obsessed fan.'),(5002709,'<The Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>In episode 2, Han Deok-gu (Hyun Bin) comes to this restaurant with his close friend Choi Chung-sik (Jin Tae-hyun) and their trainer.'),(5002710,'<K-Drama \"The Snow Queen\"(눈의 여왕)>In episode 1, Han Deuk-gu (played by Hyun Bin) searches for the Snow Queen in the bookstore of this market.'),(5002711,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>Kim Bora (played by Sung Yu-ri) and Han Deok-gu (played by Hyun Bin) pass through this park when they take a walk to her house in episode 13.'),(5002713,'<Snow Queen(눈의 여왕)>The 39th International Mathematical Olympiad, where Han Tae-woong (played by Hyun Bin) and Kim Jung-gyu (played by Lee Sun-ho) compete for 1st place, takes place at the Central Library.'),(5002714,'<Blindingly Bright(눈이 부시게)>In episode 9, Jun-ha (Nam Joo-hyuk) and the senior from the nursery school he became close to, visit this place.'),(5002715,'<Blinding(눈이 부시게)>Kim Hyeja\'s (Kim Hyeja/Han Jimin) house appears. Her mother (Lee Jeong-eun) operates a beauty salon called \'Happy Beauty Salon\'. Her father (Ahn Dae-sang) and brother Kim Young-soo (Son Ho-jun) also live here. In episode 1, Hyeja\'s close friends Lee Hyun-joo (Kim Gaeun) and Yoon Sang-eun (Song Sang-eun) were shown enjoying Hyeja\'s date on the rooftop.'),(5002716,'<Blinded by the Sun(눈이 부시게)>