ant recommended by Lee Hae-ri'),(5002740,'<Davichi(다비치)> Recommended Italian Restaurant in Cheongdam-dong by Kang Minkyung'),(5002741,'<Davichi(다비치)>Frequent snack restaurant during Kang Minkyung\'s high school days.'),(5002742,'<Davichi(다비치)>The original lamb skewer recommended by Davichi'),(5002743,'<Davichi(다비치)>A famous sandwich restaurant that Kang Min-kyung often visits.'),(5002744,'<Davichi(다비치)>Recommended soy sauce crab restaurant Davichi'),(5002745,'<Davichi(다비치)>Bakery featured in Kang Minkyung\'s vlog'),(5002746,'<Davichi(다비치)>Latte restaurant recommended by Kang Min-kyung'),(5002747,'<Davichi(다비치)>A pork tail restaurant recommended by Kang Min-kyung'),(5002748,'<Davichi(다비치)>Michelin 2010 French restaurant recommended by Kang Min-kyung.'),(5002749,'<Davichi(다비치)>Kang Minkyung certified this restaurant as a delicious pork restaurant on her Instagram profile.'),(5002750,'<Davichi(다비치)>The master of galchi jjorim recommended by Davichi'),(5002751,'<Re - Encounter(다시 만난 세계)> In episode 18, Sung Hae-sung (played by Yeo Jin-goo) took Jeong Won (played by Lee Yeon-hee) to the park.'),(5002752,'<Another World(다시 만난 세계)>In episode 18, Cha Tae-hoon (played by Kim Jin-woo) meets Lee Seo-won (played by Han So-hee) who quit her job at a cafe, and they go on a blind date at this cafe.'),(5002753,'<Once Again(다시 만난 세계)>Jeong Jeong-won (Lee Yeon-hee) appears at \'SNT\', an Italian restaurant run by Cha Si (Ahn Jae-hyun) who works as a sous chef.'),(5002754,'<Another Miss Oh(다시 만난 세계)>Seong Soo-ji (played by Kim Hye-jun) is hospitalized at this hospital, which appears as \"Taesan Medical Center\" in episode 36. Seong Yeong-in (played by Kim Ga-eun) discovers her own illness.'),(5002755,'<Another World(다시 만난 세계)> In episode 25, Sehee gives earrings to Jiho.'),(5002756,'<The World We Met Again(다시 만난 세계)>In episode 22, Seong Hae-sung (played by Yeo Jin-goo) and Cha Si (played by Ahn Jae-hyun) start a new business after quitting the SMT restaurant. They first open a pasta food truck under this bridge.'),(5002757,'<The World We Met Again(다시 만난 세계)>Jeong Jeongwon (Lee Yeonhee) and Hong Jinju (Park Jinju) live here.'),(5002758,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Dynamic Duo\'s Gaeko visited a rice soup restaurant in Busan.'),(5002759,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>A place where Dynamic Duo enjoyed Chiayi cuisine'),(5002760,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Restaurant approved by Choiza and Gaeko from Dynamic Duo on Choiza Road.'),(5002761,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Dynamic Duo\'s favorite restaurant they have been visiting since childhood'),(5002762,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Golden Tteokbokki restaurant certified by Dynamic Duo\'s Gaeko on Instagram'),(5002763,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>A must-visit restaurant where Dynamic Duo was impressed by the tonkatsu'),(5002764,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Dynamic Duo visited this famous Pyongyang cold noodles restaurant.'),(5002765,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>A place where Dynamic Duo, Choiza, ate and recalled Jeju'),(5002766,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Dynamic Duo\'s Gaeko often wants to come to this buckwheat noodle restaurant.'),(5002767,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Bakery specializing in tteokbokki visited by the members of Dynamic Duo, Gaeko.'),(5002768,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>The original chicken soup restaurant where Dynamic Duo\'s Choiza stays healthy with nutritious samgyetang'),(5002769,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>A hangover soup restaurant that Dynamic Duo\'s Gaeko enjoyed and was satisfied with.'),(5002770,'<Dynamic Duo(다이나믹 듀오)>Samgyeopsal restaurant recognized by Dynamic Duo Choiza'),(5002771,'<dia(다이아)>Filming location for Dia\'s music video \"In the October of Seoraksan\"'),(5002772,'<dia(다이아)>The location where the music video for Dia\'s \'WooWoo\' was filmed.'),(5002773,'<Dia(다이아)>Filming location of Dia\'s music video \'In Seoraksan in April\''),(5002774,'<Instagram(다이아)>Photos of the cafe posted by the members of the group Diamond'),(5002775,'<Diamond(다이아)>Gangnam cafe visited by JuEun on the V app'),(5002776,'<DIA(다이아)>A cafe where Eunchae drinks coffee in the shining country.'),(5002777,'<Dia(다이아)>The place where Jung Chae-yeon buried and dug up a time capsule in \"Drinking Solo\"'),(5002778,'<DIA(다이아)>Hongdae cafe visited by Jueun in V App'),(5002779,'<Diamond(다이아)>A brunch cafe in Sangam-dong run by Jueun\'s uncle.'),(5002780,'<Diamond(다이아)>Chaeyeon Jeong visited a bookstore on V Live.'),(5002781,'<Dia(다이아)>The location where Dia\'s music video for \'On That Road\' was filmed'),(5002782,'<Dakchigo Flower Boy Band(닥치고 꽃미남 밴드)>This is the school that the members of Eye Candy attended before transferring in Episode 1.'),(5002783,'<\"Shut Up Flower Boy Band\"(닥치고 꽃미남 밴드)>In the first episode, the band Eye Candy decides to perform in this park in front of Arko Art Theater after their performance at the club is canceled. When they start playing, they face off against rival band Strawberry Fields, who are also watching the show at the theater on the same day. Im Su-ah (Jo Bo-ah) arrives at the scene to watch the Strawberry Fields performance, but Eye Candy\'s leader Joo Byung-hee (Lee Min-ki) mistakes her for his \'muse\' and embraces Su-ah in front of her crush, singer Yoo Seung-hoon (Jung Ui-chul) of Strawberry Fields, leading to a fight between the two bands.'),(5002784,'<Doctor Stranger(닥터 이방인)>This is a place that frequently appears in the drama, as the house of the main character, Oh Soo-hyun (Kang Sora).'),(5002785,'<Doctor Stranger(닥터 이방인)>In the drama, Park Hoon (played by Lee Jong-suk) works as a doctor at \'Myungwoo Hospital,\' which is owned by Oh Soo-hyun\'s (played by Kang So-ra) father.'),(5002786,'<Doctor Jin(닥터 진)>In episode 3, Chunhong (Lee So-yeon) enjoys herself with Pastor Kim Byeong-hee (Kim Eung-soo) and his friends on this riverbank. Jinhyuk (Song Seung-heon) joins them shortly after.'),(5002787,'<Doctor Jin(닥터 진)>This place appears as part of the palace. You can see it, for example, in the 17th episode\'s royal banquet.'),(5002788,'<Doctor Prisoner(닥터 프리즈너)>While Na Yi-jae (Nam Goong Min) was on his way to Seoroseoul Prison after receiving a phone call from Oh Jeong-hee (Kim Jeong Nan), he crossed this bridge.'),(5002789,'<Dr. Prisoner(닥터 프리즈너)>In episode 1, the bewildered Lee Jae-in (played by Lee Da-in) arrives at this airport and calls her mother, Moira (played by Jin Hee-kyung).'),(5002790,'<Doctor Prisoner(닥터 프리즈너)>Formerly imprisoned for three months due to a medical accident, Na Yi-jae (Namgung Min) returns to \'Seoul Central Prison\' as Doctor Prisoner.'),(5002791,'<Doctors(닥터스)>In episode 2, Yoo Hye-jung (Park Shin-hye) and Hong (Kim Rae-won) take shelter by riding bicycles to escape a sudden downpour.'),(5002792,'<Doctors(닥터스)>Yoo Hye-jung (Park Shin-hye) and Hong Ji-hong (Kim Rae-won) ride bicycles past.'),(5002793,'<Doctor\'s(닥터스)>In episode 20, Hong Ji-hong (played by Kim Rae-won) proposes to Yoo Hye-jung (played by Park Shin-hye).'),(5002794,'<Doctors(닥터스)>This is where Hong Ji-hong (played by Kim Rae-won) and Jung Yoon-do (played by Yoon Kyun-sang) live.'),(5002795,'<doctors(닥터스)>In episode 3, Hong Ji-hong (played by Kim Rae-won) meets the school principal at the gallery cafe.'),(5002796,'<Doctors(닥터스)>Appears as part of Suni Hawaii Cafe.'),(5002797,'<Doctors(닥터스)>This is where Yoo Hye-jung (Park Shin-hye) lived.'),(5002799,'<Doctors(닥터스)>This is the place where Hong Ji-hong (played by Kim Rae-won) and Yoo Hye-jung (played by Park Shin-hye) dance and kiss in the rain in episode 6.'),(5002800,'<Doctors(닥터스)>This school appears as Namyang Girls\' High School where Yoo Hye-jung (Park Shin-hye) attends and teaches Hong Ji-hong (Kim Rae-won).'),(5002801,'<Doctor\'s(닥터스)>It appears as the home of Jin Se-woo (Lee Sung-kyung) in episode 6.'),(5002802,'<Doctor Champ(닥터챔프)> In episode 15, Kim Yeon-woo (Kim So-yeon) and Park Ji-heon (Jung Gyeo-woon) walk this path to Namsan Tower. At the foot of Namsan Tower, she finally admits that she has also fallen in love with him.'),(5002803,'<Doctor Prisoner(닥터 프리즈너)>A narrow alley gallery located in the city of Goyang, which appears in episode 9.'),(5002804,'<Doctor Prisoner(닥터 프리즈너)>A bakery cafe in Paju where actors Lee Da-in and Park Eun-seok filmed.'),(5002805,'<Dr. Freeze(닥터 프리즈너)>The place where Kim Jeong-nan and Jang Hyun-seong enjoyed a date at the amusement park.'),(5002806,'<Doctor Prisoner(닥터 프리즈너)>Filming location for building background in episode 7'),(5002807,'<Single love(단, 하나의 사랑)>Appears as the mansion of Lee Yeon-seo (Shin Hye-sun).'),(5002808,'<One and Only Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>In episode 8 (out of total 4 episodes), Lee Yeon-seo (played by Shin Hye-sun) and Kim Dan (played by Kim Myung-soo) meet after a press conference at the outdoor theater of the event venue. She wants to thank him by kissing him on the cheek, but Kim Dan, who lacks patience, turns his head and kisses her on the lips instead. Eventually, they share a real kiss, with Jigang-woo (played by Lee Dong-gun) watching from a distance. In the very next episode, episode 9 (5th episode), Kim Dan tries to avoid the kiss and runs away, while Yeon-seo shivers in the newly starting rain. Kang-woo is the one who leads her out from under the umbrella in this situation.'),(5002809,'<TV Drama(단, 하나의 사랑)>In the drama \"Angel\'s Last Mission: Love,\" Lee Yeon-seo (Shin Hye-sun) and Kim Dan (Kim Myung-soo of Infinite) visit this place to find the parents who are buried here.'),(5002810,'<Dull, One Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>In episodes 5 and 8, Jikangwoo (Lee Dong Gun) and Geomnina (Kim Bomi) regularly meet here to share stories about their dance company.'),(5002811,'<One Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>She remembers the time when she came to this place and danced on the railing in episode 1 when this bridge collapsed.'),(5002812,'<Single, One Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>In episodes 11 and 12, Kim Dan (Kim Myung-soo/Infinite\'s L) and Ji Kang-woo (Lee Dong-gun) do their best to protect Lee Yeon-seo (Shin Hye-sun) from her enemies at this location where the Fantasia sponsored event is held.'),(5002813,'<Single, One Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>Kim Dan\'s (Infinite\'s Kim Myungsoo) secret garden is a bench at Incheon Grand Park.'),(5002814,'<One Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>This building appears as \'Fantasia Ballet Theater\'.'),(5002815,'<One and Only Love(단, 하나의 사랑)>In episode 6, she came with Kim Dan (Kim Myungsoo/L from Infinite) for a walking practice, but in episode 7, she is crossing the bridge alone.'),(5002816,'<단, 하나의 사랑(단, 하나의 사랑)> Angel Kim Dan (Kim Myungsoo/Infinite\'s L) receives orders from the pastor of this church. The church first appears in episode 2, showing Kim Dan for the first time unable to meet the deadline given by his senior.'),(5002817,'<Dalliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>This is the house of Kim Dalli (Park Gyu-young).'),(5002818,'<Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 1, Jinmuhak (played by Kim Minjae) arrives at the \'Amsterdam Airport\' immigration office. In episode 14, this is also the place where Dalri\'s uncle, Kim Hongchun (played by Lee Dogyeong), arrives from overseas.'),(5002819,'<Dally and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 4, Jinmuhak (Kim Min-jae) sold all his belongings to come drink alone, and ended up at this bar with Kim Dally (Park Gyu-young).'),(5002820,'<Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 10, Curator Song Sabong (Woo Hee-jin) passes through this street with Kim Dalri (Park Gyu-young) to find the house of the fainted Nagoongju (Song Ji-won).'),(5002821,'<Dally and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>The interior of this museum is similar to that of the \'Sang Muller Museum\' where Kim Dally (Park Gyu-young) works as a science assistant.'),(5002822,'<Daliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In the drama, this place is portrayed as part of Amsterdam. In episode 1, Kim Dali (Park Gyu-young), a famous art critic who firmly believes in the artistry of Jin Hitonari, takes Jin Muhak (Kim Min-jae) through this place (part of Amsterdam). Bronkhurst\'s wife (Amy Aleha), a collector of art and sponsor of the \"Saint Muller Museum,\" appears in the drama. In episode 2, as Muhak becomes more convinced that Dali has deceived him, he returns to this place to find her.'),(5002823,'<Dally and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 4, Anchalhee (played by E.Da-bin/Yeonwoo), who appears as she did when he first saw her, works at \'Gallery Monde\'. In episode 10, she reads news in front of this gallery that her father is involved in corruption related to \'Cheongsong Art Museum\'.'),(5002824,'<Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>This building appears as the headquarters of Donhon F&B.'),(5002825,'<Dalliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>Here, Jinmuhak (played by Kim Minjae) tries to check in with Kim Dalli (played by Park Gyuyoung) at night. He is disappointed to find out that all of his credit cards (including his \'black card\') have been blocked by his father. In episode 2, after his credit cards are restored, Mu Hak checks into this hotel and gifts Dalli a watch before saying goodbye.'),(5002826,'<Dalliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 6, Jin Ki-chul (Lee Jae-yeon) meets politician Ahn Sang-tae at this restaurant.'),(5002827,'<Dalryu Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>Appears in episode 3 as Jeil Newspaper.'),(5002828,'<Daliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>After the assault video of Kim Dalli (Park Gyu-young) went viral in episode 6, people gather at this cafe. In episode 12, Jin Moo-hak (Kim Min-jae) meets An Hak-hee (Yeon Woo) here and asks her to come out of her house and live alone.'),(5002829,'<Dalriwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>After a successful exhibition in episode 12, Jinmu-hak (Kim Min-jae) takes Kim Dal-ri (Park Kyu-young) and the Cheongsong Art Museum team members to this restaurant to have jokbal.'),(5002830,'<Dalliwagamtang(달리와 감자탕)>This building is the SEGI headquarters operated by Jang Tae-jin (Kwon Yool) at Dalliwagamtang, and in episode 15, Kim Dalliwagamtang (Park Gyu-young) can be seen visiting her ex-fiancé.'),(5002831,'<Dalliwagamtang(달리와 감자탕)>In Episode 3, Kim Dalli (played by Park Gyu-young) came to this store to buy new shoes and Jinmuhak (Kim Min-jae) followed her.'),(5002832,'<\"Dalliwa Gamjatang\"(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 4, homeless person Kim Dalli (played by Park Gyu-young) is crossing this bridge after selling his house.'),(5002833,'< Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)> In episode 1, Jinmuhak (Kim Minjae) takes a taxi to the airport and crosses this bridge along the way. In episode 2, he crosses this bridge again and ends up driving parallel to Kim Dalri\'s (Park Gyu-young) taxi, who has just returned to Korea.'),(5002834,'<Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 8, Kim Dalri (played by Park Gyu-young) and her childhood friend Ju Won-tak (played by Hwang Hee) joined the playground. And they enjoyed the scenery and shared their hearts.'),(5002835,'<Dalriwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In one episode, Jin Mu-hak (played by Kim Min-jae) recalls the time when he persuaded (or rather, pressured) his stepbrother Jin Ki-chul (played by Lee Jae-yoon) into investing in the Cheongsong Art Museum.'),(5002836,'<Dalli and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>The owner of this building is Jin Mu-hak (Kim Min-jae), and in episode 2, Kim Dalli (Park Gyu-young)\'s childhood friend Joo Won-tak (Hwang Hee) rents the rooftop apartment.'),(5002837,'<Dalriwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 8, Jinmuhak\'s (Kim Minjae) father, stepmother, and stepbrother live in Dalriwa.'),(5002838,'<Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 2, Kim Dal-ri (played by Park Gyu-young) walks down this street on her way to Ju Won-tak\'s (played by Hwang Hee) house. Meanwhile, Jin Mu-hak (played by Kim Min-jae) rushes home in a car driven by his secretary Yeo Mi-ri (played by Hwang Bo-ra), passing by Dalri-ri.'),(5002839,'<Daliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 8, Jang Tae-jin (Kwon Yul/Kwon Se-in) drives along this street and follows the old apartment building road.'),(5002840,'<Daliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 8, Kim Dali (played by Park Gyu-young) is brought to this \'apartment\' by her ex-fiance Jang Tae-jin (played by Kwon Yul/Kwon Se-in).'),(5002841,'<Dalliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 4, Kim Dalli (Played by Park Gyu-young) suggests meeting her ex-fiancé Jang Tae-jin (Played by Kwon Yool) at this restaurant. Her plan is to ask him for money for her gallery. However, once she comes face to face with him, she finds herself unable to ask the questions she had prepared.'),(5002842,'<Dalliwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>In episode 4, Jin Mu-hak (Kim Min-jae) drops off Kim Dalli (Park Gyu-young) at this hotel. She leaves right after breaking up with Mu-hak, saying she doesn\'t have time for that. In episode 5, he brings her back here, this time paying for her. Once again, she doesn\'t stay and requests a refund at the reception.'),(5002843,'<Dalli and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>This village appears as a neighborhood in Amsterdam where Kim Dalli (played by Park Gyu-young), who works at an art museum in the Netherlands, lives. In episode 2, there is a scene where Jin-muhak (played by Kim Min-jae) comes to find her.'),(5002844,'<Dalriwa Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>Kim Dalri (Park Gyu-young) recalls the moment when she stayed at this church (which appears as an orphanage) in episode 11.'),(5002845,'<Dalri and Gamjatang(달리와 감자탕)>Kim Dalri (Park Gyu-young)\'s father, the late Kim Nakcheon (Jang Gwang), appears as part of the \'Cheongsong Art Museum\' established in Dalri.'),(5002846,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>The iconic snowfield legend among the filming locations for Moon Lovers: Scarlet Heart Ryeo'),(5002847,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>IU from the Goryeo Dynasty met at Mureungdowon'),(5002848,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>This park appears as part of the palace. It is where Wang So (Lee Jun Ki) and Hae Soo (IU) have conversations in episode 5.'),(5002849,'<Moon Lovers: Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>The place where the 4th Prince and Soo fell in love, as seen in the drama \"Moon Lovers: Scarlet Heart Ryeo\"'),(5002850,'<Love in the Moonlight - Moonlight Drawn by Clouds(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>13th Prince Baek Ah (Nam Joo Hyuk) warns 8th Prince Wang Wook (Kang Ha Neul) and his wife Hae Myung Hee (Park Si Eun) to stop interfering, after which Haesoo and Wook walk to the lake in this garden.'),(5002851,'<The Moon Embracing the Sun - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>Hae Soo (IU) tries to save a boy drowning in the water but ends up being transported to the Goryeo period.'),(5002852,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>Wang So (Lee Joon-gi) seeks this secluded spot for relaxation. After introducing this secret hideaway to Haesoo (IU), it becomes a place where they spend time together.'),(5002853,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>Wang So (Lee Joon-gi) and Hae Soo (IU) visit for a date in episode 12, and in episode 14, Hae Soo visits alone.'),(5002854,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>In episode 12, Prince Wang So (Lee Joon-gi) returns to the palace after a year and passes by this cliff. It is also the place where Prince Wang Eun (Hong Jong-hyun) is cornered in the palace for treason and is killed by Wang So in the final fight in episode 13.'),(5002855,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>When Wang So (Lee Joon-ki) and Wang Wook (Kang Ha-neul) were in a duel in Episode 4, Queen Yoo (Park Ji-young) cut off the arm of the men who kidnapped Wang So.'),(5002856,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>The temple where Wang So set fire in episode 3.'),(5002857,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>This is the filming location of the scene where the fourth prince Wang So (Lee Joon-gi) performs a ritual in the 7th episode.'),(5002858,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>The place where King So investigated before executing monks.'),(5002859,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>In episode 4, Haesoo (IU) saves Eun for falling off the bridge at this garden. She confesses how scared she was of losing her, leans in for a kiss, but they are interrupted.'),(5002860,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>The exterior of Goryeo Palace was filmed here.'),(5002861,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>External shots of Goryeo Palace were also filmed here. For example, Sabeok Palace appears as \"Cheondeokjeon\" in episode 13.'),(5002862,'<Moon Lovers - Scarlet Heart Ryeo(달의 연인 - 보보경심 려)>The fortress where Woo Hee (Girls\' Generation\'s Seohyun) threw herself'),(5002863,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>Odalja (Chaelim) is the headquarter of \'Handa Home Shopping\'.'),(5002864,'<Spring of Dalja(달자의 봄)>In episode 3, this building appears as the venue for the launch show of Eom Ki-joon\'s (Lee Hyun-woo) lingerie brand \'The Ro:\' managed by Oh Dal-ja (Chae Rim).'),(5002865,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>In episode 3, Oh Dalja (Chae Rim) is insulted at this station by a drunken man on the subway late at night while she is alone. Kang Tae-bong (Lee Min-ki) intervenes to save her, but disappears on the next train.'),(5002866,'<Dalmaji\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>Dalmaji lives in an apartment complex 614, also known as Sangam World Cup Park 6th Village, and later Gang Tae-bong (Lee Min-ki) moves in with her here.'),(5002867,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>In episode 20, Odalja (Charm) crosses this bridge on the way home by bus.'),(5002868,'<Spring of Dalja(달자의 봄)>In episode 1, after a tumultuous Christmas Eve, colleague Shin Sedo (Kong Hyung-jin) helps Dalja (Chae Rim) and Kang Tae-bong (Lee Min-ki) discover themselves in a hotel room. In episode 3, the launching show for Um Ki-joon\'s (Lee Hyun-woo) lingerie brand, The Dog Dalja, is held at this hotel. In episode 17, a birthday party for President Jang takes place. In the Emerald Room of this hotel, a case involving Dalja (Chae Rim), Kang Tae-bong (Lee Min-ki), and the law firm Ian Chang unfolds.'),(5002869,'<Spring of Dalja(달자의 봄)>After witnessing Wei Sun-joo (Lee Hye-young) showing a cold attitude towards him, Shin Se-do (Kong Hyung-jin) pleads to Oh Dal-ja (Chae Rim) to join forces. In episode 8, he met his father at this restaurant for their reunion.'),(5002870,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>In episode 4, Odalja (played by Chaerim) and Eom Gijeong (played by Lee Hyeonwoo) crosses this bridge due to a driver. In the final 22nd episode, when returning to Seoul, Odalja (played by Chaerim) crosses this bridge on her own following GPS guidance.'),(5002871,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>In episode 16, Shin Se-do (Gong Hyung-jin) and Wi Sun-joo (Lee Hye-young) who is pregnant come to this restaurant to eat. When Se-do starts mentioning how much she has already eaten, she decides to order more.'),(5002872,'<Dad\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>Odalja (played by Cha Rim) is happy to see Kang Tae-bong (played by Lee Min-ki) return as a lawyer in the drama \'Dad\'s Spring\'. In episode 20, she jogs in the morning and shouts \'Law Firm\' at the top of the stairs, surprising other morning exercisers.'),(5002873,'<Dalgo\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>In the drama, Kang Tae-bong (played by Lee Min-ki) runs on this street to escape from the gangsters sent by his grandfather, while Oh Dal-ja (played by Chae Rim) sheds tears behind him.'),(5002874,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>In \"Dalja\'s Spring,\" Kang Tae-bong (played by Lee Min-ki) recalls a woman in her 20s who was insulted by a drunk man while riding the subway alone late at night. Kang Tae-bong tries to save her, but as soon as he appears on the next train, he disappears.'),(5002875,'<Dalja\'s Spring(달자의 봄)>Chun-ha (Kim Jae-wook), a close friend of Gang Tae-bong (Lee Min-ki), works at a shopping mall.'),(5002876,'<Sweet My City(달콤한 나의 도시)>Nam Yujun (played by Kim Youngjae) rides a bicycle and takes Jane (played by Ji Jaeyoung) down this road on a bicycle.'),(5002877,'<Sweet My City(달콤한 나의 도시)>In episode 1, Nam Yoo-hee (Moon Jung-hee) and Oh Eun-soo (Choi Kang-hee) say goodbye to Haejein (Ji Jae-young) and Jaein in front of Miss Jokbal Hongdae main store after finishing their night out with friends.'),(5002878,'<Sweet Spy(달콤한 스파이)>In episode 4, the superior of the Black Dragon Meeting is waiting for Lee Soon-ae (Nam Sang-mi) and Han Yoo-il (Dennis Oh) at this hotel.'),(5002879,'<Sweet Spy(달콤한 스파이)>In episode 8, Song Hyeon-cheol (Kim Il-woo) invites Kang Jun (Lee Joo-hyun) and Han Yu-il (Dennis Oh) to dinner, but Yu-il enters holding hands with Lee Soon-ae (Nam Sang-mi). This is where Kang Jun and the others are surprised to see Soon-ae.'),(5002880,'<Sweet Life(달콤한 인생)>In episode 24 of the final episode, Yoon Hye-jin (Oh Yeon-soo) comes here with a group of Japanese tourists. When she sees break dancers, Lee Joon-soo (Lee Dong-wook) comes to mind.'),(5002881,'<Sweet Life(달콤한 인생)>In the final episode, Yoon Hye-jin (Oh Yeon-seo) climbs the stairs to take Japanese tourist to Namsan Park Fountain.'),(5002882,'<Sweet Life(달콤한 인생)>In episode 24 of \'The Last Empress\', Yoon Hye-jin (Oh Yeon-soo) comes here with a group of Japanese tourists and they all discover this place while all tourists come and sit at the fountain plaza.'),(5002883,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>A large park with a train ride that Yeona and Suhyun rode in the past.'),(5002884,'<Will You Be There?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>The place where Taeho and Sua had a conversation with Soohyun\'s tomb.'),(5002885,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>The place where Soohyun first met the current Yeona'),(5002886,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>The beach where Suhyun used to convey her request to the past Suhyun.'),(5002887,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>Place where past Yeona works and dolphin show is filmed'),(5002888,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>Soo Hyun\'s first encounter with Suhyun 30 years ago at Busanjin Station'),(5002889,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>The place where Tae-ho, who saw Suhyun\'s letter, went to find Yeon-ah.'),(5002890,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>A place filled with the current Suhyun and Taeho\'s unchanging friendship.'),(5002891,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>In front of the house where Suhyun and Sua\'s time was completely captured.'),(5002892,'<Will you be there?(당신 거기 있어줄래요?)>A beach where Soohyun and Taeho shared stories 30 years ago.'),(5002893,'<You are closer than you think(당신은 생각보다 가까이에 있다)>Choi Woo-jin (Lee Sang-yeob) works at a bookstore and meets Yi-seo there. It is known as \'Night Bookstore\' in the broadcasting.'),(5002894,'<You are closer than you think(당신은 생각보다 가까이에 있다)>Choi Woo-jin (Lee Sang-yeop) came to find the missing Lee Seo-yeon (Kim So-eun). And he reminisces about a date at this store. The name of the store in the broadcast is \'Gelato House.\''),(5002895,'<You are closer than you think(당신은 생각보다 가까이에 있다)>Choi Woo-jin (Lee Sang-yeop) is passing by a subway station near exit 3 to find his girlfriend Lee Seo-yeon (Kim So-eun).'),(5002896,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In episode 28, Kim Ji Woon (Ha Suk Jin) meets Im Da Young (Bona) for their first date, and she introduces this place as where her father is buried.'),(5002897,'<Your House Assistant(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In episode 26, Im Dayoung (WJSN\'s Bona), Yoon Sang-ah (Go Won Hee), and Kang Hyejoo (Jeon Soo Jin) come here to shop as Dayoung\'s date spot.'),(5002898,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In episode 27, Kwon Jin-guk (played by Lee Ji-hoon) wants to take Yoon Sang-ah (played by Go Won-hee) to a squid restaurant for a date, but it is closed. Instead, he brings her to a Seven Eleven in Mangwon Hangang Park by the Seongsan Bridge to eat squid ramen. Jin-guk finally confesses his feelings, but it is not the proposal Sang-ah is waiting for. They return to this park for a real date in episode 30.'),(5002899,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In episode 11, you can see Im Dayoung (WJSN Bona) explaining about her house helper at \'Silverlight\' company.'),(5002900,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In episode 30, Kwon Jin-gook (Lee Ji-hoon) and Yoon Sang-ah (Go Won-hee) come out on a date to this street. Sang-ah starts a conversation with a seller after seeing handmade jewelry displayed in front of this store, while Jin-gook finds something to eat at a food truck.'),(5002901,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In the final episode 32, Park Ga-ram\'s band \'Jinjjagaram\' performs here.'),(5002902,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>A bridge where Kim Ji-won (Ha Suk-jin) rides a bike to work in episodes 1 and 26.'),(5002903,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>In episode 10, Kim Ji-woon (Ha Seok-jin) visits to reminisce about his past love.'),(5002904,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>This is a new workplace where Yoon Sang-ah (Go Won-hee), with the help of her boyfriend Kwon Jin-gook (Lee Ji-hoon), returns to the path of a jewelry designer in episodes 31-32.'),(5002905,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>This building appears in the drama as the \'Fam Advertising Agency\' where Im Dayoung (Bona) works. In episode 1, you can see the building rushing to work.'),(5002906,'<Your House Helper(당신의 하우스헬퍼)>The engagement party of Yoon Sang-ah\'s old friend will be held here in episodes 6-7.'),(5002907,'<When You Speak Your Wish(당신이 소원을 말하면)>In episode 8, Yoon Gye-ri (played by Ji Chang-wook) follows a creator couple crossing this bridge in a car driven by his dog, Soni.'),(5002908,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 24, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) went fishing and came to the beach.'),(5002909,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>This is the house where Nam Hong-joo (played by Bae Suzy) lives with her mother (played by Hwang Young-hee).'),(5002911,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 28, prosecutor Choi Dam-dong (Kim Won-hae) meets Lee Yoo-beom (Lee Sang-yeob), who resigned from his job, at this place.'),(5002912,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) walks in this park. When she sees a girl who has lost her balloon, she predicts that a tall man named Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) will soon appear and help her retrieve the balloon.'),(5002913,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 23, this building appears as the courtroom where Prof. Moon Kyu (Jung Hae-in) and Lee Yoo-beom (Lee Sang-yeob) confront each other.'),(5002914,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 13, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) blames herself for what happened to Han Woo-tak (Jung Hae-in). Crying, she coincidentally meets Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) who comes looking for her with a box of tissues dreaming of such a situation.'),(5002915,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 21, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) decide to skip work for the day and visit this place. She wants to protect him from a situation where he is bound by his own dream.'),(5002916,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 8, Nam Hong-joo (Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) have a meal together.'),(5002917,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 29, there is a scene where Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) gets treated at this location.'),(5002918,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 1, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) took Lee Yoo-bum (Lee Sang-yeob) out for dinner on Valentine\'s Day.'),(5002919,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) meet here to fulfill their dreams.'),(5002920,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 1, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy), Lee Yoo-bum (Lee Sang-yeob), and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) meet in the parking lot of this restaurant. Hong-joo and Yoo-bum go out to eat, but they end up eating at \"Farmer\'s Table\" nearby instead.'),(5002921,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>This is where the wedding of Jung Jae-chan (played by Lee Jong-suk) and his colleagues takes place in the final episode 32.'),(5002923,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>This is the school where Jung Seung-won (played by Shin Jae-ha), the younger brother of Jung Jae-chan (played by Lee Jong-suk), attends. In episode 4, he reveals his family\'s domestic violence to his crush at the school entrance. It is also a place where they celebrate upon hearing news of her father\'s prosecution.'),(5002924,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In the drama \"While You Were Sleeping,\" Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) dreams of a failed proposal at this university student council building and goes there to prevent it. Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) comes here to save her from an angry mob and they run across the bridge located just behind the building.'),(5002925,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) is taking the subway at exit 1 of this station. You can see her passing by the entrance to Children\'s Grand Park just before that.'),(5002926,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In the drama, Jung Jae-chan (played by Lee Jong-suk) takes the subway at this station three times. He enters the station through exit 3.'),(5002927,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 18, Jung Jae-chan (played by Lee Jong-suk) finally realizes through a flashback that Park Doo-young is actually Nam Hong-joo (played by Bae Suzy).'),(5002928,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 1, Nam Hongju (Bae Suzy) buys flowers for Lee Yoo-bum (Lee Sang-yeob) for Valentine\'s Day.'),(5002929,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>It appears under the name \'Hongju Samgyeopsal\' as the restaurant of Nam Hong-ju (Bae Soo-ji) mother. It becomes an important meeting place for everyone in episodes 7-8.'),(5002930,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 25, the police crack down on a cellphone dealer and his victims. The dealer is the brother of the murderer who killed Nam Hongju (played by Bae Suzy) and Jung Jaechan\'s (played by Lee Jong Suk) father.'),(5002931,'<While you were sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>Episode 24 explains that Hyun (Oh Yisik), a prisoner in front of the prison, committed suicide and left a suicide note claiming he was falsely accused.'),(5002932,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 9, this building appears as Nam Hong-joo\'s (Bae Suzy) former workplace \'SBC Broadcast\'. She finds herself in front of this building when searching for work in Seoul.'),(5002933,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>The apartment complex lobby where pianist Park So-yoon (played by Kim So-hyun) appears in episode 5. Jung Jae-chan (played by Lee Jong-suk) and Nam Hong-joo (played by Bae Suzy) come here to prevent Jae-chan\'s brother from being convicted of murder.'),(5002934,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) are walking across this bridge inside the subway. Hong-joo tells Jae-chan that she saw him riding this subway in her dream.'),(5002935,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 7, Jung Jae-chan (played by Lee Jong-suk) falls asleep on the bus while heading to work as it crosses this bridge. Nam Hong-joo (played by Bae Suzy) has a dream of this scene and even wakes him up at the right moment to prevent him from missing his bus stop.'),(5002936,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>The place where Han Woo-tak (Jung Hae-in) and his colleagues arrested the person suspected to be on the phone in Episode 25 is right under this bridge.'),(5002937,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hong-ju (played by Bae Suzy) walks down this street and passes by Yoon Boseon\'s house in Anguk-dong.'),(5002938,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hongju (played by Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae Chan (played by Lee Jong Suk) both pass by this place separately.'),(5002939,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hong-ju (Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) each pass by this high school.'),(5002940,'<While You Were Sleeping(당신이 잠든 사이에)>In episode 3, Nam Hong-joo (Bae Suzy) and Jung Jae-chan (Lee Jong-suk) pass by this place separately. They pause to look at the mural before continuing to walk.'),(5002941,'<landmark(대물)>In the first episode, Seo Hye-rim (played by Go Hyeon-jeong) crosses this bridge to broadcast news of her husband\'s disappearance on the radio.'),(5002942,'<Daemul(대물)>Owned by Min-si (Song Ok-seok), aunt of Jang Se-jin (Lee Su-kyung), this is a one-percenter club in Korea operated by Se-jin, who returned from overseas and entrusted the art museum here to his aunt.'),(5002943,'<Daebeak(대박)>In the drama \"Korean Odyssey\", Lee In-jwa (played by Jeon Kwang-ryul) fatally wounds Jang Geun-seok (played by Baek Daegil) at this cliff. He then makes Daegil nearly fall off the cliff, offering to grant a wish if he survives the fall, which Daegil accepts.'),(5002944,'<Amazing(대박)>This is an appendix to the Changgyeonggung Palace Gyeongchunjeon, where Inhyeon Queen\'s residence is located, and depicts the scene of Queen Hyeon being succeeded by Queen Jang Bi-wong, who later became Empress Consort in the future.'),(5002945,'<대박(대박)>In episode 2, they come here for the audience with Sukjong (Choi Min-soo) at this pavilion.'),(5002946,'<Daebak Real Estate(대박부동산)>In episode 2, Oh In-beom (played by CNBLUE\'s Jung Yong-hwa) and Heo Ji-cheol (played by Kang Hong-seok) came to this park to have morning coffee as the sun was rising.'),(5002947,'<Daebak Real Estate(대박부동산)>In episode 9, Heo Ji-cheol (played by Kang Hong-suk) goes on his first date with Bae Su-jeong (played by Choi Ji-woo) at this cafe.'),(5002948,'<DaeBak Real Estate(대박부동산)>In episodes 1-2, a duo living in House 54 of this village, along with Hong Jia (played by Jang Nara) and Oh In-beom (played by Jung Yong-hwa), coincidentally meet here when they come alone.'),(5002949,'<DaeBak Real Estate(대박부동산)>In episode 1, Yoo In-beom (played by CNBLUE\'s Jung Yong-hwa) and Heo Ji-cheol (played by Kang Hong-seok) rent a penthouse and enjoy drinking together, before taking a rest at the hotel pool the next morning.'),(5002950,'<Dabak Real Estate(대박부동산)>In episode 3, Hong Jia (played by Jang Nara) is seen getting takeout from this restaurant (appeared as \'Hanok Chicken Soup\').'),(5002951,'<King Sejong(대왕 세종)>This tree appears in the last scene of episode 86.'),(5002952,'<Dream of the Great King(대왕의 꿈)>Drama \"Dream of the Great King\"'),(5002953,'<Daechanggeum(대장금)>A place where you can enjoy the Suwon Hwaseong Cultural Festival.'),(5002954,'<TV Drama(대장금)> In the 51st episode, Jang Geum (played by Lee Young-ae) takes care of smallpox patients in this village. In the 54th episode, Min Jeong-ho\'s (played by Ji Jin-hee) child is born here.'),(5002955,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>Korea\'s largest open set location'),(5002956,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>In the first episode, the procession of Yeonsan-gun takes place here. It is located in front of Injeongjeon, and in the third episode, King Jungjong\'s procession also takes place here.'),(5002957,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>Filming location for \'Dae Jang Geum\' offering various experiential activities'),(5002958,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>The mountain where Dae Jang Geum\'s mother\'s tomb and Yongmun Cave are located.'),(5002959,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>The place where Dae Jang Geum sat by the pond'),(5002960,'<Daechanggeum(대장금)>Filming location of \'Daechanggeum\' with impressive black sand'),(5002961,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>In episode 27, Choi Sang-gung conspires to become the director overseeing all the kitchens in the palace, and poisons the duck rice prepared by Han Sang-gung (Yang Mi-kyung) and Jang Geum (Lee Young-ae) for the ill King Jungjong. The two women, who are accused of treason, are beaten and banished to Jeju Island, but Han falls ill during the journey. Jang Geum carries her through the reed fields and along the cliff path, but sadly, her mentor passes away.'),(5002962,'<Dae Jang Geum(대장금)>Folk village with a Dae Jang Geum props exhibition hall'),(5002963,'<Da Chang Jin(대장금)>A place where you can experience unique activities in the \'Da Chang Jin\' set location.'),(5002964,'<Daejanggeum(대장금)>The place where Daejanggeum and Minyeongho walked and talked.'),(5002965,'<Da Jang Geum is Watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episode 22 (out of a total of 11 episodes), Bok Seung-ah (Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) waits at this cafe for a traditional Korean meal.'),(5002966,'<DJ Kyungmin is watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>This convenience store, which offered a job to Han Jinmi (Lee Yeoreum) in episode 3 (episode 2), boosted its sales with its unique ramen recipe. At that place, Minhyuk (BTOB Im Minhyuk) meets her and she recognizes her from the broadcast she saw. Both of them appear throughout the drama to create various convenience store products.'),(5002967,'<Appears in \"Jang Geum, Oh My Grandma\"(대장금이 보고 있다)>This is the exterior of RG Motors office where Hansanhae (Shin Dong-wook) and Bok Seung-ah (Kwon Yuri) work in the drama.'),(5002968,'<Place(대장금이 보고 있다)>In the drama \'Daechanggeum\', Sanhae (played by Shin Dong-wook) and Bokseunga (played by Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) apologize with a proposal for them to stay overnight as a sign of apology to the clients they have kept waiting in episode 10 (5 episodes in total). Afterwards, Sanhae calls his younger sister Jinmi (played by Lee Yeol-eum) and Jungshik (played by Kim Hyun-joon) to drive there to have dinner without missing it.'),(5002969,'<featuring Daejanggeum(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episode 9 (out of a total of 5 episodes), Han Sanhae (played by Shin Dongwook) and Bokseunga (played by Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) are shown meeting external clients at this place on weekends.'),(5002970,'<Daegam is watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episodes 21-22 (total of 11 episodes), Hansanhae (Shin Dong-wook) buys a gift certificate from this restaurant with the hope of receiving it from Bok Seung-ah (Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) for an office gift exchange.'),(5002971,'<Dae Jang Geum is watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>Shenwoo wants to get close to Han Jin-mi and asks Shenwoo to call her. Shortly after, Jin-mi appears and Shenwoo decides to show her his own perfect sandwich combo that he specializes in.'),(5002972,'<Daebakgeum is watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>Hansanhae (Shindongwook) suggests having lunch with manager Inayoung (Jungeerang) in order to hide his feelings for Bokseungah (Girls\' Generation Kwon Yuri).'),(5002973,'<Shown in Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episodes 11-12, Han Sanhae (played by Shin Dongwook), Bok Seungah (played by Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri), and their client/cousin (cameo by Kang Nam) are seen passing through this park while having lunch.'),(5002974,'<Dae Jang Geum is Watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>Part of this building houses RG Motors, and also serves as the studio for \'Music Core\', jointly produced by Hang Jin-mi.'),(5002975,'<appearing in Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episode 3 (2 main episodes), Hansanhae (Shin Dong Wook) suggests coming to Pride Chicken to buy chicken for the team at Bokseungah\'s (Girls\' Generation Kwon Yuri) house party.'),(5002976,'<The Great Janggeum is Watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>In the 4th episode, Bukseung-ah (Kwon Yuri) is caught by two intoxicated men. A fight breaks out and Hansanhae\'s (Shin Dong-wook) jacket is torn in half. Han Jeong-sik (Kim Hyun-joon) happens to pass by and intervenes but gets beaten up. Meanwhile, Seung-ah throws recently bought fruit at the drunkards and cleverly manipulates them.'),(5002977,'<Daejanggeum is here(대장금이 보고 있다)>Han San-hae (played by Shin Dong-wook), who narrowly saved a business on the verge of crisis, decides to bring in a rookie part-timer, Kwon Yoo-ri (played by Girls\' Generation’s Yuri), to this restaurant. Sanhae orders frozen pork belly instead of kalguksu (said to be a special menu) and then orders kalguksu.'),(5002978,'<Daechanggeum is watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episode 5 (3rd episode), Han Sanhae (Shin Dongwook) takes freshman Bok Seungah (Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) to another restaurant on his bucket list.'),(5002979,'<Appears in the drama \"Dae Jang Geum\"(대장금이 보고 있다)>In the final episode 16, Han Sanhae (played by Shin Dong Wook) proposes to Bok Seunga (played by Kwon Yuri) at this location.'),(5002980,'<Featured in Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>Han San hae (Shindongwook) and Bok Seunga (Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) encounter one of RG Motors\' VVIP customers, Yang Dong-geun (special cameo), and his three children at this restaurant. As the kids start causing trouble in episode 31 (full episode 16), Seung-a decides to play outside to distract them, while Sanha has lunch and chats with the client. Impressed by the service, the customer decides to buy a car based on Seung-a\'s recommendation.'),(5002981,'<Daejanggeum is Watching(대장금이 보고 있다)>Han Sanhae (Shin Dong Wook) and VIP customers of RG Motors (Yang Dong Geun special cameo) rapped poetically about the food they just ate on this alley in episode 31 (final 16th episode).'),(5002982,'<Appeared in Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>Han San-hae (played by Shin Dong-wook) passes by this tea house in episode 17 while following Bok Seung-ah (played by Kwon Yu-ri) to have lunch nearby.'),(5002983,'<Airing on Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episodes 17-18 (total of 9 episodes), Bok Soon-ah (Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) decides to bring Hansanhae (Shin Dong Wook) to this restaurant.'),(5002984,'<\"The Great Queen Seondeok\" is being shown(대장금이 보고 있다)>In episode 16 (out of 8 episodes), Hansanhae (played by Shin Dong-wook) decides to bring Bok Seung-ah (played by Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) here after hearing her talk about wanting to eat jjajangmyeon.'),(5002985,'<Featured in Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>Hansanhae (played by Shin Dong Wook) decides to give \"health food\" to Bokseunga (played by Girls\' Generation\'s Kwon Yuri) with his reward money after rejecting her confession and then changing his mind.'),(5002986,'<Appeared in Dae Jang Geum(대장금이 보고 있다)>Bok Seung-ah (Kwon Yuri of Girls\' Generation), in order to bring a customer (cameo by Kangnam) who is also a cousin to Hansanha (Shin Dong-wook), asks for a restaurant recommendation. Unexpectedly, Hansanha agrees to go along during lunchtime. They sit separately, but Seung-ah watches every action as Hansanha orders and eats in his own way.'),(5002987,'<The K2(더 케이투)>In episode 12, the main characters including Choi Kangsoo (Go Kyung-pyo) and Lee Danah (Chae Soo-bin) appeared at \"Gildong S