 the early part of the movie \"The King,\" actor Jo In-sung can be seen jumping around the market alley.'),(5003002,'<The King(더 킹)>The place where Jung Woo Sung and Zo In Sung ate steak.'),(5003003,'<The King(더 킹)>The place where Cho In Sung made his resolution while walking in The King'),(5003004,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>This is one of the places where Lee Lim (Lee Jung-jin) hides in The King, and a scene of meeting with Yu Kyeong-moo (Lee Ha-yeong) in episode 10 was also filmed.'),(5003005,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>Her daughter, Ahn Min-seo (played by Jang Hye-jin), is a neurosurgeon and Jung Sun-woo (played by Kim Dong-wook) is a physical therapist.'),(5003006,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>In episode 2, King Lee Gon (Lee Min-ho) studies the history of Korea for 3 days.'),(5003007,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>In episode 8, Lee Gon (Lee Min-ho) who arrives in South Korea, hears a lot of stories about Budae Jjigae in this place.'),(5003008,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>This location is where some scenes from episode 1 (entire episode 1) were filmed, showcasing the royal palace of the Korean Empire.'),(5003009,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>In episode 15, Lee Gon (Lee Min-ho) and Jeong Tae-eul (Kim Go-eun) investigate parallel worlds in this library, reminiscing about the time when they finally believed his story that parallel worlds could exist.'),(5003010,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>In episode 9, Lee Gon (Lee Min-ho) and Tae-eul (Kim Go-eun) are depicted having a chicken and beer (치맥) date at the square next to the pedestrian bridge.'),(5003011,'< The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)> In episode 2 (total 1 episode), Yi Gon (Lee Min-ho) wins the championship at the tournament he participates in with the 88th class of the Naval Academy.'),(5003012,'<The King: Eternal Monarch(더 킹 : 영원의 군주)>This is where Lee Gon (Lee Min-ho) waits for Tae-eul (Kim Go-eun) to return after 