g.'),(5003064,'<The King Two Hearts(더킹 투하츠)>The exterior of the Western Residence appears as part of a royal palace.'),(5003065,'<The King Two Hearts(더킹 투하츠)>It was used as a royal palace in The King Two Hearts.'),(5003066,'<The King 2 Hearts(더킹 투하츠)>In episode 18, Kim Hang-ah (Ha Ji-won) appears in a Chinese prison where she is imprisoned.'),(5003067,'<The Last Empress(덕혜옹주)>Set where The Last Empress filmed the Deoksugung Stonewall Building'),(5003068,'<Dokhye\'s Princess(덕혜옹주)>A set where scenes of a street in Japan were filmed at Dokhye\'s Princess'),(5003069,'<The Throne Princess(덕혜옹주)>The Throne Princess depicts the return of Son Ye-jin as an elderly woman at Deoksugung Palace'),(5003070,'<Dokkaebi Princess(덕혜옹주)>The beach where Son Ye-jin was caught in the drama \"Dokkaebi Princess\"'),(5003071,'<Princess Deokhye(덕혜옹주)>Secret hideout of independence activists at Princess Deokhye\'s residence'),(5003072,'<Dear Husband, Oh Jak Doo(데릴남편 오작두)>In episodes 9, Han Seung-ju (Yoo Yi) meets Min-hee (Park Min-ji) who is trying to join her brother Han Seung-tae (Seol Jung-hwan) in his new business venture.'),(5003073,'<Delnam Husband Okjakdoo(데릴남편 오작두)>Appears as the company of Eric Jo (Jeong Sang-hun)'),(5003074,'<Delnam Husband Ojakdu(데릴남편 오작두)>This building appears as Eric Jo\'s (Jung Sang-hoon) company.'),(5003075,'<Delicate Husband Drama(데릴남편 오작두)>In episode 9, Han Seung-ju (played by Uee) complains to Eric Jo (played by Jung Sang-hoon) at the park about Oh Jak-doo (played by Kim Kang-woo) always being misunderstood as a cold man.'),(5003076,'<My Husband Oh Jak-doo(데릴남편 오작두)>In episode 2, Han Seung-joo (played by UEE) decided that Oh Jak-doo (played by Kim Kang-woo) could become a good husband.'),(5003077,'<Daeil Nam-hyeon Ojakdu(데릴남편 오작두)>In episode 2, Ojakdu (Kim Kang-woo) arrives in Seoul at this station.'),(5003078,'<Dear My Husband(데릴남편 오작두)>In Dear My Husband, Han Seung-joo (played by Uee) lives in this house.'),(5003079,'<Goblin(도깨비)>In episode 1, this place 