ce is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>The appearance of this building appears as the building where episodes 11-12 of the famous author Yoo Myung-seok\'s Book Concert took place. It is also where Oh Ji-yool (Park Gyu-young) tells Song Ha-rin (Jeong Yu-jin) that she is now her role model as an editor when she leaves the Book Concert.'),(5003696,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>Dan-i Kang (played by Nayoung Lee) and Eun-ho Cha (played by Jong-seok Lee) celebrate receiving their first paycheck by eating snacks.'),(5003697,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>Cha Eun-ho (played by Lee Jong-suk) invites famous author Yoo Myung-seok to dinner after his radio broadcast. She tells him that two more guests will be coming, who turn out to be Song Hae-rin (played by Jeong Yu-jin) and Ji Seo-jun (played by Wi Ha-joon). Yoo suggests to Eun-ho that Seo-jun should design the cover of her book. After dinner, the three bid her goodbye, with Hae-rin leaving. The conversation between the two men inevitably turns towards Kang Dan-yi (played by Lee Na-young), and Seo-jun ends up getting into Eun-ho\'s car against his will to take him to where she is so he can see her.'),(5003698,'<Romance Is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>In this drama, the university appears as \'Korean University\' where Cha Eun-ho (played by Lee Jong-suk) teaches literature and holds a professor position.'),(5003699,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>Cha Eun-ho (Lee Jong-suk) and Ji Seo-jun (Wi Ha-joon) had a drinking party at this restaurant in episode 15.'),(5003700,'<Romance is a Supplement(로맨스는 별책부록)> Donkatsu restaurant that appears in Romance is a Supplement'),(5003701,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>A Japanese-style restaurant featured in episode 10 of Romance is a Bonus Book.'),(5003702,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>A soba restaurant featured in episode 6 of Romance is a Bonus Book.'),(5003703,'<Romance Supplement(로맨스는 별책부록)>In episode 15, Ji Seo-jun (Wi Ha-jun) and his mother had dinner here.'),(5003704,'<Romance Is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>In episode 7, Cha Eun-ho (Lee Jong-suk) brings Kang Dan-yi (Lee Na-young) to this bookstore.'),(5003705,'<Romance Is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>Cha Eun-ho (Lee Jong-suk) appears after Kim Jae-min (Kim Tae-woo) tries to start dating in the third episode, exposing Kim Jae-min\'s true identity as the CEO of Gyeru Publishing.'),(5003706,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)> In episode 4, Cha Eun-ho (Lee Jong-suk) comes here with his boss, Kim Jae-min (Kim Tae-woo), and designer Ji Seo-jun (Wi Ha-joon) after a meeting to have drinks. They talk about the missing writer Kang Byung-jun.'),(5003707,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>This restaurant appeared as \'Seon Ha Mandu\' operated by the parents of Song Haerin (Jung Yoojin) in the drama, where we can see Haerin and Cha Eunho (Lee Jong Suk) coming to eat with their lovesick parents in episode 4, and later in episode 10.'),(5003708,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>Shortly after Kang Dan-i (Lee Na-young) \"taught\" Cha Eun-ho (Lee Jong-suk) a lesson by making him drink in episode 4, she sat down in front of the Deokseong Middle School wall for a moment.'),(5003709,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>In episode 13, Song Ha-rin (Jung Yoo-jin) tries to reconcile with Ji Seo-jun (Wi Ha-joon) at the bookstore.'),(5003710,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>In episode 7, Cha Eun-ho (played by Lee Jong-suk) and his colleague Bong Ji-hong (played by Jo Han-chul) visit the house of the poet Choi Hyung-soo.'),(5003711,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>A jjimjilbang where Kang Dan-i (played by Lee Na-young) participates in a flash mob dance in Episode 1.'),(5003712,'<Romance is a Bonus Book(로맨스는 별책부록)>In episode 1, Kang Dan-i (Lee Na-young) has a job interview and on her way back, she loses her high heels at the bus stop in front of Dormitory Building B.'),(5003713,'<I Am Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 12, Seon-hye (played by Lee Min-ji) teaches Kim Min-kyu (played by Yoo Seung-ho) about ideas for love in this garden.'),(5003714,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 9, Kim Mingyu (Yoo Seung-ho) came to date with Ariel (Hwang Seung-eun).'),(5003715,'<It\'s not a robot(로봇이 아니야)>Hong Baek-gyun (Um Ki-joon) holds business meetings here 10 times to raise funds for the Santa Maria Team.'),(5003716,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>Scene where Kim Mingyu (Yoo Seung-ho) and Georgia (Chae Soo-bin) have their final date in episode 19. Georgia picks up the book \"The Velveteen Rabbit\" and tells Mingyu a story. In episode 20, Mingyu comes back to this place to read the book while thinking of Georgia.'),(5003717,'<It\'s Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episodes 24-25, Ju Jia (Chae Soo-bin) comes to the beach after bidding farewell to Kim Min-gyu (Yoo Seung-ho).'),(5003718,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 21, they visit Grandma Jia\'s restaurant (played by Chae Soo-bin).'),(5003719,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 21, Ju Ji-ah (played by Chae Soo-bin) and Kim Min-kyu (played by Yoo Seung-ho) secretly chase after her in a taxi.'),(5003720,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>It\'s a place where Hwang Yoocheol (played by Kang Ki-young) and Ariel (played by Hwang Seung-eon) meet and drink in episodes 21 and 31.'),(5003721,'<It\'s not a robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 13, Hwang Yoo-cheol (Kang Ki-young) comes here to drink and calls Yeriel (Hwang Seung-eon) to accompany Kim Min-gyu (Yoo Seung-ho) on a date to propose to Yeriel (Hwang Seung-eon).'),(5003722,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 16, Georgia (played by Chae Soo-bin) and Hong Baek-gyun (played by Um Ki-joon) came here to have dinner, and Baek-gyun finally understands the reason for their breakup.'),(5003723,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 2, Georgia (played by Chae Soo Bin) talks about how her ex-boyfriend Hong Baek Gyun used his face as a model for the robot Ah Ji 3. In episode 4, she spends the night here after being kicked out of her brother\'s house.'),(5003724,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 30, Park Se-wan received a pair of shoes at this store for a style transformation.'),(5003725,'<Not a robot(로봇이 아니야)>The scene where after discovering Seoul on its own in the 29th episode, it sits on a bench and meets a homeless person next to it to have a conversation.'),(5003726,'<It\'s Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 1, Georgia (Cha Soo-bin) parked her scooter on the way to this square (a sculpture is seen in the background).'),(5003727,'<It\'s Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 1, Ju Gia (Chae Soo-bin) feels hurt when Kim Min-kyu (Yoo Seung-ho) does not appreciate her for buying him a limited edition robot.'),(5003728,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)> In episode 9, Kim Min-kyu (Yoo Seung) finds out that Jia has a calming effect on his allergies and hugs her.'),(5003729,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 20, Kim Min-gyu (played by Yoo Seung-ho) comes to meet informant Jang Du-sam but is surprised when the informant leaves.'),(5003730,'<It\'s Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 29, Kim Mingyu (Yoo Seung-ho) and Chief Jo Jin-bae (Seo Dong-won) meet the informant Jang Du-sam here.'),(5003731,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episode 1, Jo Gia (Chae Soo-bin) meets Kim Min-gyu (Yoo Seung-ho) for the first time and sells a limited edition action figure Metal Gear Gunner. However, she refuses to pay because the packaging is damaged.'),(5003732,'<I am Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)> In episode 20, Kim Mingyu (Yoo Seung-ho) decides he needs a fan and takes a train from this station to his company.'),(5003733,'<Not a Robot(로봇이 아니야)>In episodes 26 and 27, Georgia (Chaesoobin) and Kim Mingyu (Yooseungho) are resolving misunderstandings under this tree and beautiful shooting stars.'),(5003734,'<Lobbyist(로비스트)>Maria/Yoo So-young (played by Jang Jin-young) and James Lee (played by Heo Joon-ho) temporarily stay here, where Maria has her office to hold secret meetings and sign contracts.'),(5003735,'<Loskool(로스쿨)>It appears as the family home of Kang Juman (Oh Man-seok), who decides to return his daughter Gang Sol B (Lee Soo-kyung) to the school dormitory as seen in episode 5.'),(5003736,'<Loschool(로스쿨)>This place appears as Congressman Go Hyeong-soo\'s (Jung Won-joong) unofficial office in the drama. This location can be seen in several scenes throughout the drama, including the scene in episode 11 where Lee Man-ho (Jo Jae-ryong) receives a photo of his son.'),(5003737,'<Loschool(로스쿨)>In episode 16, Professor Kim (played by Lee Jung-eun), Lawyer Park (played by Lee Chun-hee), and Dong-il (played by Woo Hyun) celebrate a mock trial at this bar.'),(5003738,'<Royal Family(로열패밀리)>It appears as the headquarters of the JK Group.'),(5003739,'<Rugal(루갈)>Korean drama <Rugal'),(5003740,'<Lugal(루갈)>In the early part of Episode 1, a man appears carrying a baby into this abandoned building.'),(5003741,'<Rugal(루갈)>It appears to be the mansion of Chairman Ko Yong-deok (Park Jeong-hak), and in episode 2, after his funeral, members of the crime organization Argos gather here for a meeting.'),(5003742,'<Kdrama: Luka: The Beginning(루카: 더 비기닝)>In episode 8, Geo (played by Kim Rae-won) and Haneul Ae Gureum (played by Lee Da-hee) come here for a date. And they also take their wedding photos here.'),(5003743,'<Look: The Beginning(루카: 더 비기닝)>Appears as the place where she and her followers\' practitioners live in episode 8.'),(5003745,'<The Chronicles of Evil(루카: 더 비기닝)>This is where Geo (played by Kim Rae-won) lives and is the place where he is chased in episode 1.'),(5003746,'<Movie: Luca: The Beginning(루카: 더 비기닝)>In episode 2, you meet Isson (Kim Sung-oh) on the pedestrian bridge parallel to the left bridge.'),(5003747,'<Lucas: The Beginning(루카: 더 비기닝)>In episode 2, Choi Yuna (Jung Daeun) passes by the building on the right and starts jogging.');
INSERT INTO `attraction_description` VALUES (5003748,'<Regal High(리갈하이)>It appears as the mansion of Sung Ki-jun\'s father. In episode 11, Song Pan-sa (played by Kim Ho-jeong) visits to report Ki-jun\'s new misdeeds, and later receives an order to beat a servant with a golf club.'),(5003749,'<Royal High(리갈하이)>This place appears as the main courtroom in the drama. Every courtroom scene was filmed here.'),(5003750,'<Regal High(리갈하이)>In episode 6, B&G Law Firm\'s Kang Ki-seok (Yoon Bak) celebrated his victory over Go Tae-rim (Jin Gu) in this bar.'),(5003751,'<Legal High(리갈하이)>This is where the law firm of Se Jae-in (played by Seo Eun-soo) is located, which appears in episode 1.'),(5003752,'<Rugal High(리갈하이)>In episode 10, Seo Jae-in (played by Seo Eun-soo) and Min Joo-kyung (played by Chae Jong-ahn) come to this bridge to discuss a case.'),(5003753,'<Legal High(리갈하이)>On the way to work, an elderly woman who protests against a specific \'pervert\' lawyer, Go Tae-rim (played by Jin Goo), who is obsessed with money, captures the attention of Se Jae-in (played by Seo Eun-su).'),(5003754,'<Regal High(리갈하이)>This hanok appeared as the father\'s house of Go Tae-rim (Jingoo) in episode 10.'),(5003755,'<Regal High(리갈하이)>This mansion appeared as the law firm of the famous lawyer Go Tae-rim (Jingu), also known as Goethe.'),(5003756,'<Regal High(리갈하이)>This is the living room of child actor Yu Harin, a genius who is planning to sue his parents in episode 10. Here, he meets Go Tae-rim (Jin-gu) and Seo Jae-in (Seo Eun-soo).'),(5003757,'<Remember(리멤버)>In episode 9, Nam Gyu-man (Namkoong Min) and prosecutor Cha Jin-kyung (Oh Na-ra) met lawyer Park Dong-ho (Park Sung-woong) here to turn him to their side.'),(5003758,'<Remember(리멤버)>This building appears as the office of gangster lawyer Park Dong-ho (played by Park Sung-woong). In episode 3, Seo Jin-woo (played by Yoo Seung-ho) tries to protect his father by getting involved in Seo Jin-woo\'s situation, only to be chased away from this place.'),(5003759,'<Remember(리멤버)>In episode 19, Lawyer Park Dong-ho (played by Park Sung-woong) and Prosecutor Tak Geom-sa (played by Song Young-kyu) celebrate their alliance with Nam Il-ho and drink soju at this restaurant.'),(5003760,'<Remember(리멤버)>Appears as the mansion of Nam Il-ho (Han Jin-hee) in episode 4.'),(5003761,'<Real(리얼)>Located at Kim Soo-hyun\'s luxurious residence in Real'),(5003762,'<Real(리얼)>A swimming pool where scenes of swimming were filmed in Real'),(5003763,'<Real(리얼)>The place where Seong Dong-il\'s main activity stage comes out at Real'),(5003764,'<Real(리얼)>A cafe where scenes featuring firefighters were filmed at Real'),(5003765,'<Real(리얼)>Hotel in Busan featured as a major background in Real'),(5003766,'<Real(리얼)>Barbershop where scenes of Kim Soo-hyun\'s tattoo were filmed in Real'),(5003767,'<Real(리얼)>Hotel bar in Songdo that came out in Real'),(5003768,'<Real Time Love(리얼타임러브)> In episode 15, Seobona (Yoo Ji-yeon) threatens Mun Ye-chan (Choi Hyeon-wook) here at night. Jeong Ha-jin (Lee Eun-soo) and Park Si-young (Hong Poon) witness this scene.'),(5003769,'<Richman(리치맨)>Appeared as the mansion of the CEO of IT company Next In, Lee Yoo-chan (EXO-K Suho).'),(5003770,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>In episode 6, Kim Bora (Ha Yeon-soo) appears at a place where she prepares a gift bought with her first paycheck for her family, friends, and two bosses with her closest friend.'),(5003771,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>In episode 7, Park Mi-so (played by Yoon Da-yeong) questions her boyfriend Cha Do-jin (played by Park Seong-hoon) about his income, savings, and future career options, ultimately concluding that breaking up with him is the best choice.'),(5003772,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>The meeting with the ministry proposing a new computer program DS to help Next In manage all public data takes place here in episode 2. The meeting goes well until Kim Bora (Ha Yeon-soo) accidentally mentions controversy.'),(5003773,'<Richman(리치맨)>In episode 2, Yoochan (Suho of EXO-K) visits for a business meeting with Kim Bora (Ha Yeon Soo).'),(5003774,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>In episode 13, Chadojin (Park Sung-hoo) and Park Miso (Yoon Da-young) appear at the hospital to meet the beauty obstetrician.'),(5003775,'<Richman(리치맨)>In the drama \"Suho\", Lee Yoo-chan (Suho) crosses this bridge on his way to work riding a motorcycle.'),(5003776,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>In episode 6, Park Mi-so (played by Yoon Da-young) takes her boyfriend Cha Do-jin (played by Park Sung-hoon) to this restaurant.'),(5003777,'<Richman(리치맨)>In episode 2, Lee Yoo-chan (EXO\'s Suho) was shown buying a necklace at this street vendor.'),(5003778,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>It appears as the place where Lee Yoo Chan (Suho from EXO-K) invites Kim Bo Ra (Ha Yeon-soo) for a meal in episode 3.'),(5003779,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>At the event where the new employee selection competition takes place, chaired by Lee Yoochan (EXO-K\'s Suho) in episode 1 and 2, Kim Bora (Ha Yeon-soo) meets him for the first time.'),(5003780,'<Rich Man(리치맨)>In episode 7, Yoo Chan (EXO\'s Suho) comes to this place with his girlfriend Mintaera (Kim Yewon) because she wants to learn more about his job.'),(5003781,'<Return(리턴)>In Return, Do Geoyoung (Lee Jin-wook) confronts Prosecutor Choi Ja-hye (Go Hyeon-jeong) over a case.'),(5003782,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>Stone wall path that appears in the autumn scene of Little Forest'),(5003783,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>Turnstile Market, which also appeared in the trailer for Little Forest'),(5003784,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>A quiet picnic spot featured in the movie Little Forest'),(5003785,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>The filming location of Hye-won\'s house in the movie Little Forest'),(5003786,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>The protected tree in the movie \"Little Forest\" located in the field.'),(5003787,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>The temple where scenes from \"Little Forest\" can be seen exactly as they were viewed in the movie'),(5003788,'<Little Forest(리틀포레스트)>Where Hye-won rode a bicycle in her hometown in Little Forest'),(5003789