)>In episode 1, the old \'Jinmi Restaurant\' inherited by Jung Jin\'s (Nam Ji-hyun) mother Seo Ae-sook (So Hee-jung) appears.'),(5003800,'<Come to Witch\'s Restaurant(마녀식당으로 오세요)>In episode 5, Jung Jin (Nam Ji-hyun) brings writer Tom Kim (Choi Sung-jae) here for dinner.'),(5003801,'<Come to Witch\'s Restaurant(마녀식당으로 오세요)>Appears as the performance venue of Jin Sun-mi (Ahn Eun-jin) in episode 4.'),(5003802,'<Come to the Witch\'s Restaurant(마녀식당으로 오세요)>In episode 1, Joo-hee (played by Song Ji-hyo) appears at the location where Jung-jin (played by Nam Ji-hyun) is drinking coffee.'),(5003803,'<Come to Witch\'s Restaurant(마녀식당으로 오세요)>Jung Jin (Nam Ji-hyun) lives in this house with her mother Seo Ae-sook (So Hee-jung)'),(5003804,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>The location where Ma Yi-deum (Jung Ryeo-won) and Yeo Jin-wook (Yoon Hyun-min) take the elevator in episode 1.'),(5003805,'<The Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>In episode 11, the trial of Lee Sang-hyeon takes place at this building called the \'Court\'.'),(5003806,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>In episode 11, Yang Yoo-jin (played by Son Dam-bi) came to have a drink with chef Lee Sang-hyun.'),(5003807,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>Appears in episodes 2 as a case involving Nam Woo-sung (played by Jang Jung-yeon).'),(5003808,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>In episode 7, Yeo Jin-wook (Yoon Hyun-min) brings Maiddum (Jung Ryeo-won) to this park\'s rock climbing wall and encourages her.'),(5003809,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>In episode 7, Ma Yi-deum (Jung Ryeo-won) and Yeo Jin-wook chat about their hometown as they walk along this road passing through DMC.'),(5003810,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>In episode 8, you can see Myeodum (played by Jung Ryeo-won), Yeo Jin-wook (played by Yoon Hyun-min), and detective Guk Seok-chan (played by Yoon Kyun-ho) questioning the receptionist about Room \'K\' inside the hotel. Afterwards, the chase continues as the host, Jang-eo (played by Kim Ki-moo), crosses the street.'),(5003811,'<Witch\'s Court(마녀의 법정)>The exterior of the bu