)>In episode 4, Ban Ji-yeon (Uhm Jung-hwa) wears a dress at this shop to raise funds.'),(5003823,'<Witch\'s Romance(마녀의 연애)>The place where Ban Ji-yeon\'s (Uhm Jung-hwa) colleagues ridicule her in episodes 1-2 is the former Bar Bida of this hotel. In reality, they paid Yong Soo-chul (Yoon Hyun-min) money to make her attractive and then publicly humiliated her. But then Yoon Dong-ha (Park Seo-joon) rushes in and kisses her.'),(5003824,'<Witch\'s Love(마녀의 연애)>In the final episode 16, Ban Ji-yeon (Uhm Jung-hwa) reflects on her life and walks towards this square.'),(5003825,'<Witch\'s Love(마녀의 연애)>In episode 4, actor Kim Jung-do (played by Jeon No-min) is filming at the UNICEF Square in this park. Ring-yeon (played by Um Jung-hwa) from her team sent someone to get DNA in a water bottle while taking advantage of the opportunity.'),(5003826,'<Witch\'s Love(마녀의 연애)>Appears as the restaurant venue where Ban Jiyeon\'s (Uhm Jung-hwa) annual alumni gathering is held in episode 6.'),(5003827,'<Witch\'s Love(마녀의 연애)>In episode 16, Ban Ji-yeon (Uhm Jung-hwa) and Yoon Dong-ha (Park Seo-joon) met Dong-ha\'s father Yoon Se-jun (Choi Tae-ho) at this location.'),(5003828,'<Witch\'s Romance(마녀의 연애)>Yoon Dong Ha (Park Seo Joon) crosses the bridge on a scooter in episode 6 after a tussle with Ban Ji Yeon (Uhm Jung Hwa).'),(5003829,'<Witch\'s Love(마녀의 연애)>Appears as the place where Yoon Dong-ha (Park Seo-joon) drives Ban Ji-yeon (Uhm Jung-hwa) to when she goes to the fruit store & cafe to buy fruits in episode 6.'),(5003830,'<Witch\'s Love(마녀의 연애)>In episode 1, there is a scene where Ban Ji-yeon (played by Um Jung-hwa) appears standing alone in front of the altar dressed in a wedding dress.'),(5003831,'<Mother(마더)>An old village that carefully preserves the look of the 1970s'),(5003832,'<Mother(마더)>A place full of silver grass where Kim Hye-ja danced in the opening'),(5003833,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Visited by B1A4 Sandeul and Mamamoo Moonbyul, a tonkatsu restaurant'),(5003834,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Filming location for Moonbyul\'s solo song \"Snow\" MV'),(5003835,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>The place where Mamamoo prepared a performance workshop in Queendom'),(5003836,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>The village where Mamamoo left a lifetime shot on Moomoo Trip'),(5003837,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>This is where Mamamoo filmed SBS Inkigayo Traffic Safety Song'),(5003838,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>MAMAMOO Hwasa and Wheein visited this popular restaurant in Busan'),(5003839,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>A bowling alley where MAMAMOO filmed the music video for \'Starry Night\''),(5003840,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>Restaurant visited by Moonbyul and Hwasa for their health'),(5003841,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Mamamoo\'s hop house where they filmed a soju commercial'),(5003842,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>The intestine restaurant visited by MAMAMOO\'s Solar'),(5003843,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>A place where Moonbyul made friendship rings for the members.'),(5003844,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Mamamoo Wheein\'s favorite gopchang restaurant'),(5003845,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>Alone in the City Ep. 252 - Taste of Ganjang Gejang that Hwasa Ate'),(5003846,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Drinking Singing Mamoo Season 3 Free Style Filming Location'),(5003847,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Famous gopchang restaurant well known as Hwasa\'s favorite place'),(5003848,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Indoor basketball court where Wheein filmed a performance video'),(5003849,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Episode 336 of I Live Alone, where Hwasa enjoys a special meal by the Han River'),(5003850,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Mamamoo visited this small intestines restaurant while doing a V LIVE with Moonbyul and Wheein.'),(5003851,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>Filming location for \"My Secret Sister, Who I Want to Know Only\" starring Wheein.'),(5003852,'<MAMAMOO(마마무)>Mexican restaurant visited by Solar and Eric Nam'),(5003853,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>bnt Mamamoo Photoshoot Location'),(5003854,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>A bakery visited by Hwasa and Wheein'),(5003855,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Mukbang restaurant featured in tv show \"I Live Alone\" episode 317 where Hwasa and Wheein ate spicy rice cakes.'),(5003856,'<Mamamoo(마마무)>Where Hwasa and Wheein