efore leaving.'),(5003888,'<The Joy of Victory(마성의 기쁨)>In episode 1, Sung Ki-joon (played by INFINITE\'s Hoya) arrives at this location.'),(5003889,'<Masung\'s Joy(마성의 기쁨)>In the 12th episode, the unrequited love of Sung Ki-joon (Infinite\'s Hoya) ended, and his first \'date\' with Ju Gi-bum (Song Ha-yoon) was realized here.'),(5003890,'<Mouse(마우스)>The house where young Jaehoon (played by Kanghun Kim) lives with his family, and part of Gaehwa 12-gil located right behind this house is also featured in episode 1.'),(5003891,'<Mouse(마우스)>The prison where Han Seo-jun (played by Ahn Jae-wook), also known as the Headhunter, is imprisoned and escapes.'),(5003892,'<Sound of Heart(마음의 소리)>Appeared from Episode 1 to Family House'),(5003893,'<Heart Signal(마음의 소리)>In this place, Jo Seok (Lee Kwang-soo) and Choi Ae-bong (Jung So-min) have their first date.'),(5003894,'<My Girl(마이 걸)>In episode 8, Juyurin (played by Ida Hae) visits the observatory and astronomy tower with Seol Gongchan (played by Lee Dong Wook). In episode 16, the two characters reunite at this location.'),(5003895,'<My Girl(마이 걸)>Appeared as one of the hotels owned by Seol Gong-chan (Lee Dong-wook).'),(5003896,'<My Name(마이 네임)>In episode 2, Yoon Ji-woo (played by Oh Hye-jin) and Choi Moo-jin (played by Park Hee-soon) met at the entrance of this location.'),(5003897,'<My Name(마이 네임)>In episode 4, Jung Tae Joo (played by Lee Hak Joo) leaves this building after meeting with buyer representatives. He gets into his car and upon arriving at the entrance with the guidance of the staff, he finds an envelope on the dashboard. In episode 5, Jeon Pil-do (played by Ahn Bo Hyun) comes to interrogate the staff about Do Kang-jae (played by Jang Ryul).'),(5003898,'<My Name(마이 네임)>After dodging the gangsters in Episode 8, Jeon Pil-do (Ahn Bo-hyun) brings Yoon Ji-woo (O Hye-jin) to this beach to find a \'hideout\'.'),(5003899,'<My Secret Hotel(마이 시크릿 호텔)>This is the architectural office of Gu Hye-young (Kim Ji-han).'),(5003900,'<