 and Shi An (Shin So Yul) visits to present her paper.'),(5004518,'<Melandcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>It appears as a elementary school where Yoon-soo (played by Im Soo-jung) teaches math in the 16th episode.'),(5004519,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 2, No Jung-ah (Jin Kyung) came to this house to meet her father, No In-hyung (Jang Kwang).'),(5004520,'<Melangcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>In Episode 7, Seong Ye-rin (Woody) almost gets hit by a former teacher while crossing this street.'),(5004521,'<Melandcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 1, Congressman Seong Min-joon (Jang Hyeon-seong) and Chairwoman Noh Jeong-a of Asung High School (Jin Gyeong) meet here to play golf and secretly discuss the upcoming Math Olympiad.'),(5004522,'<Melandcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>The exterior of this building appeared as the \'Taeyangseok Building\' where Ji Yoon-soo (played by Lim Soo-jung) works as a private tutor. It can be seen in episodes 7 and 8.'),(5004523,'<MeloCollia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 13, Seong Ye-rin (Woo Da-bi) told Ji Yoon-soo (Im Soo-jung) to meet at this cafe and warned Baek Seung-woo (Lee Do-hyun) that if anything happens, it\'s her fault.'),(5004524,'<MeloColia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 8, Ryu Sung-jae (Choi Dae-hoon) follows Ji Yoon-soo (Im Soo-jung) to this building to attempt a conversation. In episode 9, Baek Seung-yu (Lee Do-hyun) discovers them coming on a motorcycle. In episode 14, Yoon-soo meets Choi Sung-han (Jeon Jin-ki) and convinces him to submit his 2017 academic records as proof.'),(5004525,'<Mellangcolia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 3, Yoon Soo (played by Lim Soo Jung) and Baek Seung Yoo (played by Lee Do Hyun) have dinner at this restaurant.'),(5004526,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 13, Ji Yoon-soo (Im Soo-jung) and Baek Seung-yu (Lee Do-hyun) meet in this music room.'),(5004527,'<Melangcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 9, Baek Seung-yoo (played by Lee Do-hyun) and Ji Yoon-soo (played by Im Soo-jung) meet at this park and discuss how to deal with school situations.'),(5004528,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 4, Ji Yoon-su (played by Im Soo-jung) attended a math seminar.'),(5004529,'<Melangcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>Location where the 4th International Mathematical Olympiad was held in 2017. It is where Seong Yerin (Udavi) and Baek Seungyu (Lee Dohyun) meet.'),(5004530,'<Melangcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 3, Ji Yoon Soo (played by Im Soo-jung) is seen wearing a wedding dress in front of her fiancé.'),(5004531,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 11, Noh Yeon-woo (Oh Hye-won) meets Ryu Sung-jae (Choi Dae-hoon) who discovers Ji Yun-soo\'s (Im Soo-jung) whereabouts in this hotel room.'),(5004532,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 3, Ji Yoon-soo (played by Im Soo-jung) appears at the bride\'s house where she is taking a taxi to go for a wedding dress fitting appointment.'),(5004533,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 6, Baek Seung-yu (played by Lee Do-hyun) follows Ji Yoon-soo along this street and belatedly congratulates her on her wedding the next day.'),(5004534,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>The wedding of Ji Yoon-soo (Im Soo-jung) and Ryu Sung-jae (Choi Dae-hoon) takes place at this chapel in episode 6.'),(5004535,'<Melangcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 2, Congressman Sung Min-jun (played by Jang Hyun-seong) proposed meeting with Principal No Jung-ah (played by Jin Kyung) to discuss limiting student participation.'),(5004536,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 8, Baek Seungyu (played by Lee Dohyun) agrees to meet Ji Yoonsoo (played by Im Soojung) at this restaurant.'),(5004537,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 2, Congressman Sung Min-jun (played by Jang Hyun-sung) meets director No Jung-ah (played by Jin Kyung) from Asung High School to have a debate.'),(5004538,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>It appears to be the education office building where Ryu Seung-jae (Choi Dae-hoon) works as the chief of the office, as seen in episodes 7 and 8.'),(5004539,'<Melencholia(멜랑꼴리아)>This building appears to be a part of \'Aseong High School,\' where the director No Jung-ah (Jin Kyung) gives a speech to parents and students.'),(5004540,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)> Baek Seungyu (Lee Dohyun) hands over to his father Baek Minsik (Kim Hojin) at the UOS Centennial Memorial Hall in the 2nd episode to take a placement test. In the early parts of the 3rd episode, he competed to represent Aseong High School, and several years later in the 7th episode, he was introduced as a teacher at a school gathering. Also, in the 3rd episode, Seungyu and teacher Ji Yoonsoo (played by Im Soojung) reveal their appearance outside the university museum next to this hall after viewing the art exhibition.'),(5004541,'<MelandCollia(멜랑꼴리아)>After finishing a live TV interview, Baek Seung-yoo (Lee Do-hyun) and his friend Lee Hyeon-jae (Lee Kang-ji) leave this building.'),(5004542,'<Mellangcolia(멜랑꼴리아)>In the 7th episode, No Jeong-ah (played by Jin Kyung) officially invites Baek Seung-yoo (played by Lee Do-hyun) to meet at this hotel\'s \'Terrace Lounge\' as a mentor for Asung School of Math, Arts, and Genius Youth.'),(5004543,'<Melo Collia(멜랑꼴리아)>In Yeouiseoro, Ryu Sung-jae (Choi Dae-hoon), who has been following Baek Seung-yoo (Lee Do-hyun) since the 9th inning, blocks the street by driving his car to plead with Seung-yoo to let go of Ji Yoon-soo\'s (Im Soo-jung) life.'),(5004544,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 11, Ji-yoon (played by Im Soo-jung) and Seong-jae (played by Choi Dae-hoon) shared a conversation on this bridge.'),(5004545,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In scene 2, Congressman Sung Min-jun leaves this building in a car with a driver.'),(5004546,'<Mellangcollia(멜랑꼴리아)>After winning the President\'s Award on \'5th Avenue\', Sung Yerin (Udavi) and her family are celebrating on the first floor of this restaurant with two educators.'),(5004547,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>In episode 10, Baek Seung-yoo (Lee Do-hyun) and Ji Yoon-soo (Im Soo-jung) cross this bridge on a motorcycle.'),(5004548,'<Melancholia(멜랑꼴리아)>Baek Seung-yu (Lee Do-hyun) is walking on this bridge alone at night in episode 2, with mathematical equations filling his mind and sight. In episode 7, he returns to this 