 ladies distributing flyers outside Exit 11 of this station.'),(5005018,'<Miss Hammurabi(미스 함무라비)>Cha O Reum (Go Ara) and Im Ba Reun (Kim Myung Soo) work as judges here and can often be seen in front of the courthouse.'),(5005019,'<Miss Hammurabi(미스 함무라비)>Visits to attend a wedding in episode 9 and encounters Min Yong Joon (2018).'),(5005020,'<Miss Hammurabi(미스 함무라비)>In episode 5, successful prosecutor Cha Sun-bae meets with reporters at this location to distort allegations of overworking from a female judge.'),(5005021,'<Miss Hammurabi(미스 함무라비)>In episode 10, while taking a walk in the evening air, Baryun wants to support her on their way home saying she wants to support her mistake, the both of them dance.'),(5005022,'<Miss Hammurabi(미스 함무라비)> In episode 12, the protagonist discovers that the mother, who is the perpetrator of the case, lived with her until the mother committed suicide. She becomes much more violent when drunk. In episode 13, she is caught by the police while trying to protect Bo Mi.'),(5005023,'<Mr. Goodbye(미스터 굿바이)>Yoon Hyun-seo (Ahn Jae-wook) and Choi Young-in (Lee Bo-young) work as hoteliers at this hotel in the drama.'),(5005024,'<Mister Temporary(미스터 기간제)>This high school appears as \'Chunmyung High School\' in the drama where the protagonist, lawyer Ki Moo-hyeok (Yoon Kyun-sang), disguises himself as a teacher due to a murder case. It appears in every episode of the drama.'),(5005025,'<Mr. Periodical(미스터 기간제)>He stealthily works as a temporary teacher in 3 episodes.'),(5005026,'<Mr. Temp(미스터 기간제)>\n\nIn episode 6, Kim Mu-hyuk (Yoon Gyun-sang) meets his former colleague Shin Hye-soo (Kim Ye-won) at this cafe.'),(5005027,'<Mr. Temporary(미스터 기간제)>In the first episode, Kim Hyeok (Yoon Kyun Sang) meets a fellow lawyer and classmate here to have a drink.'),(5005028,'<Mister Temporary(미스터 기간제)>In episode 11, he goes undercover as a temporary teacher for a class on lies.'),(5005029,'<Mr. Baek(미스터 백)>Hong Ji-yoon (Park Ye-jin) confirms that Jeong Yi-geon (Jeong Seok-won) still doesn\'t remember anything while eating snails, and asks about the unwanted engagement.'),(5005030,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>Nearby Hwangmae Fortress in episode 6. Eugene Choi (played by Lee Byung-hun) tries to find his parents\' grave on this mountain. He meets Jang Seung-goo (played by Choi Moo-sung) who came to grieve with him.'),(5005031,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>Bamboo forest where Koe Shin practices shooting with guns'),(5005032,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>The place where Go Ae-shin pointed a gun at the Japanese soldiers inside the train.'),(5005033,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>A forest where the young Yu Jin runs away from the Japanese soldiers.'),(5005034,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>In episode 6, Eugene waits at Eunsan\'s house while thinking about his new enemy, Hui-seong.'),(5005035,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>In episode 2, Choi Yoo-jin (Lee Byung-hun) recalls his childhood memories of riding a boat in the Indian-style pavilion on the opposite bank of this pavilion. He then sits in a nearby restaurant and enjoys a Baksook. In episode 10, Go Ae-shin (Kim Tae-ri) and Yoo Jin Choi (Lee Byung-hun) take a walk along the frozen river in front of this place, talking about the origin of the Joseon Dynasty and his reasons for fleeing to North America.'),(5005036,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>The main building of this campus appeared in episode 16.'),(5005037,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>One of the traditional villages in Seongseo Campus that appeared in episodes 11 of the drama \'Mr. Sunshine\' is \'Han Hak-chon.\' One of them is Gyungchun Hall (Gyeongchun Hall/敬天堂).'),(5005038,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>Goe Shin visited the Cotton Academy to learn \'English\''),(5005039,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>A guest house Hwawolru where an American named Logan Taylor was assassinated'),(5005040,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>In episode 5 of Mr. Sunshine, Japanese soldiers march outside the venue to arrest a Japanese soldier who harmed American soldiers. After a series of language translations between the two parties, Tsuda (played by Lee Jung Hyun) declares a battle, and two sets of soldiers are pointing weapons at each other. Eugene Choi (played by Lee Byung Hun) asks if Japan has declared war on the United States.'),(5005041,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>The place where Go Ae-shin was insulted by the American military in a total loss'),(5005042,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>It is the place where you can confirm the owner of the mask.'),(5005043,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>Set of Mr. Sunshine produced by SBS'),(5005044,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>Eugene Choi (Lee Byung-hun) and Kim Hee-sung (Byun Yo-han) Official destination and residence, as well as the magnificent Glory Hotel owned by the fierce Kudo Hina (Kim Min-jung). The second is the marketplace where Gu Dong-mae (Yoo Yeon-seok) first saw the young Go Ae-shin (Kim Tae-ri). Also, the bridge where Eugene Choi and Go Ae-shin first meet on the night when the American minister is assassinated. Scenes include the Japanese-style pub where the three men meet and drink, Hwal-lul-lu run by two slave hunters, Go Ae-shin\'s house, and scenes featuring the first railroad car in Hanseong (old Seoul).'),(5005045,'<Mr. Sunshine(미스터 션샤인)>This is where Eugene Choi (Lee Byung-hun) appears as he arrives at the temporary office of the US Embassy in Episode 2 to interrogate Go Ae-sin (Kim Tae-ri).'),(5005046,'<Misty(미스티)>In episode 5, Kang Tae-wook (Ji Jin-hee) meets his mother at this place. While she only pays attention to the two men sitting at the table behind him gossiping about his wife, he wants to convince her to finally break up with his wife. He decides to stand by his wife\'s side and hits one of them before leaving the cafe.'),(5005047,'<Misty(미스티)>It appeared as Kang Tae-wook\'s (played by Ji Jin-hee) parents\' house in the final 16th episode. And he confesses to his father that he killed someone.'),(5005048,'<Misty(미스티)>In episode 3, Go Hye-ran (played by Kim Nam-joo) and Kang Tae-wook (played by Ji Jin-hee) get married at this church.'),(5005049,'<Misty(미스티)>The \"2017 KBS Drama Awards\" where Go Hye-ran (Kim Nam-joo) received an award will be held at this location.'),(5005050,'<Misty(미스티)>In episode 5, Ha Myeong-woo (Lim Tae-kyeong) is released from prison.'),(5005051,'<Missing: They Were There(미씽: 그들이 있었다)>After swindling money from elsewhere in Episode 9, informant Hwang Du-cheol (Park No-shik) meets with detective Shin Jun-ho (Ha Jun) outside this shopping mall.'),(5005052,'<Missing: They Were There(미씽: 그들이 있었다)> In episode 9, Detective Shin Jun-ho (Ha Joon) decides to meet the informant and scammer Hwang Du-chul (Park No-shik) here in order to track down the whereabouts of Choi Ye-na (Seo Eun-soo).'),(5005053,'<I\'m Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>In episode 3, Choi Yoon (Jung Kyung-ho) held a concert here, and Song Eun-chae (Lim Soo-jung) followed him.'),(5005054,'<Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>This is where So Ji-sub does his morning workout in Sorry, I Love You.'),(5005055,'<Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>In the drama \"Sorry, I Love You\", Oh Doo-hee (Lee Hye-young) lives in this mansion with her son Choi Yoon (Jung Kyung-ho).'),(5005056,'<I\'m Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>In episode 14, Choi Yoon (Jung Kyung-ho) receives treatment at this hospital annex [Seoul St. Mary\'s Hospital Annex] and Cha Moo-hyuk (So Ji-sub) visits.'),(5005057,'<Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>In episode 14, Cha Moo-hyuk (played by So Ji-sub) calls Son Eun-chae (played by Im Soo-jung) from a highway overpass and says, \'Are you well? I like you.\' Missing her, he suddenly runs to find her.'),(5005058,'<Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>Seen in front of the Yeouido Complex Shopping Mall at exit 5 of 4th in the mentioned episode.'),(5005059,'<Sorry, I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>In episode 4, Chae Moo-hyuk (So Ji-sub) and Su-yeong (Jung Kyung-ho) cross this bridge to go swimming, and after they finish swimming and return, they meet Mu-hyeon sitting in the driver\'s seat after crossing the bridge again.'),(5005060,'<Love in Sadness(미안하다 사랑한다)>In episode 15, Cha Moo-hyuk (So Ji-sub) who is terminally ill seeks refuge in this resort with the help of Moon Ji-young (Choi Yeo-jin) to avoid burdening Song Eun-chae (Im Soo-jung) who is desperately searching for him.'),(5005061,'<Sorry I Love You(미안하다 사랑한다)>In episode 5, singer duo Choi Yoon (Jung Kyung-ho) makes an appearance. Choi Yoon and Oh Deul-hee (Lee Hye-young) are having a photoshoot here. Yoon\'s trusted road manager Cha Mu-hyuk (So Ji-sub) and Yoon\'s fashion coordinator Song Eun-chae (Im Soo-jung) are also present.'),(5005062,'<Beautiful Our Baby(미운 우리 새끼)>The barbecue restaurant where Kim Hee-cheol worked part-time after independence.'),(5005063,'<\"Our Ugly Duckling\"(미운 우리 새끼)>A seolleongtang restaurant that Kim Jongkook frequented when he lived in Anyang.'),(5005064,'<Miwoon Uri Saeggi(미운 우리 새끼)>Miwoon Uri Saeggi Episode 158 where Sangmin Lee visits a restaurant'),(5005065,'<Ugly Our Kid(미운 우리 새끼)>Kim Hee-chul, Jung Joon-ha, Soyou visited a Gangnam chicken feet restaurant'),(5005066,'<Ugly Our Baby(미운 우리 새끼)>Kangnam restaurant visited by Kim Hee-chul, Jung Jun-ha, and Soyou'),(5005067,'<Ugly Delicious(미운 우리 새끼)>Apgujeong Brazilian restaurant visited by Lee Sang-min and Tak Jae-hoon'),(5005068,'<Ugly Our Baby(미운 우리 새끼)>Kim Jun-hyun and the Chun-ttung brothers eat all day long in one place'),(5005069,'<Ugly Our baby(미운 우리 새끼)>Hong Jin Young, Hong Seon Young visited a high-end restaurant'),(5005070,'<Ugly Our Kids(미운 우리 새끼)>A Gangnam chicken skewer shop operated by Jeong Jun-ha'),(5005071,'<Ugly Our Children(미운 우리 새끼)> A pig\'s feet restaurant visited by Lee Sang-min and Kim Bo-sung after exercising'),(5005072,'<Ugly Our Baby(미운 우리 새끼)>Potato soup restaurant visited by sisters Hong Jin-young and Hong Seon-yeong'),(5005073,'<Ugly Our Baby(미운 우리 새끼)>\"It\'s alive~\" A must-visit restaurant in Dongmyo that impressed Bae Jeong-nam.'),(5005074,'<My Ugly Duckling(미운 우리 새끼)>Episode 164 Grilled Intestines Tteokbokki\n\nPlease note that 