ho) first met Hyeonseong, the former boyfriend of Han Eunsung (played by Lee Yooyoung).'),(5005087,'<Crazy for You!(미치겠다, 너땜에!)>In episode 2, Kim Raewon (Kim Sunho) and Han Eunsung (Lee Yooyoung) try to pick plums hanging on a tree outside their house.'),(5005088,'<Going Crazy Because of You!(미치겠다, 너땜에!)>Kim Raewan (Kim Sun-ho) comes here to see Han Eunsung (Lee Yoo-young) interpreting for a French director in episode 4. He sketches her while watching her. Later, he tries to approach her but overhears a phone call between her and Heenam (Seongju).'),(5005089,'<Mingyeonghoon(민경훈)>Mingyeonghoon\'s restaurant where he ate gamjatang on Ssigshin Road.'),(5005090,'<Minkyung Hoon(민경훈)>A temple where Kyung-hoon experienced temple stay on \"Knowing Bros\"'),(5005091,'<Minkyung Hoon(민경훈)>Minkyung Hoon\'s unique noodle soup restaurant that he ate on Siksindang'),(5005092,'<Minkyung Hoon(민경훈)>Minkyung Hoon visited this beach after camping on Jeju Island in a YouTube video'),(5005093,'<Minkyung Hoon(민경훈)>Minkyung Hoon YouTube, climbed to the top of Mang Ureum at Hamdeok Beach'),(5005094,'<Minkyung Hoon(민경훈)>Minkyung Hoon on YouTube arrives at Jeju Island as the final destination.'),(5005095,'<Minkyeonghun(민경훈)>Minkyeonghun visited the park in Jeju on his YouTube channel'),(5005096,'<Mingyeong Hun(민경훈)>A place where people come to take a boat ride to the outer harbor on a solo travel app.'),(5005097,'<Mint Condition(민트 컨디션)>Twenty-year-old senior citizen Lee Hyun-cheol (Auyeon) wakes up to hip-hop artist Lee Moon-se (Jimin-hyuk) and becomes friends with his group.'),(5005098,'<Mint Condition(민트 컨디션)>Stingy old man Lee Hyeon-cheol undergoes an MRI scan due to a mechanical failure and wakes up to find his 20-year-old self (Ahn Woo-yeon). At the bus stop, he recognizes hip-hop musician Lee Moon-se (Jimin-hyuk) and convinces him to help, as he was also at the hospital. Moon-se agrees to let him stay at his place and they pass by this cafe on their way. Later, Hyeon-cheol discovers MRI nurse Hong Chae-ri (Red Velvet\'s Yeri) hiding behind a pillar outside the cafe.'),(5005099,'<Mint Condition(민트 컨디션)>Lee Hyun-cheol (Ahn Woo-yeon) becomes friends with Lee Moon-se (Ji Min-hyuk) and his group. After facing school bullying and arguments, the group walks through this tunnel in slow motion, trying to look cool.'),(5005100,'<Mint Condition(민트 컨디션)>In \"Mint Condition,\" Imunse (Jiminhyuk) meets his friend and helps him find a missing neighborhood grandmother while arguing with Hong Cha-ri (Red Velvet Yeri) outside her convenience store.'),(5005101,'<Mint Condition(민트 컨디션)>After waking up with a malfunctioning MRI machine, Lee Hyeon-cheol (played by Ahn Woo-yeon) in his twenties becomes friends with hip-hop artist Lee Moon-se (played by Ji Min-hyuk) who lives in the Mint Condition rooftop room.'),(5005102,'<Miryang(밀양)>The church in Miryang where Jeon Do-yeon attended in a movie.'),(5005103,'<Miryang(밀양)>Scene where Jeon Do-yeon teases Song Kang-ho for being a bumpkin'),(5005104,'<Miryang(밀양)>A gathering place for the New Breed happens here'),(5005105,'<Miryang(밀양)>Located in Miryang\'s film set where actors Song Kang-ho and Jeon Do-yeon appeared'),(5005106,'<Milyang(밀양)>The place where Jeon Do-yeon and church members sang and preached together'),(5005107,'<Secret Campus(밀회)>It is the university background that appears in episodes 12 and 13.'),(5005108,'<Secret Meeting(밀회)>In the 13th episode of the 2014 JTBC drama \'Secret Meeting\', Oh Hye-won (Kim Hee-ae) suggests meeting privately at a friend\'s house to Lee Sun-jae (Yoo Ah-in). She tells him that she will keep her distance from him for a while.'),(5005109,'<Secret Affair(밀회)>This is where Lee Sun-jae (Yoo Ah-in) lives in \'Secret Affair\'.'),(5005110,'<Bardan Bada(바라던 바다)>A multipurpose rental space that appeared as a filming location in season 1'),(5005111,'<Wind, Cloud, Rain(바람과 구름과 비)>The marriage ceremony of Emperor Gojong (played by Park Sang-hoon) and Min Ja-yeong (later Queen Myeongseong) unfolds in the palace area of this park.'),(5005112,'<Wind Flower Garden(바람의 화원)>This is the place where drama promotional posters are taken.'),(5005113,'<Wind Flower Garden(바람의 화원)>It is part of a garden that appeared in a drama.'),(5005114,'<\"The Wind Blows\"(바람이 분다)>In the drama, Lee Soo-jin (played by Kim Haneul) visits this cafe in episode 1.'),(5005115,'<The wind blows(바람이 분다)>In Episode 1, Lee Soo-jin (Kim Haneul) comes to this restaurant, waits for a while, and then gets up to call her husband Kwon Dohoon (Gam Woosung) to inform him that she will be leaving.'),(5005116,'<Barami Bunda(바람이 분다)>In episode 3, Kwon Dohoon (played by Kang Woo-sung) attends a funeral and Brian Jung (played by Kim Sung-chul) and his assistant Son Yerim (played by Kim Ga-eun) transform into drivers to carry out the final test at \'Sowol Funeral Home\'.'),(5005118,'<The Wind Blows(바람이 분다)>After coming out of the church in Episode 4, Kwon Dohoon (Kam Woosung) and Choi Hangseo (Lee Junhyuk) persuade Dohoon to inform his family about his Alzheimer\'s disease with Hangseo.'),(5005119,'<The wind blows(바람이 분다)>This is a theater where Lee Soo-jin (played by Kim Ha-neul) disguises herself as another woman, Yu-jeong, and plots to divorce her husband through an affair. She started the affair just one month after meeting her husband, Kwon Do-hoon (played by Gam Woo-sung). In episode 5 of \"The wind blows,\" he rushes to the scene, but she decides not to meet him and watches from the upstairs of Soba restaurant across the street (around 1:20 PM). They go their separate ways. Five years later, they coincide again at the same theater while performing a play about thieves, but he doesn\'t recognize her at first due to his Alzheimer\'s disease.'),(5005120,'<When the Wind Blows(바람이 분다)>In episode 8, Lee Soo-jin (played by Kim Ha-neul) comes out of exit 3 of the station to check how her car is being towed. While crossing the street, she coincidentally meets her ex-husband, Kwon Do-hoon (played by Gam Woo-sung), who she recently divorced. They briefly exchange greetings and she exits through exit 2 of the station, shedding tears.'),(5005121,'<The Wind Blows(바람이 분다)>In Episode 2, Kwon Do-hoon (played by Kang Woo-sung) comes to this church and prays for over an hour, feeling sorry for his close friend Choi Hang-seo (played by Lee Joon-hyuk) who joins him.'),(5005122,'<When the Wind Blows(바람피면 죽는다)>The outdoor restaurant where the after-party for Kang Yeo-joo\'s (played by Jo Yeo-jeong) \'Spooky Music Concert\' is held. Kang Yeo-joo is sitting across from her \'savior\' Cha Soo-ho (played by Kim Young-dae).'),(5005123,'<Barampimyeon Jukneunda(바람피면 죽는다)>This place appears in episode 8 when Ma Dong-kyun (played by Oh Min-seok) meets his boss at a restaurant called \"Barampimyeon Jukneunda\".'),(5005124,'<If You Breathe, You Die(바람피면 죽는다)>Kang Yeo-joo (played by Cho Yeo-jeong) presents the \'Spooky Book Concert\' here in Episode 1. When she is attacked by antis, Cha Soo-ho (played by Kim Young-dae) rescues her on site.'),(5005125,'<Wind Blows to the Wise(바람피면 죽는다)>In episode 8, Cha Soo-ho (played by Kim Young-dae) follows another NIS agent who had previously handled Kang Ye-ju to obtain information about the case.'),(5005126,'<The wind dies when you blow it(바람피면 죽는다)>In episodes 6 and 7, Kang Woo-seong (Go Jun) brings Go Mi-rae (Yeonwoo/Jeon Momoland Da-bin) to this place, and Mi-rae explains that she is working part-time here. She is not trying to deceive people about being a regular student. In fact, she is a regular customer of this hair salon and had a promise here to prepare for an important ceremony.'),(5005127,'<Windstruck(바람피면 죽는다)>This is where Han Woo-sung (Go Jun) and his close friend Son Jin-ho (Jung Sang-hoon) were drinking after finding out about the death of Woo-sung\'s girlfriend, Baek Soo-jung (Hong Soo-hyun), in episode 5.'),(5005128,'<If the wind blows, you die(바람피면 죽는다)>In episode 6 of Go Momoland (former Momoland Yeonwoo) walks on this street.'),(5005129,'<The Wind Blows(바람피면 죽는다)>In episode 6, Kang Yeo-joo (Jo Yeo-jeong) and Han Woo-sung (Go Joon) have dinner at this place. The dinner was awkward throughout and he tries to lighten the mood by reminding her that this is the place where he kissed her for the first time five years ago. And he is taken aback when she asks if she should have a child later on. '),(5005130,'<If you get caught in the wind, you die(바람피면 죽는다)>Appears in \'Han River Hospital\''),(5005131,'<If the wind blows, you die(바람피면 죽는다)>This is a place where TV interviews of Han Woo-seong (Ko Joon) and Baek Soo-jeong (Hong Su-hyun) from the show \"National Husband\" took place.'),(5005132,'<When the Wind Blows(바람피면 죽는다)>In this cafe, Han Woo-sung (Go Jun) meets his close friend and secretary Son Jin-ho (Jung Sang-hoon). In episode 4, he is portrayed trying to find a solution to the threatening situation he is in.'),(5005133,'<Barampimyeon Jugneunda(바람피면 죽는다)>In an episode of \"When the Wind Blows,\" the lovers of Han Woo-sung (Go Jun) were shown living in this building before separating in her apartment.'),(5005134,'<Wind Blows, You Die(바람피면 죽는다)> Cha Soo-ho (played by Kim Young-dae) is searching for an out-of-print book at this store.'),(5005135,'<Wind Blows If You Breathe It(바람피면 죽는다)>Lawyer Hanwoo (Gojun) has a law firm in this building.'),(5005136,'<The Wind Blows and Dies(바람피면 죽는다)>In episode 3, Cha Soo-ho (played by Kim Young-dae) runs down this street after passing by Eulji Observatory.'),(5005137,'<Mobile House(바퀴달린집)>Mobile House Yoona\'s Favorite Green Tea Field Cafe'),(5005138,'<Wheeled House(바퀴달린집)>A place where Wheeled House family and IU went paragliding'),(5005139,'<Wheel House(바퀴달린집)>The Damyang noodle restaurant where the Wheel House members had lunch'),(5005140,'<Wheelhouse(바퀴달린집)>The tidal flat that was the front yard of Wheelhouse Episode 6'),(5005141,'<TV show \"Wheeled House\"(바퀴달린집)>A place where people from \"Wheeled House\" and Gong Hyo-jin met and ate gimbap.'),(5005142,'<Park Jae-bum(박재범)>Park Jae-bum stayed overnight at Kimaris featured on the 13th episode of Tasty Square'),(5005143,'<Jay Park(박재범)>Loco operates, and Jay Park visited the burger restaurant'),(5005144,'<Jay Park(박재범)>The location where Jay Park and H1GHR Music artists filmed the music video for \"Sunshine\"'),(5005145,'<Jay Park(박재범)>The location where Jay Park filmed the \"Gang Remix\" music video'),(5005146,'<Park Jae-beom(박재범)> Filming location for Kang Remix music video featuring Park Jae-beom'),(5005147,'<Park Jaebeom(박재범)>Filming location for Park Jaebeom\'s DRIVE music video'),(5005148,'<Park Jae-beom(박재범)>The place where Park Jae-beom appeared in the special Chuseok episode of \"Taste of Namdong Square\"'),(5005149,'<Park Ji-hoon(박지훈)>Battle Trip\" where Park Ji-hoon rode the zipline'),(5005150,'<Park Jihoon(박지훈)>Walking street where Park Jihoon walked in \'Battle Trip\''),(5005151,'<Park Ji-hoon(박지훈)>Featured on \'Battle Trip\', where Park Ji-hoon stayed'),(5005152,'<Park Jihoon(박지훈)>Filming location of Park Jihoon\'s \'Tomorrow\''),(5005153,'<Park Ji-hoon(박지훈)>A place visited in the program \'Night\' Wanna One\''),(5005154,'<Park Jihoon(박지훈)>Park Jihoon visited the forest personally'),(5005155,'<Park Jihoon(박지훈)>Park Jihoon\'s visit to the Nopo Gamak Pub'),(5005156,'<Banuibani(반의반)>In episodes 7 and 8, Mun Ha-won (played by Jung Hae-in) knows in this park that she will not marry him.'),(5005157,'<Half and Half(반의반)>In Episode 4, Kang In-wook (Kim Sung-kyu) comes to comfort Choi Jin-moo (Lee Seung-jun) who is drowning in sadness. Jin-moo discovers Moon Soon-ho (Kim Ha-na) passing by and suddenly something urgent comes up, so she has to substitute for her.'),(5005158,'<Viki(반의반)>In the drama \"Our Beloved Summer,\" Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) calls Mun Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) to meet at a corner where cherry blossoms are in full bloom. She needs healing. Shortly after, Ha-won arrives to join her and they embrace under the flowers.'),(5005159,'<Half and Half(반의반)>In episode 2, Choi Jin-moo (Lee Seung-jun) comes to assist pianist Kang In-wook (Kim Sung-kyu) with his piano performance.'),(5005160,'<Half of Half(반의반)>In episode 7, Han Seo-woo (played by Chae Soo-bin) hesitates about purchasing a ticket to her hometown Yangyang, where she has never visited since her parents and family died in a bus fire. In the latter part of the drama, she bravely walks to the ticket booth and finally buys a ticket to Yangyang.'),(5005161,'<V Live(반의반)>In episode 9, Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) and his colleagues from AH Research Institute came to have lunch.'),(5005162,'<Half and Half(반의반)>AH Research Institute building operated by Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in). Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) rushes here to avoid the rain in episode 3, and Ha-won contemplates about what she actually does.'),(5005163,'<Half and Half(반의반)>In this place, Seo Woo first meets Kim Ji-soo (played by Park Ju-hyun), who came to deliver plates to herself. Then Mun Ha-won (played by Jung Hae-in) passes this street and heads home. In episode 4, it is said that Seo Woo\'s late mother, who waited for her to come home with a twisted chair next to the street light, placed it there.'),(5005164,'<tvN(반의반)>In \"Vincenzo\", Moohwa Law Firm employees Hong Cha-young (Jeon Yeo-been) and Jang Han-seo (Kim Young-woong) meet at Wow Goga Tea House.'),(5005165,'<Half & Half(반의반)>In episode 9, Gang In-wook (played by Kim Sung-kyu) offers to give Han Seo-woo (played by Chae Soo-bin) a ride. He asks her to get off at the entrance to \"Uk In 4-gil\" and carries a heavy bag as he heads to Moon Ha-won\'s (played by Jung Hae-in) house.'),(5005166,'<TvN(반의반)>In episode 9, Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) takes a walk between the metasequoia trees to organize his thoughts.'),(5005167,'<BanuiBan(반의반)>In the 6th episode, Moon Sun-ho (Lee Na) laughs while looking at Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) in a scene of reminiscence. In this restaurant (officially \'Fly Up Snack\'), Sun-ho confesses to Kim Ji-soo (Park Ju-hyun) who just returned from the United States that she was rejected. Sun-ho\'s laughter, as she writhes in the misery of being rejected by her fiance for her best friend, soon turns into unconscious tears.'),(5005168,'<Ban\'s Ban(반의반)>In episodes 5 and 10 of the movie \'Peace\', Moon Sun-ho (Kim Hana) and Kang In-wook (Kim Sung-kyu) met several times at this restaurant.'),(5005169,'<Viki(반의반)>In the drama \"The Third Charm,\" during their university years, On Joon-young (Seo Kang-joon) and Lee Young-jae (Esom) meet and take a walk in this park.'),(5005170,'<Half of Half(반의반)>In episode 9, Choi Jin-moo (Lee Seung-jun) records in this larger studio.'),(5005171,'<Banui Ban(반의반)>Han Se-woo (Cha Soo-bin) and Kim Ji-soo (Park Joo-hyun) meet at M Coffee Cafe and walk along this street in episode 1, following Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) out of curiosity.'),(5005172,'<Ban\'s Ban(반의반)>Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) and Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) walk down the main road past this building for Seo-woo to catch a bus.'),(5005173,'<Banui ban(반의반)>In the fifth round, Han Seo-woo (played by Chae Soo-bin) and Moon Ha-won (played by Jung Hae-in) hide in an alley to talk with the AI version of Kim Ji-soo (played by Park Ju-hyun).'),(5005174,'<Pan-eui Pan(반의반)>In the drama, \"Half of a Half,\" the bus that Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) and Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) ride passes by the square, with the illuminated statue as the background.'),(5005175,'<V Live(반의반)>In Episode 11, Moon Sun-ho (played by Kim Hana) brings Kang In-wook (played by Kim Sung-kyu) to the cafe. They meet Moon Ha-won (played by Jung Hae-in) and leave.'),(5005176,'<Banui Ban (Half Half)(반의반)>In episode 4, Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) approaches Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) and heads towards this bus stop. When she tries to take the bus, Ha-won suggests taking her home instead.'),(5005177,'<Ban\'s Ban(반의반)>In episode 4, Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) follows Kim Ji-soo\'s final steps in Korea, walking down this street after leaving the recording studio. Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin), who sees him at the studio, decides to follow him. In episode 2, Ji-soo walks down this street after meeting Seo-woo at the studio.'),(5005178,'<Ban\'s Half(반의반)>In episode 4, Moon Ha-won (Jung Hae-in) is walking towards this footbridge following Kim Ji-soo\'s last steps in Korea. While comparing his photo with the landscape, Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) watches him from the ground as he takes his own photo.'),(5005179,'<Half of Half(반의반)>In episode 2, Kim Jisoo (Park Juhyun) waits at the bus stop after meeting Han Seowoo (Chae Soobin). She watches the airport bus across the street. She then changes her mind and runs towards the bus.'),(5005180,'<Half and Half(반의반)>This is the house where Moon Hae-won (Jung Hae-in) stays, and it appears to be the house where Han Se-woo (Chae Soo-bin) lives. Han Se-woo starts spending time with him.'),(5005181,'<Half&Half(반의반)>In episode 4, Kim Chang-seop (played by Kang Bong-seong) meets Jeon Eun-joo (played by Lee Sang-hee) and they are having a meal together.'),(5005182,'<Half of Half(반의반)>Han Se-woo (Chae Soo-bin) and Kim Ji-soo (Park Ju-hyun) walk a few steps away from this house after Se-woo finishes recording Ji-soo\'s voice in Episode 1.'),(5005183,'<반의반(반의반)>Han Seo-woo (Chae Soo-bin) and Kim Ji-soo (Park Ju-hyun) walk a short distance from this place after Seo-woo finishes recording Ji-soo\'s voice in Episode 1.'),(5005184,'<Vincenzo(반의반)>In Vincenzo, Mo Hae Won (played by Jeong Hae In) is studying abroad in the United States when he receives a call from Kim Ji Soo (played by Park Ju Hyun) and returns to Korea.'),(5005185,'<Ban Chang Kko(반창꼬)>The place where Han Hyo-joo and Master Go enjoyed barbecue'),(5005186,'<Banchangkko(반창꼬)>Visited by Ko Soo and Han Hyo-joo for a drink'),(5005187,'<Banchangkko(반창꼬)>Scene of Han Hyo-joo attempting suicide'),(5005188,'<\"Ban Chang Ggo\"(반창꼬)>A place where Han Hyo-joo and Go Soo went on a beach date.'),(5005189,'<Ban Chang Kko(반창꼬)>A place where Han Hyo-joo waits for the expert'),(5005190,'<Events in Bali(발리에서 생긴 일)>In Episode 5, Kang In-wook (So Ji-sub) and Choi Young-joo (Park Ye-jin) drive to this park.'),(5005193,'<Fierce Girls(발칙하게 고고)>In episodes 8 and 9, the Sebit High School cheerleading team goes on a trip. Here, Kim Yeol (Lee Won-Geun) confesses his feelings to Kang Yeondoo (Jung Eun-Ji). However, when she tries to answer, Seo Hajoon (Jisoo) interrupts awkwardly. The confession takes place on a bridge leading to the camping site.'),(5005194,'<The Scholar Who Walks the Night(밤을 걷는 선비)>Kim Sung-yeol (Lee Jun-ki) and Jo Yang-sun (Lee Yoo-bi) reunite under this tree in the final scene of episode 20.'),(5005195,'<Every night(밤이면 밤마다)>In episode 10, Heo Cho-hee (Kim Sun-ah) meets her late father at the opposite platform of this station.'),(5005196,'<Every night at night(밤이면 밤마다)>In the drama, 4 times, the characters Heo Cho-hee (played by Kim Sun-ah) and Kim Bum-sang (played by Lee Dong-gun) participate in an auction at this hotel.'),(5005197,'<Every night(밤이면 밤마다)>Heo Cho-hee (Kim Sun-ah) works at the Cultural Properties Bureau\'s Cultural Relics Enforcement Team in this museum. Kim Beom-sang (Lee Dong-gun) joins as a Vice Minister in episode 2.'),(5005198,'<Every night at night(밤이면 밤마다)>In the 14th episode, Gang Ji-yoon (played by Kim Byeong-ok) and her subordinates conduct transactions at this location.'),(5005199,'<Every night with nightfall(밤이면 밤마다)>In episode 16, some members of the CHA Team drive across this bridge.'),(5005200,'<Every night(밤이면 밤마다)>In one episode, Heo Cho-hee (played by Kim Sun-a) apprehends a cultural heritage smuggler in front of the traditional tea house in Insadong.'),(5005201,'<Every night at night(밤이면 밤마다)>In episode 14, Heo Cho-hee (played by Kim Sun-a) and Kim Beom-sang (played by Lee Dong-gun) walk along this street.'),(5005202,'<Every night at night(밤이면 밤마다)>This house appears as Chairman Jang Oh-sung\'s mansion in episode 16.'),(5005203,'<Every night at night(밤이면 밤마다)>Heo Cho-hee (Kim Sun-ah) lives in this house with her younger brother Heo Kyun (Park Ki-woong)'),(5005204,'<Every night at night(밤이면 밤마다)>In Episode 13, Wang Ju-hyeon (Kim Jung-hwa) followed her superior Kang Si-wan (Lee Ju-hyun), who was looking for the last person her father, Heo Cho-hee (Kim Sun-ah), met before he went missing. Following this, Ju-hyeon comes to this street and takes a selfie in front of the entrance as usual without taking her work seriously.'),(5005205,'<Pretty Sister Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 4, Seo Jun-hee (played by Jung Hae-in) and Yoon Jin-ah (played by Son Ye-jin) who were on a one-night business trip together, visit this beach in the evening.'),(5005206,'<Pretty Sister Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 6, Yoon Jin-ah (played by Son Ye-jin) and Jun-hee (played by Jung Hae-in) take a walk in this forest while leaving their friends behind for a moment.'),(5005207,'<Pretty Sister Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) who lives in an apartment complex with her family.'),(5005208,'<Pretty Sister Who Buys Me Rice(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 9, Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) runs to the bus after meeting Seo Jun-hee (Jung Hae-in) while on her way home to help her younger brother with computer problems due to an exit from Bundang Line Exit 1.'),(5005209,'<Beautiful Sister Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>Seo Jun-hee (played by Jung Hae-in) and his younger sister Seo Kyung-sun (played by Jang So-yeon) live in separate apartments in this apartment complex.'),(5005210,'<\"Beautiful Noona Who Buys Me Food\"(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 5, Seo Jun-hee (Jung Hae-in) and Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) walk through this place.'),(5005211,'<Dine Well Pretty Sister(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>This Coffee Bay cafe is a branch operated by Seo Kyung-seon (played by Jang So-yeon), the younger sister of Seo Jun-hee (played by Jung Hae-in). It regularly appears as a meeting place and almost all characters pass by this cafe. Yoon Jin-ah (played by Son Ye-jin) comes here after learning that her ex-boyfriend had been here twice in one episode, and she talks about never having truly loved anyone while drunk, painting a dark future for the two.'),(5005212,'<Beautiful Noona Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>The mother of Seojun-hee (Jung Hae-in) and Jang So-yeon (Seo Kyung-seon) is buried here.'),(5005213,'<Good Sister Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>A restaurant where Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) gets angry at her ex-boyfriend who cheated on her in episode 1.'),(5005214,'<Drama(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In \"She Would Never Know,\" Yoon Jin-ah (played by Son Ye-jin) is sent to this store from headquarters to assist her.'),(5005215,'<Bab Jal Sajuneun Yeppeun Nuna(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 13, after witnessing Yoon Jina (Son Yejin) meeting her father, Seo Junhee (Jung Haein) comes to drink in frustration.'),(5005216,'<Film (Drama)(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 12, the character Ye Jin-ah (played by Son Ye-jin) comes with her colleagues for lunch.'),(5005217,'<Pretty Noona Who Buys Me Food(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>During his morning commute to the office, Seo Jun-hee (Jung Hae-In) parks his car in front of this building and listens to a voicemail from Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-Jin) saying \"I love you.\"'),(5005218,'<Good Sister Who Buys Meals Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 2, Yoon Jina (Son Ye-jin) calls a taxi in front of this building for her drunk colleague Moon Daeri.'),(5005219,'<Bab Well-Providing Pretty Noona(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 7, Yoon Jin-a (played by Son Ye-jin) insists on taking the subway home even though Seo Jun-hee (played by Jung Hae-in) offers to give her a ride, so he escorts her to the station\'s exit 2 and chases after her to lend her his phone after bidding her goodbye. In episode 13, Jin-a reminisces about that moment from episode 7 while waiting for the train alone as she returns to this place.'),(5005220,'<Jealousy Incarnate(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 8, Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) gets off the bus at this bus stop on her way home from work. You can also see Jin-ah going into the CU convenience store at the bus stop.'),(5005222,'<Good looking sister who buys food well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>Yoon Seung-ho (Wi Ha-joon) and Seo Jun-hee (Jung Hae-in) have a drink here in episode 7.'),(5005223,'<Drama \"Pretty Noona Who Buys Me Food\"(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In episode 15, during a break, Yoon Jin-A (Son Ye-Jin) reminisces about the happy times spent with Seo Joon Hee (Jung Hae-In) at this park.'),(5005224,'<Drama \'Pretty Noona Who Buys Me Food\'(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)> In episode 12, Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) gets off the taxi a little further down from this bus stop.'),(5005225,'<Pretty sister who buys rice well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>The street where Son Ye-jin and Jung Hae-in walked together sharing an umbrella'),(5005226,'<Good Girl Who Buys Me Food(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>Scene in Episode 2 where Seo Jun-hee (Jung Hae-in) and Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) have dinner together.'),(5005227,'<A Pretty Sister Who Buys Me Food(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>Yoon Jin-ah (Son Ye-jin) visits this place to reflect after an unexpected meeting with a blind date and a senior at work in episode 12.'),(5005228,'<Beautiful Noona Who Buys Rice Well(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>This building appears as the office where Yoon Ji-na (Son Ye-jin)\'s ex-boyfriend Lee Gyu-min (Oh Ryong) works.'),(5005229,'<The pretty noona who buys me food(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>In the drama, Jun Hee (played by Jung Hae In) and Yoon Jin Ah (played by Son Ye Jin) pass by this cafe. In episode 4, right after eating dinner together, Jun Hee desperately shrinks himself in order to avoid holding Jin Ah\'s hand or putting his arm around her shoulder. In episode 11, the two are seen leisurely walking in front of this cafe, linking arms. In episode 12, only Jin Ah passes by this place. In episode 14, the two have an argument in front of this cafe.'),(5005230,'<Bap Jal Sajuneun Yeppeun Nuna(밥 잘 사주는 예쁜 누나)>Yoon Jin-a (Son Ye-jin) and Seo Jun-hee (Jung Hae-in) frequently appear as customers at this restaurant.'),(5