e 17, Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) and Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) argue here. In episode 21, Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) is filming a drama at the waterfall plaza in this park.'),(5006049,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 20, Do Min-joon (played by Kim Soo-hyun) opens the door to his house. However, he accidentally teleports outside the subway station exit 6 plaza.'),(5006050,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 17, Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) and Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) are depicted spending a night at this pension. Song-yi cries desperately thinking Min-joon has disappeared. And he comes to comfort her.'),(5006051,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>Many people gathered at this park to see the meteor shower where the stars fly like UFOs in Episode 21.'),(5006052,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>Cafe where Yoo In-na, Kim Soo-hyun, and Jun Ji-hyun met'),(5006053,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)> Kim Soo-hyun and Jun Ji-hyun camped at the snow-covered reservoir'),(5006054,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In Episode 3, Do Min-jun (Kim Soo-hyun) brings Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) to this hospital with acute appendicitis.'),(5006055,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) follows Cheon Song-yi (Jeon Ji-hyun). In episodes 6 and 7, he goes to this amusement park to have a date with Lee Hwi-kyung (Park Hae-jin). While Hwi-kyung and Song-yi are riding the Ferris wheel and Song-yi is about to respond to Hwi-kyung\'s confession, Min-joon stops time and when everything starts working again, she changes her response to negative.'),(5006056,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>Where Kim Soo-hyun and Jun Ji-hyun escaped from the reporters'),(5006057,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 5, Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) rides his bicycle past this station exit and sees Cheon Song-yi\'s (Jun Ji-hyun) advertisement board being taken down.'),(5006058,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 7, Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) is invited to this boutique and Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) takes her there. Inside the boutique, they coincidentally run into Yoo Se-mi (Yoo In-na) and an uncomfortable conversation unfolds between the two. As they leave the building, an assassin drops a heavy glass bottle on Song-yi from the rooftop, and Min-joon barely saves her.'),(5006059,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 8, when Lee Hwi Kyung (played by Park Hae Jin) almost falls off a cliff, Chun Song Yi (played by Jun Ji Hyun) takes him back to the hospital. As they meet Do Min Joon (played by Kim Soo Hyun) at the entrance, Chun Song Yi asks him if he was there at the cliff at that moment.'),(5006060,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 14, Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) threatens Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) on the rooftop of this building. And it\'s where Song-yi is briefly hanging in midair.'),(5006061,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 5, Cheon Song-yi (Jun Ji-hyun) explains to Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) that she has moved to this building, where she currently lives. She invites him to join her on the balcony of her apartment. According to Cheon Song-yi, this is the most expensive place in town for billboards, and the hottest star in the country (currently herself) lives here.'),(5006062,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>In episode 1, the protagonist\'s mother Yang Mi-yeon (played by Na Young-hee) is portrayed having a company dinner with her friends at this restaurant.'),(5006063,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>The drama series \"My Love from the Star\" depicted scenes of Do Min-joon (Kim Soo-hyun) riding a bicycle through this park, which is close to the 119 Special Rescue Team Yeouido Headquarters.'),(5006064,'<My Love from the Star(별에서 온 그대)>The place where Kim Soo-hyun and Jun Ji-hyun promised their love while putting a lock.'),(5006065,'<From the Star(별에서 온 그대)>After locking the lock, enjoy a meal at a revolving restaurant.'),(5006066,'<You Who Came from the Stars(별에서 온 그대)>In episodes 1 