s to leave the room due to a panic attack.'),(5006088,'<Guardian of the Boss(보스를 지켜라)>Kim Biso (Kim Hyung-beom) drinks here and overhears the reporter\'s words, leading to a new scandal surrounding Cha Jihun (Jihun).'),(5006089,'<Drama - Stealing Fate(보쌈-운명을 훔치다)>In episode 1, Sukyung (played by Kwon Yuri of Girls\' Generation) and Jogungnyeo (played by Shin Dong-mi) visit \'Sangwonsa\' before descending the mountain.'),(5006090,'<Boa(보아)>Pension visited by Boa and Choi Danielle'),(5006091,'<Boa(보아)>A countryside restaurant visited by Boa and SHINee Key.'),(5006092,'<BoA(보아)>The view of BoA riding a bus from Autumn Post Office'),(5006093,'<Boa(보아)>Theme park visited by Boa and Son Hyun-joo'),(5006094,'<BoA(보아)>A place visited by BoA for MV filming'),(5006095,'<BoA(보아)>BoA visited and even signed at this sushi restaurant.'),(5006096,'<BoA(보아)>Popular restaurant for army stew that BoA visited'),(5006097,'<Boa(보아)>Boa visited a famous octopus restaurant with Lee Dong Wook.'),(5006098,'<Boa(보아)>Boa from a drama went on a bicycle date here'),(5006099,'<BoA(보아)>BoA visited the green tea fields in Jeju while filming Running Man.'),(5006100,'<BoA(보아)>A snack house visited by BoA during the filming of Night Goblin.'),(5006101,'<Boys(보이스)>It is a house that was revealed as the scene of the murder of Mo Tae-goo (Kim Jae-wook) in episodes 15 and 16.'),(5006102,'<Voice(보이스)>In episode 6, Moo Jin-hyuk (played by Jang Hyuk) and Kang Kwon Joo (played by Lee Ha-na) visit this place to interview witnesses about a murder case at Club Madame.'),(5006103,'<Voice(보이스)>Appears as a background in episode 15.'),(5006104,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>Footage captured Jo Hwa-jin, who appears to be under the influence of drugs (looking like a zombie), wandering around this area in Episode 7.'),(5006105,'<Voices 2(보이스2)>A place where the lead character Lee Jung-sin meets Son Eun-seo and guides her'),(5006106,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>The place where the subway bomber in the drama was subdued'),(5006107,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>The place where the grave of Hae Young, a character in the drama, appeared prominently'),(5006108,'<Voice2(보이스2)>The place where the parents of a crime victim in the drama ran a business'),(5006109,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>Location featured in the drama \"Pungsan City\" where the intercity bus terminal is located.'),(5006110,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>The location where detective Lee Jin-wook was investigating'),(5006111,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>The location where actor Lee Jin-wook discovered the criminal and chased after them.'),(5006112,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>The place where Kwon Yul and Lee Jin-wook had a fateful encounter.'),(5006113,'<Voice 2(보이스2)>The place where the protagonist goes to catch a serial killer'),(5006114,'<The Advisors(보좌관)>In episode 2, Jang Tae-jun (played by Lee Jung-jae) has a meeting with Song Hee-seop (played by Kim Kap-soo) and Kim Hyeong-do (played by Lee Cheol-min) at this restaurant.'),(5006115,'<Travel Show(보좌관)>Featured in episode 8 having a meal.'),(5006116,'<Chief of Staff(보좌관)>In episode 1, Kyung (Kim Dong-jun) gets off at exit 5 of this station on his way to work.'),(5006117,'<Aide(보좌관)>In the drama, \"Advisor,\" Jang Tae-joon (played by Lee Jung-jae) and his friend Go Seok-man (played by Im Won-hee) meet on this bridge.'),(5006118,'<Advisor(보좌관)>It is a building that appears as the workplace of Jang Tae-jun (played by Lee Jung-jae) and Han Do-kyung (played by Kim Dong-jun) in episode 1.'),(5006119,'<The Flog(보좌관)>In episode 1, Song Hee-sub (played by Kim Gap-soo) holds a three-day meeting and a breakfast meeting here, sparking suspicions about himself and leading him to call Jang Tae-jun (played by Lee Jung-jae).'),(5006120,'<Ordinary Wealth(보통의 재화)>In this cafe, Kim Jaehwa (played by Kwak Seon-young) meets her long-lost friend Park Soojin (played by Oh Hye-won). Upon learning about their past affair, Jaehwa is forced to do something she should have done years ago.'),(5006121,'<Ordinary Life(보통의 재화)>Kim Jaehwa (Kwak Seonyoung) stepped on gum while walking along 