re I Die\'.'),(5006132,'<The Penthouse(복수가 돌아왔다)>In episode 1, Kang Bok-soo (played by Yoo Seung-ho) walks past this place, which was the school route everyone took in 2009.'),(5006133,'<The Witch Returns(복수가 돌아왔다)>A school with Kang Bok-soo (Yoo Seung-ho) returning as a teacher and Oh Se-ho (Kwak Dong-yeon) as the principal.'),(5006134,'<Vincenzo(복수가 돌아왔다)>In episode 3, Oh Sesho (played by Kwak Dong-yeon) arrives at this location.'),(5006135,'<Revenge has returned(복수가 돌아왔다)>In episode 14, Kang Boksu (Yoo Seung-ho) and Son Soo-jeong (Jo Bo-ah) visit this park as a math trip destination. During their visit, they grow closer and the afternoon turns into a date, but Lee Kyung-hyun (Kim Dong-young) and Yang Min-ji (Park Ah-in) join them and disturb the sweet time of the two. However, Boksu leaves Kyung-hyun and Min-ji behind and finds the right moment in the evening to end the day with a kiss in front of the tower in this park with Soo-jeong.'),(5006136,'<The Wrath of Vengeance(복수해라)>Kim Tae-on (Yoo Seon)\'s villa. And she sends her lover Lee Hoon-seok (Jung Wook) here to rest.'),(5006137,'<Roco Drama(복수해라)>The drama depicts the search for Lee Ga-on (Jung Hyeon-joon), the son of Kang Hae-ra (Kim Sarang), in episode 9.'),(5006138,'<Three Meals a Day(복수해라)>In the sixth episode, Kim Sang-gu (Jeong Man-sik) and Cha Min-jun (Yoon Hyun-min) meet at this restaurant.'),(5006139,'<Boksuhae-ra(복수해라)>Kanghae-ra (Kim Sarang) holds a book signing event at this library cafe in Episode 1'),(5006140,'<Multiple(복수해라)>The exterior of this building appears as Lee Hoon-sook\'s (Jung Wook) office/agency space.'),(5006141,'<Double Jeopardy(복수해라)>Cha Min-jun (Yoon Hyun-min) proves his innocence of the secretary\'s sexual assault charges at this court in episode 1.'),(5006142,'<The Break-Up(복수해라)>Kang Haera (Kim Sarang), who is running late for a fan signing event in the first episode from the 1st exit, decides to take the subway and leaves her van behind.'),(5006143,'<Boksuhaera(복수해라)>This ho