ll Me Your Wish(본대로 말하라)>In episode 3, Cha Soo-young (Soo-young from Girls\' Generation) returns to the home of serial killer Kang Seung-hwan located in this building to verify any evidence she might have missed.'),(5006155,'<Tell It Like It Is(본대로 말하라)>It is an abandoned theme park previously operated by the deceased father of lawyer Kim Na-hee in episodes 7-8, and is also where she lives. It holds the captive young Gil-hyun-soo, known as \'Maze Land\'.'),(5006156,'<Say the main road(본대로 말하라)>In episode 8, a photographer is climbing the stairs next to this restaurant and filming the area.'),(5006157,'<Say the main street(본대로 말하라)>Shown in Hae Woldong, a fictional village in Muccheon in episodes 8, 9, and 11, considered a gang territory claimed by various factions.'),(5006158,'<Spring Days(봄날은 간다)>Historical site visited by Lee Young-ae and Yoo Ji-tae in \"Spring Days\"'),(5006159,'<Spring Day(봄날은 간다)>This is the house where Lee Young-ae lived in Spring Day.'),(5006160,'<Spring Day Goes(봄날은 간다)>Actress Lee Young-ae and actor Lee Ji-tae visited the beach in the drama \'Spring Day Goes\''),(5006161,'<Spring Days Go(봄날은 간다)>Spring Days Go Temple where Lee Young-ae and Yu Ji-tae stayed'),(5006162,'<Spring Days(봄날은 간다)>A resort that actress Lee Young-ae visited in the drama \"Spring Days\"'),(5006163,'<Spring Days Are Coming(봄날은 간다)>Spring Days Are Coming village visited by actors Lee Young-ae and Yoo Ji-tae'),(5006164,'<\"Spring Days\"(봄날은 간다)>In \"Spring Days,\" Lee Young Ae and Yoo Ji Tae visit the river.'),(5006165,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 13, Yoo Ji-ho (played by Jung Hae-in) and Lee Jung-in (played by Han Ji-min) are shown taking Eun-woo (played by Hae In) to the park.'),(5006166,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 31 (total 16 episodes), Kwon Ki-seok (played by Kim Jun-han) makes a dinner appointment at this restaurant with his father Kwon Young-guk (played by Kim Chang-wan) and prospective father-in-law Lee Tae-hak (played by Song Seung-hwan). He also reveals his plan to marry Lee Jung-in (played by Han Ji-min) in the fall.'),(5006167,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>A chicken restaurant visited by Jung Hae-in and Han Ji-min in \"Spring Night\"'),(5006168,'<Spring Night(봄밤)> In the 19th episode of \"Spring Night\" (total of 10 episodes), Yoo Ji-ho (played by Jung Hae-in) and Lee Jung-in (played by Han Ji-min) secretly peek at the art museum while taking an evening walk.'),(5006169,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In this cafe, Yoo Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in) and Lee Jung-in (Han Ji-min) come together. At the end of episode 18, the two share their first kiss and at the beginning of episode 19, one of Kwon Ki-seok\'s (Kim Jun-han) colleagues who was at the cafe with them sees them and calls Ki-seok directly, making him run to the cafe to confront them.'),(5006170,'<BomBam(봄밤)>A sandwich specialty shop where Han Jimin and Lee Sang-hee visited in BomBam.'),(5006171,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In the movie, the debtor Nam Si-hoon (played by Lee Moo-saeng) invites his \'brother\' Kwon Gi-seok (played by Kim Jun-han) to this restaurant three times to ask for a favor.'),(5006172,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In this apartment on the 3rd floor, Yu Jiho (Jung Haein) and on the 2nd floor, Lee Jungin (Han Jimin) live with their close friend Song Youngju (Lee Sanghee).'),(5006173,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>The cafe is located on the way to Yoo Ji-ho\'s (Jung Hae-In) house in episode 6, and scenes of him passing by this place often appear in the drama.'),(5006174,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>The chicken restaurant visited by Jung Hae In in Spring Night'),(5006175,'<BomBam(봄밤)>At BomBam, Jeong Haein and Han Jimin\'s Cafe where they had tea'),(5006176,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>This pharmacy appears as \'Our Pharmacy\' where Yu Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in) works as a pharmacist.'),(5006177,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>The Japanese restaurant Han Jimin visited in Spring Night'),(5006178,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 14, Lee Jung-in (Han Ji-min) meets Kwon Young-guk (Kim Chang-wan), who is Kwon Ki-seok\'s (Kim Jun-han) father, at the restaurant in this building. In episode 15, he says he is not interested in the marriage his son is pursuing.'),(5006180,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>At LP Bar, Kim Jun-han enjoys drinking alone'),(5006181,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 12, after a basketball game, Kwon Ki-seok (played by Kim Jun-han), Yoo Ji-ho (played by Jung Hae-in), and their close friend Choi Hyun-soo (played by Im Hyun-soo) come to this restaurant to have a drink.'),(5006182,'<Spring Night(봄밤)> Han Jimin visited a Mexican restaurant in Spring Night.'),(5006183,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 16\'s ending and episode 17\'s beginning, the three sisters (Ja-in, Seo-in, Jeong-in) meet at this restaurant for dinner. Jeong-in (Han Ji-min) receives a phone call from Kwon Ki-seok (Kim Joon-han) informing her about a confrontation between Yoo Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in).'),(5006184,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>After Lee Jung-in\'s mom, Shin Hyung-soon (Gil Hye-yeon), meets Yoo Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in) and his son Yoo Eun-woo (Ha Yi-an) for the first time in the final episode 32 (16) of \'Spring Night\', she goes window shopping.'),(5006185,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>Kim Jun-han and Kim Chang-wan\'s favorite ox bone soup restaurant'),(5006186,'<BomBam(봄밤)>The park where Jung Hae In and Han Ji Min took a walk at BomBam'),(5006187,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In \"Spring Night,\" Lee Jung-in (Han Ji-min) works at this library while Yoo Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in) visits with his son Yoo Eun-woo (Hwi).'),(5006188,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In the drama, Lee Jung In (Han Ji Min) and Kwon Ki Seok (Kim Joon Han) come here to have dinner in episode 6. Ki Seok mentions marriage and asks if she is attracted to someone else, doubting her strong denial.'),(5006189,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In this street where Yoo Ji-ho (played by Jung Hae-in) parked his car in front of Namsan Public Library, Lee Jung-in (played by Han Ji-min) expresses her worries about their relationship and future together.'),(5006190,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>A library that Jung Hae-in and Han Ji-min visited in Spring Night.'),(5006191,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 1, Lee Jung In (Han Ji Min) is seen coming out of an apartment complex in which she lives. Kwon Ki Suk (Kim Joon Han) appears either helping her get out of a taxi or calling a taxi with her sister in front of this building.'),(5006192,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In the final episode 32 (16th episode) of \"Spring Night\", Lee Jung-in (Han Ji-min), Yu Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in), and their son Yu Eun-woo (Hai An) pass by this place on their way home after meeting Jung-in\'s family.'),(5006193,'<BomBam(봄밤)>A chicken restaurant visited by Kim Jun-han and Im Hyun-soo at BomBam'),(5006194,'<BomBam(봄밤)>In episode 11, this laundry appears as a laundry run by Yoo Ji-ho\'s (Jung Hae-in) parents.'),(5006195,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In the 19th episode, Yoo Jiho (Jung Hae In) and Lee Jung In (Han Ji Min) take an evening stroll and secretly peek at the museum.'),(5006196,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>In episode 10, Yoo Ji-ho (Jung Hae-in) and Lee Jung-in (Han Ji-min) take an evening stroll on this street.'),(5006197,'<Spring Night(봄밤)>The character Yoo Ji-ho (played by Jung Hae-in) is first seen meeting Seo In (Han Ji-min) along with her mother Shin Hyung-sun (played by Kye Hae-yeon) and two sisters Lee Seo-in (Im Sung-eon) and Lee Jae-in (Chu Min-kyung) at this location.'),(5006198,'<Spring Waltz(봄의 왈츠)>Philip Rosenthal (Daniel Henney) stays at this hotel.'),(5006199,'<Spring Turns to Spring(봄이 오나 봄)>In episode 2, Bom (Um Ji-won) sees herself (Lee Yoo-ri) alongside the iconic sculptures in the square and on the large LED screen.'),(5006200,'<When Spring Comes(봄이 오나 봄)>The exterior of this building appears as the workplace of Kim Bomi (Lee Yu-ri) as seen in episode 1. The lobby interior shows Lee Hyung-seok (Lee Jong-hyuk) experiencing an unfortunate accident.'),(5006201,'<When Spring Comes(봄이 오나 봄)>In episode 6 (out of a total of 3 episodes), Park Si-won (Lee Seo-yeon) came to watch a street busking performance.'),(5006202,'<The Spring is Coming(봄이 오나 봄)>This drama features the exterior of an entertainment agency that appeared in Episode 1. Bang Gwang-gyu (Kim Kwang-gyu) is looking at the fans surrounding the idol\'s van from afar, telling James (Kim Sung-hyun) that his time has come.'),(5006203,'<Spring turns to spring(봄이 오나 봄)>In episode 9 (out of 5 total), Kim Bomi (Lee Yuri) comes to this place to find Lee Bom (Um Ji Won), who is behaving like a fool and getting unwanted attention while drunk.'),(5006204,'<Unfair(부당거래)>It is a place featured as a party location in the movie \"Unfair\"'),(5006205,'<Unfair Deal(부당거래)>The place where Hwang Jung-min receives an award in Unfair Deal'),(5006206,'<Unfair Deal(부당거래)> Unfair Deal unfolds in the heart of Seoul when an unfair transaction begins'),(5006207,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)> Train station that appears in the drama at Gosan Station'),(5006208,'<TV drama \"The World of the Married\"(부부의 세계)>The sea where Im Joo-kwan tried to save Kim Hee-ae.'),(5006209,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>It is featured as a backdrop in episode 8.'),(5006210,'<TV Show \"The World of the Married\"(부부의 세계)>In episode 15, Ji Sun-woo (Kim Hee-ae) discovers an upset Lee Tae-oh (Park Hae-joon) at this location and leaves after arguing with him.'),(5006211,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In the drama, Ji Sun-woo (Kim Hee-ae) and her neighbor Go Ye-rim (Park Sun-young), and Lee Tae-oh (Park Hae-joon) live in this residential complex.'),(5006212,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)> Bella Citta appeared in episode 15.'),(5006213,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In episodes 9 and 10, CEO Yeo Byung-gyu (played by Lee Kyung-young) and Dr. Kim Yoon-ki (played by Lee Moo-saeng) meet at this location. It raises questions about what emotions remain between son-in-law Tae-oh (played by Park Hae-joon) and his ex-wife Sun-woo (played by Kim Hee-ae).'),(5006214,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)> In this complex, one of the houses (unit 3, 24/25) appears as Yeo Da-kyung\'s (Han So-hee) house.'),(5006215,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>As seen in Episode 1, Yeo Hye-jung (played by Kim Seon-kyung) is holding a solo exhibition at the cultural lounge in this location.'),(5006216,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>Cafe where Kim Hee-ae spent time with her son Jeon Jin-seo'),(5006217,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>The location where Lee Tae-oh\'s (played by Park Hae-joon) birthday party took place in episodes 1 and 2.'),(5006218,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In episode 5, Tae-oh (played by Park Hae-jun) is seen taking his son Jun-young (played by Jeon Jin-seo) to a cafe. After picking him up from school, Dae-kyung (played by Han So-hee) enters and Tae-oh stares at her blankly. She looks back irritably and leaves the cafe.'),(5006219,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>This is the former colleague Ji Sun-woo (played by Kim Hee-ae) and her ex-husband Dr. Ma Kang-seok (played by Park Chung-seon)\'s house.'),(5006220,'<World of the Married(부부의 세계)> Sun-woo (Kim Hee-ae) and Da-kyung (Han So-hee) meet outside this building after colliding with each other while paying for books.'),(5006221,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In episodes 1 and 2, this is the bar where Sunwoo (Kim Hee-ae) works as a doctor and her patient Min Hyun-seo (Shim Eun-woo) also works.'),(5006222,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In episode 8, Ji-hyeok (played by Kim Young-min) and his wife Ye-rim (played by Park Sun-young) are seen dining at this bar. The waitress flirts with Ji-hyeok, and as the couple is leaving, she writes something on the back of the receipt he had kept. In episode 9, he returns to this bar to meet the waitress for drinks. Tae-oh (played by Park Hae-joon) suddenly enters and joins Ji-hyeok, leading to a drunken confrontation. Ye-rim, discovering her husband\'s infidelity, learns in episode 10 that he had found out the waitress had resigned while searching for her frantically.'),(5006223,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>The exterior of this wedding hall that appeared as \'Hee Won\' restaurant in episode 1. Seonu (Kim Hee-ae) sends a message to her husband\'s cell phone saying, \"Do you want to see me again on a beautiful night? Hee Won.\"'),(5006224,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>The exterior of Changgong Hall appears as the \"Family Love Hospital\" where Ji Sun-woo (played by Kim Hee-ae) works as a director.'),(5006225,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>This is where Kim Hee-ae ordered rice cakes for her husband\'s birthday.'),(5006226,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In episode 7, Sunwoo (Kim Hee-ae) stops by this restaurant after work and coincidentally runs into Jae-hyuk (Kim Young-min). He then leaves without finishing his food. Meanwhile, Yoon-ki (Lee Moo-saeng) happens to pass by and sees Sunwoo drinking alone. He joins her and they chat about Tae-oh (Park Hae-joon), who left the island two years ago and returned with a new family.'),(5006227,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>In episode 16, Sun-woo (played by Kim Hee-ae) follows her son Joon-young (played by Jeon Jin-seo) and reunites with friends at this restaurant. In the same episode, Sun-woo invites her son to have dinner together at this restaurant, feeling sorry for how miserable her ex-husband Tae-oh\'s (played by Park Hae-joon) life has become.'),(5006228,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)>Restaurant where Kim Hee-ae and Park Hae-joon went on a date'),(5006229,'<The World of the Married(부부의 세계)> In episode 9, Sunwoo (Kim Hee-ae) and Yoon-ki (Lee Moo-saeng) are having dinner and talking at this restaurant when Tae-oh (Park Hae-joon) and Da-kyung (Han So-hee) suddenly arrive.'),(5006230,'<Buam-dong Lovers(부암동 복수자들)>The swimming pool at this resort appears as the swimming pool of Lee Soo-gyeom (Jun of U-KISS) and Kim Jung-hye (Lee Yo-won) mansion in episode 1.'),(5006231,'<Bumdam Multiple Performers(부암동 복수자들)>In episode 5, Park Seung-woo (played by Kim Sa-kwon) blamed himself for not confessing his one-sided love while passing by his furniture workshop. In episode 9, there is an interview with Im Mi-sook (played by Myung Se-bin) explaining that her son committed suicide.'),(5006232,'<Buamdong Avengers(부암동 복수자들)>In Episode 8, the antagonists of the Social Avengers Club, Lee Byeongsoo (Choi Byeongmo) and Bae Yeongpyo (Jeong Seokyong), along with Principal Hong Sangman (Kim Hyeongil), meet at this place.'),(5006233,'<Buam-dong Multiple People(부암동 복수자들)>In episode 2, Hong Do-hee (played by Ra Mi-ran) is doing makeup.'),(5006234,'<Buamdong Ghosts(부암동 복수자들)> The teaser for Buamdong Ghosts was filmed here.'),(5006235,'<Boksuja Market in Buam-dong(부암동 복수자들)>This is where Hong Do-hee (Rami Ran) used to sell fish. It is now a meeting place for the regular gatherings of the Buam-dong Avengers Social Club.'),(5006236,'<Buamdong Revenants(부암동 복수자들)>In episode 6, Han Sooji (played by Shin Dongmi), the mother of Yoo Jun (played by Jun from U-KISS), meets Kim Junghye (played by Lee Yowon) and proposes another deal to get money from Junghye before Jun interferes with them.'),(5006237,'<Buamdong Avengers(부암동 복수자들)>In the first episode, Buamdong Social Avengers Club was established and became their headquarters. Kim Jung-hye\'s (Lee Yo-won) gallery, where the two people meet twice, is the art museum on the second floor.'),(5006238,'<Buam-dong Avengers(부암동 복수자들)>In this place, Professor Nam, the husband of Imisuk (Myung Se-bin), a university professor, holds a public celebratory meeting for his new book. Kim Junghye (Lee Yoo-won) also appears at the gathering and asks if Imisuk wants revenge after seeing her being abused by her husband. The first step towards Buam-dong\'s social revenge.'),(5006239,'<Multiple Lovers in Buam-dong(부암동 복수자들)>In episode 3, the husband trio of the Social Avengers Club, Lee Byeong-soo (Choi Byeong-mo), Bae Yeong-pyo (Jeong Seok-yong), and Principal Hong Sang-man (Kim Hyeong-il), meet here.'),(5006240,'<The Avengers of Buam-dong(부암동 복수자들)>Three women from Buam-dong Social Avengers Club meet here in Episode 4.'),(5006241,'<Bupamdong Baksujadeul(부암동 복수자들)>This is where Lee Byung-soo (Choi Byeong-mo) and Baek Young-pyo (Jeong Seok-yong) were imprisoned in the 12th episode.'),(5006242,'<Buam-dong Avengers(부암동 복수자들)>In this Avengers Social Club, students from our Buam-dong, Lee Soo-kyum (Jun of U-KISS), Kim Hee-soo (Choi Kyu-jin), and Baek Seo-yeon (Kim Bo-ra) attend school. As seen in episode 1, they appear as \'Sebit High School\'.'),(5006243,'<Buam-dong Avengers Social Club(부암동 복수자들)>Hong Do-hee (played by Ra Mi-ran) lives with her son Kim Hee-soo (played by Choi Kyu-jin) and daughter Kim Hee-kyung (played by Yoon Jin-sol). Im Mi-sook (played by Myeong Se-bin) moves here with her daughter Baek Seo-yeon (played by Kim Bo-ra) after divorcing her husband.'),(5006244,'<Boksuja Club(부암동 복수자들)>This is the \'BJ Spa\' operated by Kim Jung-hye (Lee Yoo-won) at the Avengers Social Club in Boksuja Club. It can be seen in episode 12.'),(5006245,'<Buamdong Multiples(부암동 복수자들)>The younger sister of Kim Jung-hye (played by Lee Yo-won) in the drama operates this location. In episode 4, she visits her and in the same episode, a late night family dinner is held here. It is a crucial moment where Jung-hye learns the truth that she is adopted.'),(5006246,'<Buamdong Rebels(부암동 복수자들)>In Episode 12, Lee Soo-kyung (from U-KISS and UNB) escorts his birth mother to this place and pleads with her to become a mother to him just once and tell him the truth about his father.'),(5006247,'<Buam-dong Multipartite(부암동 복수자들)>In episode 12, Lee Byung-soo (Choi Byeong-mo) stays here overnight to meet clients the next morning.'),(5006248,'<The Penthouse(부잣집 아들)>In episode 24, Kim Myeong-ha (played by Kim Min-gyu) meets Mong-mong (played by Elkie) in the midst of cherry blossoms at a tree house and they share a conversation.'),(5006249,'<Rich Family\'s Son(부잣집 아들)>Kim Myung-ha (Kim Min-gyu) is a student studying here. He takes on the mission of becoming \'friends\' with the exchange student Mong-mong (Elkie), who accidentally spilled wine on him on the returning flight. After being reintroduced in episode 9, they walk by the university lake where she asks him to take a photo of her. In episode 11, they meet outside the student office where she tells him her hot water ran out and asks him to take her to a public bathhouse.'),(5006250,'<Rich Kids(부잣집 아들)>After successfully receiving a promotional gift, Kim Myungha (Kim Mingyu) and Mongmong (CLC\'s Elkie) head here in episode 18. They successfully win the nail game on their first try.'),(5006251,'<Rich Son(부잣집 아들)>In episode 18, Kim Myungha (Kim Mingyu) meets Mongmong (former CLC member Elkie). He helps her by standing in line at the beauty salon to collect promotional items, including 2 BTOB posters. Mongmong happily embraces the surprised Myungha and expresses gratitude for his efforts.'),(5006252,'<Rich Family\'s Son(부잣집 아들)>In episode 18, Kim Myung-ha (played by Kim Min-kyu) is seen running to find Mong-mong (CLC\'s Elkie). Despite being sick, she still stood in line at the store to receive a free BTOB poster. In the end, Myung-ha waits for her at the famous street food alley while saving a spot in line for her.'),(5006253,'<The Rich Son(부잣집 아들)>In episode 46, Nam Suhee (played by Lee Seungyeon) came on a picnic here.'),(5006254,'<Rich Family\'s Son(부잣집 아들)>Appears as the background when Nam Soo-hee (Lee Seung-yeon) goes out for a walk during Episode 46.'),(5006255,'<Wealthy Family\'s Son(부잣집 아들)>Waiting in front of a cafe on this street for her exchange student friend Mongmong (Former CLC member Elkie) in Episode 11.'),(5006256,'<Unavailable(불가살)>Filming location for the exterior of Ok Eul-tae\'s (Lee Jun) house'),(5006257,'<Unavailable(불가살)>Retro-themed Paju bar featured on episode 8.'),(5006258,'<Unavailable(불가살)>Island with a mysterious atmosphere featured in Episode 9'),(5006259,'<Bulyaseong(불야성)>The 12th episode depicted Lee Seo-kyung (Lee Yo-won) and Lee Se-jin (Yoo Yi) meeting and playing a game. Everything about whether to accept the promissory note is entrusted to Lee Kyung. Afterwards, Park Geon-woo (Jin Gu) joins in to defend Se-jin.'),(5006260,'<Bulyaseong(불야성)>In episode 1, Seo E-kyung (Lee Yo-won) played Russian roulette on the first floor with gangsters.'),(5006261,'<Love Affairs in the Afternoon(불야성)>In episode 4, Seo Eun-kyung (Lee Yoo-woon) and Lee Se-jin (Yoo Ee) come under this bridge to have a conversation.'),(5006262,'<Bulyaseong(불야성)>In episode 7, Lee Se-jin (Uee) is working part-time at a gallery after being fired from S Gallery.'),(5006263,'<Red Dan-sim(붉은 단심)>The palace and prison area seen in the first teaser trailer.'),(5006264,'<Red Heart(붉은 단심)>The first meeting between the young crown prince Lee Tae (Park Ji-bin) and Yoo Yeon (Shin Eun-soo) unfolds by the pond.'),(5006265,'<Red Danxim(붉은 단심)>This palace appears as the main palace.'),(5006266,'<Red Danxim(붉은 단심)>It appears as one scene of the temple in episode 2.'),(5006267,'<Crimson Heart(붉은 단심)>In episode 1, young Prince Itae (played by Park Ji-bin) and Yoo Yeon (played by Shin Eun-soo) first meet at a festival by the pond.'),(5006268,'<Scarlet Heart(붉은 단심)>In the 16th and final episode, this pond appears as part of the palace and the worried Queen Dowager Daemok (played by Park Ji-yeon) seeks refuge here. (KBS2, 2022)'),(5006269,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>The place where Seo Hyun-jin and Lee Min-ki went on a surprise trip together'),(5006270,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>A place where Seo Hyun-jin and Lee Min-ki enjoyed their own date.'),(5006271,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki) comes to do morning jogging in episode 4.'),(5006272,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>Mayor Shin Myeong-hee (Choi Kwang-il) is informing the press about the future development direction of Jungjin City.'),(5006273,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>Location featured in Episode 9 of Lee Min-ki\'s family dining scene.'),(5006274,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>A place where Lee Min-ki and his companions sit on a bench and have a conversation'),(5006275,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 9, Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) receives a shaman\'s exorcism here while being watched by her close friend Yoo-mi (Moon Ji-in) and Ryu Eun-ho (Ahn Jae-hyun).'),(5006276,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 8, the drama depicted Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) and Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin) arguing over their breakup.'),(5006277,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 9, Han Se-kyung (Seo Hyun-jin) came to this place to pray with manager Yoomi (Moon Ji-in).'),(5006278,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>This is where scenes were filmed from the drama \"Beauty Inside,\" where Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin) experiences her first transformation and Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) has an accident where he loses his ability to recognize faces (in the English Village with a fountain) while on a \'Europe\' trip due to his grandmother.'),(5006279,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 5, when asked if he really completed the date while preparing for a date with Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin), Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki) recalls that the date went wrong at this place where he didn\'t recognize his girlfriend. In episode 13, Chae Yu-ri (Ryu Hwa-young) meets a reporter here and hints that something is strange with her rival Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) receiving all the attention from the world.'),(5006280,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>The 3rd food donation event unfolds. Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki) and Kang Sara (Lee Da-hee) are in rival mode, while Ryu Eun-ho (Ahn Jae-hyun) makes every effort to approach Sara.'),(5006281,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 1, Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) visits this place on a business trip to resist the order of Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki). Surprisingly, he comes to pick her up here because he saw her reading a book on the plane thanks to a leaflet.'),(5006282,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 11, Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) and Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin) spend a night here during their trip.'),(5006283,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 6, Kang Sara (played by Lee Da-hee) attends an unofficial dinner with some male colleagues from T\'way Airline and hears a lot of misogynistic remarks from the male group. She quickly decides to take a vacation. Ryu Eun-ho (played by Ahn Jae-hyun) asks her what she thinks about herself, and she later returns saying she wants to become a bride.'),(5006284,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>The building where Seo Hyun-jin and Lee Min-ki come to watch a movie in the drama \"Beauty Inside.\"'),(5006285,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 5, Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) auditions for a movie at this university. When she sees Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki) waiting for her outside with a bouquet of flowers, she runs into his arms.'),(5006286,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 8, Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki) and Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) have their first secret meeting as a couple here, each driving their own car.'),(5006287,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>The teaser trailer 1 was filmed on the street in front of the western entrance of this building.'),(5006288,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>This is another outdoor cart where the meeting place of Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin), a top star in the world, and her good friend and manager Yoo-mi (Moon Ji-in) takes place. Yoo-mi (Moon Ji-in) and Ryu Eun-ho (Ahn Jae-hyun) drink together here and vent their frustration with life.'),(5006289,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In the drama, Ryu Eun-ho (played by Ahn Jae-hyun) works part-time at the cafe in the building. In episode 3, Kang Sa-ra (played by Lee Da-hee) comes to drink a vanilla latte.'),(5006290,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 1, Seo Do-jae (Lee Min-ki) and Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) come to eat on a business trip. In episode 15, Kang Sara (Lee Da-hee) and Ryu Eun-ho (Ahn Jae-hyun) come to eat and she tells him she wants to become a judge and reveals that she graduated from Seoul National University.'),(5006291,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In the drama \"The Last\", when Cha Joo Hing (played by Lee Min-gi) finds out Secretary Ha Man Se (played by Seo Hyun-jin) whereabouts, he drives across this bridge. In response, Doh Jae ends up making a U-turn to cross the bridge in the opposite direction.'),(5006292,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)> In episode 5, Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) and Seo Do-jae\'s (Lee Min-ki) mother, Im Jung-yeon (Na Young-hee), meets at this restaurant to try to buy her son. Both reappear in episode 6, and Jung-yeon begs Se-gye to go on a date with her son this time.'),(5006293,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In the drama, \"Beauty Inside,\" Han Se-gye (played by Kim Min-seok) and Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) transform in episode 6 and drive across this bridge after picking up \"her\" at the police station. She is upset with him and he briefly stops the car at one end of the bridge where they have a conversation.'),(5006294,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>It appeared as a cafe in the Seonho Group building.'),(5006295,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 15, Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin) is depicted as living in a house that isolates herself.'),(5006296,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 5, Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) goes on his first date with Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin).'),(5006297,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) and Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin), who have just finished dinner in episode 5, are walking along this promenade at their first official public appearance together.'),(5006299,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>A movie where Lee Min Ki and Seo Hyun Jin appeared in episode 4'),(5006300,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 2, Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin) who transforms into a different person every month, comes alone to have a meal. In episode 5, Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) and Se-gye sit together for the first time in an official setting, perfectly coordinated, enjoy a lunch date and have sincere conversations.'),(5006301,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>The food truck located at the center of the facility is a meeting place for Han Se-gye (Seo Hyun-jin), her close friend and manager Yoo Yumi (Moon Ji-in), and Ryu Eun-ho (Ahn Jae-hyun). They drink together and share their life struggles, especially Se-gye.'),(5006302,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>The place where Seo Hyun-jin and her friends went to a food cart in episode 4.'),(5006303,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>It is the \'hospital room\' where Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) visits his grandfather, Chairman Lim (played by Lee Moon-soo), in episode 3.'),(5006304,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>In episode 15, Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) passes by this place on his way back to Seoul and sees Han Se-gye (played by Seo Hyun-jin) for the first time on the large advertising screen of this building.'),(5006305,'<Beauty Inside(뷰티 인사이드)>This is where Seo Do-jae (played by Lee Min-ki) works as the chief director of T\'way Airlines.'),(5006306,'<Beautiful Mind(뷰티풀 마인드)>Hyunseong Hospital, where Lee Young Oh (Jang Hyuk) works as a neurosurgeon.'),(5006307,'<Beautiful Mind(뷰티풀 마인드)>In episode 11, Kye Jin Sung (Park So Dam) and Lee Young Oh (Jang Hyuk) end up playing basketball here.'),(5006308,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>Narsha met the best value street food on Wednesday Food Talk'),(5006309,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>The popular Korean variety show \"Delicious Map\" featured this restaurant, which impressed both the members and viewers with its delicious snacks.'),(5006310,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>TV show \'Produce 101\' mentor JeA\'s favorite DimSum restaurant'),(5006311,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>JeA introduced Hamheung-style garit gukbap on the TV show \"Wednesday Food Talk\"'),(5006312,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>The place where JeA and Lala Dung took part in the Lalala Singing Contest.'),(5006313,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>The emotions-filled restaurant that Narsha tagged on Instagram.'),(5006314,'<Brown Eyed Girls(브라운 아이드 걸스)>A popular restaurant known for its hangover soup that even JeA from Brown Eyed Girls has visited as a 