 Goo Joon-hwi (Kim Jae-young) visit this park for their first date.'),(5006707,'<Love Beautiful Life Wonderful(사랑은 뷰티풀 인생은 원더풀)>In episode 50, Kang Si-wol (played by Lee Tae-sun) collides with Judge Hong (played by Na Young-hee) in front of this building.'),(5006708,'<Love is Beautiful Life is Wonderful(사랑은 뷰티풀 인생은 원더풀)>In episode 65, Kim Cheong-a (Seol In-ah) and Gu Jun-hwi (Kim Jae-young) continue the discussion about the relationship between Gu Jun-gyeom (Jin Ho-eun)\'s death and Kang Si-wol (Lee Tae-sun). Cheong-a highly praises the landscape she is looking at from above, quoting Anne Shirley and telling Jun-hwi that it will remain a good memory. The scene ends with Jun-hwi asking Cheong-a to forget the night he rejected her and embracing her.'),(5006709,'<Love is Beautiful, Life is Wonderful(사랑은 뷰티풀 인생은 원더풀)>In episode 3 (total 2 episodes), Do Jin-woo (played by Oh Min-seok) and his mother Hong Hwa-young (played by Park Hae-mi) visit this pub.'),(5006710,'<Believe in love(사랑을 믿어요)>Seo Hyejin (Park Jumi) works as a curator at this museum.'),(5006711,'<Crash Landing on You(사랑의 불시착)>Paragliding spot where the Dooli couple\'s meeting began'),(5006713,'<Crash Landing on You(사랑의 불시착)>In order for Cheong Hye-ji (played by Hwang Woo-seul-hye) to ensure her husband can inherit the family business, she prays for her discovery as quickly as possible while also hoping for her to be found by Se-ri\'s secretary, Hong (played by Go Gyu-pil).'),(5006714,'<Crash Landing on You(사랑의 불시착)>A thrilling sky bridge where the Dooli couple have heart-to-heart conversations'),(5006715,'<Crash Landing on You(사랑의 불시착)>Luxury hotel in Pyongyang visited by the Dooly couple.'),(5006716,'<Crash Landing on You(사랑의 불시착)>The exterior of this restaurant appears in Episode 1 as the place where Yoon Se-ri (Son Ye-jin) goes to have dinner with her boyfriend, Chae Song-hwa (Jung Kyung-ho). It is also a spot where Se-ri and Song-hwa\'s date was captured by paparazzi.'),(5006717,'<Crash Landing on You(사