ki). This is where he lives with his younger sister Kang Choco (played by Lee Yoo-bi).'),(5008239,'<Good Boy: A Romance Drama(세상 어디에도 없는 착한남자)>In episode 7, Kang Maru (played by Song Joong Ki) and Seo Eunki (played by Moon Chae Won) come to the octagonal pavilion in the park [Odong Park\'s Octagonal Pavilion] to drink beverages.'),(5008240,'<The place where Kang Maru (played by Song Joong-ki) takes Seo Eungi (played by Moon Chae-won), who ruined his wedding in the final episode of \"Nice Guy,\" to(세상 어디에도 없는 착한남자)>This is where Kang Maru (Song Joong-ki) brings Seo Eungi (Moon Chae-won), who disrupted his wedding in the final episode of \"Nice Guy\".'),(5008241,'<My Mister 2(세상 잘 사는 지은씨2)> Ji Eun (Kim Si Eun) agrees to become Ha Jun\'s (Cha In Ha) girlfriend after meeting him in episode 10, where she encounters him in a tense situation.'),(5008242,'<World Lives Well Jeong Si Eun 2(세상 잘 사는 지은씨2)> Eun Ji Eun (Kim Si Eun) is a freshman in the fashion department and Cha In Ha is a sophomore in the design department at Serim University. In episode 6, Ha Joon takes Ji Eun to the university library to have a peaceful and quiet time together. After they start dating, the two secretly meet on the 11th floor rooftop of the Engineering Building.'),(5008243,'<The Most Beautiful Goodbye in the World(세상에서 가장 아름다운 이별)>In episode 1, after going to a club with his girlfriend Jaeyoung (Naeun), Jungsoo (Minho) gets heavily drunk and almost passes out on the stairs of this cafe. His younger sister, Yoonsu (Jiwoo), asks if he wants to go home.'),(5008244,'<The Most Beautiful Goodbye in the World(세상에서 가장 아름다운 이별)>In episode 2, Jaeyoung (Son Na-eun) and Jeongsoo (SHINee\'s Choi Minho) enjoyed a date.'),(5008245,'<My Daughter, the Prettiest in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>In episode 25, Park Sun-ja (played by Kim Hae-sook) comes here with her friends for a day trip.'),(5008246,'<The Most Beautiful Daughter in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>Park Sun-ja (played by Kim Hae-sook) is buried under this tree in the final episode. Later, her three daughters Kang Mi-ri (played by Kim So-yeon), Kang Mi-hye (played by Kim Ha-kyung), and Kang Mi-seon (played by Yoo Sun) visit.'),(5008247,'<The World\'s Most Beautiful Daughter(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>In order to express condolences to the father who passed away in Episode 6 Kim Woo-jin (Gi Tae-young) came to visit.'),(5008248,'<The Most Beautiful Daughter in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>This is the Hanseong Group office where Kang Miri (Kim So-yeon) works.'),(5008249,'<The Most Beautiful Daughter in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)> In episode 4, Jeon In-sook (played by Choi Myung-gil) appears as Embo Tailor, who picks up the dress shirt ordered by her daughter.'),(5008250,'<The Prettiest Daughter in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>The exterior of Hansung Group House where CEO Han Jong-soo (Myeonggyenam) lives.'),(5008251,'<My Daughter, the Prettiest in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>In episode 16, Jeon In-sook (Choi Myung-gil) comes out to the office of Han Jong-soo (Dong Bang-woo), the representative who is invited for various meetings or conversations.'),(5008252,'<The World of My 17(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>In episode 2, Kang Mi-ri (played by Kim So-yeon) reminisces about her meeting with Jun In-suk (played by Choi Myung-gil) while drinking alone.'),(5008253,'<The Most Beautiful Daughter in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>Kang Miseon (Yoo Sun) comes here to meet her mother-in-law Hamiok (Park Jeong-soo) in episode 39.'),(5008254,'<The World of the Married(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>Kang Mi-ri (Kim So-yeon) and Han Tae-ju (Hong Jong-hyun) frequently visited the main branch of the marinated fish cake restaurant Anjuya.'),(5008255,'<My Daughter, the Prettiest in the World(세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)>In episode 28, Han Tae-joo (Hong Jong-hyun) and Kang Mi-ri (Kim So-yoon) meet here for dinner.'),(5008256,'<The Most Beautiful Daughter in the World (세상에서 제일 예쁜 내 딸)> This is a Han Chon Traditional Soup restaurant run by Park Soon-ja (played by Kim Hae-sook).'),(5008257,'<The Most Beautiful 