un Ha-won (played by Park So-dam) delivering pizza.'),(5009703,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>In episode 4 of Cinderella and Four Knights, Kang Ji-woon (Jung Il-woo) is swimming in the swimming pool of this mansion. Then Eun Ha-won (Park So-dam) finds him here and convinces him to have breakfast with everyone.'),(5009704,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>The Galaxy One (Park So-dam) appears as a part-time job location in episodes 2 and 7'),(5009705,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>A cafe recognized by Kang Ji-woon (played by Jung Il-woo) when flipping through old family photos in episode 14. In fact, it is a cafe that his parents used to visit frequently, and where his mother left a note for him and his father.'),(5009706,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>In episode 15, Eun Ha-won (Park So-dam) and Kang Ji-woon (Jung Il-woo) visited this place before the surgery.'),(5009707,'<Cinderella and the Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>This is a scene where Eun Ha-won (played by Park So-dam) and Kang Ji-woon (played by Jung Il-woo) meet on their way back after horseback riding in episode 8.'),(5009708,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>This place can be seen in a scene where Eun Ha-won (played by Park So-dam) visits Chairman Kang Jong-du\'s (played by Kim Yong-geon) office in episode 7 to meet Chairman Kang Jong-du (played by Kim Yong-geon).'),(5009709,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>This place appears as the house in the sky. Kang Ji-woon (Jung Il-woo), Kang Hyun-min (Ahn Jae-hyun), Kang Seo-woo (Lee Jung-shin) live here and Eun Ha-won (Park So-dam) moves in with them. In episode 2, it is explained that this building is one of the \'Top 100 Modern Architectural Buildings in the World\'.'),(5009710,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>In episode 9, Eun Ha-won (played by Park So-dam) receives treatment at this hospital after she faints slipping on soap. Astonishingly, she only has a minor concussion and sprain.'),(5009711,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>In episode 1, Kang Hyun-bin (played by Ahn Jae-hyun) asks Eun Ha-won (played by Park So-dam) to be his fake fiancée here for three hours.'),(5009712,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>This is where Kang Seo Woo (CNBLUE\'s Lee Jung Shin) holds a concert in episode 16.'),(5009713,'<Cinderella and Four Knights(신데렐라와 네 명의 기사)>In episode 5, Eun Ha-won (Park So-dam) embarks on her second mission of the year, where all three men attend.'),(5009714,'<Shin Dong-yup, Sung Si-kyung, What will we eat today?(신동엽,성시경은 오늘뭐먹지?)>Shin Dong-yup, Sung Si-kyung, What will we eat today? Episode 54 Spicy Galbi Jjim Restaurant'),(5009715,'<Dinner of the Gods(신들의 만찬)>In episode 14, Choi Jaeha (played by Joo Sang-wook) betrays Ko Jun.'),(5009716,'<Wedding ceremony(신부수업)>The place where the two main characters, a man and a woman, hold their wedding ceremony.'),(5009717,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In Episode 6, shortly after arriving in the United States, Kim Anna is involved in an accident on this bridge.'),(5009718,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>The main character, Yoo Jin-gook (Ji Hyun-woo), lives in this house.'),(5009719,'<Korean drama(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 36 of \"Shin Sa-wa Ah Ga-ssi,\" Jo Sara (played by Park Ha-na) and Cha Geon (played by Kang Eun-tak) break up at this cafe.'),(5009720,'<Gentleman and Lady(신사와 아가씨)>In the drama \"Gentleman and Lady,\" Kim Anna (played by Lee Il-hwa) reminisces about her date with Park Soo-chul (played by Lee Jong-won) when she visited this cafe in the 11th episode.'),(5009721,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 48, Bong Joon-oh (Yang Byung-yeol) and Kang Mi-rim (Kim Yi-kyung) have lunch at this restaurant. When a boy at another table starts choking on his food and struggles to breathe, Joon-oh rushes to help apply what he learned during medical school to save the boy\'s life.'),(5009722,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 5, Park Sun-chul (played by Lee Jong-won) picks up Miss Anna Kim (played by Lee Il-hwa) who has just arrived from the United States at the airport.'),(5009723,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In this cafe, Yi Yoong-guk (played by Ji Hyun-woo) meets Jo Sera (played by Park Ha-na). In episode 48, he asks to be separated from his seniors and family.'),(5009724,'<Shin Sa-wa Agassi(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 36, Lee Young-guk (Ji Hyun-woo) visits this cave with children and Park Dan-dan (Lee Se-hee). This is right after Young-guk and Dan started dating, and when he leaned in to kiss her while they were alone, they are interrupted by the sound of his children approaching and she pushes him away.'),(5009725,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>Park Dan Dan (Lee Si-hee) suggests to Yoo Yeong-guk (Ji Hyun-woo) to go buy desserts at a cafe after finishing dinner. In episode 11, she mentions having worked part-time at this location.'),(5009726,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In episodes 30 and 31, Yi Eung-guk (played by Ji Hyun-woo) suggests meeting Jo Sola (played by Park Hana) at this cafe to break off their engagement.'),(5009727,'<Mr. and Mrs. Shin(신사와 아가씨)>Park Soo-chul (Lee Jong-won) recalls the happy moments spent in this garden with his ex-girlfriend and Dan-dan\'s (Lee Se-hee) mother.'),(5009728,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>Cha-gun (Kang Euntak) and Josara (Park Hana) enjoy a lunch date at this restaurant in episode 51.'),(5009729,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)> In episode 14, Eugene Choi (played by Byun Yo-han) and Kudo Hina (played by Kim Tae-ri) have lunch at this restaurant.'),(5009730,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 8, Lee Geon (Ji Hyun-woo) meets Anna Kim (Lee Il-hwa) in this cafe and asks if they can live together with their family.'),(5009731,'<The Gentleman and The Lady(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 47, Lee Young-guk (Ji Hyun-woo) and Park Dandan (Lee Se-hee) came separately to attend a book launch event. Especially, Dandan feels awkward because her college friend Ma Hyun-bin (Lee Tae-ri) is also here with them.'),(5009732,'<Shin Sa-wa Ah-ga-ssi(신사와 아가씨)>In Episode 7 of \"Shin Sa-wa 