) to this restaurant for a meal. As they both leave the restaurant, he hands her a bouquet of yellow tulips and says, \"This is a farewell gift.\"'),(5009743,'<Tazza: The High Rollers(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 1, Lee Yoon-seok (Ji Hyun-woo) passes by this building on his way home while bringing young Park Danda (Ji Hyun-woo).'),(5009744,'<Shinsa and Agassi(신사와 아가씨)>Park Dandan (Lee Sehee) appears in the neighborhood alley where she grew up.'),(5009745,'<Mr. Sunshine(신사와 아가씨)>In episode 33, Park Dal-dan (Lee Si-eon) meets old neighborhood acquaintances and learns about his birth mother at this cafe.'),(5009747,'<Men of the City(신사의 품격)>Hong Sera practicing golf at the golf course'),(5009748,'<Gentleman\'s Dignity(신사의 품격)> Kim Do-jin (Jang Dong-gun), Seo Yi-soo (Kim Ha-neul), and Colin (Lee Jong-hyun) meet here.'),(5009749,'<Gentleman\'s Dignity(신사의 품격)>In episode 16, Kim Do-jin (Jang Dong-gun) and Seo Yi-soo (Kim Ha-neul) come to this park for a picnic.'),(5009750,'<Shin Sa\'s Style(신사의 품격)>It suddenly transforms into a green landscape (Anseong Farm Land) in Episode 1 and shows Dojin\'s mood well.'),(5009751,'<Gentleness of a Gentleman(신사의 품격)>Cafe where Kim Do-jin proposed to Seo Yi-soo'),(5009752,'<Gentleman\'s Dignity(신사의 품격)>Location where episodes 1 and the final episode of Gentleman\'s Dignity were filmed'),(5009753,'<The Gentleman\'s Dignity(신사의 품격)>In the first episode, Kim Do-jin (Jang Dong-gun) and Seo Yi-soo (Kim Ha-neul) pass by this place after his dress is torn and he runs after her.'),(5009754,'<Gentleman\'s Dignity(신사의 품격)>Theme park where Kim Do-jin goes on a field trip in episode 3.'),(5009755,'<Grace of My Heart(신사의 품격)>In the drama \"When the Camellia Blooms,\" Kim Do-jin (played by Jang Dong-gun) visits this café, feeling heartbroken as he recalls a date with Seo Yi-soo (played by Kim Ha-neul) in the past. Shortly after, he is joined by Kim Eun-hee (played by Park Ju-mi), revealing the fact that he has a son.'),(5009756,'<Gentleman\'s Dignity(신사의 품격)>K