ap.'),(5009873,'<Ssam My Way(쌈 마이웨이)>The location where the martial arts competition was held at Ssam My Way'),(5009874,'<Ssam My Way(쌈 마이웨이)>Location of the rooftop garden featured in Episode 3 of Ssam My Way'),(5009875,'<Ssam My Way(쌈 마이웨이)>The crucial place where Go Dong-man (played by Park Seo-joon) decides to quit his job in the 4th episode is at the intersection of this street.'),(5009876,'<Ssam My Way(쌈 마이웨이)>Favorite actor Kim Ji-won is working as a employee here.'),(5009877,'<Ssam My Way(쌈 마이웨이)>In episode 3, Park Mu-bin (played by Choi Woo-shik) falls in love with Choi Ae-ra (played by Kim Ji-won) and decides to gift her a pair of sneakers.'),(5009878,'<Fight for My Way(쌈 마이웨이)>This is where Park Mu Bin (played by Choi Woo Sik) works. In episode 7, Choi Ae Ra (played by Kim Ji Won) receives treatment, Mu Bin kisses her without her real consent, and Go Dong Man (played by Park Seo Joon) witnesses the incident.'),(5009879,'<SsangGap PoCha(쌍갑포차)>Featured in Episode 4, this valley is part of \'Dream World\'.'),(5009880,'<Ssanggap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>The venue for the event held in episode 4 of Ssanggap Pocha.'),(5009881,'<Ssanggap Pochar(쌍갑포차)>The dreamy story from Ssanggap Pochar episode 6.'),(5009882,'<Ssanggap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>In the drama \"6 Flying Dragons,\" a trio of Wolju (played by Hwang Jung-eum), Hangang-bae (played by Yook Sungjae), and Gwigwajang (played by Choi Won-young) persuade a zoo tiger to help Chaesoogyeong (played by Lee Seo-an) with her pregnancy.'),(5009883,'<Ssanggapocha(쌍갑포차)>It is part of the palace where Crown Prince Lee Hwon (Song Geon-hee) lives in the Joseon Dynasty.'),(5009884,'<SSang Gap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>In episode 11, the nobleman/horse trader (Yook Sungjae) comes to this temple to pray and sees Woljoo (Hwang Jung Eum) waiting for him as he leaves.'),(5009885,'<Ssanggap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>In this cafe, Manager Kangbae (Yook Sung-jae) and Woljoo (Hwang Jung-eum) meet. In episode 11, they finally give her the Okbanji that has been preserved for 500 years, while having a cup of green tea. This is what happens after they finally resolve the misunderstanding that made him hate her for the same amount of time.'),(5009886,'<Ssanggap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>This park has a Pocha set where Wal-Iu (played by Hwang Jung-eum) operates in episode 1. This park is also where Song Mi-ran (played by Park Ha-na) calmly walks towards Kangbae\'s (played by Yook Sung-jae) approaching truck and they meet face to face.'),(5009887,'<Ssang Gap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>The actual location of \"Sangil Hotel\" in SSang Gap Pocha Episode 3.'),(5009888,'<Ssanggap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>The place where Gosi drank in Ssanggap Pocha Episode 2'),(5009889,'<Ssanggap Food Stall(쌍갑포차)>The bamboo forest where Ssanggap Food Stall was featured in the show 3 Meals a Day'),(5009890,'<Ssanggap Pocha(쌍갑포차)>Prince Wanse is recovering from illness. Later, the young Woljoo passes away under the tree. In episode 11, the prince is seen grieving under this tree for Woljoo.'),(5009891,'<Sunny(써니)>A place that serves as the background for the train to MT'),(5009892,'<Sunny(써니)>Featured in movies as a background for street scenes.'),(5009893,'<Sunny(써니)>Filming location for Nami\'s First Love and Suzy\'s Kiss'),(5009894,'<Sunny(써니)>A place of comfort and meeting for the protagonist duo Nami'),(5009895,'<Sunny(써니)>The place where the character Nae (played by Shim Eun-kyung) is possessed'),(5009896,'<Circle: Connected Worlds(써클: 이어진 두 세계)>This place is depicted as Han Jung-yeon\'s (played by Gong Seung-yeon) house, where she and Kim Woo-jin (Yeo Jin-goo) visit to find something in Professor Han\'s study.'),(5009897,'<Circle: Connected Worlds(써클: 이어진 두 세계)>In the first episode, Kim Jun-hyeok (Kim Kang-woo) solves a murder case and searches for his brother at Smart Earth.'),(5009898,'<Summer Guys(썸머가이즈)>In episode 1, Seon Woo-chan (played by Lee Jung-shin) and Park Kwang-bok (played by Kwon Hyun-bin) arrive at the airport.'),(5009899,'<Sista(씨스타)>Sokcho Dongmyeonghang, famous for crabs, also experienced by Sistar'),(5009900,'<Sista(씨스타)>A popular chicken restaurant for hikers to enjoy after climbing Mount Bukhan at Dasom.'),(5009901,'<Sistar(씨스타)>Enjoy healing seasoned crab with the backdrop of the South Han River.'),(5009902,'<Sistar(씨스타)>The 3 Best Galbi Restaurants in Suwon Conquered by Food Genius Soyu'),(5009903,'<Sistar(씨스타)>Suwon\'s sundae gopchang where Suzy enjoyed the full course sundae'),(5009904,'<Sistar(씨스타)>Bora\'s favorite Garosu-gil sushi, which she often visits.'),(5009905,'<Sistar(씨스타)>Spicy chicken feet, a must-try dish that the owner Soyoo loves passionately'),(5009906,'<SISTAR(씨스타)>The museum that Soyou visited with her New Zealand mother and daughter'),(5009907,'<Sistar(씨스타)>A cafe escape room in Mokdong visited by Soyou and Bora.'),(5009908,'<Lady(아가씨)>A place where Suk-hee comes up with paint and easel.'),(5009909,'<The Handmaiden(아가씨)>Location featured in the movie The Handmaiden where the monk hands over money'),(5009910,'<The Handmaiden(아가씨)>Location appearing on the road to the mansion in the movie The Handmaiden'),(5009911,'<Lady(아가씨)>A place where the Baekjak and Sukhee argue over a secret transaction'),(5009912,'<Miss(아가씨)>The space where the Count and Hideko had a meal in the movie \"The Handmaiden\"'),(5009913,'<Lady(아가씨)>Hideko and Sukhee running hard in a bamboo field.'),(5009914,'<The Handmaiden(아가씨)>Featured in the movie The Handmaiden as the location for the mental hospital scene'),(5009915,'<Lady(아가씨)>A place that becomes the escape door for Sukhee and Hideko'),(5009916,'<Lady(아가씨)>Park with a tree where Hideko\'s aunt hugged the tree'),(5009917,'<Lady(아가씨)>A place where the path leading to the pervert nobleman\'s house was filmed.'),(5009918,'<The Handmaiden(아가씨)>The location where the cliff scene by the beach was shot in the early part of The Handmaiden\''),(5009919,'<Lady(아가씨)>In the movie \"Lady,\" this is the place where the characters cross the lake by boat.'),(5009920,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>By a stroke of luck, Cha Joo-hyuk (Seo Kang-joon) comes here with Seo Woo-jin (Esom). They visit this place again in order to reminisce and further their story in episode 12.'),(5009921,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 13, Wu Jin\'s mother (Lee Jeong-eun) brings Cha Ju-hyeok (Ji Sung) to this cafe. She sells him products. Meanwhile, Ju-hyeok is pleased to see her healthy appearance and happily purchases her products.'),(5009922,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>This bus stop is located near a bank where Cha Joo-hyuk (Ji Sung) and Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) work together.'),(5009923,'<The Good Wife(아는 와이프)>After finishing a company dinner, Cha Joo-hyuk and Seo Woo-jin walk down the shopping street across the park. At that moment, a motorcyclist rushes towards Woo-jin and Joo-hyuk extends his hand to pull Woo-jin to safety.'),(5009924,'<The Good Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 11, Jong-hoo found out the reason why Joo-hyuk rejected Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) and slapped Joo-hyuk in the lobby.'),(5009925,'<The World of the Married(아는 와이프)>In the drama \"The World of the Married,\" Seo Woojin (played by Han Jimin) works as an employee at a global bank headquarters and meets Japanese customers at this cafe.'),(5009926,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 12, Cha Ju-hyuk (Ji Sung) discovers Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) across the street and stands on the street outside this store. It appears as \'Lamerit Cafe\' in the drama.'),(5009927,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>This location is the office of Lee Hye Won, the current wife of Cha Ju Hyeok (Ji Sung) in the drama. In episode 12, various characters can be seen having conversations here.'),(5009928,'<My Wife Knows(아는 와이프)>In episode 15, Cha Joo-hyuk (Ji Sung) and Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) visit this place for a secret date.'),(5009929,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In the drama \"Knowing Wife,\" Cha Joo-hyuk (played by Ji Sung) meets Lee Hee-won (played by Han Ji-min) at this cafe. In episode 14, Joo-hyuk coincidentally runs into her on his way back from lunch to the bank. She confesses that she had a crush on him in college, but decides not to act on it this time and instead leaves.'),(5009930,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>Han Ji-min (Han Ji-min)’s house lives with her mother (Lee Jung-eun) through all time/space. Cha Ju-hyuk (Ji Sung) appears multiple times throughout the drama and Yoon Jong-hoo (Jang Seung-jo) appears when Woo-jin is being stalked in the first alternative universe.'),(5009931,'<My Wife is a Know-it-all(아는 와이프)>In the drama, the two main characters Seo Woojin (Han Jimin) and Hyuk (Jisung) often walk hand in hand past this mart on their way home.'),(5009932,'<The Good Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 13, young Seo Woojin (Han Jimin) goes to get a health checkup instead of her father who is on a business trip to China. There, she witnesses Yoon Jonghoo (Jang Seungjo) trying to apologize to his unhappy girlfriend. She then causes a minor commotion to bring them back together.'),(5009933,'<The know-all wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 12, Cha Joo-hyuk (played by Ji Sung) and Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) visit to talk about their situation, with Joo-hyuk getting down on one knee. He sheds tears and apologizes for how he treated Woo-jin in the past. Woo-jin decides to give him one more chance, asking him to show sincerity this time.'),(5009934,'<The Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>Cha Ju-hyuk (Ji Sung) and Lee Hye-won (Han Ga-na) attended the university that appeared in the drama. In the last episode, Ju-hyuk takes Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) back to their walk and talks about their future.'),(5009935,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>Hide and Seek: In the 14th episode, Cha Ju-hyuk (Ji Sung) hides in the men\'s restroom in this building and Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) has to find him.'),(5009936,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 2, Cha Joo-hyuk (Ji Sung) and Yoon Jong-hoo (Jang Seung-jo) meet on the sidewalk outside this building for a take-out breakfast. Joo-hyuk discovers a new scar on himself when they talk about game consoles, and Jong-hoo mentions that he was always there. In episode 4, on their way to work, Jong-hoo meets Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) and invites her for breakfast on a bench near the sculpture.'),(5009937,'<The World of the Married(아는 와이프)>In the drama \"The World of the Married,\" Seo Woojin (played by Han Jimin) comes running here in episode 2. At the same time, Ji Sungho (played by Ji Sungho) learns that his first love, Lee Hyewon (played by Kang Hana), has married someone else.'),(5009938,'<The Good Wife(아는 와이프)>Located in KCU Gahyun store, Cha Ju-hyuk (Seo In-guk), Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min), and Yoon Jong-hoo (Jang Seung-jo) frequently appear at this location.'),(5009939,'<The Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 15, Cha Ju-hyeok (played by Ji Sung) and Seo Woo-jin (played by Han Ji-min) come to this place where Woo-jin always wanted to be proposed to on a roller coaster ride. The roller coaster proposal happens twice, causing joy for Woo-jin and discomfort for Ju-hyeok. Later on the ground, she officially accepts his proposal for the second time.'),(5009940,'<The Lovers of Daejeon (Known Wife)(아는 와이프)>This is the bus stop in Daejeon where Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min) and Cha Joo-hyuk (Ji Sung) first met in the series, available in various flashback scenes throughout the series.'),(5009941,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>This restaurant is operated by Oh Sang-sik (Oh Yi-sik), a friend of Cha Ju-hyuk (Ji Sung) in the drama. In episode 1, Ju-hyuk comes here to eat after fighting with his wife and tells his friends that he wants to divorce. In episode 2, Ju-hyuk comes back here after another fight, but the door is closed.'),(5009942,'<The Good Wife(아는 와이프)>Seo Woojin (Han Jimin) used to enjoy eating tteokbokki at this restaurant during her school days. In episode 5, Cha Joohyuk (Ji Sung) brings her here early for a meal after leaving work. \'He vividly remembers that place even in the alternative world. Later, when they leave, it starts raining but they run together holding a potted plant towards the bus stop to avoid getting wet. They return to Kang Sunwoo\'s (Cho Jungseok) restaurant in episode 15 and head back to the second alternative world.'),(5009943,'<Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 12, Cha Joo-hyuk (Ji Sung) comes to the subway station with a bag of snacks and a bottle of soju to find a mysterious man. Joo-hyuk reflects on the fact that he makes people around him unhappy and tells how he realizes that what he is experiencing (from a different universe) is a \"heavenly punishment\" for being too greedy.'),(5009944,'<The Knowing Wife(아는 와이프)>In episode 7, Cha Joo-eun (Park Hee-bon) and Oh Sang-sik (Oh Ui-sik) invite Cha Joo-hyeok (Ji Sung), Lee Hye-won (Kang Han-na), Seo Woo-jin (Han Ji-min), and Yoon Jong-hoo (Jang Seung-joo) to this pension.'),(5009945,'<Arang and the Magistrate(아랑사또전)>In the drama, Arang (played by Shin Min-ah) crossed this \'Suspension Bridge\' in episode 2, feeling frustrated and discouraged.'),(5009946,'<Aran Satellite(아랑사또전)>In episode 5, Eun-oh gets angry and comes here after Arang (Shin Min-a) says that her mother definitely left because of his \'bad breath\'. In episode 7, Eun-oh comes back to find the talisman placed on the tree on this cliff. While climbing the tree to get the talisman, he falls off the cliff and is rescued by Arang who came to find him.'),(5009947,'<To My Beautiful You(아름다운 그대에게)>In episode 4, Goo Jae-hee (played by Sulli) deceived her brother by pretending that this place is the high school she attends.'),(5009948,'<To My Beautiful You(아름다운 그대에게)>This pension appears as \"Paradise Pension.\" It is operated by Ha Seung-ri\'s (played by Seo Jun-young) mother and invites everyone on weekends.'),(5009949,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In the drama \"Beautiful Days,\" Lee Seon-jae (Ryu Si-won) and Kim Se-na (Lee Jung-hyun) came here to practice before making their singer debut in episode 14.'),(5009950,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>Kim Yeon-soo (Choi Ji-woo) and Lee Min-cheol (Lee Byung-hun) came to this place for their honeymoon in episode 23.'),(5009951,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>This cafe is a place of important meetings. The 1st floor is where the main characters frequently meet, and it is also where Lee Min-chul (played by Lee Byung-hun) and Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo) break up in episode 16. The 2nd floor is the headquarters of \'Muse Record\'.'),(5009952,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>Lee Min-chul (played by Lee Byung-hun) visits to celebrate the first \'salary\' (drawing money by drawing pictures in a mall, sponsored by Yeon-su) with Lee Min-ji (played by Shin Min-ah) and Kim Yeon-su (played by Choi Ji-woo) in episode 6.'),(5009953,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In episode 15, Lee Sun-jae (played by Ryu Si-won) came to the \'Promise Date\' of the muse president Yang Kyung-hee (played by Lee Hwi-hyang)'),(5009954,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In the early episodes of Beautiful Days, Im In-chul (Lee Byung-hun) drops off Kim Yeon-soo (Choi Ji-woo) from a taxi at exit 10.'),(5009955,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In the 19th season of \"Beautiful Days,\" Kim Yeon-soo (Choi Ji-woo) art academy is located near this street, and Im In-cheol (Lee Byung-hun) comes here in distress. Yeon-soo, who comes out of the academy by bus, sees In-cheol outside the bus window, asks the bus driver to stop, and runs towards In-cheol.'),(5009956,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In the drama Beautiful Days, Lee Sun-jae\'s (played by Ryu Si-won) secret place is located above exit 5 of this station. In episode 11, Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo) brought her here and had a heartwarming conversation.'),(5009957,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In episode 11, Lee Soon-jae (played by Ryu Si-won) decides to go on a trip after finding out who his biological father is. Understanding the seriousness of the situation, Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo) ignores an important dinner invitation from Lee Min-cheol (played by Lee Byung-hun) to bid him farewell. In the end, Soon-jae decides not to go on the trip and shares a brief conversation with Yeon-soo at the station, walking out of the station together to the taxi stand in front of the station.'),(5009958,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>The drama follows the story of Lee Soon-jae (played by Ryu Si-won) and Kim Sae-na (played by Lee Jung-hyun) as they feel disappointment for not being able to sign a record deal in episode 10. In the final episode 24, Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo) returns after drinking alcohol due to fear about her life. In episode 13, Lee Min-chul (played by Lee Byung-hun) and Yeon-soo come here.'),(5009959,'<Personal residence(아름다운 날들)>In the drama \"Beautiful Days,\" Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo) moves in with her close friend Kang Na-rae (played by Lee Yoo-jin), who lives in an apartment in this building. Yeon-soo eventually moves in with her.'),(5009960,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In episode 7, Lee Sun-jae (played by Ryu Si-won) brings Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo). You can see \'Unni\' Kim Se-na (played by Lee Jung-hyun) making her first appearance on stage. She spends time with Yeon-soo.'),(5009961,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In the drama \"Beautiful Days,\" Lee Min-chul (Lee Byung-hun) and Kim Yeon-soo (Choi Ji-woo) along with Min-chul\'s sister Lee Min-ji (Shin Min-a) visit this place in the afternoon while riding bicycles. Min-ji practices drawing at the sculpture park in this park.'),(5009962,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>This bridge is located on the way Im In-cheol (Lee Byung-hun) commutes from home. In episode 3, he crosses alone by car, and in the beginning of episode 5, he commutes by car with Kim Yeon-soo (Choi Ji-woo). In episode 7, Yeon-soo crosses this bridge again.'),(5009963,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>Kim Se-na\'s introduction as a muse singer at the 14th event was held at the on-deck concert venue.'),(5009964,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In episode 9, Lee Seon-jae (played by Ryu Si-won) comes here at night to contemplate.'),(5009965,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In the first episode, Kim Yeon-soo (played by Choi Ji-woo) and Kim Se-na (played by Lee Jung-hyun) promise to meet here on Christmas Eve. While Se-na waits in the cold, Yeon-soo gets into an accident while running to the tower, causing Se-na to see him as a \'traitor.\' After he recovers, she returns to this place regularly to meet Se-na.'),(5009966,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>It is featured as the filming location for the Victory Records party in episode 2.'),(5009967,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>Lee Sun-jae (Ryu Si-won) crosses this bridge. The bridge where Lee Sun-jae rides a motorcycle in episode 9 of Beautiful Days.'),(5009968,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>I Seon-jae (Ryu Si-won) comes here right after finding out who his father is in episode 11.'),(5009969,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>Yang Kyung-hee (Lee Hwi-hyang) meets Lee Sun-jae (Ryu Shi-won) in episode 12 and reunites with Sun-jae and Kim Sae-na (Lee Jung-hyun) in episode 14.'),(5009970,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In episode 22, he proposed to her, wishing her health. She left behind the ring at the airport.'),(5009971,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>Remembering the first time they met on stage when Lee Min-chul (Lee Byung-hun) came looking for a rookie scout and Kim Se-na (Lee Jung-hyun) was about to leave.'),(5009972,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>The wedding of Kim Yoon-soo (Choi Ji-woo) and Lee Min-chul (Lee Byung-hun) takes place here in episode 22.'),(5009973,'<Beautiful Days(아름다운 날들)>In episode 13, Lee Min-chul (played by Lee Byung-hun) is planning to leave this place for Paris with his sister Lee Min-ji (played by Shin Min-ah).'),(5009974,'<Our Beautiful Moment(아름다웠던 우리에게)>After the karaoke session with Cha Hun (WEi\'s Kim Yohan), Shin Soli (So Juyeon), and Kang Hayoung, Woo Dae-seong (Yeo Hwehyun) comes out of this building to answer a phone call. In episode 2, Cho Hyeju (Jo Hyeju), and Jung Jinhwan (Jung Jinhwan) from The Man BLK. They plan to quickly start cycling when they spot a school uniform nearby.'),(5009975,'<Beautiful to us(아름다웠던 우리에게)>In episode 12 of \"Love Revolution,\" the seniors hosted a barbecue party. Here, Solsol (So Joo-yeon) tries to confess to Chaheon (Kim Yo-han) but things do not go as planned.'),(5009976,'<Beautiful to us(아름다웠던 우리에게)>Sin Soli (played by So Joo-yeon) is waiting outside gate 1B on the west side of the stadium to watch a soccer match with Cha Hun (played by WEi\'s Kim Yohan) in episode 8. Later, she finds out that the ticket was fake.'),(5009977,'<Beautiful to Us(아름다웠던 우리에게)>In episode 8, Sin Sol (played by So Ju-yeon) comes to this fast food restaurant. He meets Woo Dae-sung (played by Yeo Hoi-hyun) who is working part-time there.'),(5009978,'<Beautiful to us(아름다웠던 우리에게)> In episode 18, Kang Hayoung (played by Cho Hyeju) studies here (as part of Korea University) and gets annoyed when her boyfriend Jung Jinhwan (played by Manblock Jung Jinhwan) attracts fans trying to get his attention.'),(5009979,'<To Us, Who Were Beautiful(아름다웠던 우리에게)>After walking along the adjacent street of this road, Chaheon (Kim Yohan) and Shinsol (So Joo-yeon) are seen standing outside this building holding hands, where Heon confesses to Sol by calling her his girlfriend.'),(5009980,'<Beautiful to us(아름다웠던 우리에게)>In episode 17, Kang Hae-young (played by Jo Hye-joo) and Jung Jin-hwan (played by The Man BLK Jung Jin-hwan) meet here and show each other their college acceptance letters.'),(5009981,'<Our Beautiful Us(아름다웠던 우리에게)>In episode 15, she tells him he must give the bag to his mother after bag shopping. In episode 18, Sin Sol (Jo Soo-yeon) and Kang Ha-young (Jo Hye-ju) meet over coffee. Then, there is a scene where Seol-i finally talks about her date with Cha Hun (Kim Yo-han) in the same episode. There is also a scene where Woo Dae-sung (Yeo Hoi-hyeon) catches the attention of the guests as he meets the manager.'),(5009982,'<Our Beautiful Moment(아름다웠던 우리에게)>Cha Hun (Kim Yohan), Shin Sol-i (So Joo-yeon), Kang Ha-young (Jo Hyejoo), and Jung Jinhwan (Jung Jinhwan) come here in episode 18 for a double date.'),(5009984,'<Our Beautiful Moments(아름다웠던 우리에게)>In episode 18, Cha 