nd 13, Lee Seung-yoo (CNBLUE\'s Kang Min-hyuk) meets Lee Hye-ryeong and confronts her over a post he made about Seo Ji-won (Jung In-sun).'),(5010116,'<Still Not Thirty(아직 낫 서른)>In episode 9, Seo Ji-won (played by Jeong In-seon) and Hong Ah-young (played by Cha Min-ji) have a conversation here.'),(5010117,'<Still Not Thirty(아직 낫 서른)>In episode 2, Hani meets her blind date at the hotel lobby, only to find out that he is actually her younger friend Hyung Joon-young (Baek Sung-chul). In episode 7, Hani decides to take their relationship to the next level, leaving her date waiting at the hotel entrance after upsetting her with the thought.'),(5010118,'<Still Want to Get Married(아직도 결혼하고 싶은 여자)>The MBC Ilsan Dream Center appears as the headquarters of the broadcasting station \'UBN\' where Shin Young works as a reporter in Episode 1, where she still wants to get married and receives a proposal from her boyfriend. Later, Young encounters her boyfriend\'s younger lover at the company cafe and is asked to return the diamond ring she received.'),(5010119,'<Athena: Goddess of War(아테나: 전쟁의 여신)>Lee Jung-woo (Soo Ae) and Yoon Hye-in (Soo Ae) coincidentally meet here in the first episode of Athena: Goddess of War.'),(5010120,'<Nohsoo Boys(아홉수 소년)> In episode 3, Kang Jin-gu (Kim Young-gwang) and Ma Se-young (Kyeong Soo-jin) had a meal at a seaside restaurant when looking for a place to work.'),(5010121,'<Ninth Boy(아홉수 소년)>In episode 3, Ma Seyoung and Kang Jin-goo take a break at this cafe during a business trip.'),(5010122,'<Nohsoo Boy(아홉수 소년)>In episode 3, Maseyoung (Kyung Soo-jin) and Kang Jin-gu (Kim Young-kwang) walk along these streets to plan a \'date course\' for a travel agency. This area is recommended to them as a \'secret hotspot\' for dates.'),(5010123,'<Noh Su-yeon(아홉수 소년)>In episode 3, Ma Se-young (played by Kyung Soo-jin) and Kang Jin-gu (played by Kim Young-kwang) also come to this place for a trip. In fact, they came to the travel agency to receive a travel proposal.'),(5010124,'<Nine Boys(아홉수 소년)>It ends with Seyoung being kissed by Jin-gu when they propose a trip to the travel agency where they work in Episode 4.'),(5010125,'<Nine Boys(아홉수 소년)>This is Yudain\'s cafe.'),(5010126,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In episode 1, Mo Tae-kang (played by Park Sung-woong) suddenly gets into an accident.'),(5010127,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In episode 1, Ha Rip (Jung Kyung-ho) appears at this building to meet with Song Ha-jang.'),(5010128,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>They reconciled at the press conference for the 8th episode.'),(5010129,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>This building is owned by Jiseoyoung (played by IU) and Halip (played by Jung Kyungho) of \'Soul Entertainment\'.'),(5010130,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>This is the exterior and interior of the \'tvN\' broadcasting company building, where Ji Seo-yeon (played by Lee El) takes Ha Lip (played by Jung Kyung-ho) live in Episode 1.'),(5010131,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In episode 1, Harib (Jung Kyung-ho) and Ji Seo-yeong (Lee El) walk down this street full of buskers.'),(5010132,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In the first episode of \"When the Devil Calls Your Name,\" Harib (played by Jung Kyung-ho) jumps over this bridge.'),(5010133,'<The Call(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>A figure of Halip (Jung Kyung-ho) with a wound on his head is depicted crossing this bridge twice in an ambulance in The Call. In the third scene, The figure of Hayeong (Lee El) driving Halip across the bridge is drawn.'),(5010134,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In the scene of episode 1 where Harib (Jung Kyung-ho) appears in a flashback scene, you can briefly see this bridge.'),(5010135,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In episode 3, Kim I-kyeong (played by Lee Seol) who was kicked out of her apartment arrives at this subway station with her belongings. She has just arrived in Korea and encounters a fellow traveler (played by Song Gang) who also had been pickpocketed like her. She ends up helping him pay the subway fare.'),(5010136,'<When the Devil Calls Your Name(악마가 너의 이름을 부를 때)>In episode 2, Hani from EXID meets Baek Seungcheol in the hotel lobby. In episode 7, Ranju parks her car at the hotel entrance.'),(5010137,'<Demon Judge(악마판사)>In episode 1, Kim Ga-on (Jinyoung from GOT7) follows Kang Yo-han\'s (Ji Sung) intent by riding a bicycle to track him down to this restaurant.'),(5010138,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>K (Kim Ga-on, played by Park Jin-young/Jinyoung from GOT7, who is drunk due to being forced to drink in episode 12 by Judge Kang Yo-han) chases him to the top of the overpass.'),(5010139,'<The Devil Judge(악마판사)>After bowing to Ga-on in the final episode 16, Yo-han leaves for an unknown future.'),(5010140,'<Devilish Judge(악마판사)>This is a scene from episode 8 where Kang Yo-han (Ji Sung) introduces Kim Ga-on (Park Jin-young/GOT7) to his team against his will.'),(5010141,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episodes 12-13, Jung Sun-ah (played by Kim Min-jung) orders Ji Sung (played by Kang Yo-han) to come to this mixed cultural space and threatens the life of his close friend.'),(5010142,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>The workplace of Cha Kyung-hee, the Minister of Justice (played by Jang Yeong-nam) in the drama, appearing as the Ministry of Justice.'),(5010143,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 12, realty TV judge Kang Yo-han (Jisung) who is having a falling out with Ga-on (Park Jin-young, formerly of GOT7) runs around this park at night.'),(5010144,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>During the first broadcast of the 1st episode of the live court show, chairman Park Du-man (Yi Seo-hwan), one of the financial sponsors of the show, appears in his office celebrating the show\'s high ratings while drinking champagne.'),(5010145,'<Devil\'s Judge(악마판사)> Kim Ga-on (Jin-young) encounters Yoon Su-hyun (Park Gyu-young) and Min Jung-ho (Guide) at a café.'),(5010146,'<Devil’s Judge(악마판사)>In episode 4, Kim Ga-on (played by Park Jin-young from GOT7) shows a surprised reaction to the second public trial of Kang Yo-han on this street.'),(5010147,'<The Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 3, Lee Young-min (played by Moon Dong-hyuk) visits this place with his girlfriend (played by Bae Eun-woo). When he asks why she brought him to such a dirty place, she replies, \"It\'s a place that was featured on TV as a popular neighborhood restaurant. It\'s a hot spot.\"'),(5010148,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>During episode 2, Kang Yo-han (Jisung) closely follows Im Young-min (Moon Dong-hyuk) across this bridge while two people have a car race.'),(5010149,'<The Devil Judge(악마판사)>After having an uncomfortable meeting with the president in episode 11, Cha Kyung Hee (Jang Young Nam) is taken home not by her usual driver, but by K (Lee Kyu Tae).'),(5010150,'<Devil\'s Judge(악마판사)>In episode 8, the confused Kim Gaon (Park Jin-young, former GOT7 member) meets former professor Min Jung-ho (played by Ahn Nae-sang) for advice at a food truck located at the western end of this parking lot.'),(5010151,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>This is where Kim Ga-on (formerly from GOT7, played by Park Jin-young) appears at home.'),(5010152,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>The \'Gwanghwamun Riots\' took place at this plaza in episode 1.'),(5010153,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 8, Kim Gaon (played by Park Jin-young of GOT7) misses her and calls Yoon Suh-hyun (played by Park Gyu-young) late at night. They walk along this street to a pub.'),(5010154,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 8, Kim Ga-on (played by Park Jin-young) calls and meets Yoon Soo-hyun (played by Park Gyu-young) late at night because she wants to see her, and they walk along this street.'),(5010155,'<Devil\'s Advocate(악마판사)>The event will feature the Live Court Show \'National Participation Trial\' hosted by the Society for Restoring Fairness (SRF) and the main judge Kang Yohan (played by Ji Sung) will attend as a special guest, with high-ranking politicians and CEOs in attendance.'),(5010156,'<The Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 7, the lobby of this building makes an appearance as one of the Minbo Group\'s buildings where the prosecutor Kang Yo-han (played by Ji Sung) unexpectedly visits the CEO Min Young-sik (played by Hong Seo-jun).'),(5010158,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 2, Kang Yo-han (Ji Sung) follows Im Young-min (Kim Dong-hyuk) closely along this bridge while racing cars.'),(5010159,'<The Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 7, all male members of the Social Responsibility Foundation (SRF) gather at this restaurant to conspire against the foundation\'s secretary, Jung Sun-ah (played by Kim Min-jung).'),(5010160,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 7, Gaon (Jinyoung) visits this prison and faces off against the scammer Do Young-joon. While someone else is carrying out the execution, Gaon crumbles in this prison courtroom.'),(5010161,'<Devil Judge(악마판사)>In episode 7, Kim Ga-on (played by Park Jin-young) returns to attend the trial of scammer Do Young-joon (responsible for his parents\' death) in order to put an end to the life of a scammer in his dreams.'),(5010162,'<The Devil Judge(악마판사)>A place where Heo Joon-se (Ji Sung) welcomes Kang Yo-han (Ji Sung) in Episode 7, or contemplates his own plans in Episode 11.'),(5010163,'<Akmoo(악뮤)> Filming location for Akdong Musician\'s \'Last Goodbye\' music video'),(5010164,'<Agmu(악뮤)>Visited by Suhyun in her third day Vlog in Jeju, a ramen restaurant'),(5010165,'<Akmu(악뮤)>A cafe visited by Suhyun on the first day of her Jeju vlog'),(5010166,'<Akmu(악뮤)>Cafe visited by Suhyun on the fourth day of the Jeju Vlog'),(5010167,'<YouTube(악뮤)>Saryeoni Forest Path visited by Soohyun on the second day of Jeju vlog'),(5010168,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 14, Baek Man-woo (Son Jong-hak) meets Kang Soo-seo (Hong Seo-jun) at this restaurant with the help of Congressman Sangwon. They discuss their concerns about Cha Ji-won (Moon Chae-won), who sits still in the darkness with Prosecutor Do and Dr. Baek.'),(5010169,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>Baek Hee-sung (played by Lee Joon-gi) brings his daughter Eun-ha (played by Jo Soo-yeon) to this cafe to eat egg tarts. Shocked by her father taking the side of a sudden guest who used to come pick her up from kindergarten in the past, Eun-ha refuses to eat her favorite dessert.'),(5010170,'<Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>This university main building appears as a courthouse where Do Hyun-soo (Lee Joon-gi) and Cha Ji-won (Moon Chae-won) receive trial in the final episode 16.'),(5010171,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 10, Do Hyeon-soo (Lee Joon-gi) calls the Kangsu Police Station\'s Major 3 Team with a disguised voice and provides information about the serial murder case while playing piano at this cafe.'),(5010172,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 7, Gong Mi-ja (Nam Ki-ae) takes Baek Eun-ha (Jung So-yeon) to this cafe to make her happy after seeing her torn workbook and complaining.'),(5010173,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 16, Do Hae-soo (Jang Hee-jin) reveals her study abroad plans to Do Hyun-soo (Lee Joon-gi) and Kim Mu-jin (Seo Hyun-woo) over dinner at this restaurant. Mu-jin tells Hae-soo that he has her support and quickly leaves. Hae-soo instructs her brother to follow Mu-jin outside. Hyun-soo ends up comforting Mu-jin after seeing him cry, ultimately cheering up his friend.'),(5010174,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 2, depicts Oh Yeong (Lee Joo Yeon), a social worker, being pressured by the son of a murder victim, An Jong-gu (Heo Jae-ho). He approaches her in front of building 5 in the apartment complex, demanding to know where his mother\'s ledger is. He forcefully grabs her but is stopped in time by police detective Jae-seop (Choi Young Joon). Later, Jae-seop strikes up a conversation with her on a bench and learns about the victim\'s son\'s gambling habits. Meanwhile, Oh Yeong recalls a story where the murder victim, Jung Moon-ok (Park Hye Jin), had called her the previous night to inquire about her will. Later at the police station, Jae-seop remembers seeing Oh Yeong looking out at the rooftop of the apartment complex while sharing the story. Using this hint, he rushes to the rooftop, opens an access panel, and searches for physical evidence of the murder.'),(5010175,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 16, at this cafe, Do Hyun-soo (played by Lee Joon-gi) and Cha Ji-won (played by Moon Chae-won) try to persuade Yang Jin-tae (played by Jang Hee-jin) for Haesoo\'s testimony.'),(5010176,'<Evil Flower(악의 꽃)>In the final episode 16, Do Hyun-soo (Lee Jun-ki) and Cha Ji-won (Moon Chae-won) are shown gathering in apartment building 3. They plan to ask Jang Jin-tae\'s nephew Yang Jin-tae to testify in court to help Haesoo (Jang Hee-jin). Ji-won receives a text from Jin-tae saying he won\'t testify, but decides to wait at home until he arrives. When Jin-tae arrives, he sees Hyun-soo and runs away. Hyun-soo and Ji-won chase after him and corner him in the elevator.'),(5010177,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In the drama, Baek Hee-sung (played by Lee Joon-gi) crosses this bridge with his wife Cha Ji-won (played by Moon Chae-won) and daughter Eun-ha (played by Jung Seo-yeon) to celebrate Hee-sung\'s birthday with their parents.'),(5010178,'<Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 2, a scene depicts Nam Soon-gil (played by Lee Kyu-bok), who operates a Chinese restaurant, reading an article about the serial murders of Kim Moo-jin (played by Seo Hyun-woo). While he leaves a voicemail for Moo-jin, a figure in a black hooded sweatshirt enters the restaurant, pulls out a knife, and stabs him to death.'),(5010179,'<Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In episode 4, a flashback scene depicts Baek Hee Sung/Do Hyun Soo (played by Lee Joon Gi) and Cha Ji Won (played by Moon Chae Won) running in the rain. After their first date, they seek shelter in a hanok along this alley. He unconsciously smiles at her smile, but his mood changes when he sees the ghost of her father, Do Min Seok (played by Choi Byung Mo), watching them from afar. In the final episode 16, Hyun Soo wakes up from a coma with most of his memories lost, and he returns here to try to revive memories with Ji Won.'),(5010180,'<Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In the 4th episode flashback scene, Baek Hee Sung/Do Hyun Soo (played by Lee Joon Gi) is seen fleeing with Cha Ji Won. While on a rainy date, Cha Ji Won (played by Moon Chae Won) sees her father, Do Min Seok\'s (played by Choi Byung Mo) ghost standing in front of the guest house holding a dog leash.'),(5010181,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>In the drama, Cha Ji-won (Moon Chae-won) appears at the mini-mart \"Eunha Super\" operated by her mother. As seen in episode 2, Ji-won first meets Baek Hee-sung (Lee Joon-gi) while running the store in the summer of 2006.'),(5010182,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>This is where Baek Hee Sung (played by Lee Joon Gi) appeared with his family, Cha Ji Won (played by Moon Chae Won) and daughter Eun Ha (played by Jung Seo Yeon), as the metal craft workshop \'Starlight Workshop\''),(5010183,'<The Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>The exterior of this mansion appears as Baek Hee-sung\'s (Lee Joon-gi/Kim Ji-hoon) house.'),(5010184,'<Love with Flaws(악의 꽃)>It is a dinner celebrating the birthday of Baek Hee Sung (Lee Jun Ki), an awkward gathering with his wife Cha Ji Won (Moon Chae Won), daughter Eun Ha (Jung Seo Yeon), and parents.'),(5010185,'<Evil Flower(악의 꽃)>In episode 12, the scene where Do Hyun-soo (played by Lee Joon-gi) and detective Choi Young-ju (played by Choi Young-ju) secretly head to this restaurant due to Hyun-soo\'s intuition was depicted. They made a deal with Yum Sang-chul (played by Kim Ki-moo) to kill him. Following a plan to give Sang-chul the perfect opportunity to kill him, Hyun-soo asks for help from detective Choi to catch him and uncover all the masterminds behind it.'),(5010186,'<Flower of Evil(악의 꽃)>Hyeon-su (Lee Joon-gi) comes face to face with Baek Hee-seong (Kim Ji-hoon) at an old house, believing that he killed his wife, Cha Ji-won (Moon Chae-won), and attempts to kill him in episode 15.'),(5010187,'<The Ones who can read the Hearts of Evil(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>In episode 11, a scene was depicted where Woohoseong (Na-chul) pulls a heavy bag at midnight and pushes it off a cliff of this waterfall.'),(5010188,'<The Lurking Evil(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>In episode 7, Nam Gi-tae (Kim Jung-hee) commits murder and climbs the stairs of Exit 7 of this station in the early hours of the morning. In episode 9, Song Ha-young (Kim Nam-gil) walks the night streets following the footsteps of a southwest murderer and heads to Exit 3 of this station.'),(5010189,'<The Mind Readers(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>Appears as part of an aerial shot in episode 6.'),(5010190,'<The Mind Readers(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>A live panel discussion on serial killers in Episode 10 will be broadcasted on this screen.'),(5010191,'<Minds of Evil(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>This is the house where a economics professor and his wife were murdered in Episode 5.'),(5010192,'<The ones who read evil minds(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>In episode 7, Song Hayoung (Kim Nam-gil) accompanies his mother to this church for early morning mass.'),(5010193,'<Readers of Evil Intent(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>In episode 8, Song Ha-young (played by Kim Nam-gil) and Gu Yeong-chun (played by Jin Sun-kyu) interrogate Gu Yong-chun (played by Han Jun-woo) at the prison and relax with drinks.'),(5010194,'<The Uncanny Counter(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>In episode 2, Sohn Ha-yeong (played by Kim Nam-gil) goes to this prison to find suspect Yang Yong-chul (played by Go Geon)'),(5010195,'<Readers of Evil Intentions(악의 마음을 읽는 자들)>In episode 1, young Song Ha-young and her mother are riding a duck boat when they get into an accident and fall into the water.'),(5010196,'<Anna La Sumana(안나라수마나라)>In episode 5, Nile (played by Hwang In Yeop) imagines himself as a successful adult living a boring life. Driving a sports car through a tunnel and entering a field of yellow rapeseed flowers, he watches from afar as Leeul (played by Ji Chang Wook) teaches magic to Yoon Ee (played by Choi Sung Eun) in this flower field.'),(5010197,'<Anala Suma Nara(안나라수마나라)>This is where the high school of Se-won appears.'),(5010198,'<Anna La Suma Nara(안나라수마나라)>In episode 5, Nail-Deung (played by Hwang In-yeop) follows Yoon-ee (played by Choi Sung-eun) down the slope at the entrance of the school. She expresses her belief that the magician is not the killer. Nail-Deung\'s mother arrives outside the school in a car and honks the horn to get his attention.'),(5010199,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episode 16, Han Ji-man (Yoon Ju-sang) takes dance lessons at this location.'),(5010200,'<Hello? It’s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episode 4, Banhani (Choi Kang-hee) buys clothes at this store with Airen.'),(5010201,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>Ban Ha-ni (Choi Kang-hee), Young Ban Ha-ni (Lee Re), Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang), Anthony (Anthony)/ Yoon Choon-shik (Yum Mun-seok) go on a picnic to this park in episode 12. Ha-ni and Yoo-hyun made a wish at the \"Wish Stone Pagoda\" in this park while walking alone in this park.'),(5010202,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episode 16, Ban Ha-ne (Choi Kang-hee) and Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang) visited this park to go on a date. Yoo-hyun personally made a bouquet of Freesia flowers to officially propose to Ha-ne. It symbolizes a new beginning.'),(5010203,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In the 13th episode, Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang), Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang), Anthony (Anthony)/Yang Chun-sik (Yum Moon-seok) are depicted visiting a park for a picnic.'),(5010204,'<Hey? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>Antoni (Um Moon-seok), who has just finished volunteering at an animal shelter, invites everyone to join. Banhani (Choi Kang-hee) and Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang) share a drink at this bar in episode 8.'),(5010205,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In Episode 3, Han Yoo-hyun (played by Kim Young-kwang), disguised as Anthony (played by Eom Moon-seok), meets at this tunnel. And they exchange money for limited edition accessories.'),(5010206,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)> In Episode 1, an ambulance carrying Banhani (played by Choi Kang-hee) to the hospital crossed this bridge.'),(5010207,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In the first episode, Banhae (Choi Kang-hee) writes a letter in this restaurant.'),(5010208,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episode 3, Banhani (Choi Kang-hee) walks across this bridge.'),(5010209,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>Banha (Choi Kang-hee), her younger self Banha (Lee Re), and Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang) \'congratulate\' each other before knowing the results. In episode 11, a competition to create a new snack takes place at this restaurant.'),(5010210,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episode 6, Anthony (played by Um Moon-seok) remembered the memories of taking pictures with his high school crush, Ire (played by Lee Rae), at this place.'),(5010211,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-gwang) is mistaken for exposing himself as a sex offender in Episode 1. This is due to being caught in a bet with his father and being kicked out of the house wearing only underwear.'),(5010212,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episode 16, Banhani (Choi Kang-hee) and Oh Ji-eun (Kim Yoo-mi) solidified their friendship in this park on a 37-year-old afternoon.'),(5010213,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>Appears in episode 5 as \'Sun&Moon Star Hotel\''),(5010214,'<Hey? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>Han Yoo-hyun (Kim Young-kwang) and Anthony (Um Moon-seok) are challenged by Anthony, who says he already kissed Yoo-hyun when they were outside the Conalle Walk D2 SUMMER.'),(5010215,'<Hello? It\'s me!(안녕? 나야!)>In episodes 2 and 4, Hanyu Hyun (played by Kim Young Kwang) comes to this restaurant for dinner. Meanwhile, Banhani (played by Choi Kang Hee) also goes on a blind date here. It\'s their second meeting after meeting at the nearby police station.'),(5010216,'<Anturaji(안투라지)>Here, Cha Young-bin (acted by Seo Kang-jun) and Ahn So-hee (acted by Ahn So-hee) share a kiss at the swimming pool at night.'),(5010217,'<Entourage(안투라지)>It is a place where Cha Young-bin (Seo Kang-joon) went with his close friends and where Lee Ho-jin (Park Jung-min) broke up.'),(5010218,'<Entourage(안투라지)>In episode 10, Kim Eun-gab (played by Jo Jin-woong) had a meeting up close at this square to determine the role of Cha Young-bin (played by Seo Kang-joon), and Jay Jung (Amber) also joins at this square to discuss future plans.'),(5010219,'<Known(알고있지만)> In the drama \"Oh My Venus,\" Oh Bit Na (Yang Hye-ji) and Nam Gyu-hyun (Kim Min-kyu) take a walk in this park but end up reconciling.'),(5010220,'<Algotitin(알고있지만)>In episode 9, Yang Do-hyuk (Chae Jong-hyeop) signs an exclusive contract with a management company at this cafe. At the same time, Do-hyuk notices Park Jae-eon (Song Kang) and Yoon Seol-ah (Lee Yeol-eum) walking up to the second floor.'),(5010221,'<Known(알고있지만)>In episode 8, Park Jae-eon (played by Song Kang) and Yoon Sol (played by Han So-hee) leave the art museum and come to this place. He tells her that he fell in love with her at first sight when he saw her at the museum.'),(5010222,'<Know, but(알고있지만)>In episode 2, Park Jae-eon (Song Kang) helps graduate student Ahn Kyung-jun (Jung Jae-kwang) by putting mud in a pipe to treat the sculpture located behind this building. However, graduate student Ahn Kyung-jun (Jung Jae-kwang) receives his salary in the office and is offered a part-time job, and Na-bi (Han So-hee) says she may also be working there. In episode 8, Do-hyuk (Chae Jong-hyup) surprises Na-bi with a picnic lunch he was eating under a pine tree in front of the art hall. Afterward, she guides him around campus.'),(5010223,'<I Know But(알고있지만)>In episode 3, Yoon-ah (Han So-hee) reminisces about having a date with her ex-boyfriend at this place.'),(5010224,'<KnownBut(알고있지만)>In episode 5, Oh Bitna (Yang Hye-ji) discovers Nam Gyu-hyeon (Kim Min-gwi) having a blind date with another woman at an ice cream shop along this street while walking.'),(5010225,'<Known but(알고있지만)>In episode 5, Seo Ji-wan (Yoon Seo-a) and Yoon Sol (Lee Ho-jeong) leave the police station where Park Jae-eon (Song Kang) and Yoo Na-bi (Han So-hee) were and spend time here.'),(5010226,'<Known(알고있지만)>In Episode 8, Seo Ji-wan (played by Yoon Se-ah) admits to remembering everything that happened on the night of the MT while waiting for Yoon Sol (played by Lee Ho-jung) to arrive at home.'),(5010227,'<Not available(알고있지만)>Seo Ji-wan (Yoon Se-ah) and Yoon Sol (Lee Ho-jeong) meet their high school friends at this cafe. While here, one of them breaks the news that she is getting married, causing her to feel a turning point in their relationship. This leads to Ji-wan and Sol talking about their relationship and working through their issues.'),(5010228,'<Unknown(알고있지만)>At this cafe, friends gather to discuss his dangerous work, inspired by the butterfly he saw at the entrance in episode 1.'),(5010229,'<Unknown(알고있지만)> Yoo Sehun (Kim Moo-jun) is scheduled to meet his crush Yoon Sol (Lee Ho-jung) at this cafe. He thinks it\'s a date, but she just wants to talk about art and school. Her best friend Seo Ji-wan (Yoon Seo-ah) wanted her to go there all the time, so the awkward three-way date happens because the girls are not aware of Sehun\'s feelings.'),(5010230,'<I Know(알고있지만)>In episode four, Yoon-ahbi (Han Soo-hee) meets her childhood friend Yang Dohyuk (Chae Jong-hyup) on the bus. It\'s raining heavily, and Dohyuk shares his umbrella with her as they walk from the bus stop to her house. They make a promise to properly meet a few days later outside this cafe, and Dohyuk runs back to the bus stop through the rain.'),(5010231,'<known(알고있지만)>In episode 4, Yoon-Ah (Han So-hee) imagines herself having a serious conversation with Park Jae-eon (Song Kang) on the cafe\'s outdoor terrace. She expresses her feelings about dating him. In episode 5, Jae-eon meets an unidentified woman at this place.'),(5010232,'<Knows it but(알고있지만)>In When the Camellia Blooms, Yoon Hye (Kang Ha-neul) joined 