 Young-sim (played by Kim Yong-rim), who open Emma\'s guitar workshop in episodes 9 and 10.'),(5010263,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)> Appears as a quaint antique shop in the neighborhood of Granada in Spain, visited by Eugene (Hyun Bin). He waits outside in episode 6. In order to make it possible for Jinwoo, the protagonist, to be there, he has to trespass into the shop that is actually a weapon shop in the AR game Next.'),(5010264,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>This hospital is located in Spain and makes regular appearances in the drama. In episodes 5-6, Yoo Jin-woo (Hyun Bin) receives treatment here, has a seizure, releases himself from the seizure, and continues playing the AR game Next.'),(5010265,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>This building appears as \"J Holdings.\"'),(5010266,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In episodes 13-14, there is a brief encounter between Jung Hee-joo (Park Shin-hye) and injured Yoo Jin-woo (Hyun Bin). She then explains to him about the \"Key to Heaven\" until he has to leave.'),(5010267,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In episode 14, Go Yura (Han Bo Reum) clashes with her manager No Young Joon (Park Jin Woo) at a residential location.'),(5010268,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>The 16th AR game Next Guild Battle takes place here. Passersby are amazed as they watch a group of people seemingly engaged in shadow boxing, intrigued by the process.'),(5010269,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)> The place where Jung Hee-joo (played by Park Shin-hye) and Yoo Jin-woo (played by Hyun Bin) kissed in episode 12 is the Iland Cruise pier.'),(5010270,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>The test run of the Korean AR Game Next with Episode 7 takes place right in front of this statue. While a pair of players fight against different warriors (with Park Sun-ho (played by Lee Seung-joon) and his team watching from afar), Yoo Jin-woo (played by Hyun Bin) drives through, passing all opponents and shooting a gun.'),(5010271,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In the final scene of Episode 16, Jung Hee-joo (played by Park Shin-hye) wonders if Yoo Jin-woo (played by Hyun Bin) might be here. Cross the crosswalk in front of this gate to enter the AR game Next, where Jin-woo is shooting enemies from the park across the gate in Next.'),(5010272,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In episode 3 of the AR game, Yoo Jin-woo (Hyun Bin) fights against Cha Hyun-seok (Park Hoon) in front of the greenhouse in this park to defeat him, but his actual death is announced the next morning.'),(5010273,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In episode 13, Park Seon-ho (played by Lee Seung-joon) returns to Seoul and arrives at this airport.'),(5010274,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In episodes 3 and 4, the interior of this hotel appears as the hotel in Granada, Spain where Cha Hyung-seok (Park Hoon) and his wife Lee Su-jin (Lee Si-won) are staying.'),(5010275,'<Memories of Alhambra Palace(알함브라 궁전의 추억)>In episode 16, the AR game \"Next\" unfolds at this church. When Park Seon-ho (played by Lee Seung-joon) arrives at this place a few hours later, he discovers only traces of destruction in the form of sand piles scattered throughout the church, and Jung Hee-joo (played by Park Shin-hye) who joined him finds the same. Later, Hee-joo returns to this church and realizes that she may be a part of the possible death of Jin-woo.'),(5010276,'<Assassination(암살)>Filming location of beautiful Miscanthus grass in Assassination'),(5010277,'<Assassination(암살)>A video theme park featuring various scenes from the movie \"Assassination\"'),(5010278,'<Assassination(암살)>Exotic memorial hall in Gwangju where the movie Assassination was filmed'),(5010279,'<Assassination(암살)>A favorite restaurant of the director of the movie \"Assassination\"'),(5010280,'<Assassination(암살)>One of Seoul\'s iconic night view spots featured in the movie \"Assassination\"'),(5010281,'<Assassination(암살)>The home of Kang In-guk and Mitsuko in the movie \"Assassination\"'),(5010282,'<Assassination(암살)>A palace where films like Assassination and Goblin were filmed'),(5010283,'<Assassination(암살)>A place that has been transformed from a train station into Seoul\'s representative exhibition space'),(5010284,'<Apgujeong Baekya(압구정 백야)>In episode 1, Baekya/Baek Soon-dong (played by Park Hana) is waiting in front of this exit to have a drink with Baek Young-jun (played by Shim Hyeong-tak) in the evening.'),(5010285,'<Apgujeong Baekya(압구정 백야)>You can see her in a scene where Kim Doran (Kim Yujin/Yooi) visits her in episode 18.'),(5010286,'<Mischievous Stone Girl(앙큼한 돌싱녀)>In episode 12, Cha Jung-woo (played by Joo Sang-wook) waits here until closing time to celebrate Na Ae-ra\'s (played by Kim Min-jung) pitching success.'),(5010287,'<Playful Dolsing girl(앙큼한 돌싱녀)>In episode 12, Na Ae-ra (played by Lee Min-jung) accompanying Kook Seung-hyun (played by Seo Kang-joon) is offered a job by the hotel\'s representative in the hotel lobby (appearing as \'Tongil Shilla Hotel\').'),(5010288,'<Angry Solo Lady(앙큼한 돌싱녀)>In episodes 12-13, Nara (played by Lee Min-jung) is walking towards the \'Unification Shilla Hotel\'. Suddenly, Cha Jung-woo (played by Joo Sang-wook) appears to try to stop her from moving her company, which later becomes known as the \'Cherry Blossom Kiss\'.'),(5010289,'<Mischievous Dolsingnyeo(앙큼한 돌싱녀)>In episode 6, Na Ae-ra (Lee Min-jung) and Cha Jung-woo (Joo Sang-wook) ride the swan-shaped paddle boat.'),(5010290,'<Eaganjang(애간장)>The bridge, also known as Yeonkkot Lake Bridge, was featured as the \'Firefly Bridge\' that Kang Shin-woo (Lee Jung-shin) and Han Ji-soo (Lee Yeon-eum) agreed to meet in 2007.'),(5010291,'<Aganjang(애간장)>In episode 10, Kang Shin-woo (Lee Jung-shin) and Han Ji-soo (Lee Yul-eum) embark on an adventure from this park to the shopping street leading to Western Dome Shopping Mall for a date.'),(5010292,'<Aegangjang(애간장)>After working overtime from 6 to 10 hours, tired adult Han Jisoo (pseudonym) finishes work and comes to drink coffee.'),(5010293,'<Love Alarm(애간장)>In season 1, Kang Shin-woo (Lee Jung-shin) and Han Ji-soo (Lee Yoo-mi) meet outside Vegibox and have coffee together.'),(5010294,'<Aeganjang(애간장)>After reuniting after 10 years, Kang Shin-woo (CNBLUE\'s Lee Jung-shin) and Jisoo (Lee Yeol-eum) come to chat. When he says he misses her, she says she doesn\'t have much time and shortens the meeting.'),(5010295,'<Aeganchang(애간장)>Kang Shin-woo (CNBLUE Lee Jung-shin) comes to \'Garam Pub\' with his high school friends in episode 7. He informed Han Ji-soo (Lee Yeol-eum) of the meeting, but there was no response. When she shows up, he shows joy. However, he becomes terrified when his younger self (Seo Ji-hoon) appears with her.'),(5010296,'<Ageandjang(애간장)>Kang Shin-woo (CNBLUE\'s Lee Jung Shin) came to meet Jun-ah since the first episode. His friend Kim Min-seok only hears that they have set up a blind date at the cafe.'),(5010297,'<Lovers in Bloom(애인있어요)>In episode 15, Do Haegang (Kim Hyunjoo) and Choi Jin-eon (Ji Jinhee) come here.'),(5010298,'<They Have a Lover(애인있어요)>The metasequoia tree-lined path in this park is a special place for Do-hae (Kim Hye-joo) and Choi Ji. Their love is reaffirmed and confirmed again.'),(5010299,'<Love Affairs(애인있어요)>This is the place where Haekang (played by Kim Hyun-joo) lived in the drama.'),(5010300,'<Love Affairs(애인있어요)>In Episode 16, Kim Hyun-joo and Lee Gyu-han come to drink alcohol in the evening. They play a drinking game, and the tipsy Baek Seok confesses his love to the woman next to him and must write her name with his butt.'),(5010301,'<Aein Is Here(애인있어요)>In one episode, Kim Hyun-joo leaves her twin mom Kim Kyu-nam (Kim Cheong) on this bridge and leaves.'),(5010302,'<Encounter(애정만만세)>In episode 3, Kang Jaemi (Lee Bo-young) returns here with her mother Oh Jeong-hee (Bae Jong-ok) and aunt Oh Jeong-sim (Yoon Hyeon-seok) after finishing their trip to Guam.'),(5010303,'<Attractive Romance(애타는 로맨스)>In the drama \"Attractive Romance,\" Lee Yumi (played by Song Ji Eun) makes her first appearance at her mother\'s wedding held at Daemyung Resort Sol Beach Samcheok to catch her breath.'),(5010304,'<Aetaneun Romance (The Longing Heart)(애타는 로맨스)> In episode 1, Jin-wook is ordered by his father to work at a hotel that he inherits, while Yoo-mi comes to attend her mother\'s second wedding, leading Jin-wook (Seong-hoon) and Yoo-mi (Song Ji-eun) to stay together.'),(5010305,'<At Eighteen(애타는 로맨스)>In episode 1, they were at this bus stop. Cha Jin-wook was driving by when he saw her trying to eat a triangular kimbap. He stopped and offered her a ride. Despite their initial argument, Yoo Mi ended up getting into Jin-wook\'s car after hearing that the bus had stopped.'),(5010306,'<A Love So Beautiful(애타는 로맨스)>Here comes out the headquarters of Daebok Group managed by Cha Jin-wook (Lee Sang) in \"A Love So Beautiful.\" It is shown as a place owned by the family in episode 2 and where Lee Yu-mi (Song Ji-eun) works.'),(5010307,'<At Eighteen: Ep5(애타는 로맨스)>In episode 5 of \"At Eighteen,\" Lee Yumi (played by Song Ji-eun) came to this place to drink and encountered her crush, Jung Hyuntae (played by Kim Jae-young), there.'),(5010308,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 1, Park Jin-kyum (Joo Won) rushes to this shopping mall on the day his mother passed away and encounters Yoon Tae-yi (Kim Hee-sun). Thinking she is his mother from a distance, he heads towards her. Time freezes just before a truck collides with him.'),(5010309,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 1, Hong Eun-soo\'s mother (played by Oh Yeon-ah) is looking out the window with tears in her eyes on the airplane back to Korea.'),(5010310,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 6, a time traveler taps a visitor (who appears to be their past self) on the shoulder in the library bookshelf.'),(5010311,'<Alice(앨리스)>In the first episode, the famous internist Jang Dong-sik (Jang Hyun-sung) is murdered by a time traveler (Park In-soo) in his own home, witnessed by his young daughter.'),(5010312,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 10, Kim Do-yeon (played by Lee Da-in) and her parents come here for a meal.'),(5010313,'<Alice(앨리스)>This university is depicted as \'Korean University\' in dramas. Yoon Tae-eui (played by Kim Hee-sun) studied here as an undergraduate in 2010 and now works as a lecturer in 2020.'),(5010314,'<Alice(앨리스)>Jin-kyum Park (Ju-won) and Hui-seon Kim (Yoon Tae-yi) meet here in episodes 5 and 6 to have drinks and share stories. Tae-yi talks to Jin-kyum about her childhood here.'),(5010315,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 2, he/she comes to this building and discovers a mysterious aircraft flying around, and finds the deceased civilian spirit.'),(5010316,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 10, Park Jin-kyum (Ju-won) and Yoon Tae-i (Kim Hee-sun) head to this theme park for a day out. It is also a place where the two take photos together as they face Jin-kyum\'s impending death.'),(5010317,'<Alice(앨리스)> Park Jinkyum (Joo Won) and Yoon Taei (Kim Hee-sun) drive across this bridge.'),(5010318,'<Alice(앨리스)>Park Jinkyum (Joo Won) and Kim Dongho (Lee Jaeyoon) investigate this house to confirm if Seok-ohwon (Choi Wonyoung) used it as a hideout.'),(5010319,'<Alice(앨리스)>This is the Chinese restaurant run by Yoon Tae Yi\'s (Kim Hee Sun) parents.'),(5010320,'<Alice(앨리스)>Choi Won-young is discussing \'the butterfly effect\' on-site while Park Jin-gyeom (Ju Won) attends the 4th episode.'),(5010321,'<Alice(앨리스)>In episode 10, Park Jin-kyum (Ju Won) and the police receive a tip about the whereabouts of director Seok Oh-won and head to this abandoned theme park.'),(5010322,'<Alice(앨리스)>This is the childhood home where Park Jin-gyeom (Joowon) lived with his mother Park Seon-yeong (Kim Hee-sun) in episode 1.'),(5010323,'<Midnight Snack Men and Women(야식남녀)>In this street, you can see the late-night bistro \'Brothers\' operated by Chef Park Jin-sung (Jung Il-woo) in episode 1.'),(5010324,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 12, Kim Hee-woo (played by Lee Jun-ki) and his colleague Kim Seok-hoon (played by Choi Kwang-il) meet Jo Tae-seop (played by Lee Kyung-young) at this restaurant.'),(5010325,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 3, Kim Hee Woo (played by Lee Joon Gi) meets Kim Han Mi (played by Kim Jae Kyung) at this cafe.'),(5010326,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>It is a place where Kim Hee-woo (Lee Jun-ki) attends a court auction in Episode 3 and meets the auction king Woo Yong-soo (Lee Soon-jae).'),(5010327,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 12, Kim Hee-woo (Lee Joon-gi) meets Kim Hee-ah (Kim Ji-eun) at this cafe. She reveals her company\'s confidential information \"Case\" to him.'),(5010328,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 1, Cho Taeseop (Lee Geunyeong) visits his son-in-law Heo Jaegun (Ryu Jin) at the Blue House.'),(5010329,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 7, Kim Hee-woo (played by Lee Jun-ki) drinks with Jang Il-hyun (played by Kim Hyung-mook) at this tavern.'),(5010330,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>This is where Kim Hee-woo (Lee Jun-ki) and Lee Min-su (Jung Sang-hoon) drank together in episode 15.'),(5010331,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>Appears in Episode 1 as Seoul Central District Prosecutors\' Office.'),(5010332,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 2, Kim Hee-woo (played by Lee Jun-ki) gets off at Exit 8 of the station to go to work as an exhibition office worker.'),(5010333,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 2, Park Jingyeom (Joo Won) comes to this building and discovers a mysterious flying object floating around, and he finds the dead Yeongmin Sung (Shin Yeong Gyu).'),(5010334,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>The exterior of this building appears in pastel blue in episode 1.'),(5010335,'<Ageing My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>Kim Hee-woo (Lee Jun-ki) and Kim Han-mi (Kim Jae-kyung) come to drink in episode 5.'),(5010336,'<Agein My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>Kim Hee-woo (Lee Jun-ki), who received a draft notice in episode 5, visits at night.'),(5010337,'<Again My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 3, after breaking up with her father, Kim Hanmi (Kim Jaekyung) drinks here and drunkenly calls Kim Heewoo (Lee Joongi) who rushed to find her.'),(5010339,'<Agein My Life(어게인 마이 라이프)>In episode 2, Kim Hee-woo (played by Lee Jun-ki) is back to start his studies at a Korean university. In the same episode, the academic information center (Central Library Information Center) appears as the \'Dyke Hall\', where the freshman party takes place.'),(5010341,'<One day, destruction came to our front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 10, the destruction (Seo In-guk) comes here and introduces them to it.'),(5010342,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 4, Tuk Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) and Myeol-mang (Seo In-guk) come to this library.'),(5010343,'<One day, destruction came to our front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>The building of this cafe with a digital floor on top is owned by Cha Joo-ik (Lee Su-hyeok), with a web novel publishing company where Pak Dong-kyeong (Park Bo-young) works and a 1st floor cafe (actually called Icetile) run by Lee Hyun-gyu (Kang Tae-oh).'),(5010344,'<One day, destruction came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>This is the rooftop terrace where Songyoshin (Jung Ji-so), who is receiving treatment at the hospital, is located. Even Myeolmang (Seo In-guk) who occasionally works as a \'doctor\' at the hospital can be seen at the rooftop in episode 4.'),(5010345,'<One day, destruction came into our front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 3, young Tak Dong-kyung (Lee Ye-seo) visited this amusement park with her parents and older brother.'),(5010346,'<One day, destruction came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 6, after the school reunion ends, Na Jina (played by Shin Dohyun) tries to catch a taxi. Lee Hyungyu (played by Kang Taeo) suggests taking her home, but she refuses and he leaves. They part ways like this, and their first love comes to an end.'),(5010347,'<One day, destruction came to our house front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 10, Tak Dong-kyung (Chaos) brings Destruction (Seo In-guk) to this park to celebrate Destruction\'s birthday at night. In episode 14, the two come to another part of this park to confirm their love again.'),(5010348,'<One day, destruction came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 16, Na Ji-na (played by Shin Do-hyun) and Cha Joo-ik (played by Lee Soo-hyuk) go on a date at the rooftop lounge and share their first kiss as a couple.'),(5010349,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 14, Myeolmang (played by Seo In-guk) brings Tak Dong-kyung (played by Park Bo-young) to this bridge.'),(5010350,'<One day destruction entered our front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In Episode 7, when invited artist gets annoyed while having a team dinner at this place, Takk Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) makes him sit down and leaves.'),(5010351,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 6, Myeolmang (Seo In-guk) takes Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) to this street. And here, her one possible wish is to love him.'),(5010352,'<One day, destruction came into our house(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In Episode 6, Myul Mang (Seo In-guk) crashes Takh Dong-kyung\'s (Park Bo-young) blind date at this \'Asian fusion pub\' branch. And after putting the other two people present to sleep, he pulls her out of the situation.'),(5010353,'<One day destruction came to our house front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>Destruction (Seo In-guk) accepts an invitation from Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) to observe and understand her as a human, and from episode 5 onwards, he follows her everywhere, including during lunch breaks with colleagues at this restaurant.'),(5010354,'<One day, destruction came to our house gate(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 6, the meeting of Cha Joo-ik and Na Ji-na takes place.'),(5010355,'<One day, destruction came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 9, it tells the story of how he lived as a god on the outdoor terrace of this place.'),(5010356,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 14, Naji-na (Shin Do-Hyun) climbs a hill to this park.'),(5010357,'<One day, destruction came to our house door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 13, Najina (Shin Do-hyun) and Lee Hyun-gyu (Kang Tae-oh) met at this bar.'),(5010358,'<One day disaster came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)> In Episode 13, when Na Jina (played by Shin Dohyun) meets Lee Hyun-gyu (played by Kang Tae-oh), she thinks about the gathering that took place at a bar/restaurant, hoping to meet him at the alumni meeting.'),(5010359,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 14, Na Ji-na (played by Shin Do-hyun) and Lee Hyun-gyu (played by Kang Tae-oh) remember the time they fell in love at this school, which used to be an old high school for their \'date\'.'),(5010360,'<One day, disaster strikes our house(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 8, Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) happens to see the web novel writer Park Young-eun/Gwigongja (Nam Dareum) on the outdoor stage of Naminsa-madang in this street and ends up unable to get away as a member of the boy band Hiteen Dream.'),(5010361,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 6, they meet in front of this store, destruction (Seo In-guk) and the new girl god (Jung Ji-so). And ask whether his love for Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) will go well.'),(5010362,'<One day, destruction came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>Destruction (Seo In-guk) brings Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) to this cafe. In episode 13, he asks her if she met the Girl Deity (Jung Ji-so). She informs him of a recent phone call with a voice saved under the name \'Person\' with a specific number.'),(5010363,'<One day, destruction came to our front door(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>Right in front of the crosswalk where Tak Dong-kyung (played by Park Bo-young) decides fate. In episodes 1-2, she holds hands with destruction in front of the \'Fate Truck\'.'),(5010364,'<One day, destruction came to our house front gate(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episodes 6-7, Phok Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) falls in love with Mu-Myung (Seo In-guk) as they climb the stairs leading to this street, and he answers with a kiss before disappearing suddenly.'),(5010365,'<One day, disaster struck our home front porch(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) and her younger brother Tak Sun-kyung (Da-won) live in this rooftop apartment.'),(5010366,'<One day, destruction came to our doorstep(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In Episode 4, Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) passes through this street while riding a taxi to the hospital where her brother is located.'),(5010367,'<One day, destruction came into our house doorway(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>A few days after she ran away to Jeju Island in Episode 11, Dong-kyung\'s family and friends arrive upon receiving a call from Myeolmang. Dong-kyung walks the forest trail with her close friend Ji-na and stops by this landmark observatory to take a selfie. She says, \"I thought I was running away, but after arriving, I realized that everything I love is here.\" Ji-na promises to always be by her side rather than running away with her. Ji-na confesses that she is back together with Hyeon-gyu, but Dong-kyung questions her about liking Cha Joo-ik at work. Ji-na insists it\'s not true. Meanwhile, destruction watches them from a nearby cliff.'),(5010368,'<In an episode, the destruction entered our house front gate(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 11, Tak Dong-kyung (Park Bo-young) and Myeolmang (Seo In-guk) have lunch at this restaurant. And he is surprised by her usual nagging.'),(5010369,'<One day, destruction came into our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episode 5, Myeong (Seo In-guk) awkwardly observes Dohyeong (Park Bo-young) and tries to figure her out. Following her for a while, he realizes she\'s carrying a heavy burden of sadness and wants to lighten her load. He covers her eyes, leads her to a special beach on Jeju Island along the coastal walking trail. She shares that she used to come here to cry when she was young, reminiscing about her childhood. Awkwardly, they kiss and return home as if nothing happened. In episodes 10 and 11, Myeong misses his family and friends as he leaves Seoul, and coincidentally finds her here, eventually admitting his wish is to live. Myeong confesses that he wants to live too and wants to be with Dohyeong until the end.'),(5010370,'<One day, destruction came to our house entrance(어느 날 우리 집 현관으로 멸망이 들어왔다)>In episodes 10 and 11, Tak Dong Kyung (played by Park Bo Young) runs away to her hometown Jeju Island. She stays at this villa left to her by her aunt Kang Soo Ja (played by Woo Hee Jin) for a \"forever home.\" Ma Dong Chan (played by Seo In Guk), who discovers her, arrives to support her, worried about his mental health, and notifies his family and closest friend of his whereabouts.'),(5010371,'<A Wonderful Day(어느 멋진날)>Appears as \'Deep Blue Restaurant\'.'),(5010372,'<A Wonderful Day(어느 멋진날)>For her birthday, Kang Dong-ha (played by Namgoong Min) books a hotel room within the hotel. Here, he sees her and comes to realize she is from a different social class.'),(5010373,'<A Wonderful Day(어느 멋진날)>In episode 1 of \"A Wonderful Day,\" Seo Haneul (former Fin.K.L member Sung Yuri) comes to this school with the birthday gift for her mother (which is none other than Park Taewon [Yoo Hajun]).'),(5010374,'<one day(어느날)>This is where Kim Hyun-soo (Kim Soo-hyun) holds his trial.'),(5010375,'<One day in episodes 3 and 4, the building appears to be the law firm \'Buemhan Law\' where the lawyers Park Mi-kyung (Seo Jae-hee) and Seo Soo-jin (Lee Seol) work.(어느날)>N/A'),(5010376,'<One Fine Day(어느날)>One day, Kim Hyun-soo (played by Kim Soo-hyun) and Hong Guk-hwa (played by Hwang Se-on) have a meal at an ice cream stand and then run past Han River Paradise in this park.'),(5010377,'<One Fine Day(어느날)>In episode 6, Shin Joong-han (Cha Seung-won) meets Yoon Hyo-jong (Na Eun-saem) on the rooftop of this building and asks about the situation with Hong Guk-hwa (Hwang Se-eon).'),(5010378,'<One Fine Day(어느날)>In episode 8, Kim Hyun-soo (Kim Soo-hyun) stood on the rooftop of this building looking at the night view.'),(5010379,'<One Day(어느날)>In episode 1, Kim Hyun-soo (Kim Soo-hyun) and Hong Guk-hwa (Hwang Se-on) have a meal at an ice cream stall before passing through Hangang Paradise in this park.'),(5010380,'<One Day(어느날)>In the drama \"3 Days,\" Shin Chung-han (Cha Seung-won) takes a village bus to this street to meet Kim Hyun-soo (Kim Soo-hyun).'),(5010381,'<One Day(어느날)>It appears to be the building where the meticulous lawyer\'s law firm (played by Cha Seung-won) is located on the 4th floor in episodes 2 and 3.'),(5010382,'<One Day(어느날)>During the trial on Episode 2, they are transferred to prison.'),(5010383,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 13, Oh Soo-nyeo (Kim Hae-sook) confesses to Choi Mi-kaella (Lee Sung-kyung) that she can see the remaining time on Earth as if it were her own. She tells Mi-kaella how she found out that Mi-kaella can also see the \"clock\" and recounts the first time she saw Mi-kaella at this hospital.'),(5010384,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 3, Choi Mikaella (Lee Sung Kyung) met Jo Jaeyoo (Kim Dong Joon) and Jung Seong Hee (Han Seung Yeon) here to discuss a contract, and before leaving, Jaeyoo praised Mikaella\'s singing to soothe Do Ha\'s (Lee Sang Yoon) annoyance. Later in the broadcast, Jaeyoo meets the mischievous Mikaella after failing an audition for a musical.'),(5010385,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In the drama, this bridge is where Choi Mi-ka (played by Lee Sung-kyung) witnesses a traffic accident in episode 1.'),(5010386,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 15, this is where Choi Mi-kae-la (Lee Sung-kyung) and Lee Do-ha (Lee Sang-yoon) had a dinner date, but they keep their distance as Mi-kae-la is afraid of stealing Do-ha\'s time if they get too close. They have dinner while talking on the phone and looking at each other from afar.'),(5010387,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 10, Choi Mi-kaella (Lee Sung-kyung) meets Yeon-hee and hands her the script for \'Yeonhee\'s Suspicious Case\'. A note from her about the characteristic of saying farewell to Mi-kaella before she leaves Korea again after quitting the production. She also tells Mi-kaella not to give up on Doha, as he is the one who makes her happy now, and that she deserves to be happy.'),(5010388,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>The teaser was filmed here. The first teaser shows Lee Do-ha (Lee Sang-yoon) holding on to Choe Mika (Lee Sung-kyung) as she falls, with flowers bursting around them. The second teaser is a 15-second clip of the two main characters making eye contact inside a tram.'),(5010389,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 11, Beth (played by Lim Se-mi) hears the news that Jang Chiang (played by Woo Hyo-gwang) is making a contract with Lee Do-ha (played by Lee Sang-yoon) without consulting her, so she asks Chiang to meet her at the spot. She requests to postpone the contract with Do-ha in the restaurant episode.'),(5010390,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 9, Bae Su-bong (Im Se-mi) invites Choi Mi-kaella (Lee Sung-kyung) and Kim Joon-a (Kim Gyu-ri) to have brunch together. Su-bong is amazed to see the past (Joon-a), present (Mi-kaella), and future (Choi Mi-kaella) all meeting face to face. She tells the two women that it is better to resolve things in the past before Mi-kaella and Do-ha get married, so that he can sort things out in the past and finish things in the present before marrying her.'),(5010391,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 3, Ido-ha (Lee Sang-yoon) and Chae Mika (Lee Sung-kyung) watched a movie. She desperately tries to touch his hand, checking if her \'natural clock\' really counts upwards when she touches him.'),(5010392,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 11, Lee Do-ha (Lee Sang-yun) and Bae Su (Im Se-mi) meet at this cafe and he finally proposes to her. However, Do-ha tells her that he no longer wants to get married to her and tells her not to meet him again.'),(5010393,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>Choi Mi-kae-ra (Lee Sung-kyung) watched the musical About Time audition here.'),(5010394,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 7, Subong called Mikaela because he was curious about Mikaela\'s reaction to her \'gift\'. The \'gift\' is the lead role in a musical produced by I Do-ha (Lee Sang-yoon) and casted by Kim Juna (Kim Gyu-ri), and Subong confirms Juna\'s real identity to Mikaela. Subong mentions that Mikaela\'s failed love story with Do-ha is similar to their current relationship, and that just like Do-ha couldn\'t protect her, he won\'t be able to protect her as well.'),(5010395,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>This is where Baesoo Bong (Im Semi) and Idoha (Lee Sang-yoon) meet in episode 13. Doha calls her to propose meeting and cancel their family\'s wedding. He asks why she keeps insisting on getting married even though she has already rejected him. She tells him that if he truly doesn\'t want to marry her, he can give up everything he has and run away.'),(5010396,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>This is the place where Baesoo Bong (Im Se-mi) called Lee Do-ha (Lee Sang-yoon) to meet him while receiving a massage in episode 13.'),(5010397,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 9, there is a scene where Jeo Jae-yoo (played by Kim Dong-jun) calls and picks up a girl at night, and they have a conversation under the bridge.'),(5010398,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 3, Choi Mi-ka (Lee Sung-kyung) and Lee Do-ha (Lee Sang-yoon) appear after dinner. He tells her to walk backwards for driving practice and catches her when she falls, noticing for the first time that her \'natural clock\' counts upwards at his touch.'),(5010399,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 7, Lee Do-ha (played by Lee Sang-yoon) and his ex-girlfriend Kim Joon-ah (played by Kim Gyu-ri) talked about their past at this park located right outside Arko Art Theater.'),(5010400,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 12, Cho Jae-yoo (Kim Dong-jun) follows Choi Mika (Lee Sung-kyung) outside the museum and suggests going to eat chicken together.'),(5010401,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>This is the museum name that Ha-ri (Lee Sang-yoon) saw while heading towards this bus stop in Episode 6. It reminds him of Bae\'s warning to leave from Yi-do\'s (Lee Do-hyun) house. He called her from this bus stop but she didn\'t answer so he texted her asking where she was and why she wasn\'t answering his calls. She lies that she is near the bus stop close to his office building but actually she is where he is. He holds her hand and they take the bus together back home.'),(5010402,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>It appears as Lee Do-ha\'s (Lee Sang-yoon) residence. Outside the building is where Choi Mi-ka (Lee Sung-kyung) shared an umbrella with Lee Do-ha to win him over in episode 2. In the same episode, Choi Mi-ka applies to be Lee Do-ha\'s new chauffeur. Both the interior and front of the building were used in the drama.'),(5010403,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 1, Mikael refuses treatment but is forcibly taken in a wheelchair by Do to the hospital and asks the nurse to take her there.'),(5010404,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>Yiseonggyeong has dinner at this place in episode 3.'),(5010405,'<About Time(어바웃타임)>In episode 4, Lee Do-ha (Lee Sang-yoon)’s stepbrother Yoon Do-san (Jeong Moon-sung) appears.'),(5010406,'<Abyss(어비스)> In episode 2, Go Se-yeon (Park Bo-young) and Cha Min (Ahn Hyo-seop) eat kimbap on a bench in this park.'),(5010407,'<Abyss(어비스)>In the drama, it is the house of Eom Ae-ran (Yoon Yoo-sun), the mother of the main character Cha Min (Ahn Hyo-seop). In episode 2, you can see scenes of Cha Min\'s (Ahn Hyo-seop) mother at this location.'),(5010408,'<Abyss(어비스)>Appears as Cha Min\'s mother Eom Ae-ran\'s mansion in episode 2.'),(5010409,'<Abyss(어비스)>This is the place where Go Se-yeon (Kim Sa-rang) went in episode 1 recollection scene.'),(5010410,'<Abyss(어비스)>The prosecution office where Go Se-yeon (played by Kim Sa-rang) worked before she died in the first episode and where Cha Min (played by Ahn Hyo-seop) comes to find her.'),(5010411,'<Abyss(어비스)>In episode 1, Cha Min (Ahn Hyo-seop) lives in an apartment in this place where he must leave when his body changes.'),(5010412,'<Abyss(어비스)>In episode 15, Go Seyeon (Park Bo-young) and Cha Min (Ahn Hyo-seop) visited this park\'s multiplaza for a date.'),(5010413,'<Abyss(어비스)>In episode 2, Go Se-yeon (Park Bo-young) and Cha Min (Ahn Hyo-seop) are walking to exit 7 of Seoul Station on Line 1.'),(5010414,'<Abyss(어비스)>A place where the reincarnated Go Seyeon (Kim Sarang) and Cha Min (Won Ohwon, Ahn Hyoseop) go to buy food. Seyeon chooses expired food on purpose to threaten the cashier and get it for free. It becomes the regular meeting place for the duo throughout the series.'),(5010415,'<Abyss(어비스)>The drama depicts Go Se-yeon (played by Park Bo-young) and Cha Min (played by Ahn Hyo-seop) walking out of Exit 7 of Seoul Station on Line 1.'),(5010416,'<Welcome(어서와)>In the drama \'Come and Hug Me\', Kim Sola (played by Shin Ye-eun) moves to a house across the street on episode 2.'),(5010417,'<Welcome(어서와)>In episode 8 (4), Sol-a (played by Shin Ye-eun) searches for Hong-jo (played by Kim Myung-soo) in the park.'),(5010418,'<Welcome(어서와)>In the drama \"Welcome\" (2016), Kim Sola (Shin Ye-eun) and Hong Jo (Kim Myung-soo) come to this street in human form to enjoy the afternoon together after finishing their blind date on episode 7 (out of 4 episodes).'),(5010419,'<Welcome(어서와)>The office of \"Nalsam Design\" where Kim Sola (Shin Yeeun) works is located in this building.'),(5010420,'<Welcome(어서와)>In episode 4 (2nd episode), Kim Sola (played by Shin Ye-eun) walks out of her house and down this street.'),(5010421,'<Welcome(어서와)>In episode 4 (episodes 1 and 2) Kim Sora (played by Shin Yeeun) leaves her house and crosses this pedestrian overpass.'),(5010422,'<Come on in(어서와)>In episode 7, the two people\'s blind date and meeting take place on these stairs.'),(5010423,'<Welcome(어서와)>In episode 1, this place is also where Jaeseon (Kim Myung-soo) inherits the ability to transform into a cat.'),(5010424,'<Welcome~ Is it your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)> Chuncheon Dakgalbi found on Welcome, First Time in Korea Episode 16'),(5010425,'<Welcome~ Is this your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Welcome to Korea, Is this your first time? Specializing in eel dishes as seen in the Indian film.'),(5010426,'<Welcome~ Is it your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Glamping site featured in Welcome First Time in Korea Episode 15'),(5010427,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Visited in episode 6 of Welcome, First Time in Korea at the southern end of South Korea'),(5010428,'<Welcome~ Visiting Korea for the First Time?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Welcome to Korea for the First Time - German Edition Gyeongju Accommodation'),(5010429,'<Welcome~ This is your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Bulguksa featured in Welcome, First Time in Korea Episode 7'),(5010430,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>The pond from episode 8 of Welcome, First Time in Korea'),(5010431,'<Welcome~ Is it your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Cheonmachong visited in episode 7 of \"Welcome, First Time in Korea\"'),(5010432,'<Welcome~ Is this your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Aquarium featured in Welcome, First Time in Korea Episode 11'),(5010433,'<Welcome~ Is it your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Visited a Russian restaurant in episode 12 of Welcome, First Time in Korea'),(5010434,'<Welcome~ Is this your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>The stadium featured in Welcome, First Time in Korea Episode 1'),(5010435,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Exploring history in episode 6 of Welcome, First Time in Korea'),(5010436,'<Welcome First Time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Observatory featured in Episode 4 of Welcome, First Time in Korea'),(5010437,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Place visited in Welcome First Time in Korea Episode 13'),(5010438,'<Welcome~ Is this your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Visited a museum in Welcome to Korea for the first time Episode 17'),(5010439,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Welcome, first time in Korea German Edition Itaewon Accommodation'),(5010440,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Visited a hanok village in Welcome, First Time in Korea Episode 14'),(5010441,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Visited the palace in Welcome to Korea for the First Time Season 14'),(5010442,'<Welcome~ Is this your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Featured on \'Welcome First Time in Korea\', French home-cooked meals in Ikseon-dong'),(5010443,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)> Tteokbokki restaurant featured in \"Welcome, First Time in Korea\" episode 14'),(5010444,'<Welcome~ Is it your first time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Gwangjang Market featured in Welcome, First Time in Korea season 2'),(5010445,'<Welcome~ First time in Korea?(어서와~ 한국은 처음이지?)>Visited the palace cuisine restaurant in episode 16 of Welcome, First Time in Korea'),(5010446,'<Extraordinary You(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>In this location, the original house of Eundan Oh (played by Kim Hye-yoon) appears as her home. Gosa Garden (Glass House) is where Lee Do-hwa (played by Jung Gun-ju) confessed his feelings to Yeo Joo-da (played by Lee Na-eun) at Onamju\'s (played by Kim Young-dae) birthday party on episode 10. On episode 5, Cottage Garden is set against the backdrop of Sori High School\'s snack bar.'),(5010447,'<Somehow 18(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>This place appears as the vacation home of the Baek Gyeong family in episode 4.'),(5010448,'<Somehow discovered day(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>In episode 22 (total 11 episodes), Baek Gyeong (Lee Jae-wook) visits this place on his birthday. Eundan-o (Kim Hye-yoon) joins him shortly after. As they sit down for a moment, he tells her that she\'s the only person he can lean on.'),(5010449,'<Somehow Family(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>The rooftop cafe featured in episode 9 is located in this complex.'),(5010450,'<Somehow 18(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>Part of this campus appears as \'Sori High School\'.'),(5010451,'<Extraordinary You(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>In episode 1, Eun Dan-oh (Kim Hye-yoon) meets Haru (Rowoon) again on the alley when she returns to school, and in episode 17 (episode 9), Haru regains his memories. The 7th episode math trip takes place in the university\'s Hanhakchon.'),(5010452,'<Somehow Family(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>Sri Godeung Hakkyo (Sri High School) goes on a math trip here in episodes 6-7 (total 3-4 episodes).'),(5010453,'<Extraordinary You(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>In episodes 9-11 (5-6 overall), Oh Nam-joo\'s (played by Kim Young-dae) birthday party takes place here. Eun Dan-oh (played by Kim Hye-yoon) potentially changes the scenes in the comic and in life here.'),(5010454,'<Extraordinary You(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>Some parts of the campus appeared as \"Suri High School\" in episodes 1 and 2.'),(5010455,'<The Day I Found(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>In episode 16, Eundan-o (Kim Hye-yoon) and Baek Kyung (Lee Jae-wook) are depicted having dinner with their families. Outside the stage, Baek Kyung confirms to Eundan-o that all the memories they shared together meant nothing to her.'),(5010456,'<Somehow Family(어쩌다 발견한 하루)>In episode 22 (out of a total of 11 episodes), Haru (Rowoon) remembers the memories of the Goryeo Dynasty, and how he brought Eundanoh (Kim Hye-yoon) to this park, as well as how he accompanies her as Baekgyeong\'s spouse in a different time.'),(5010457,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 16, Han Jung-hyun/Lee Seok-gyu (Ji Jin-hee) and Choi Yeon-soo (Kim Hyun-joo) visit this place.'),(5010458,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 15, a pep rally for the Harmony Party candidate takes place at this restaurant, and the police attempt to suppress the gathering until Choi Yeon-soo (played by Kim Hyun-joo) arrives.'),(5010459,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 11, Choi Yeonsu (Kim Hyunju) and Go Yoonjoo (Han Goeun) agreed to meet at this park.'),(5010460,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 1, Choi Yeon-soo (Kim Hyun-joo) met Kang Cheong-mo (Lee Seung-joon) in front of this hotel.'),(5010461,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 10, Choi Yeon-soo (Kim Hyun-joo) meets Chief Prosecutor Kwak Moon-heum (Song Young-kyu) at this restaurant to seek advice.'),(5010462,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 7, Kang Cheong-mo (Lee Seung-jun) asks Choi Yeon-soo (Kim Hyun-joo) to talk with him and they come to the eastern end of this park.'),(5010463,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 4, Choi Dae-woong (Choi Dae-chul) is suspended from duty at the prosecution office and is seen leaving the building, while Joo Seok-tae (Park Won-jong) emerges at the National Intelligence Service headquarters waiting for his farewell.'),(5010464,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 4, Im Hyeong-rak (played by Heo Joon-ho) has dinner at this restaurant with Song Mun-bae editor (played by Cha Soon-bae), and Congressman Yoo Sang-dong (played by Son Jong-hak). In episode 9, it becomes a meeting place for Hyeong-rak, Sang-dong, and this time, Prosecutor Kwak Moon-heum (played by Song Young-kyu).'),(5010465,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 13, Han Jung-hyun (Ji Jin-hee) is kidnapped in this park while walking his dog. In episode 14, his children Han Seung-gu (Yoo Seon-ho) and Han Seung-mi (Lee Jae-in) come here to find him and their missing dog.'),(5010466,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 11, different characters all cross this bridge and head to \"Miwolde\".'),(5010467,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 5, Han Jung Hyun (Yeon Woo Jin), Go Yoon Joo (Park Kyung Ri), and Hwang Jung Ho (Im Ji Gyu) drink at this store.'),(5010468,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 1, Young Jun (played by Jung Hyun) and Lee Seok Gyu (played by Yeon Woo Jin) are depicted drinking together at this park with Oh Hyun Jae (played by Kwon Hae Hyo).'),(5010469,'<Undercover(언더커버)>In episode 10, Choi Yeon-soo (Han Sun-hwa) from her childhood, introduces her close friend Min Sang-a (Han Bo-bae) to young Han Jeong-hyun/Lee Seok-gyu (Yeon Woo-jin) at this cafe.'),(5010470,'<Always Spring Day(언제나 봄날)>In episode 1, Joo In-jung (played by Kang Byul) visits her father\'s hospital room.'),(5010471,'<Frozen Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>In episode 2, Guareum (played by Lee Da-hee) reminisces about her date with her ex-fiance Kim In-woo (played by Song Jong-ho) at this park.'),(5010472,'<Frozen Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>In episode 2, Park Jaehoon (played by Choi Siwon) and Han Jiyeon (played by Lee Juyeon) have another blind date at this bar.'),(5010473,'<Frozen Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>In episode 8, Park Jae-hoon (played by Choi Si-won) had his first kiss at this bar.'),(5010474,'<Frozen Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>The building is the headquarters of O.NA TV where Gooyeol (played by Dahee Lee) works.'),(5010475,'<Freezing Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>In episode 6, Park Jaehoon (played by Choi Siwon) and Han Jiyeon (played by Lee Jooyeon) can meet at this cafe and share their stories outside the filming location of the variety show \'The King of Love - Season 2\' without cameras and microphones.'),(5010476,'<Frozen Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>In episode 4, Kim In-woo (played by Song Jong-ho) and Gu Yeo-rum (played by Lee Da-hee) have a meeting with their parents here before their wedding.'),(5010477,'<Freezing Love(얼어죽을 연애따위)>In episode 1, Park Jaehoon (Choi Siwon) is jogging along the Hangang River in this park between Hangang Iron Bridge and Hangang Grand Bridge.'),(5010478,'<Up10tion(업텐션)>The place where Up10tion\'s Xiao visited the Ajae Ranch'),(5010479,'<Up10tion(업텐션)>The village that served as the backdrop for the variety show featuring Xiaogua.'),(5010480,'<Up10tion(업텐션)>Up10tion\'s surprise filming for the concert'),(5010481,'<Uptension(업텐션)>The place where Uptension\'s Jinhik visited for a variety show filming.'),(5010482,'<Uptension(업텐션)>Hotdog restaurant visited by Uptension Wooshin'),(5010483,'<Up10tion(업텐션)>Place visited by Up10tion\'s Kuhn for his birthday'),(5010484,'<Uptention(업텐션)> Perfume workshop for special birthday memories on YouTube'),(5010485,'<Up10tion(업텐션)>The spot where Up10tion\'s Kuhn\'s signature is located'),(5010486,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>The camping site where Eric Nam filmed a variety show'),(5010487,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>Eric Nam prepared a vacation spot for ordinary people on a variety show.'),(5010488,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>Eric Nam visited this escape room cafe during his appearance on We Got Married'),(5010489,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>Eric Nam visited this place to drink Turkish-style coffee'),(5010490,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)> The shop in Cheongdam that Eric Nam uses'),(5010491,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>Eric Nam appeared as an interpreter on Mudo Tour'),(5010492,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>The location where Eric Nam operated a restaurant for a variety show filming.'),(5010493,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>This is where Eric Nam toured as a translator on Mudo Tour.'),(5010494,'<Eric Nam(에릭남)>Looks like Spring\' Music Video Shooting Location'),(5010495,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>Come to EverglowLAND where Mia went'),(5010496,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>Visited by E:U and Sihyeon at EverglowLAND'),(5010497,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>The place where E:U and Shi Hyun went to carry out a mission'),(5010498,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>Everglow debuted as a reality show amusement park'),(5010499,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>This is where Aisha and E:U visited at EverglowLAND'),(5010500,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>Jelly Yanggang Dessert Cafe visited by Aisha and E:U'),(5010501,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>The place where Aisha and E:U went to carry out this mission.'),(5010502,'<Everglow(에버글로우)>Cafe where Everglow held their first busking performance'),(5010503,'<SF8(에스에프 에잇)>In episode 7 of SF8, Eominjun (Super Junior\'s Choi Siwon) and Han Jiwon (Yoo Ee) decide to meet at \'Augmented Bean Pod\'.'),(5010504,'<At Eighteen 2(에이틴 2)>In episode 16, Kim Hana (April\'s Naeun) and Ryu Juha (Golden Child\'s Bomi) have a meal together here and Hana confesses her feelings to Juha.');
