rt at a stray cat support cafe'),(5010549,'<EXO(엑소)>Gubongsan Skywalk Cafe visited by Chanyeol and Sehun'),(5010550,'<EXO(엑소)>A famous grilled meat restaurant visited by Xiumin.'),(5010551,'<Exo(엑소)>A popular restaurant known for its delicious food that Xiumin visited.'),(5010552,'<Exo(엑소)>Cafe with a good atmosphere visited by Xiumin'),(5010553,'<Exo(엑소)>A scenic cafe with a clear view of the Bukhan River that Suho visited.'),(5010554,'<Exo(엑소)>A meat restaurant visited by D.O.'),(5010555,'<EXO(엑소)>Baekhyun and Chanyeol\'s arcade in Instagram'),(5010556,'<EXO(엑소)>Cafe featured on Suho\'s Instagram'),(5010557,'<EXO(엑소)>Shooting location for Miracle in December'),(5010558,'<EXO(엑소)>A place where members gathered for a meal before Xiumin\'s enlistment'),(5010559,'<Instagram(엑소)>Sehun\'s pick tteokbokki restaurant'),(5010560,'<EXO(엑소)>Suho\'s favorite barbecue restaurant on Instagram'),(5010561,'<EXO(엑소)>Dio used to eat gopchang in \'Room 7\''),(5010562,'<EXO(엑소)>Minseok\'s recommended restaurant for seaweed soup'),(5010563,'<EXO(엑소)>Sehun\'s favorite shrimp restaurant where he eats shrimp'),(5010564,'<EXO(엑소)>Cafe by the Han River visited by Xiumin.'),(5010565,'<Exo(엑소)>A meat restaurant visited by Xiumin.'),(5010566,'<EXO(엑소)>A vintage cultural space visited by Suho'),(5010567,'<EXO(엑소)>Place where Suho enjoys dinner'),(5010568,'<Exo(엑소)>Popular soy sauce marinated crab restaurant visited by D.O.'),(5010569,'<Exo(엑소)>Soba restaurant visited by Suho'),(5010570,'<EXO(엑소)>A cafe operated by Kai\'s sister.'),(5010571,'<EXO(엑소)>Trendy clothing store in Seongsu visited by Suho'),(5010572,'<EXO(엑소)>A studio, cafe, and bookstore complex visited by Suho'),(5010573,'<EXO(엑소)>Siwoo Min\'s favorite Chinese restaurant that he frequently visits'),(5010574,'<EXO(엑소)>A historical museum in Seongbuk-dong visited by Chanyeol.'),(5010575,'<Instagram(엑소)>A handmade burger restaurant visited by EXO\'s Suho'),(5010576,'<Exo(엑소)>Suhobar\'s favorite makguksu restaurant'),(5010577,'<Exo(엑소)>A glamping site that Suho and Suho went to.'),(5010578,'<EXO(엑소)>Cafe frequented by Block B member visited by Suho.'),(5010579,'<EXO(엑소)>Suho\'s favorite burger restaurant in Hyehwa-dong'),(5010580,'<EXO(엑소)>D.O\'s favorite café'),(5010581,'<EXO(엑소)> <Love Me Right'),(5010582,'<Exo(엑소)>Cafe with a great view of Jeju Island visited by Suho'),(5010583,'<Exo(엑소)>Jeju Island sentimental cafe visited by Suho'),(5010584,'<EXO(엑소)>Chanyeol, Sehun, and D.O. visited the theme park riding karts.'),(5010585,'<EXO(엑소)>Jeju homestay where EXO\'s Xiumin and Yu filmed the music video \"Island\"'),(5010586,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>The drama depicts the house of Yoon Soo-wan (played by Ku Hye-sun)'),(5010587,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>This hospital is featured as \'SeYoung Hospital\' in episode 4.'),(5010588,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>Episode 13 depicts Yoon Soo-wan (Gu Hye-sun) and Park Dong-joo (Lee Sang-yoon) receiving heart transplants.'),(5010589,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>In episode 1, Yoon Jae-beom (Jung Jin-young) drinks with his friend.'),(5010590,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>In episode 19, Yoon Soo-wan (Gu Hye-sun) and Park Dong-joo (Lee Sang-yoon) had their wedding at this cathedral.'),(5010591,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>This abandoned amusement park can be seen in the opening credits. Yun Su-wan (Koo Hye-sun) and Park Dong-joo (Lee Sang-yoon) ride the merry-go-round here.'),(5010592,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>In episode 19, Yoon Soo-wan (played by Ku Hye-sun) rode a bike across the Somo Island Bridge to serve the elderly villagers in Muui-dong.'),(5010593,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>The house of young Yoon Su-wan (Nam Ji-hyun) as seen in the drama.'),(5010594,'<Angel Eyes(엔젤아이즈)>In episode 1, young Park Dong-joo (played by Kang Ha-neul) is walking down this street to deliver food he made at home. One of the places he stops by is the house of his future girlfriend Yoon Soo-wan (played by Gu Hye-sun).'),(5010595,'<Summer Fragrance(여름 향기)>Korean drama \"Summer Fragrance\"'),(5010596,'<Summer Please(여름아 부탁해)>In the drama \"Itaewon Class,\" Wang Geum-dong (Park Seo-joon) and his father Wang Jae-gook (Yoo Jae-myung) come here for a jog.'),(5010597,'<Summer Please(여름아 부탁해)>Father of the Southwest Siblings (Kim Chang-wan) stayed here while he was in Korea.'),(5010598,'<Summer Fragrance(여름향기)>In the final 16th episode, there is a scene where the two meet again.'),(5010599,'<Summer Fragrance(여름향기)>It is also the second location where Yoo Min-woo (played by Song Seung-heon) and Shim Hye-won (played by Son Ye-jin) appear in episode 3.'),(5010600,'<Goddess Advent(여신강림)>The 5th New Spring High School Festival Concert will be held in an outdoor theater.'),(5010601,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 13, Han Joon-woo (Oh Eui-sik) sees Lim Hee-kyung (Lim Se-mi) across the street and stands at the intersection in front of this park. He stops her from crossing the street and calls her, telling her they should take a break.'),(5010602,'<Goddess Airing(여신강림)>In episode 13, Lee Suho (Cha Eunwoo of ASTRO) runs along the park path to find Im Jugyeong (Moon Gayoung)'),(5010603,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 14, Lee Suho (played by Cha Eun-woo) and Lim Jugyeong (played by Moon Ga-young) draw each other during a date.'),(5010604,'<Goddess Advent(여신강림)>In episode 7, Im Jugyeong (played by Moon Ga-young) escapes a broken elevator and hastily runs to the restroom, only to find out that it\'s snowing outside the building.'),(5010605,'<Goddess\' Landing(여신강림)>In episode 14, Lee Su-ho (Cha Eun-woo) and Lim Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) meet at the bus terminal exit 4 before going on a date.'),(5010606,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 9, Cha Seo-hoo (Cha Eun-woo of ASTRO) believed he could openly date Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ga-young) here without running into his school friends, so he took her to the VIPS Pangyo branch located in this complex. In episode 10, Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ga-young) and Kang Su-jin (Park Yoo-na) met in front of this complex to go shopping together.'),(5010607,'<Goddess\' Secret(여신강림)> The place where Lee Su-ho (Cha Eun-woo) lives in the drama.'),(5010608,'<Goddess of Revenge(여신강림)>In episode 9, Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) and Lee Su-ho (played by Cha Eun-woo of ASTRO) are seen leaving this building.'),(5010609,'<Goddess\'s Moiety(여신강림)>In episode 15, Lee Suho (Cha Eun-woo) appears in the living room of the residence where he stays while in the United States.'),(5010610,'<Goddess\' Day(여신강림)>In episode 5, Im Hee-kyung (Im Se-mi) confesses to Han Joon-woo (Oh Yi-sik) at this location.'),(5010611,'<Goddess\'s Room(여신강림)>In episode 14, Lee Suho (Cha Eunwoo from ASTRO) and Lim Jugyeong (Moon Gayoung) came here for a date.'),(5010612,'<Goddess\'s Descendant(여신강림)>While knitting in episode 12, Lee Soo-ho (Cha Eun-woo from Astro) meets Han Seo-jun (Hwang In-yeob). They find out what is bothering Lim Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young). Feeling betrayed, Yoo Tae-hyun (Lee Il-jun) and Kim Chorong (Park Woo-jae) come here to find Soo-ho and Seo-jun, respectively.'),(5010613,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(여신강림)> This is the filming location of \"Yongpa High School\" where the character Lee Sung-yong (played by Shin Jae-hwi) attends in the drama.'),(5010614,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 16 of the final episode of True Beauty (tvN, 2020-21), Lim Ju-kyung (Moon Ka-young) and Han Seo-jun (Hwang In-yeop) come together at this cafe. In True Beauty, she apologizes to him for not responding to her feelings, and he, who has confused her, apologizes in turn.'),(5010615,'<Goddess Landing(여신강림)> This beauty salon is where Im Ju-kyung (Moon Ka-young) interns as \'Selena Beauty\' in the final episode 16.'),(5010616,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 9, Lee Soo-Ho (Cha Eun Woo from ASTRO) and Kang Soo-Jin (Park Yoo-Na) had lunch with their parents at this restaurant.'),(5010617,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 12, Im Joo Kyung (Moon Ga Young), Suho (Cha Eun Woo), Lim Hee Kyung (Im Se Mi), and Han Joon Woo (Oh Hee Joon) coincidentally meet at school and have a meal together while chatting.'),(5010618,'<The Penthouse(여신강림)>In episode 11, Lee Suho (Cha Eunwoo of ASTRO), Han Seojun (Hwang Inyeop), and Kang Chanhee (Chani of SF9) are shown outside a shop looking at items. Seoyeon chooses bracelets for all of them, telling Suho and Seojun that they must always wear them.'),(5010619,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>tvN 2020-21 True Beauty / In the final episode of True Beauty, Im Joo-kyeong (Moon Ga-young) meets Lee Su-ho (Cha Eun-woo of ASTRO). Nearby female students are jealous of her. She behaves excessively in front of Suho, who jokes with her. Later, she practices on him as a makeup model.'),(5010620,'<Goddess\'s Love(여신강림)>In \"The Secret of Angel,\" Lim Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) and Kang Soo-jin (Park Yoo-na) spend time at this place where Soo-jin apologizes to Ju-kyung.'),(5010621,'<Goddess\'s Gambit(여신강림)>In episode 10, Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ka-young) and Kang Soo-jin (Park Yoo-na) come shopping.'),(5010622,'<Goddess of the Moon(여신강림)>A cafe where the characters go on a blind date in episode 4. In episode 9, scenes show Lee Soo-ho (Cha Eunwoo from ASTRO) and Kang Soo-jin (Park Yuna) coming here after having lunch with their parents.'),(5010623,'<Goddess\' Beauty(여신강림)>In Episode 15, the students from Saebom High School gather at this restaurant for a meal. When Im Jugyeong (Moon Gayoung) passes out drunk, Han Seojun (Hwang Inyeop) appears and helps her.'),(5010624,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 12, Park Se-mi (played by Jung Hye-won) fails to make a call to Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ka-young) while walking with friends in this park.'),(5010625,'<She\'s Beautiful(여신강림)>In episode 14, Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ga-young) and Choi Su-ah (Kang Min-ah) wait for corn at a food cart in this park and flatter their favorite groups. They also witness Ju Hye-min (Oh Yu-jin) being harassed by the girls from Yongpa High School.'),(5010626,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>Lim Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) transfers to Saebom High School in season 1.'),(5010627,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 15, Han Seo-jun (played by Hwang In-youp) takes Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) on an ice skating date here. In the final episode (16), Ju-kyung and Lee Su-ho (played by Cha Eun-woo) watch Seo-jun’s debut performance at the Garden Stage.'),(5010629,'<Love Alarm(여신강림)>In episode 14, Lee Su-ho (Cha Eun-woo) and Hwang In-yeob (Han Seo-jun) come to the tower, with Su-ho requesting Seo-jun to sing as part of a bet he won between them. In episode 15, Im Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) heads to the \'highest place in Seoul\' to see snow falling for the first time. On her way back to find a dropped wallet, she runs into Lee Su-ho (Cha Eun-woo) who has returned from the USA.'),(5010630,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 6, Im Ju-kyung (Moon Ka-young) goes to a luxury jjimjilbang (Korean sauna) with her hungover sister. She receives a bribe by promising to eat spicy chicken feet and boiled eggs. Unfortunately for Ju-kyung, Seo Jun (Hwang In-yeop) and another classmate arrive as well. Worried they will recognize her without makeup, she tries everything to avoid them.'),(5010631,'<Goddess\'s Approach(여신강림)>In episode 7, Im Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) stops outside this flower shop on her way to the academy and admires Lee Su-ho\'s hairpin. (Cha Eun-woo) He gave it to her as a gift the night before.'),(5010632,'<Gyeonggi Academy of the Arts(여신강림)>In episode 6, Lim Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) is shown hiding in this alley next to the stairs after running away from bullies during her high school days.'),(5010633,'<Youth of May(여신강림)>In episode 4, Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ga-young) goes on a university date to watch a movie and comes to this movie theater. Suho (Cha Eun-woo from ASTRO) also comes to the same theater to get to know the two of them, but ends up mistaking them for a different couple. Outside the building, Suho learns that Joo-kyung lied about her university days where she was already meeting someone else.'),(5010634,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In episode 6, Han Seo-jun (played by Hwang In-yeop) is confronted by Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) and her former high school bullies in front of KFC Daehangno branch.'),(5010635,'<Goddess Descending(여신강림)>This is where Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) and her family stay.'),(5010636,'<Extraordinary You(여신강림)>In episode 9, Han Seojoon (played by Hwang Inyeop) parks his motorcycle on this street.'),(5010637,'<Extraordinary You(여신강림)>In episode 9, a scene was depicted where Lim Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) treats Han Seo-jun (Hwang In-yeop) to a meal after a photo shoot. As they are about to leave, Seo-jun suggests taking Ju-kyung home, but she doesn\'t notice as she is already on the phone with Lee Su-ho (Cha Eun-woo).'),(5010638,'<She\'s Pristine(여신강림)>In the first episode, Im Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) walks down this street towards her favorite comic book store.'),(5010639,'<True Beauty(여신강림)>In the first episode, Lee Suho (Cha Eunwoo of ASTRO) comes to this store to find a specific cartoon but gets annoyed when the first page is missing. Later in the broadcast, Im Jugyeong (Moon Gayoung) and Suho argue over a cartoon and end up falling over each other in this store.'),(5010640,'<Goddess of Fire(여신강림)>In episode 10, Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ga-young) and her father Lee Jae-pil (Park Ho-san) walk on this street after leaving Lee Su-ho\'s (ASTRO\'s Cha Eun-woo) apartment.'),(5010641,'<My ID is Gangnam Beauty(여신강림)>It is the school where Lim Joo Kyung (played by Moon Ga Young) transferred in Episode 1 and where Su Ho (played by Cha Eun Woo from Astro) is also located.'),(5010642,'<The Goddess of Revenge(여신강림)>In episode 2, Im Joo-kyung (Moon Ga-young) waits for the bus at the (fake) bus stop located on this street as she passes by it. The men on the bus (captivated by her appearance) focus their attention to help the driver stop the bus so she can still get on.'),(5010643,'<True Beauty(여신강림)> Kang Su-jin (Park Yuna) lives here. In episode 11, there is a scene where Im Ju-kyung (Moon Ga-young) comes here to inform Su-jin that Lee Soo-ho (Cha Eun-woo) is in love with her.'),(5010644,'<The Goddess\' Landing(여신강림)>In the second episode, Han Seo-jun (played by Hwang In-yeop) rides his motorcycle down this street and coincidentally runs into Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young).'),(5010645,'<Love Alarm(여신강림)>In the drama \"Love Alarm,\" Lim Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young) takes the cable car to N Seoul Tower to see the first snowfall.'),(5010646,'<The Secret Life of My Secretary(여신강림)>In episode 2, Han Seo-jun (played by Hwang In-yeop) encounters men chasing him in front of Seun Shopping Support Center. As he is cornered, with the help of Im Ju-kyung (played by Moon Ga-young), the police alarm goes off and the men flee. Ju-kyung, upon meeting Seo-jun, runs away in fear with a helmet on.'),(5010647,'<The Goddesses(여신강림)>In episode 1, Im Joo-kyeong, who is in despair, goes up to the rooftop of this building. The appearance of Lee Su-ho (played by Cha Eun-woo of ASTRO) who saves her is captured.'),(5010648,'<The Goddess Returns(여신강림)>In episode 13, Lee Joo-hun (Jung Jun-ho) talks on the phone with his son Lee Soo-ho (Cha Eun-woo from ASTRO) at the airport.'),(5010649,'<Goddess of River(여신강림)>In episodes 8 and 9, viewers can see the characters\' juniors from Saebom High School, their alma mater, doing fieldwork at this camping site.'),(5010650,'<FoxStar(여우각시별)>In episode 32, five friends Lee Soo-yeon (Lee Je-hoon), Han Yeorum (Chae Soo-bin), Oh Daegi (Kim Kyung-nam), Na Young-joo (Lee Soo-kyung), and Go Eun-seob (SF9 Rowoon) came to drink.'),(5010651,'<Fox Bride(여우각시별)>In \"Fox Bride\" young Lee Soo-yeon (Nam Dae-reum) waits for Seo In-woo (Lee Dong-gun) to tag along with her on this street.'),(5010652,'<Yeogak Sibyeol(여우각시별)>This is the place where a car accident occurred as a result of the young Soo-yeon (Nam Dareum) chasing behind the van that the young Seo In-woo (Yi Dong-geun) was sitting in during a flashback scene from episode 6 of \'Star\'s Echo\'.'),(5010653,'<Fox Guy Star(여우각시별)>In the third teaser, Lee Soo-yeon (played by Lee Je-hoon) passes by this restaurant.'),(5010654,'<Fox Pub(여우각시별)>The exterior of this place used to be a former bar called \'Fox Pub\' operated by Han Jae-young (Choi Won-young), the father of Han Ji-yeong (Chae Soo-bin). It has now been transformed into a restaurant, house, and clinic run by the Jang family. It was a secret place belonging to Lee Soo-yeon (Lee Je-hoon). It is also where a young man (Nam Da-reum) who used to frequent this place often with \'older brother\' Seo In-woo (Lee Dong-geon) saw Han Ji-yeong (Chae Soo-bin).'),(5010655,'<Yeou Gak Sibyeol(여우각시별)>This street is the path returning to Su-yeon\'s (Lee Jehoon) house in the 22nd Hour.'),(5010656,'<Fox Clock(여우각시별)>In the 7th flashback, after buying it, young Isuyeon (Nam Dareum), who is tied with chains to a wheelchair, wants to throw herself off the stairs next to this gallery.'),(5010657,'<Foxstar(여우각시별)>In episode 1, Han Yeo-reum (played by Chae Soo-bin) avoids the rain on her way to work and takes shelter at the entrance of this restaurant, where Lee Soo-yeon (played by Lee Jehoon) is already standing. She pours raindrops on him and apologizes as her amulet necklace (compass) touches his arm, saying \"He is just standing there.\" She sticks to him until he opens the umbrella and leaves.'),(5010658,'<Fox Stars(여우각시별)>It is where Lee Soo-yeon (Lee Jehoon) receives a call from his fellow airport colleagues and where Han Yeoreum (Chae Soobin) gets injured.'),(5010659,'<FoxStar(여우각시별)>Lee Su-yeon (Lee Jae-hoon) and Han Yeoreum (Chae Soo-bin) work at the Incheon Airport Service Team here.'),(5010660,'<TV series(여우각시별)>In episode 24, Lee Soo-yeon (Lee Je-hoon), Han Yeo-rum (Chae Soo-bin), Oh Dae-gi (Kim Kyung-nam), and Na Young-joo (Lee Soo-kyung) ride rail bikes here.'),(5010661,'<The Light in Your Eyes(여우야 뭐하니)>In episode 2, Go Byung-hee (Ko Hyun-jung) comes to the lighthouse and watches the sunset.'),(5010662,'<The Scent of a Woman(여인의 향기)>In episode 15, Kim Soon-jung (played by Kim Hye-ok), the mother of Lee Yeon-jae (played by Kim Sun-ah), receives flowers here during her date with Kim Sabu (played by Jung Dong-hwan).'),(5010663,'<Scent of a Woman(여인의 향기)>In episode 15, Lee Yeon-jae (played by Kim Sun-ah), her mother Kim Soon-jeong (played by Kim Hye-ok), and Kang Ji-wook (played by Lee Dong-wook) took family photos during their trip to Jeju.'),(5010664,'<The King\'s Garden(여인천하)>This attraction is featured in dramas and serves as the main residence of the king and queen, as well as the rear palace, Hyangwonjeong and Chuhanggyo. It includes places like Hamhwadang, Bihyeongak, and Gyeonghoeru.'),(5010665,'<Girl\'s Generation(여자아이들)>The filming location of the workshop featuring Girl\'s Generation from Queendom.'),(5010666,'<G-IDLE(여자아이들)>A place where Miyeon and Ryu Hyun-woo from G-Idle confirmed their feelings while practicing as adults'),(5010667,'<Girl\'s Generation(여자아이들)>A pub where Miyeon and Yeonseo from the band BoA meet at Replay.'),(5010668,'<G I-DLE(여자아이들)>The location where G I-DLE shot their photos for the July issue of TENS STAR.'),(5010669,'<GIDLE(여자아이들)>A restaurant where Miyeon and Yuqi from (G)I-DLE talk about in RePlay'),(5010670,'<Girls\' Generation(여자아이들)>A place where Yugi meets a giraffe on the runway and learns about breeding.'),(5010671,'<Girl\'s Day(여자아이들)>Where Miyeon from (G)I-DLE busked at Begin Again'),(5010672,'<Girl\'s Day(여자아이들)>The arboretum where the teaser for Girl\'s Day oh my god was filmed'),(5010673,'<G(I)-DLE(여자아이들)>G(I)-DLE\'s jacket photoshoot location'),(5010674,'<(G)I-DLE(여자아이들)>(G)I-DLE\'s Minnie visited a Thai restaurant with Lisa.'),(5010675,'<G-IDLE(여자아이들)>Where Yuqi learned latte art on the runway.'),(5010676,'<Girl\'s Day(여자아이들)>The temple visited by Jeon So-yeon on I Live Alone'),(5010677,'<G_I-DLE(여자아이들)>Cafe with a raccoon that pulls Su Jin\'s hair.'),(5010678,'<(Korean girl group) (G)I-DLE(여자아이들)>Cafe operated by Cube Entertainment.'),(5010679,'<Girl\'s Generation(여자아이들)>Workshop where Yuqi learned woodworking on a runway'),(5010680,'<G-IDLE(여자아이들)>G-IDLE\'s Uh-Oh music video shooting location'),(5010681,'<G_I-dle(여자아이들)> A workshop where we learn wool crafts on the runway.'),(5010682,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>\"Memoryia\" EP2 Rail Bike Filming Location'),(5010683,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Stayed at \'Memoria\' accommodation'),(5010684,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Sledding field featured in \"Memoria\"'),(5010685,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>\'Listen\' MV filming location'),(5010686,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>\"You and I\" MV filming location'),(5010687,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Filming location for \'You and I\' MV'),(5010688,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>The water park visited by the girlfriends on Battle Trip'),(5010689,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Girlfriend\'s favorite charcoal-grilled meat restaurant visited by girlfriend'),(5010690,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>The favorite intestines restaurant of the members of Girlfriend'),(5010691,'<GFriend(여자친구)>\"Today we begin\" MV shooting location'),(5010692,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Location for \"Time Flies\" MV filming'),(5010693,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Filming location for \"Summer Rain\" MV'),(5010694,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>\"Time for the Moon Night\" MV filming location'),(5010695,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>RAINBOW Photo Book Shooting Location'),(5010696,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>\'You, Me, and Us\' teaser photo shoot location'),(5010697,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>MV filming location when you listen closely'),(5010698,'<Girlfriend(여자친구)>Girlfriend visited Churros Cafe'),(5010699,'<Traveler(여행자)>Jinhee (Kim Saeron) leaves the airport to meet her American adoptive parents.'),(5010700,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 9, Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) and Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) drive on this road on their way to the beach.'),(5010701,'<Actress Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 6, Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) sat in front of the convenience store.'),(5010702,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 1, Lee Sung-kyung and Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) compete in this venue known as \'Olympia Swimming Stadium\'.'),(5010703,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>Part of this university appears as \'Haneol Sports University\'.'),(5010704,'<Star Athlete Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 12, Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) plans to visit this place with Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) for a \'date\'.'),(5010705,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>The last kiss scene from episode 16 is located in the track and field area, partially labeled as \'Hanol Sports University\'. The lake where Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) and Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) often meet is also here.'),(5010706,'<Weightlifting prodigy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>She trains here from the 15th episode. She joins the national team. In the 16th episode, Jun-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) sends Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) back to Taereung, portraying a difficult situation where the two lovers find it hard to part ways.'),(5010707,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>The entrance to this university is shown as \'Haneul Sports University\' It is also where the first meeting between Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) and Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) begins in episode 1.'),(5010708,'<Yakdo Yojung Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 10, Jung Joon-hyeong (played by Nam Joo-hyuk) meets his younger sister Jung Jae-i (played by Kim Jae-yoon) at this park and shares a heartwarming story.'),(5010709,'<Yakdo fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 3, Jung Joon-hyung (played by Nam Joo-hyuk) meets his ex-girlfriend Song Shi-ho (played by Kyung Soo-jin) at this bridge.'),(5010710,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 3, Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) suggests having dinner together at this place with Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) and his younger sister Jung Jae-yi (Lee Jae-yoon) who still thinks of Bok-joo as his own.'),(5010711,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 10, Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) wants to apologize to her crush Jung Joo-hyung (Lee Jae-yoon) and asks to meet him at this location. It is a completely painful moment for her, and she leaves as soon as possible.'),(5010712,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok Joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 11, Kim Bok Joo (Lee Sung Kyung) and Jung Joon Hyung (Nam Joo Hyuk) pass by this cafe while trying to take her home.'),(5010713,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 11, Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) and Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) confess about their part-time job and visit this place. Here, he confesses that she is actually his first love and proposes to date for a month to see if she likes him back.'),(5010714,'<Star Chef Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>A restaurant that appeared in the drama as \"Bok Chicken\". It is run by Kim Bok-joo\'s family.'),(5010715,'<Weightlifting fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In the drama, some parts of this university appear as the Sky Sports University. This is where Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) trains.'),(5010716,'<Actress Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 15, Kim Bok-joo (played by Lee Sung-kyung) comes to this place looking for Junhyung (played by Nam Joo-hyuk) as if she is crazy. She even thinks he might have committed suicide here.'),(5010717,'<Gyungbokjoo from Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>Kim Bok-joo (played by Lee Sung-kyung) comes to this restaurant with her colleagues in the 2nd episode.'),(5010718,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>The building houses \'JBN Clinic\' operated by Lee Jae-yoon, starring Kim Bok-joo as a weightlifter fairy in episode 3.'),(5010719,'<Strong Woman Do Bong Soon(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 9, Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) and Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk) have a drink.'),(5010720,'<Kim Bok-joo, the weightlifting fairy(역도요정 김복주)>This is where Go Ah-young (played by Yoo Da-in) lives in the drama. In episode 13, Jung Jae-yi (played by Lee Jae-yoon) who has been secretly in love for 4 years comes to her house to ask her out on a date. It\'s heartbreaking.'),(5010721,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 6 of Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo, Jung Jae-yi (Lee Jae-yoon) brings Kim Bok-joo (Lee Sung-kyung) home from a concert and stops in front of this museum.'),(5010722,'<Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 14, Jung Jae-i (Lee Jae-yoon) invited Go Ah-young (Yoo Da-in) to this restaurant.'),(5010723,'<Kim Bokju as The Weightlifter Fairy(역도요정 김복주)>In episode 2, Bokju (played by Lee Sung-kyung) falls for the kind man Jung Jae-ii (played by Lee Jae-woon). In episode 3, the two meet again here, and Bokju can\'t believe her eyes.'),(5010725,'<Actress Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>Incheon International Airport is featured in two important scenes. In episode 15, Jung Jun-hyung (played by Nam Joo-hyuk) sees off his mother, and in episode 16, he goes to pick up Kim Bok-joo (played by Lee Sung-kyung) who has returned from a competition in China. She ignores all the reporters there for her and runs directly to Jun-hyung. Incheon Airport provides the best hospitality ever.'),(5010726,'<Yekdo Fairy Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>It appears as the office of psychologist Jung Joon-hyung (Nam Joo-hyuk).'),(5010727,'<Star Athlete Kim Bok-joo(역도요정 김복주)>The place where Kim Bok-joo (played by Lee Sung-kyung) held a climbing competition in episode 3. Bok-joo started climbing the mountain passionately in order to win the prize for being the first person to reach the mountain to register for the weightlifting program led by Doctor Jae-yoon (played by Lee Jae-yoon), even leaving her friends behind. Unfortunately, Jung Joon-hyung (played by Nam Joo-hyuk) discovered her and followed her, teasing her along the way, but ultimately ended up carrying Bok-joo on his back to the finish line.'),(5010728,'<Yeonmo(연모)>This is a secret location of Prince Lee Hwi (Park Eun-bin) and the place where Jareun/Lee Hyun (Nam Yoon-soo) joins in episode 6.'),(5010729,'<Yeonmo(연모)>In the first episode, Jeong Jiwoon (Go Wooreum) waits for Danmi (Choi Myeongbin) on the wooden bridge as he arranged in the episode, but unfortunately, she does not come.'),(5010730,'<Yeonmo(연모)> This place appears as a royal palace. In episode 1, young Jeong Ji-woon (Ko Woo-rim) is brought here by his father Jeong Seok-jo (Bae Su-bin).'),(5010731,'<Yeonmo(연모)>A place filled with memories of the first meeting between two main characters reunited after a long time'),(5010732,'<Drama(연모)>In episode 3, Jung Ji-woon (played by Rowoon) and Crown Prince Lee Hwi (played by Park Eun-bin) eventually jump off the cliff into the river below to escape from the royal guards who have them cornered.'),(5010733,'<Yeonmo(연모)>This set represents part of a palace and city during the Joseon Dynasty, featured in episode 2.'),(5010734,'<Yeonmo(연모)>As seen in episodes 1 and 2, it appears that this place was a lodging for palace maids, as depicted by young Jung Ji-woon (Go Woo-rim) searching for young Dam Yi (Go Woo-rim).'),(5010735,'<Yeomo(연모)>After completing some tasks given to Crown Prince Yi Hwi (Park Eun-bin) in episode 4, Jung Ji-woon (Kim Seok-woo/SF9 Rowoon) washes himself in the river in front of this pavilion to prove his worthiness for the position of the Crown Prince\'s tutor.'),(5010736,'<Yeonmo(연모)>In episode 2, Yeong Jung Ji Woon (Go Woo Rim) follows his father, Jung Suk Jo (Bae Soo Bin), who was chasing after a young court lady in this countryside village.'),(5010737,'<Yeonmo(연모)>It is represented as a part of the palace.'),(5010738,'<Yeonmo(연모)>In the 4th round, Prince Yi Hwi (Park Eun-bin) and his attendants cross a bridge in this garden that looks like part of a royal palace. New guard Kim Ga-on (Choi Byung-chan) becomes discouraged when he does not follow the \'5-step back\' rule.'),(5010739,'<Yeonmo(연모)>In episode 2, young Damyi (Choi Myeong-bin) appears in the background when attending a royal ceremony as Crown Prince Lee Hwiseja.'),(5010740,'<Yeonmo(연모)>In episode 1, Yeongjeong (Go U-rim) follows Yeon Dam-ee (Choi Myung-bin) along the King\'s Bamboo Path to retrieve the clothes she washed.'),(5010741,'<Yeonmo(연모)>Some parts of this location are part of the royal palace, where a scene from episode 1 of \'The King\'s Affection\' shows young Jeong Ji-woon (Go Yoo-rim) chasing after young Dam Yi (Choi Myung-bin) in front of the dormitory building library.'),(5010742,'<Yeonmo(연모)> In episode 1, young Prince Yi Hwi (Choi Myeongbin) meets a young palace maid, Yi Hwi/Dami (Choi Myeongbin), who looks just like him for the first time. Then in episode 5, Dami is shown working as a private tutor in the palace for Yi Hwi (Park Eunbin) who has now become a crown prince and the adult Jung Jiwoon (Kim Seokwoo).'),(5010743,'<Marriage, Not Dating(연애 말고 결혼)>This is a store operated by Lee Hoon-dong (Heo Jeong-min).'),(5010744,'<Marriage, Not Dating(연애 말고 결혼)> In episode 1, Jang Mi (Han Groo) prepares a proposal for Heo Jeong Min (Yeon Woo Jin) in this hotel room. Gong Ki Tae (Yeon Woo Jin) gets tricked by Jeong Min and ends up going on a blind date at the hotel\'s restaurant/lobby at the same time.'),(5010745,'<Marriage, Not Dating(연애 말고 결혼)>This scene is where the character has to defend himself against the allegations of continued harassment involving claiming roses (one stalk) in episodes 1-2.'),(5010746,'<Love is bothersome but loneliness is worse!(연애는 귀찮지만 외로운 건 싫어!)>In episode 1, Lee Na-eun (played by Kim So-eun) walks down this alley after hastily leaving her apartment.'),(5010747,'<Love Catcher(연애미수)>Siwon (Yang Hye Ji) and Kang Parang (Son Sang Yeon) live here.'),(5010748,'<Love Forecast(연애미수)>In episode 4, Jeong Chae-so (Lee Seo-bin) meets Hee-soo (Park Ji-won) outside the restaurant.'),(5010749,'<Love Alarm(연애미수)>In episode 3, characters from the drama went to the National Palace Museum to volunteer for the day.'),(5010750,'<Love Generation(연애시대)>The swimming pool at this location appears as Yoo Eun-ho\'s (Son Ye-jin) workplace. Kim Mi-yeon (Yoona) meets and falls in love with Lee Dong-jin (Kam Woo-sung) here.'),(5010751,'<Love Generation(연애시대)>In the drama, Lee Dong-jin (Kam Woo-sung) and Jung Yoo-kyung (Moon Jung-hee) get married on a Han River cruise ship.'),(5010752,'<Love Affairs(연애시대)>Yoo Eun-ho (Son Ye-jin) and Lee Dong-jin (Kam Woo-sung) have a wedding.'),(5010753,'<The Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>The island where you can go on a workshop at The Discovery of Love'),(5010754,'<Discovery of Romance(연애의 발견)>In episode 15, Nam Ha-jin (Sung Joon) had dinner with Yeo Reum (Jung Yu-mi) at this restaurant.'),(5010755,'<Discovery of Romance(연애의 발견)>In the final episode, Kang Tae-ha (played by Eric) and Nam Ha-jin (played by Sung Joon) have a business meeting at this location. As Tae-ha (who is still wearing a couple ring) looks at Ha-jin from afar, he is reminded of a summer with Han Yeo-reum (played by Jung Yu-mi).'),(5010756,'<Finding Love(연애의 발견)>The place where Jeong Yu-mi and Moon Jeong-hyeok visited in Finding Love'),(5010757,'<Love Alert(연애의 발견)>This place appears as Kang Tae Ha\'s (Eric) interior design company.'),(5010758,'<Love Discovery(연애의 발견)>A pretty pension seen in Love Discovery'),(5010759,'<Love\'s Discovery(연애의 발견)>In Love\'s Discovery, Jung Yoo Mi and Moon Jung Hyuk cross a bridge.'),(5010760,'<Love Discovery(연애의 발견)>In episode 15, Do Jun-ho (Yoon Hyun-min) and Yoon Sol (Kim Seul-gi) meet at this park for their morning jog. Yoon Sol, who scolds Jun-ho until late, asks him to give three reasons why he likes her, and he responds. This interrogation ends with him capriciously kissing her, even though she didn\'t agree.'),(5010761,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>In episode 15, Nam Ha-jin (Sung Joon) sends Ahn Ah-rim (Yoon Jin-i) to the airport from this bus stop.'),(5010762,'<Love Discovery(연애의 발견)>This is the home of Han Yeo-reum (Jung Yu-mi) in the middle of summer.'),(5010763,'<Love\'s Discovery(연애의 발견)>The park where Jung Yoo-mi and Sung Joon went on a date in Love\'s Discovery.'),(5010764,'<Love Discovery(연애의 발견)>In episode 5, Han Yeo-reum (Jung Yoo-mi) and Nam Ha-jin (Seong Joon) part ways on this street after a slight argument following lunch with Kang Tae-ha (Eric).'),(5010765,'<Love\'s discovery(연애의 발견)>After breaking up with her ex-boyfriend Kang Tae-ha (Eric) while drunk, Han Yeorum (Jung Yumi) confesses her love to Nam Hajin (Sung Joon) in the summer, and later introduces him as her boyfriend to her friends.'),(5010766,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>In episode 10, Kang Tae-ha (Eric) who is angry and frustrated, visits Hongdae Baseball Battlecage with his close friend Yoon Jeong-mok (Lee Seung-joon). Finally, when Jeong-mok convinces Tae-ha to stop, the two have a sincere conversation on the street in front of them.'),(5010767,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>In episode 10, the angry Kang Tae-ha (Eric) visits Hongdae in Daejeon with his close friend Yoon Jung-mok (Lee Seung-joon). When Jung-mok finally convinces Tae-ha to stop, the two have a heartfelt conversation on the street right in front of that place.'),(5010768,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>In the first episode of Discovery of Love, the characters Han Yeoreum (played by Jung Yu-mi) and Kang Tae-ha (played by Eric) are shown visiting this place in winter. She gives him a pair of wooden couple rings as a gift.'),(5010769,'<Love\'s Discovery(연애의 발견)>In episode 1, Han Yerim (Jung Yumi) and Nam Hajin (Seong Jun) kiss for the first time right after their blind date at Peace Park.'),(5010770,'<Discovery of Romance(연애의 발견)>In episode 5, Kang Tae-ha (played by Eric) who is drunk, waits for Han Yeorum (played by Jung Yoo-mi) on the stairs leading to this street.'),(5010771,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>In episode 9, Han Yeorum (Jung Yumi) and Kang Tae-ha (Shinhwa\'s Eric) come to this mall to have lunch after meeting each other.'),(5010772,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>In episode 8, Ahn Ah-rim (played by Yoon Jin-yi) is riding a bicycle on this bridge.'),(5010773,'<Love\'s Discovery(연애의 발견)>In episode 1, An Arim (played by Yoon Jin-yi) passes by here. She stops to shop on her way to Nam Hajin\'s (played by Sung Jun) clinic.'),(5010774,'<Finding Love(연애의 발견)>You can see the scene where Ha Jin (Sung Joon) comes to visit Han Yeo-reum\'s (Jung Yu-mi) mother at his house.'),(5010775,'<Love\'s discovery(연애의 발견)>The path walked by Jung Yu-mi and Moon Jung-hyuk in Love\'s Discovery.'),(5010776,'<Discovery of Love(연애의 발견)>The restaurant visited by Lee Seung-joon and Jung Soo-young in Discovery of Love'),(5010777,'<Temperature of Love(연애의 온도)> 이동희(이민기)와 장영(김민희)이 이곳에서 화장을 한다.'),(5010778,'<Love\'s Trace(연애의 흔적)> Ju-young (also known as Yoo-young) eats lunch and walks along this wall. Then, she answers a phone call while standing on the crosswalk and sees her former boyfriend and current colleague, Jung Ji-seop (also known as Lee Sang-yeop), across the street.'),(5010779,'<Love\'s Traces(연애의 흔적)>Lee Joo-young (Lee Yoo-young) and Jung Ji-sub (Lee Sang-yeob) talk on the phone at opposite ends of this crosswalk and eventually meet in the middle.'),(5010780,'<Traces of Love(연애의 흔적)>In the drama, Jung Ji-seop (Lee Sang-yeop) stands near this cafe to answer a call from Ju-young (Lee Yoo-young), only to have his phone battery die.'),(5010781,'<Dating Agency: Cyrano(연애조작단: 시라노)>In episode 10, the Cyrano team is seen carrying out a mission at this location.'),(5010782,'<Dating Agency: Cyrano(연애조작단: 시라노)>The beautiful finale of episode 16 also unfolds here. Cha Seung-pyo (Lee Chun-hee) repeats every word of Seo Byung-hoon (Lee Jong-hyuk) to confess his love to Gong Min-young (Sooyoung) in a Cyrano-style.'),(5010783,'<Love Revolution(연애혁명)>In episode 1, Gong Yeo Woong (Park Ji Hoon) moves to this guesthouse.'),(5010784,'<Love Revolution(연애혁명)> It appears as Gong Yoo (Park Ji-hoon)\'s way to school.'),(5010785,'<Love Revolution(연애혁명)>In episode 9, Lee Kyung-young (Younghoon from The Boyz) is working part-time at this cafe.'),(5010786,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In episode 12, Han Yoo-kyung (played by Han Seung-yeon) bid her final farewell to Cha Hyeon-oh (played by Shin Hyun-soo) at this location.'),(5010787,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In episode 1, Han Yoo-kyung (played by Han Seung-yeon) looks at a photo taken while sitting on a bench in front of this building.'),(5010788,'<열두밤(열두밤)>In episode 11, Moon Hye-ran (played by Seo Eun-woo) meets her doctor friend Kim Jae-wook (played by Sung Chang-hoon) here and gets information about health.'),(5010789,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)> In episode 10, Cha Hyeon-oh (played by Shin Hyeon-soo) sighs alone at this place.'),(5010790,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In episode 2, Hanyukyung (Han Seung-yeon) gets off at this bus stop to take a sunrise photo at Dongjakdaegyo on the morning of the 12th. This scene is from the third day of a short 4-day stay in Seoul in 2010.'),(5010791,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>Meet Moon Hye-ran (Seo Eun-woo) at this restaurant.'),(5010792,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In the first episode, 2 million (played by Jang Hyun-sung) sits in the passenger seat with Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon) from Incheon Airport to Bukchon Hanok Village, crossing this bridge and heading to the guesthouse.'),(5010793,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In Twelve Nights, Lee Baek Man (played by Jang Hyun Sung) who contemplates about life visits Wonhyo Bridge and receives a phone call from Yoon Chan\'s (played by Hwang Jae Won) father.'),(5010794,'<YouTube(열두밤)>Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon) comes to this bridge twice in the early morning to film the sunrise.'),(5010795,'<열두밤(열두밤)>In episode 1, Hanyukyung (Han Seungyeon, formerly of Kara) came to drink with her friend Kang Chae.'),(5010796,'<Yeoldubam(열두밤)>This is where the guesthouse \'Jaehoe\' operated by Lee Baek-man (Jang Hyun-sung) appears. Almost always stays overnight here.'),(5010797,'<12 Nights(열두밤)>In the first day of her short stay, Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon) stops in front of this \'photo studio.\' In 2010, in Seoul, she decides to go inside and the store owner Lee Ri (Ye Soo-jung) tells her that she sees in Yoo-kyung the eye of a sharp photographer. Eventually, to her surprise, Yoo-kyung runs here and Cha Hyeon-oh (Shin Hyeon-soo) opens the door for her.'),(5010798,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>Cha Hyun-oh (Shin Hyun-soo) and Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon) meet at this park on the first day of their short 4-day stay in Seoul in 2010, and meet here for the second time. She falls asleep on a bench, leaning her head on his shoulder, and wakes up to him telling her a story about wanting to become a dancer for her.'),(5010799,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In a scene from the third day of his four-day stay in Seoul in 2010, Cha Hyun-oh (Shin Hyun-soo) meets his friend Park Seon-joo (Han Ji-eun) outside the ARKO Arts Theater to have a conversation and share at the rehearsal for the \'Seoul Contemporary Dance Company 17th Performance\'.'),(5010800,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In the drama \'The Last Empress,\' Cheon Da-yeong (Han Da-sol) is dropped off at a (fake) bus stop in front of this hotel by Yoon Chan (Kim Do-wan) who plays \'Jeolchin,\' and takes her to the airport.'),(5010801,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In the drama, Cha Hyun-oh (played by Shin Hyun-soo) and Han Yoo-kyung (played by Han Seung-yeon) walk alone on this street in episode 1.'),(5010802,'<열두밤 (Yoldu Bam)(열두밤)>In episodes 3 and 4, Han Yoo-kyung (played by Han Seung-yeon) and Cha Hyeon-oh (played by Shin Hyeon-soo) shared a kiss in front of the house at 12-7 on this alley on the last day of their short 4-day stay in Seoul in 2010, to avoid the rain on their way back to the guesthouse. They left Seoul on that very night.'),(5010803,'<Yeoldu Night(열두밤)>Cha Hyun-oh (Shin Hyun-soo) visits here on the first day of his short 4-day stay in Seoul in 2010.'),(5010804,'<Yoldu Bam(열두밤)>The small square at the northern end of this street is a thoroughfare. Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon, former member of Kara) passes through here when exploring Bukchon in episode 1, and also passes through here when looking for a homestay in episode 2.'),(5010805,'<Midnight(열두밤)>They visit to clear the air in Episode 3 and to finally end their triangular love (she thinks).'),(5010806,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>Located in Seoul, Gwanghwamun Square is a place where Cha Hyun-oh (Shin Hyun-soo) goes to see the sunrise early in the morning on the third day of his 4-day short stay in Seoul in 2010.'),(5010807,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>This store appeared in \'D&N\' and many characters pass through here. For example, in episode 1, Im Baekman (Jang Hyun Sung) came here to drink.'),(5010808,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)> In the first episode of Channel A\'s Twelve Nights, Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon, Kara) lives in this apartment with her friend Kang Chae-won (Lee Ye-eun).'),(5010809,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In episode 3, Han Yoo Kyung (Han Seung Yeon, formerly of Kara) and Cha Hyun Woo (Shin Hyun Soo) pass by this house. In 2010, Hyun Woo stopped by here in Seoul to improvise a dance choreography on his bike.'),(5010810,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>The drama depicts the scene where Han Yoo-kyung (played by Han Seungyeon, former member of the group Kara) is dropped off by Ha Myung (played by Jang Hyun Sung) at Exit 2 of this station in the first episode.'),(5010811,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In episode 4, Cha Hyun-oh (Shin Hyun-soo) talks to Park Sun-joo (Han Ji-eun) about Han Yoo-kyung (Han Seung-yeon) at this restaurant.'),(5010812,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In episode 2, this school appears as \'Aram Middle School\' where Hanyukyung (played by Han Seungyeon of Kara) and her friend Kang Chaewon (played by Lee Ye-eun) attend. Yoo Kyung decides to visit the school on the 3rd day of her short 4-day trip to Seoul.'),(5010813,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>Yoonchan (played by Kim Dowan) makes an appearance on episode 10 as the \"lucky dry cleaner.\" He gets his knitted sweater, which he received as a birthday present from his \"best friend\" Cheon Dayoung (played by Hana Sol), dry cleaned here.'),(5010814,'<Twelve Nights(열두밤)>In the first episode of Twelve Nights, the third fateful encounter between Cha Hyun-oh (played by Shin Hyun-soo) and Han Y