d assistant cartoonist, Im Dong-hee (Baek Seok-gwang), meet and share stories while sitting near the wetland area of the park [Ichon Hangang wetlands].'),(5010970,'<Today\'s webtoon(오늘의 웹툰)>In episode 2, Onmaeum (Kim Se-jung) and Gu Jun-yeong (Nam Yoon-soo) take the subway across this bridge on their way home, dreaming of a job that will allow them to go home while watching the sunset over the Han River. She tells him how her wishes have come true. He simply remarks on how simple her dream is.'),(5010971,'<Today\'s Webtoon(오늘의 웹툰)> It is where the cartoonist Na Kangnam (Im Cheolsu) from episode 7 goes to meet friends for drinks in the evening.'),(5010972,'<Today\'s Webtoon(오늘의 웹툰)>The main character, Onmaeum (Kim Sejeong), trains for jogging in this park every morning.'),(5010973,'<Orange Marmalade(오렌지 마말레이드)>In episode 3, Baek Ma-ri (played by Seolhyun) comes to the lighthouse first and realizes that she has feelings for Jung Jae-min (played by Yeo Jin-goo), and that she missed him. When Jae-min also appears and they find the key there, he says that their wishes have come true. They finally admit their feelings for each other and share a kiss.'),(5010974,'<Aurora Princess(오로라 공주)>In the drama \"5th Republic,\" Aurora (Jeon So-min) meets her brother Oh Geum-seong (Oh Chang-seok) here.'),(5010975,'<Princess Aurora(오로라 공주)>Queen Saimdang (Seo Woo-rim) lives in this mansion.'),(5010976,'<Aurora Princess(오로라 공주)>Aurora (Jeon So-min) visits for shopping in Episode 2.'),(5010977,'<Aurora Princess(오로라 공주)> Park Joo-ri (Shin Joo-ah) and Hwangmama (Son Chang-min) have a meal together in episode 5.'),(5010978,'<Oh My Girl(오마이걸)>The restaurant where the final supper was held by Miracle Expedition.'),(5010979,'<Oh My Girl(오마이걸)>The place where Oh My Girl rode the Sea Train during the Miracle Expedition'),(5010980,'<Oh My Girl(오마이걸)>The sea that was the final destination in Miracle Expedition.'),(5010981,'<Oh My Girl(오마이걸)>Location of \"Oh My Girl Miracle Expedition\" filming'),