scuss a lawsuit involving her and her husband.'),(5011122,'<Why Visit Osuje(왜 오수재인가)>In a scene of the first episode, Osuje (Seo Hyun-jin) meets a witness for the lawsuit at this cafe.'),(5011123,'<Why is Osujeon?(왜 오수재인가)> In episode 1, Osujeon (played by Seo Hyun-jin) is defending a lawsuit here.'),(5011124,'<Why Go to Osu?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 1, Osu (played by Seo Hyun-jin) is demoted at TK Law Firm and is appointed as a law school professor at this university. Here, she reunites with Gong Chan (played by Hwang In-youp) as her disciple.'),(5011125,'<Why are you arguing?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 8, Choi Ju-wan (Ji Seung-hyun) is depicted drinking with two friends and arguing.'),(5011126,'<Why Visit Osujae(왜 오수재인가)>There is a hostess bar operated by Hong Seok-pal (Lee Cheol-min) in this building.'),(5011127,'<Why choose Imperial Palace?(왜 오수재인가)>In the drama, the first episode of \'Korea Association of Women Lawyers General Meeting\' was held at this hotel\'s Selena Wedding Hall.'),(5011128,'<Why Go to Osu Garden(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 2, Osu (Seo Hyun-jin) plans to meet the President of TK Law Firm, Choi Taek-guk (Heo Joon-ho), at Flute Room (To Room).'),(5011129,'<Why Go to Sujai?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 2, it appears as \'HanSu Group\' operated by Han Sung-beom (Lee Geun-young).'),(5011130,'<Why Visit Oh Soo?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 7, Oh Soo (Seo Hyun-jin) meets TK Law Firm CEO Choi Tae-gook (Heo Joon-ho) at this restaurant. He tests her with questions to find out more about her next move.'),(5011131,'<Why should Osu go?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 5, Osu Jae (Seo Hyun-jin) leaves this airport for New York, hoping for a child with Choi Ju-wan (Ji Seung-hyun).'),(5011132,'<Why did he come to Osujae(왜 오수재인가)>Han Gi-taek (Jeon Jae-hong) visited the park with his daughters in the morning after drinking at the 2022 MIE Festival. There, Osujae (Seo Hyun-jin) approaches him and proposes a deal.'),(5011133,'<Why visit Grand Walkerhill Seoul?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 2, Oh Soo-jae (Seo Hyun-jin) meets her boss and TK Law Firm Chairman Choi Tae-gook (Heo Joon-ho) at the lobby cafe.'),(5011134,'<Why Oh Soo is Here(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 10, Baek Jin-ki (Kim Chang-wan) the dean of Sejong University Law School, is having a business meeting at this restaurant.'),(5011135,'<Why Does Osu Live?(왜 오수재인가)>In the rooftop house, Gongchan (played by Hwang In-yeop) and his stepmother Ji Soon-ok (played by Bae Hae-sun) are seen in episode 6, with her leaving food outside the apartment door following him.'),(5011136,'<Why go to Osujai?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 6, Gungchan\'s (Hwang In-yeop) mother Jisunok (Bae Hae-sun) can be seen leaving food outside the apartment door following Gungchan (Hwang In-yeop) home.'),(5011137,'<Why visit the National Cemetery(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 2, lawmaker Lee In-soo (played by Cho Yeong-jin) visits the National Cemetery as the first stop of his official schedule to receive an envelope. He receives it before leaving the cemetery.'),(5011138,'<Why are you going to Osujae?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 4, Choi Yoon-sang (played by Bae In-hyuk) drinks at this restaurant with his TK Law Firm secretary, Jeon Jin-gi (played by Jeon Jin-ki). He checks whether his father and brother were involved in the \"An Kang-won Incident.\"'),(5011139,'<Why visit Osoojae(왜 오수재인가)> The exterior of this tower appears as the TK Law Firm building operated by Choi Taekook (Heo Joon-ho) in the drama.'),(5011140,'<Why Osujae goes(왜 오수재인가)>Osujae (Seo Hyun-jin) and Gong Chan (Hwang In-yeop)’s regular place. In episode 4, Sujae, who is drunk, overhears Gong Chan telling him that he likes her.'),(5011141,'<Why Is Osoojae Important?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 8, Ha Il-goo (Jeon Jin-ki), the head of the TK law firm\'s secretariat, meets Hong Seok-pal (Lee Cheol-min) here and gets him drunk.'),(5011142,'<Why Visit Osuje?(왜 오수재인가)>In episode 6, Osuje (played by Seo Hyun-jin) finishes a hard day of work and sits in front of the newly opened supermarket on this street on her way home.'),(5011143,'<Why Vis