 Na-young) and Yuri-a (Minseo/Kim Minseo). In episode 5, he has dinner at this restaurant and receives his first paycheck in 3 years.'),(5011576,'<This is the first time this is happening(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 14, Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) purchases \"Nothing changes\" by Park Joon (Park Joon). Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) comes later looking for the same book and is told that the last copy has been sold.'),(5011578,'<This is my first time here(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 3, Yoon Ji-ho (played by Jung So-min) is brought to this restaurant by writer Hwang.'),(5011579,'<This is the first life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 16, Horang (played by Kim Gaeun) and Wonseok (played by Kim Minseok) start planning their future together after a tearful reunion and Wonseok\'s proposal.'),(5011580,'<First meeting this time(이번 생은 처음이라)>Ho-rang (Kim Ga-eun) works at the restaurant in this shopping complex. In episode 4, Ji-ho (Jeong So-min) decides to stay in Seoul and surprises Ho-rang by showing up at the restaurant. They then have a conversation on a bench above ground. This place also appears in different scenes in episodes 1, 2, 13, 14, and 15.'),(5011581,'<This Life Is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)>This bus stop is where Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) spontaneously kissed Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) for the first time before getting off the bus.'),(5011582,'<This Moment is First(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episodes 13 and 14, Nam Se-hee (played by Lee Min-ki) meets his ex-girlfriend Go Jung-min (played by Lee Chung-ah) in front of this church for the first time in 12 years. She is soon to become the superior of Ji-ho (played by Jung So-min), who witnesses the entire situation.'),(5011583,'<This Life is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 15, Ho-rang (played by Kim Ga-eun) gets angry with Won-seok (played by Kim Min-seok) in a flashback scene.'),(5011584,'<This time it\'s the first(이번 생은 처음이라)>This is a furniture store, selling Dream Sofas by Yang Horang (Kim Gaeun).'),(5011585,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 1, there is a scene where Su-hee (played by Yoon So-hee) demands a divorce from her husband Oscar (played by Yoon Doo-joon) at this location. He grabs her wrist and leans towards her. Instead of kissing his wife, he reaches out for a packet of red ginseng on the bookshelf.'),(5011586,'<This life is the first(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episodes 10 and 12, this place is where Woo Jisoo (Lee Som) and Ma Sang-gu (Park Byung Eun) first met in room 304 of this hotel.'),(5011587,'<This is My First Life(이번 생은 처음이라)>Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) and Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) get married in episode 1 (starting from episode 2 and looking back in episode 9). As seen in episode 9, Yeon Bok-nam (Kim Min-goo) suggested taking wedding photos while working part-time at the wedding.'),(5011588,'<This is my first life(이번 생은 처음이라)>Exit at the entrance of \'Seoul Eumdae\' on 2 occasions.'),(5011589,'<This is my first life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 13, Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) and Woo Soo-ji (Lee Soo-min) are seen discussing about \'room nineteen\' at this university\'s lake [Carp room].'),(5011590,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>Upon learning that Horang (Kim Gaeun) is filing for marriage in episode 16, Wonseok (Kim Minseok) rushes to this cafe.'),(5011591,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 16, Park Byung-eun and Manager Kim have a conversation outside the building. Later, Lee Som surprises her former manager Kim Sang-gu by riding a motorcycle and giving him a ride.'),(5011592,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>They appeared backwards in the 16th and final scene. Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min), Nam Se-hee (Kim Min-ki), Woo Su-ji (Lee Soo-min), Ma Sang-gu (Park Byung-eun), Sim Won-seok (Kim Min-seok), and Yang Ho-rang (Kim Ga-eun) run together to catch the bus.'),(5011593,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 12, Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) and Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) walk along this street for a date.'),(5011594,'<This Life is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 14, Yongseok PD and Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) meet here.'),(5011595,'<This is the first time this place has appeared(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 12, Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) and Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) appeared here as a dating spot.'),(5011596,'<This Life is the First(이번 생은 처음이라)>It is a place where Shim Won-seok (played by Kim Min-seok) tells Yoon Bo-mi that he cannot accept the proposal because he still has too much attachment to Yang Ho-rang (played by Kim Ga-eun) in episode 16.'),(5011597,'<For the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 8, Marsagu (Park Byung-eun) feels excited when Jiwoo (Lee Som) shows interest in him. He is seen greeting everyone he meets in this park and dancing with passersby.'),(5011598,'<This Time It\'s Your First Time(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 6, after attending Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) and Nam Se-hee (Kim Min-ki)\'s wedding, Woo Soo-ji (Lee Soo-mi) and Yang Ho-rang (Kim Ga-eun) come together. Sang-gu, who is chatting while drinking, is said to have pulled out a sofa for Ho-rang that Won-seok bought for her, causing her anger. She storms out of the restaurant in anger and disappointment with Won-seok behind her, ultimately expressing her desire to get married and wanting him to propose to her.'),(5011599,'<This Life is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)>In the second episode, Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) passes by this store. Ji-ho is shocked when her colleague director (Kim Wook) tries to force her. She stops on the street, looks at her reflection in the store window, and wonders who she should call to talk about it. This scene takes place before entering Jahamun Tunnel and walking down for a while.'),(5011600,'<This Life is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)> This Life is Our First, also known as YOLO Cafe, is a place where Yeon Bok-nam (Kim Min-gu) and his father run a cafe where Ji-ho (Jung So-min) gets a job in episode 6. It is also the place where Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) attempts a backflip to avoid falling off Bok-nam\'s expensive motorcycle in episode 8.'),(5011601,'<This Life is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)>Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) and her good friend Woo Soo-ji (Lee Soom) meet here after finding out that Soo-ji entered into a contract marriage with Ji-ho.'),(5011602,'<This Life Is Our First(이번 생은 처음이라)>In the first episode, Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) and his colleagues come for a drink after work.'),(5011603,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 13, this is where Suji (Lee Soom) and Masanggu (Park Byung Eun) came to resolve misunderstandings.'),(5011604,'<This Life is the First Time(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 7, Yoon Ji-ho\'s coworker Yeon Bok-nam picks her up on his motorcycle after work to show her a beautiful view, but she clearly tells him that she has no feelings for him. The next evening (episode 8), Nam Se-hee, who thinks Bok-nam has bad intentions, comes to find a safe Ji-ho.'),(5011605,'<This is your first time(이번 생은 처음이라)>This is where Sehee (Kim Mingi) and Jiho (Jeong Somin) visited after their date at the Gyeongui Line Forest Park in episode 12.'),(5011606,'<This is the first time in this life(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 9, Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) runs from this street to Naksan Park to find Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min), and then it is the place where he walks hand in hand with his wife in Naksan Park.'),(5011607,'<This is my first time(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 2, Jihoo (played by Jung So-min) escapes from her temporary lodging after feeling disheartened when Director Gae (played by Kim Wook) tries to force himself on her while drunk. She enters this tunnel through the stairs used by the staff and walks alone through the hallway at midnight.'),(5011608,'<First Time in My Life(이번 생은 처음이라)>This house appears as a guesthouse where Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) stays after leaving Nam Se-hee\'s (Lee Min-ki) apartment in episode 16.'),(5011609,'<This is the First Life(이번 생은 처음이라)>It is a rooftop house of Horang (Kim Gaeun) and Wonseok (Kim Minseok). After they break up, Horang moves out and Wonseok ends up living alone in that house.'),(5011610,'<This life is the first for Kim Gaeun (Yang Hora)(이번 생은 처음이라)>Yang Hora (Kim Gaeun) comes out of the house where she lived with Sim Wonseok (Kim Minseok)'),(5011611,'<This is the first time I\'ve been to this place(이번 생은 처음이라)>In episode 11, while Nam Se-hee (Lee Min-ki) makes kimchi with his family, Yoon Ji-ho (Jung So-min) goes into the village to buy medicine for him. Reading the poem \"Guest\" from Jung Hyun-jong\'s poetry collection \'Island\', she stops and sits on this embankment for a moment. Se-hee, who was looking for her, finds her here and they have a conversation, where he tells her that the \'kiss\' that happened at Pangyo Seven Venture Valley bus stop was not real. In episode 12, Se-hee shows her what a real kiss is until they are interrupted by a phone call.'),(5011612,'<Check out events(이벤트를 확인하세요)>In episode 1, Go Ha-song (played by Bang Min-ah) meets other competition winners at this airport before flying to Jeju.'),(5011613,'<Check out the event(이벤트를 확인하세요)>In Episode 1, Ha-song (played by Bang Min-ah) flies to this airport with other competition winners.'),(5011614,'<The Farewell(이별이 떠났다)> Han Sang-jin (played by Lee Sang-jae) and Jeong Su-cheol (played by Jeong Woong-in) drink and have heartfelt conversations at this restaurant.'),(5011615,'<Eve(이브)>It appears as Riyan Kindergarten. The scene depicted Israel (Seo Ye-ji) sending her daughter Boram (Kim Si-woo) on the first day of school.'),(5011616,'<Eve(이브)>In episode 1, Seo Eun-pyeong (Lee Sang-yeob) opens a book here during the book concert.'),(5011617,'<Eve(이브)>In Episode 1, viewers can see Seo Eun-pyeong (played by Lee Sang-yeop) visiting the Blue House to have a direct conversation with the President.'),(5011618,'<Eve(이브)>The after party for the 1st semester Yanu Kindergarten entrance ceremony will be held here.'),(5011620,'<Eve(이브)>In episode 1, in 2009, Seo Eun-pyeong (Lee Sang-yeob) encounters a young girl, Lee Ra-eol (Kim Ji-an), who is waiting for a flight to the United States at the airport.'),(5011621,'<Everything about Eve(이브의 모든것)>Jin Sun-mi (Chae-rim), Heo Young-mi (Kim So-yeon), and Jo Cho-jae (Kim Hyo-jin) start their studies at this university.'),(5011622,'<Everything about Eve(이브의 모든것)>Yoo Ju-hee (Kim Jung-eun) from MBS News Today filmed a news report in this park.'),(5011623,'<Isa Bae(이사배)>The music video for \'E.N.C (Feat. Kisum)\' by Youtuber Isa Bae was filmed here.'),(5011624,'<Weird Lawyer Woo Young Woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>Retro feeling pub where circle and Woo Young Woo meet'),(5011625,'<The Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>In episode 13, the Hana Bada lawyer team visits this temple at the invitation of the chief monk. Christian believer Kwon Min-woo (played by Joo Jong-hyuk) skips the harsh 158-fold prayer while the other team members follow the ritual.'),(5011626,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>A place with a big oak tree in Sodeok-dong'),(5011627,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>In front of this building, lawyer Tae-su Mi (played by Jin Kyung) holds a press conference, announcing his withdrawal from the candidacy for minister, and declares that he will dedicate himself to being a full-time mom.'),(5011628,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>In episode 10, Kwon Min-woo (played by Joo Jong-hyuk) meets Taesumi (played by Jin Kyung) and Kim Sunbae at this restaurant to confirm his suspicion that Taesumi is connected to his colleague Woo Young-woo (played by Park Eun-bin).'),(5011629,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>In the second episode, lawyer Choi Soo-yeon (Ha Yoon-kyung) visits this hotel to use the women\'s restroom while investigating the wedding dress case with Lee Jun-ho (Kang Tae-oh).'),(5011630,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young Woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>In episode 11 of the drama \"Strange Lawyer,\" Soo Yeon (played by Ha Yoon Kyung) goes on a dinner date with Jong Kwon (played by Jung Wook Jin) at this restaurant. After his ex-girlfriend (played by Jung Ga Hee) excuses herself to go to the restroom, Jong Kwon reveals his true nature and motives to Soo Yeon. Angered, Soo Yeon storms out of the restaurant with the most expensive bottle of alcohol.'),(5011631,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>In episode 10 of the drama \"Strange Lawyer\", Woo Young-woo (played by Park Eun-bin) and Lee Joon-ho (played by Kang Tae-oh) walk down this alleyway, where he tells her, \"I heard that couples who walk along Deoksugung Stone Wall Path will break up.\" In the past, the Seoul Family Court and the Supreme Court were located at the northern end of Deoksugung Stone Wall Path. This saying originated from the fact that people had to walk down this path to get divorced.'),(5011632,'<Strange Lawyer Woo Young-woo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>The place where Young-woo and Jun-ho went to see the sunset in episode 4'),(5011633,'<Strange Lawyer Wooyoungwoo(이상한 변호사 우영우)>Filming location of 4th episode of Nakjo Village'),(5011634,'<Seulbi(이슬비)>After telling Sun Dong-sik (Choi Jung-woo) that she won\'t be fooled, Seulbi (Girls\' Generation\'s Seohyun) meets Sun Min-jun (Kang Hoon) and Gong Soo-gwang (Nainwoo) at a cafe in Oriole.'),(5011635,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)> Lee Seung-gi visited this famous spicy soup restaurant featured on \"1 Night 2 Days\"'),(5011636,'<Lee Seung Gi(이승기)>Lee Seung Gi praised East River as a beautiful scenic spot'),(5011637,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>Popular restaurant visited by Lee Seung-gi and Lee Dae-ho on 1 Night 2 Days'),(5011638,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>Lee Seung-gi visited a snack bar on 1 Night 2 Days'),(5011639,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>Popular tteokbokki restaurant visited by Lee Seung-gi'),(5011640,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>Photo spot for Lee Seung-gi angel mural certification shot'),(5011641,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>The restaurant that Lee Seung-gi and Yoon Yeo-jung visited, Jipsabu Ilche'),(5011642,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>1 Night 2 Days Lee Seung-gi Bamboo Garden with a pond'),(5011643,'<Lee Seunggi(이승기)>A famous octopus restaurant visited by the butler Lee Seunggi'),(5011644,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>Popular restaurant for white lily porridge visited by Lee Seung-gi'),(5011645,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>Lee Seung-gi falls in love with the scenic Eongddo Waterfall'),(5011646,'<Lee Seung-gi(이승기)>1 Night 2 Days Lee Seung-gi made a snowman at the ranch'),(5011647,'<Neighborhood Flower Boy(이웃집 꽃미남)>A place where in episode 4, Enrique (Yoon Shi-yoon) and Go Dok-mi (Park Shin-hye) have a beach date. Enrique builds a giant sandcastle while Dok-mi simply gazes out at the sea.'),(5011648,'<네이버 TV(이웃집 꽃미남)>In season 2, Mu-hak becomes more convinced that Kim Dal-ri (played by Park Gyu-young) deceived him, so he returns to find her at this place.'),(5011649,'<Neighbor Flower Boy(이웃집 꽃미남)>The apartment where Kim Enrich (Yoon Shi-yoon) is staying and Han Tae-joon (Kim Jeong-san) is staying.'),(5011650,'< Neighbor Flower Boy(이웃집 꽃미남)>The series depicts the lives of Go Dok-mi (Park Shin-hye) and Oh Jin-rok (Kim Ji-hoon) in \"Ocean Village\".'),(5011651,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 6, Jang Geun-won (Ahn Bo-hyun) had a blind date with Seo Jeong-in (Yoo Jae-myung) at this restaurant.'),(5011652,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 14, Kang Min-jung (Kim Hye-eun) and Choi Seo-joon (Kim Da-mi) meet investors here.'),(5011653,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>Oh Soo-ah (Nara) works at a convenience store after school, and it is the place Park Saeroyi\'s (Park Seo-joon) father, Park Sung-yeol (Son Hyun-joo), visits to find her in the first episode after quitting his job. Despite this, he assures her that he will continue to support her college tuition, and Oh Soo-ah promises to repay him three times. In the final episode, episode 16\'s epilogue, a scene is depicted where Park Saeroyi and Jo Yi-seo (Kim Dami) watch the sunset and kiss by the lake behind the sculpture \'Human Times\'.'),(5011654,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 15, Park Saeroy (played by Park Seo-joon) who fell into a coma at the hospital meets his father, Park Sung-yeol (played by Son Hyun-joo), in a sort of daydream on the park\'s wooden bridge.'),(5011655,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 5, after work, Jo Yi-seo (played by Kim Da-mi), Jang Geun-soo (played by Kim Dong-hee), and Choi Seung-kwon (played by Ryu Kyung-soo) wait for the bus here.'),(5011656,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 1, Osua (played by Kwon Nara) runs along this street for a college entrance interview while Park Saeroyi (Park Seo-joon) is present in the morning. She realizes she had to run because she forgot her ID at home while on the bus.'),(5011657,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>Location of Father\'s Accident site'),(5011658,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>Park Saeroy\'s father worked at a restaurant in Jangga.'),(5011659,'<Itaewon Cloth(이태원 클라쓰)>Cafe where Joy and Jang Geun-won met'),(5011660,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In the drama, this school was featured as \'Yonggak High School\' where one of the main characters, Joy Seo (played by Kim Da-mi), attended. Reference to episode 3.'),(5011661,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>This restaurant appears as \'Queens Palace,\' operated by Oh Soo-ah (Kwon Nara) who quits her job as a high-ranking official.'),(5011662,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 15, Park Saeroyi (played by Park Seo Joon) wakes up at this hospital and gets into Choi Seungkwon\'s (played by Yoo Kyung Soo) car to save Jo Yi Seo (played by Kim Dami).'),(5011663,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In the first episode, the exterior of this place is depicted as the residence of the CEO of Jangga Pub, Jang Dae-hee (played by Yoo Jae-myung).'),(5011664,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In this university, Park Sae-roy (Park Seo-jun) appears as \'Kwangjin University\' where Oh Soo-ah (Kwon Nara) takes an entrance exam in the law school building while waiting outside.'),(5011665,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>Jang Geun-won (played by Ahn Bo-hyun) rushes out of the car at the signal light to understand and go to the courthouse, where his father\'s secretary, Kim Chi (played by Hong Seo-joon), takes him to be sentenced in Itaewon Class Episode 10.'),(5011666,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>It appears as Itaewon Branch of Jangga Po Cha. In episode 6, O Su-a (Nara Kwon) approaches Park Sae-ro-yi (Seo Jun Park) on the street and passes by that place.'),(5011667,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>Joy (Kim Da-mi) and Ohsu-ah (Kwon Nara) had a serious conversation about Park Saeroy (Park Seo-joon) in the winter garden of this cafe'),(5011668,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>A pub prepared by a retired dad and a newcomer'),(5011669,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 9, Chairman Jang Dae-hee (played by Yoo Jae-myung) invites Jo Yi-seo (played by Kim Da-mi) to dinner at this restaurant and proposes to her.'),(5011670,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 4, Park Saeroyi (Park Seo-joon), Jo Yi-seo (Kim Da-mi), and Oh Soo-ah (Kwon Nara) discuss their strategy for promoting Danbam at this cafe, but in reality, it is an uncomfortable and tense situation for all parties involved.'),(5011671,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 6, Park Saeroyi (Park Seo-joon) is talking to Joysa (Kim Da-mi) on the phone, while Oh Soo-ah (Kwon Nara) approaches him at the bar. She tells him that her bar will be introduced as the \'best pub.\''),(5011672,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In Itaewon Class, Park Saeroyi (played by Park Seo-joon) and his father, Park Sung-yeol (played by Son Hyun-joo), found this restaurant after Saeroyi dropped out of school and his father quit his job.'),(5011673,'<Itaewon Craigslist(이태원 클라쓰)>A rest area where people throw coins with their worries'),(5011674,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In this bus stop, Park Saeroy (played by Park Seo-joon) chases Oh Soo-ah (played by Kwon Nara). In episode 6, Kwon Nara learns from Choi Soo-ah (played by Kim Da-mi) that the person who reported her bar to the police was not Soo-ah.'),(5011675,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In Episode 7, Park Saeroyi (Park Seo-joon) and his right-hand man Oh Hozin (David Lee) meet Kang Min-jung (Kim Hye-eun) here to join the camp together.'),(5011676,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 6, Park Saeroyi (Park Seo-joon) dines with his father Park Sung-joon (Yoo Jae-myung) at this restaurant.'),(5011677,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>People crossed this overpass regularly starting from the second episode. In the second episode, Oh Soo-ah (played by Kwon Nara) walks the path leading to Itaewon. In the third episode, Choi Seo (played by Kim Da Mi) and Jang Geun Soo (played by Kim Dong Hee) also appear riding a scooter. And in the early part of the fourth episode, Park Saeroyi (played by Park Seo Joon) makes an appearance. In the sixth episode, Saeroyi coincidentally meets Yi Seo on the bridge.'),(5011678,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 3, Jo Yi-seo (played by Kim Da-mi) and Jang Geun-soo (played by Kim Dong-hee) make a grand entrance riding scooters.'),(5011679,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>It appears as \'Marudang Restaurant,\' located on the same street as Park Saeroyi (played by Park Seo-joon)\'s second restaurant from episode 9.'),(5011680,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>It appears as \'Jojo\'s House\', located on the same street as Park Saeroyi (Park Seo-joon)\'s second restaurant in Episode 9.'),(5011681,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 2, when Park Saeroy (Park Seo-jun) suggests walking her home, she offers to stay overnight which he declines.'),(5011682,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>A reading room where Jo Yi-seo used to study'),(5011683,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 10, Jang Geun-soo (played by Kim Dong-hee) struggles at this stairs as he competes with Jo Yi-seo (played by Kim Da-mi) to become the future representatives of Jangga.'),(5011684,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>The restaurant where Park Saeroy (Park Seo-joon) appears as \'Danbam\' in episode 8, newly opened under this name.'),(5011685,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>The main backdrop of Itaewon Class'),(5011686,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>A place where Park Saeroyi coincidentally meets Oh Soo-ah'),(5011687,'<Itaewon Class(이태원 클라쓰)>In episode 4, Park Sa