o drives her drunk boss home after a company dinner.'),(5011820,'<Between Two Worlds(일로 만난 사이)>Korea\'s Uyuni Desert / Variety show \"Between Two Worlds\"'),(5011821,'<Charming Love(일리있는 사랑)>In episode 13, Jang Hui-tae (Um Tae-woong) and Kim Il-ri (Lee Si-young) come here. Ilsan still wonders if Il-ri loves herself and conveys her feelings.'),(5011822,'<Instagram: @beautiful_love(일리있는 사랑)>In the drama \"Beautiful Love Wonderful Life,\" the character Kim Il-ri (Kim Hye-yoon) works at a cafe run by a friend of Kim Il-ri (Ji Se-yeong) from Ili in episode 13.'),(5011823,'<True Love(일리있는 사랑)>In episode 6, Kim Jun (played by Lee Soo-hyuk) comes to the food truck to eat, and Kim Ilri (played by Lee Si-young) joins him.'),(5011824,'<The Joy and Sadness of One(일의 기쁨과 슬픔)> As they walk together on the bridge, Lee Ji-hye (Kang Mal-geum) suggests to Kim Anna (Go Won-hee) that they should walk hand in hand. However, they laugh at the strange situation when they realize that the \"overpass\" only moves from one end of the bridge to the other, they pause for a moment to appreciate the scenery of the park below the bridge.'),(5011825,'<The Joys and Sorrows of Work(일의 기쁨과 슬픔)>This building is where the office of the online retail platform \'Woodong Market,\' where Kim Anna (played by Ko Won-hee) works, is located.'),(5011826,'<Joy and Sadness of a Day(일의 기쁨과 슬픔)>Kim Anna (Go Won-hee) came here with her colleague to buy an iced Americano.'),(5011827,'<Iljimae(일지매)>A place preserving the architectural style of the Joseon Dynasty'),(5011828,'<Iljimae(일지매)>The place where the filming of a village affected by a contagious disease in the drama took place'),(5011829,'<The Book of the Three Hans(일지매)>The main filming location for the historical drama The Book of the Three Hans'),(5011830,'<Iljimae(일지매)>A place where you can feel the energy of Goguryeo'),(5011831,'<iljimae(일지매)>The place where actor Lee Jun-ki filmed the scene of becoming the righteous bandit Iljimae'),(5011832,'<Iljimae(일지매)>In episode 1, young Iljimae/Yong-i comes here with his father, Soedol (played by Lee Moon-shik), who apologizes to his poor and uneducated son. In the same episode, Yong-i is taken away while his father watches from behind this tree, feeling animosity towards him. In episode 4, adult Iljimae/Yong-i returns to this place to regain his memories. The same scene can also be seen in the last scene of episode 86.'),(5011833,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)>Bob Bless You 2 Mister Trot Edition Cafe'),(5011834,'<Im Young-woong(임영웅)> Im Young-woong\'s favorite chive intestines restaurant'),(5011835,'<Im Young-woong(임영웅)>Filming location of the hanok academy in which Im Young-woong appeared on Bbongsungahk-dang'),(5011836,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)>Filming location of \"Peach Blossom Academy\" on Dobongsan featuring Lim Young Woong'),(5011837,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)>Lim Young Woong worked part-time at a tonkatsu restaurant in the past.'),(5011838,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)>Lim Young Woong\'s delicious pig pork soup restaurant'),(5011839,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)>Lim Young Woong, the winner of \'Mr. Trot\', dined at this Korean BBQ restaurant.'),(5011840,'<Im Young-woong(임영웅)>Im Young-woong walked along Seosan-dong Sihwa Alley'),(5011841,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)>Lim Young Woong visited Barley Field in Mokpo where the Mokpo MBC Music Center is located.'),(5011842,'<Lim Yeong-woong(임영웅)>The history museum that contains the time of Mokpo visited by Lim Yeong-woong'),(5011843,'<Lim Young Woong(임영웅)> Noodle house with Lim Young Woong\'s signature'),(5011844,'<Giant(자이언트)>The church where wedding scenes were filmed at Giant'),(5011845,'<Giant(자이언트)>SBS drama \'Giant\' filming location'),(5011846,'<Giant(자이언트)>The village that became the background for the drama Giant'),(5011847,'<Giant(자이언트)>Village that became the background of the drama Giant'),(5011848,'<Giant(자이언트)>The lighthouse that became the backdrop for the drama Giant'),(5011849,'<Giant(자이언트)>Theme park known as the filming location for the dram