d in Episode 2. Um Da-da (Bang Min-ah) watches the process on TV from her apartment.'),(5012111,'<Absolute Guy(절대 그이)>In episode 15, a dinner takes place here and Ma Wang Jun (Hong Jong Hyun) tries to have a conversation with Eom Da Da (Bang Min Ah) again, but it proves to be in vain.'),(5012112,'<Absolute Boyfriend(절대 그이)>The broadcasting company where Ma Wang-joon (Hong Jong-hyun) and Um Da-da (Bang Min-ah) work is located in this building. In episode 12, Young-gu (Yeo Jin-goo) follows Da-da to work and is seen interrogating Wang-joon about the events of the previous evening.'),(5012113,'<Absolute Gim(절대 그이)>This building is featured as Eumdada\'s (Bang Min-ah) house.'),(5012114,'<Absolute When(절대 그이)>In a flashback scene, on the amusement park, Ma Wang-jun (Hong Jong-hyun) proposed to Eom Dadada (Bang Min-ah).'),(5012115,'<Absolute Hee(절대 그이)>In Episode 11, Zero Nine/Young-gu (Yeo Jin-goo) wins 2 regular tickets for a Han River tour. He insists on going on a cruise with Eom Tada (Bang Minah). Reluctantly, he accepts Ma Wang-jun\'s (Hong Jong-hyun) dinner invitation. He tries to join Wang-jun until the last minute and asks Young-gu to wait for her.'),(5012116,'<Absolute Hero(절대 그이)>The character Diana (played by Hong Seo-young) comes out of the house where she lives. In episodes 2 and 12, it can be seen that she is living in this building.'),(5012117,'<Jung Yong-hwa(정용화)>The place where Jung Yong-hwa went to watch the sunrise on We Got Married'),(5012118,'<Jung Yong Hwa(정용화)>A sushi restaurant booked by Jung Yong Hwa\'s mother on We Got Married'),(5012119,'<Jung Yong-hwa(정용화)>The place where Jung Yong-hwa gave cookies to seagulls in \"We Got Married\"'),(5012120,'<Jung Yonghwa(정용화)>Located behind the newlyweds\' house of Jung Yonghwa from \"We Got Married\"'),(5012121,'<Jung Yong Hwa(정용화)>Jung Yong Hwa\'s dating spot on We Got Married'),(5012122,'<Jung Yong-hwa(정용화)>Jung Yong-hwa briefly stopped by this restaurant after visiting a bookstore'),(5012123,'<Jeong Yong Hwa(정용화)>The place where Jeong Yong Hwa went to see a guitar in We Got Married'),(5012124,'<Jung Yong-hwa(정용화)>The tteokbokki restaurant visited by Jung Yong-hwa on We Got Married'),(5012125,'<Jung Yong Hwa(정용화)>Jung Yong Hwa visits the beach at night on the show We Got Married'),(5012126,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 10, E-som (played by E-som), Lee Young-jae, and On Joon-young have their second breakup scene. Joon-young, who is in denial about what just happened, wants to bring Young-jae to a café to divert attention or calm the situation. He runs to several cafes in the street, but when he arrives, he turns off the lights of each café. In that moment, Young-jae realizes that their season has ended.'),(5012127,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>Lee Young-jae (Lee Soom) and her brother Soo-jae (Yang Dong-geun) are living in their teens and twenties.'),(5012128,'<Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 1, Yoon Jun-young (played by Seo Kang-joon) and Lee Young-jae (played by Lee Som) meet again at this place on December 31, 2012. Jun-young is undercover and Young-jae came here with her friend Baek Ju-ran (played by Lee Yoon-ji) to have a party.'),(5012129,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>After finishing rock climbing in episode 6, Baek Ju-ran (played by Lee Yoon-ji) and Kang Cheol-nam (played by Lee Ha-yul) come to this \'pet cafe\' to have a meal. Ju-ran is not particularly interested in exercise or pets, but when Cheol-nam brings up the topic, she pretends to be interested in them.'),(5012130,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 4, On Joon-young (played by Seo Kang-joon) joins his colleagues at a pochangmacha located on the sidewalk in front of the parking lot next to this building. He calls Lee Young-jae (played by Esom) with affection, while envying Detective Jung who was comforting his sadness with a blind date. In this scene, COEX West and Seven Luck Casino are shown in the background.'),(5012131,'<Third Charm(제3의 매력)> In episode 4, Lee Young-jae (played by Lee Som) visits this place to discuss the hair design showcase by designer Hong (played by Choi Byung-mo). There, she finds out that Kim So-hee (played by Shin Do-hyun) is the main model for the event.'),(5012132,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>Appears in the facade of the family house.'),(5012133,'<The third charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 15, Min Se-eun (Kim Yoon-hye) meets Oh Joon-young (Seo Kang-jun) and they meet here. Here he confesses about his whereabouts, saying that he was not at home the night before but was with Young-jae.'),(5012134,'<Third Charm(제3의 매력)>This is the exterior of the real estate office of Only One (played by Park Gyu-young), which was revealed in episode 13.'),(5012135,'<Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 7, Lee Young-jae (Lee Som) and Choi Ho-cheol (Min Woo-hyuk), who coincidentally come across each other at a wedding hall, take a walk here.'),(5012136,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>On his way back home from the restaurant, Oh Joon Young (Seo Kang Joon) once again catches Lee Young Jae (Esom) buying instant food. At this convenience store, he gently scolds her for not eating well, pointing out that she has picked up a spicy stir-fried octopus dish that she doesn\'t like. When she mentions that it doesn\'t taste good, he offers to teach her how to make it.'),(5012137,'<The Third Attraction(제3의 매력)>In episode 10, the Strong Crime Team sets up this store to catch a wanted criminal called \'Snakehead\' who secretly visits this store.'),(5012138,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>On Joon-young (played by Seo Kang-joon) and Lee Young-jae (played by Esom) ride across this bridge at a place where they met high school friends for dinner in episode 4. While walking, they each receive a call from Jung Hyung-sik and Joo-ran (played by Lee Yoon-ji) who went on a disastrous blind date together.'),(5012139,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 4, On Junyoung (Seo Kang-joon) and Lee Youngjae (Esom) enjoyed a picnic date lying on the grass by the riverbank here.'),(5012140,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>At the top of these stairs sits the coffee cart \'Amor Party\', run by Lee So-Yoon\'s (E Soom) brother Yang Soo-Jae (Yang Dong-Geun). On episode 3, Ohn Joon-Young (Seo Kang-Joon) comes here to look for himself, and he learns the truth about what happened on the night Lee So-Yoon broke up with him 7 years ago. In episode 4, Joon-Young returns to this place to meet Soo-Jae again and is asked detailed questions about his job, parents, and more as Soo-Jae\'s sister\'s boyfriend. Joon-Young meets Soo-Jae for the last time at this place before leaving for a backpacking trip to Portugal.'),(5012141,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>This is the apartment exterior of Min Se-eun (played by Kim Yoon-hye) which was revealed in Episode 16. On Jun-young (played by Seo Kang-joon) waits for her here and tells her they cannot meet his parents together. She decides to break up with him.'),(5012142,'<Attraction of the Third kind(제3의 매력)>It\'s the apartment of Lee Young-jae (Lee Som). After finishing the meal at On Jun-young\'s (Seo Kang-joon) restaurant in episode 12, Choi Ho-chul (Min Woo-hyuk) walked her to the apartment from behind.'),(5012143,'<Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In Episode 6, after the hair show ends, Oh Jun-young (Seo Kang-joon) and Lee Yeong-jae (Lee Som) cross this bridge to attend the congratulations party. Yeong-jae is in a good mood while Jun-young tries to maintain his dignity even after witnessing a confrontation with Choi Ho-chul (Min Woo-hyuk). Later in the episode, when crossing the bridge again, they argue and Yeong-jae asks him to park the car on the side of the road. She walks away and he follows her, but prevents her from walking on her own.'),(5012144,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>On Jun-young (Seo Kang-joon) comes with his teammates to have a meal in episode 5, and eventually confesses the reason why he was nervous all day. They each try to analyze and rationalize beautician Yeong-jae (Lee Som), who cuts male customers\' hair at a salon after work hours, attempting to play the roles of \"angel/devil\".'),(5012145,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 14, Lee Soo-jae (played by Yang Dong-geun) invites Jun-young (played by Seo Kang-joon) to dine together at this place. He apologizes for not being able to buy drinks for Jun-young, despite him being one of the inspirations for his scenario. Later, Jun-young pays for the meal and offers to drive instead of Lee Soo-jae, repeating this history.'),(5012146,'<Third Attraction(제3의 매력)>In episode 8, Min Se-eun (played by Kim Yoon-hye) infiltrates a building where the \'Scala\' billiard hall run by a powerful crime syndicate is located. Meanwhile, Jun-young is anxious about whether he can catch the wanted criminal \'Snakehead\' for a long time, so he calls Young-jae (played by Lee Som) to hear her voice.'),(5012147,'<Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In episode 6, Baek Joo-ran (Lee Yoon-ji) and Kang Cheol-nam (Lee Ha-yool) came here for a rock climbing date.'),(5012148,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>In the drama \"The Third Charm,\" Oh Joon Young (Seo Kang Joon) meets with Lee Young Jae (Esom), Baek Joo Ran (Lee Yoon Ji), Lee Soo Jae (Yang Dong Geun), and Choi Ho Chul (Min Woo Hyuk) here before boarding a ferry to their volunteer destination in episode 9.'),(5012149,'<The Third Charm(제3의 매력)>On episode 11, On Jun-young (Seo Kang-joon) depart and arrive at this place with a 5-year time difference from Portugal.'),(5012150,'<The 5th Republic(제5공화국)>In episode 1, Jeon Du-hwan (Lee Deok-hwa) and Heo Hwa-pyeong (Lee Jin-woo) jog together along this street in the morning and later meet Han Sam-soo (Cha Kwang-soo).'),(5012151,'<Fifth Republic(제5공화국)>Onyx Room located on the 32nd floor. Part of Dorim Chinese Restaurant'),(5012152,'<Fifth Republic(제5공화국)>Protests took place in front of this station during the 14th presidential election.'),(5012153,'<Empire\'s Children(제국의 아이들)>A Gyeongju rice cake ribs restaurant that Lim Si-wan visited'),(5012154,'<Emperor\'s Children(제국의 아이들)>Shooting experience at Gwanghee\'s bland tour on Battle Trip Episode 24.'),(5012155,'< Empire of Kids (제국의 아이들)> The restaurant where Gwang-hee ate jjajangmyeon'),(5012156,'<The Emperor\'s Children(제국의 아이들)>Scene in Episode 5 of Misaeng where Sung-min Lee and Si-wan Im have a drink at a Korean BBQ restaurant'),(5012157,'<Empire of Kids(제국의 아이들)>The company building featured in the drama Misaeng, starring Lim Siwan'),(5012158,'<Empire of Kids(제국의 아이들)>Featured on Battle Trip episode 24, Gwanghee\'s bland tour introduces a bibimbap restaurant.'),(5012159,'<Empire of the Kids(제국의 아이들)>Popular eel soup restaurant visited by Gwanghee'),(5012160,'<Please Don\'t Meet That Man(제발 그 남자 만나지 마요)>The scene at the end of the final episode of the drama \"Please Don\'t Meet That Man\" was filmed here.'),(5012161,'<Please Don\'t Meet That Man(제발 그 남자 만나지 마요)>This cafe is known as \'Natural Table\', a unique cafe operated by Tak Gi-hyun (Gong Min-jeong). It is a place frequently visited by Seo Ji-seong (Song Ha-yoon) and Moon Ye-seul (Apink\'s Kim Bo-mi).'),(5012162,'<Please Don\'t Meet That Man(제발 그 남자 만나지 마요)>Seo Jisung (Soonhayoon) heads to the lobby of this building to meet her fiance Bang Joonhan (Lee Sihoon) in the drama.'),(5012163,'<Please don\'t meet that man(제발 그 남자 만나지 마요)>In episode 1, Seo Jisung (played by Song Ha-yoon) hears a man at this place insulting a woman who is dating his friend.'),(5012164,'<Baker King Kim Tak Gu(제빵왕 김탁구)>This is where master Palbong (Jang Hang Sun) operates. This is where Kim Tak Gu (Yoon Shi Yoon) and Gu Ma Jun (Ju Won) train as baking apprentices.'),(5012165,'<TV show(제시)>A popular Gangnam pizza restaurant where Jessi and Yoo Jae Suk met and filmed a mukbang.'),(5012166,'<The King\'s Daughter, Su Baek-hyang(제왕의 딸, 수백향)>The King\'s Daughter, Su Baek-hyang\'s main filming location.'),(5012167,'<Korean Drama \"Dr. John\"(조선 정신과 의사 유세풍)>In episode 1, Yoo Se-pyung (played by Kim Min-jae) and Seo Eun-woo (played by Kim Hyang-gi) first meet on this cliff. She then convinces him that his life is worth continuing.'),(5012168,'<Chosun Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>Part of the palace is filmed in episode 17 (total 9 episodes). In episode 18 (total 9 episodes), this is the first place where Jeon Nok-du (Jang Dong-yoon) receives the reward for passing the civil service exam for the first time and sees the king for the first time when the queen unexpectedly visits the king.'),(5012169,'<Joseon Rocko Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>Jeon Nokdu (played by Jang Dong-yoon) is forced to take a bath in this waterfall by the virtuous women\'s group of \'Widows Village\', and Dongju (played by Kim So-hyun) joins him on the way here.'),(5012170,'<Chosun Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>In episode 7, Jeon Nokdu (Jang Dong-yoon), Dong Dong-joo (Kim So-hyun), and Aeng-doo (Park Da-yeon) go on a picnic. There is a scene where Nokdu and Dong-joo argue while riding a boat. Dong-joo thinks Nokdu fell into the water and rushes to save him, only to realize that he does not know Nokdu\'s real name.'),(5012171,'<Chosun Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>In episode 3 (out of 2) Heo Yoon (Kim Tae-woo) and Jung Yoon-jeo (Lee Seung-joon) reminisce about the moment on this cliff.'),(5012172,'<Chosun Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>In episode 25 (total 13 episodes) of \"Dong Dong Joo,\" Dong Dong Joo (played by Kim So-hyun) suggests going on a picnic to the sea with Jeon Nokdu (played by Jang Dong-yoon). Since the sea is too far, she brings him to this riverbank instead. The story also reveals why she came to the widow village and learns about her heritage.'),(5012173,'<Chosun Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>The fields of this farm are located on the path where Jeon Nokdu (Jang Dong-yoon) and Dong Dong-ju (Kim So-hyun) walked several times. In episode 20 (out of 10), Dong-ju reminisces about the first time they held hands while walking on this path. In episode 26 (out of 13), Nokdu follows Dong-ju as she walks on this path after they parted ways, trying to understand her feelings. In episode 27 (out of 14), Nokdu walks on this path lost in thought.'),(5012174,'<Chosun Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>Jeon Nokdu (Jang Dong-yoon) tracks this place and discovers the first important piece of his origin puzzle.'),(5012175,'<Joseon Rococo Nokdujeon(조선로코 녹두전)>In episode 11 (out of a total of 6 episodes), King Gwanghae (Jung Jun-ho) appears in this pavilion with torture, as it is part of the palace.'),(5012176,'<TV drama(조작)>In episode 16 flashback scene, Han Mu-yeong (played by Namkoong Min) saves Yoon Seon-woo (played by Lee Ju-seung) from attempting suicide by jumping off the bridge.'),(5012177,'<Manipulation(조작)> It appears as the gate seen in the 16th panoramic scene.'),(5012178,'<Zombie Detective(좀비탐정)>Appears as a chaebol house where Kim Moo Young (Choi Jin Hyuk) imagines his future self in episode 6.'),(5012179,'<Final episode 12 Halloween party unfolds here.(좀비탐정)>A Halloween party scene from the final episode 12 unfolds here.'),(5012180,'<Zombie Detective(좀비탐정)>HBS broadcasting station where Detective Gong Soo-chi (Park Joo-hyun) works as a current affairs PD.'),(5012181,'<Zombie Detective(좀비탐정)>In Episode 1, Gong Sun Ji (Choi Jin Hyuk) added ramen to his triangle kimbap with the PD (Park Joo Hyun).'),(5012182,'<Zombie Detective(좀비탐정)>In episode 9, Lee Kwang-shik (Park Sang-myeon) is imprisoned here.'),(5012183,'<Pine tree forest(종려나무 숲)>Scenic spot known as the filming location for the movie \"Pine Tree Forest\"'),(5012184,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>The place where Kim So-hyun meets Ji Doh-hyun in Season 2.'),(5012185,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>University attended by Kim So-hyun in Season 2'),(5012186,'<Likes to Ring(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 1, Kim Jojo (Kim So-hyun) skates at One Mount Snow Park [One Mount Park] with two close friends. In episode 4, Jojo returns here for a skating date with Hwang Sun-oh (Jung Ga-ram).'),(5012187,'<Like it rings(좋아하면 울리는)>There is a photo shoot location for the main characters Kim Si-eun and Song Kang on land in episode 1. Taking her out makes everyone jealous of her boyfriend.'),(5012188,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>A place where Kim So-hyun and Jung Ga-ram go on a cherry blossom date in season 2'),(5012189,'<Like(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 7, Lee Hye-young (Jung Ga-ram) rides a bicycle to this bridge on the first snowy day and brings Kim Jo-jo (Kim So-hyun).'),(5012190,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 5, Hwang Sun-Oh (Song Kang) comes to the bar in this hotel to have a drink and calls Lee Hye-Young (Jung Ga-ram).'),(5012191,'<Ring My Bell(좋아하면 울리는)>In episodes 5 and 6, Kim Jojo (Kim So-hyun) is running on the night street.'),(5012192,'<Like It If You(좋아하면 울리는)>In Episode 1, Kim Jo (played by Kim So-hyun) finishes her part-time job and sees Lee Hye-young (played by Jung Ga-ram) quietly passing by this store.'),(5012193,'<Like Sounds Ringing(좋아하면 울리는)>On her way back after finishing her part-time job, Kim Jojo (Kim So-hyun) passes by this shop.'),(5012194,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>The place where Kim So-hyun and Jung Ga-ram reunite after 4 years'),(5012195,'<Like(좋아하면 울리는)>This is where Kim So-hyun and Song Kang reunited after breaking up in season 1.'),(5012196,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>After going on a skate date at One Mount in Episode 4, Kim Jojo (Kim So-hyun) and Hwang Sun-oh (Song Kang) take a walk around the lake in this amusement park at night.'),(5012197,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>In the drama Love Alarm, Hwang Sun-oh (Song Kang) and Kim Jo-jo (Kim So-hyun) use an app that alerts them if someone likes them, crossing the GomMal Bridge to confirm their love for each other.'),(5012198,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>The lake where Kim So-hyun and Song Kang took a walk at night'),(5012199,'<Lovestruck in the City(좋아하면 울리는)>In the drama \"Lovestruck in the City,\" Hwang Soo-oh (played by Song Kang) drives over this bridge on his way to meet Kim Jojo (from \"Love Alarm\").'),(5012200,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>A place where Kim So-hyun triggers Jung Ga-ram\'s Love Alarm.'),(5012201,'<Like(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 1, this convenience store is run by Kim Jojo\'s aunt, and it is where Jojo (Kim So-hyun) works part-time. She lives on the rooftop of the store with her aunt.'),(5012202,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 7, Kim Jojo (Kim So-hyun) reminisces about a moment. While Go Hye-young (Jung Ga-ram) sits on a bench outside this palace, he recalls the moment when Go Hye-young (Jung Ga-ram) confessed his feelings.'),(5012203,'<Like(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 6 of \"Do You Like Brahms?\", Kim Cho-jo (Kim So-hyun) rings the love alarm for Lee Hye-young (Jung Ga-ram) in front of this museum.'),(5012204,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 8, Hwang Sun-oh (Song Kang) waits in front of the entrance gate of Deokseong Middle School on this street for the breakup with Kim Jo-jo (Kim So-hyun).'),(5012205,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>Kim Jojo (Kim So-hyun), Lee Hye-young (Jung Ga-ram), and Hwang Sun-oh (Song Kang) and their friends attend this school.'),(5012206,'<When You Love(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 3, Lee Hye-young (Jung Ga-ram) and Hwang Sun-oh (Song Kang) take a walk in the evening, sitting briefly on the fortress wall, reminiscing about the time they spent together in their childhood.'),(5012207,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>A walking path narrated by Song Kang and Jung Ga-ram in Season 2'),(5012208,'<Like Button Rings(좋아하면 울리는)>In episode 8, the new feature of Like Button Rings 2.0 is revealed and there is a scene of people checking the app here.'),(5012209,'<Like(좋아하면 울리는)>In one scene, Lee Hye-young (Jeong Ga-ram) and Hwang Sun-oh (Song Kang) ride bicycles through this street on their way to school.'),(5012210,'<Like It Rings(좋아하면 울리는)>A park that Kang Song has passed by on his way to school'),(5012211,'<Love Alarm(좋아하면 울리는)>Park where Kim So-hyun\'s cherry blossoms are in full bloom for a walk.'),(5012212,'<Lovely Horribly(좋아하면 울리는)>Location of Kim So-hyun and Song Kang\'s Jeju Island math trip'),(5012213,'<Like, If You Like(좋아하면 울리는)>The place where Kim So-hyun and Jung Ga-ram reunite in the final episode'),(5012214,'<Like It Once Was(좋아하면 울리는)>Accommodatio