),(5012324,'<Now, we\'re breaking up(지금, 헤어지는 중입니다)>In episode 10, Seok Dohoon (Kim Joo-hoon) makes Hwang Chisuk (Choi Hee-seo) walk to this place and confesses his love by filling a lock on the railing and handing over the key. Later, they come back here and she accepts his feelings.'),(5012325,'<Now, we are breaking up(지금, 헤어지는 중입니다)> In episode 9, Yoon Jae-guk (Jang Ki-yong) and Hae-young (Song Hye-kyo) come here to walk together and comfort each other while enjoying the night view.'),(5012327,'<Now, We\'re Breaking Up(지금, 헤어지는 중입니다)>In episode 5, Yoon Jaekook (Jang Ki Yong) rejects Hwang Chisook (Choi Hee Seo) at this restaurant.'),(5012328,'<Right now, we\'re breaking up(지금, 헤어지는 중입니다)>This is the \"Our Photo Studio\" opened by Yoon Jae-guk (Jang Ki-yong) in episode 10.'),(5012329,'<Now, We Are Breaking Up(지금, 헤어지는 중입니다)>This building appears as the fashion company \'The One\', where Ha Young-eun (played by Song Hye Kyo) works as a team leader.'),(5012330,'<Currently Watching(지금은 연애중)>In episodes 1-2, Yoon Ho-jae (played by Kwon Sang-woo) brings Choi Kyu-in (So Ji-sub) here with a white lie, and Ho-jung falls in love with a female student working here to save money for tuition.'),(5012331,'<We Are Dating Now(지금은 연애중)>In episode 12, Yoon Ho-jung (Chae Rim) and Choi Kyu-in (So Ji-sub) come on their first date here at the Ilsan Lake Park main square, riding bicycles for a picnic. In episode 16, Su-ji (Lee Eun-jung) and Yoon Ho-jae (Kwon Sang-woo) get married here.'),(5012332,'<Now, We Are Dating(지금은 연애중)> In Episode 11, Yoon Ho-jung and Geon-woo came for a date.'),(5012333,'<Currently in Love(지금은 연애중)>In episode 1, Yoon Ho-jung (Chae Rim) falls in love with Geon-woo. In episode 5, she works part-time here. In episode 10, Chae Rim returns to the ice rink with Geon-woo.'),(5012334,'<Now, We Are Dating(지금은 연애중)> Yoon Ho-jung (Chae Rim), Kang Soo-ji (Lee Eui-jeong), Han Jae-young (Sung Si-kyung) are sitting on the subway when the train stops at this station, and Jae-young sees a brief encounter with a woman he knows passing by. In episode 1, he instructs everyone to get off the train.'),(5012335,'<Currently in Love(지금은 연애중)>Appears as a station when returning home after completing military service and vacation in episode 9.'),(5012336,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite dumpling restaurant with juicy fillings'),(5012337,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite restaurant specializing in Daegutang'),(5012338,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>Restaurant visited by G-Dragon and many other celebrities'),(5012339,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>A popular jjimdak restaurant where G-Dragon\'s picture was taken'),(5012340,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite gopchang restaurant'),(5012341,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>Seafood restaurant with G-Dragon\'s autograph'),(5012342,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite traditional restaurant'),(5012343,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>Popular restaurant visited by G-Dragon and T.O.P'),(5012344,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon, Park Bo-gum, and other celebrities have visited this famous restaurant'),(5012345,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite pork belly restaurant'),(5012346,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>Popular army stew restaurant visited by G-Dragon and many other celebrities'),(5012347,'<Zidragon(지드래곤)>Authentic Korean restaurant near Nakwon Shopping Center.'),(5012348,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>Famous king-sized pork cutlet restaurant near Namsan'),(5012349,'<Zidragon(지드래곤)>A popular hotpot restaurant known as Beckham\'s favorite spot'),(5012350,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite kimbap restaurant in Jeju Island'),(5012351,'<Zidragon(지드래곤)>Zidragon\'s favorite pork joint and pig\'s trotters place'),(5012352,'<Ji-dragon(지드래곤)>Ji-dragon\'s favorite Jeju black pork restaurant'),(5012353,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>The restaurant G-Dragon visited before enlisting'),(5012354,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>The cafe in Jeju operated by G-Dragon'),(5012355,'<GD(지드래곤)>GD visited this restaurant twice'),(5012356,'<G-Dragon(지드래곤)>G-Dragon\'s favorite leftover meat restaurant'),(5012357,'<Hell(지옥)>The location where the sinner Park Jeong-ja, who received the declaration of an angel in front of the children on her birthday, received 3 billion from the New Truth Conference and staged a scene of going to hell.'),(5012358,'<Hell(지옥)>A place where a criminal who set fire to a cafe and fled is chased by demons from Hell.'),(5012359,'<Hell(지옥)>Lions heading to hell by breaking glass and entering while grabbing a shivering man.'),(5012360,'<Hell(지옥)>The auditorium space where the scene of Hell from \"New Journey to the West\" was filmed'),(5012361,'<Hell(지옥)>Yoo Ah-in, leading the newly created principles, makes his first appearance explaining to people about angels and hell.'),(5012362,'<Hell(지옥)>Abandoned building where Yoo Ah-in\'s monologue scene in episode 3 was filmed'),(5012363,'<Reality Show(진검승부)>On episode 6 of \"Jin Geum Seung Bu,\" Lee Si-woon and Joo Bo-young introduced themselves at this bar.'),(5012364,'<True Beauty(진검승부)>In episode 5, Jin Jeong (Do Kyung-soo/ D.O) and his team track down drug dealers at this club.'),(5012365,'<The Determination(진검승부)>This is the office of attorney Kim Chang-wan (played by Seo Hyun-kyu) from the hit drama \"The Determination.\"'),(5012366,'<Jin Geumseongbu(진검승부)>\'Cheongsimgwan\' is where the Seoul Central District Prosecutor\'s Office Criminal Department team holds their team dinners in on season 1.'),(5012367,'<Truth(진실)>In episode 3, Lee Ja-young (Choi Ji-woo) and Park Seung-jae (Son Ji-chang) come here for a bicycle date.'),(5012368,'<Truth(진실)> Jiyoung Lee (played by Choi Jiwoo), Hyunwoo Jung (played by Ryu Siwon), and Shinhee Lee (played by Park Sunyoung) are students at this university.'),(5012369,'<Truth(진실)>In episode 5, Lee Jae-yeong (Choi Ji-woo) and Jung Hyeon-woo (Ryu Si-won) come to skate on ice.'),(5012370,'<Touching Hearts(진심이 닿다)>In episode 7, Yeoyeom (Son Sung-yoon) is transported to the hospital with the help of Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) who faints outside the office.'),(5012371,'<Touching Hearts(진심이 닿다)>The entrance to this apartment complex appears as the entrance to \'Heights Mansion,\' where Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) lives.'),(5012372,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 7, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) confesses his feelings to Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) by handing her a letter in this park\'s metasequoia tree-lined path.'),(5012373,'<Touching(진심이 닿다)>The Oh My Wayz team visited for a workshop in episode 8. Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) cannot sleep and coincidentally meet outside the accommodation, where they share their first kiss.'),(5012374,'<Genuine Heart Touches(진심이 닿다)>In episode 9 of \"Touch Your Heart,\" Kwon Jung Rok (played by Lee Dong Wook) watches Yu In Na (played by Oh Jin Shim) walk up the stairs of this building to attend an awards ceremony.'),(5012375,'<JinSim Lee reaches(진심이 닿다)>In episode 5, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) drive past the entrance of this place on their way back to Seoul from the prison.'),(5012376,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 5, Kwon Jung Rok (Lee Dong Wook) and Yoo Yeo Reum (Son Sung Yoon) come here and she seeks advice about a case she has just taken on. For this lunch date, Jung Rok leaves with Oh Yoon Seo (Yoo In Na) in mind.'),(5012377,'<Sincerely Yours(진심이 닿다)>Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) appears in Episode 14.'),(5012378,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 14, five years ago, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) concluded that the disinfectant was toxic due to an internal whistleblower who manipulated the investigation results for the client of a chemical company at the bar owned by Yoon Jun-gyu (Oh Jung-se).'),(5012379,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episodes 13~14, Kwon Jung-rok (played by Lee Dong-wook) starts taking the bus to work from this place.'),(5012380,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 2, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) meets Jang Kwang-seol\'s client here and arrives late to Oh Yoon-seo\'s (Yoo In-na) welcome party. In episode 3, he returns here to have a meal with the senior trial lawyer who is also his senior. This time, the senior lawyer brings Yoon-seo dressed up as his fan. Yoon-seo comes out of the restroom and runs into the senior lawyer, who tries to reveal his identity to her but is stopped by Jung-rok at the right moment.'),(5012381,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>This is the front of the house of murder suspect Lim Yoon-hee, who is considered a criminal scene. In episode 6, Kwon Jung-rok (played by Lee Dong-wook) comes here with Yoon Seo (played by Yoo In-na) to see the evidence, and Yoon-seo accompanies him. While in the house, Jung-rok is attacked by an intruder, surprising Yoon-seo. Despite being slightly dazed, he tells her to call the police before chasing the intruder downstairs. Manager Lee Du-yeop (played by Park Ji-hwan) later talks with an elderly resident across the street at 186-7 (actually 10).'),(5012382,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 6, Kwon Jung Rok (played by Lee Dong Wook) reunites with Oh Yoon Seo (played by Yoo In Na) who he encounters outside this mart following the intruder incident, witnessing the pain he endured and shedding tears. After conversing with her, he escorts her home in a taxi. Manager Lee Doo Yeob (played by Park Ji Hwan) later engages in a conversation with an elderly man here to gather information about Park Soo Myung, a mentally handicapped owner of a butcher shop suspected of being present at the scene of the murder on the night of the incident.'),(5012383,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 7, Kwon Jung Rok (played by Lee Dong Wook) takes Oh Yoon Seo (played by Yoo In Na) on a late-night date.'),(5012384,'<Touching Hearts(진심이 닿다)>In the final episode 16, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) arrive together at EntermeEnt\'s 10th anniversary event.'),(5012385,'<Touching Heart(진심이 닿다)>Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) and Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) meet here for legal tutoring in episode 4. She imagined it to be somewhat romantic, but it eventually turned into a somewhat boring study session.'),(5012386,'<When the Heart Touches(진심이 닿다)>In episode 9, Yoo In-na as Oh Yoon-seo comes to Gyeongui Line Plaza to breathe in some fresh air and sits in the park.'),(5012387,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>After winning the Im Yoon-hee case, Jung Rok chooses a drink instead of a company dinner when asked why he accepted her proposal for a drink despite their breakup. In episode 14, he invites her for a drink and accepts her offer to talk outside as soon as he arrives.'),(5012388,'<The heart is reaching(진심이 닿다)>This bridge appears in the opening scene of episode 1.'),(5012389,'<When My Love Blooms(진심이 닿다)>In episode 9, Kwon Jung-rok (played by Lee Dong Wook) and Oh Yun-seo (played by Yoo In-na) come to this place to enjoy some fresh air after Jung-rok shares drunken gossip. She tells him it\'s refreshing to see a new side of him, and he reassures her that it\'s okay that she\'s not ready to share what she truly wants yet.'),(5012390,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episodes 9 and beyond, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) meets a new client with Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na).'),(5012391,'<Jinsimi Data(진심이 닿다)>In episode 2, Choi Yoon-hyuk (played by Shim Hyung-tak) witnesses a embarrassing incident at a sandwich shop and follows Dan Mun-hee (played by Park Kyung-hye) to tease her.'),(5012392,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In Episode 4, on her way back home at night, secretary Yang Eun-ji (played by Jang So-yeon) decides to pass through this tunnel, which is a shortcut to her house. Meanwhile, she suddenly senses someone following her and speeds up. She is surprised when that person catches up to her, but it turns out to be her colleague, Lee Doo-seob (played by Park Ji-hwan).'),(5012393,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>심심한 변호사 남자와 인기 여배우 여자가 로맨스를 그리는 로맨틱 코미디 드라마.'),(5012394,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>It appears in the opening scene of episode 1 and in episode 2. In episode 16, a van carrying Oh Yoon Seo (played by Yoo In Na) passes over this bridge.'),(5012395,'<When My Love Blooms(진심이 닿다)>This is the bridge that appears in the opening scene of episode 1.'),(5012396,'<진심이 닿다(진심이 닿다)>The Oh My Wayz law firm team goes for drinks here after company dinners.'),(5012397,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 15, the law firm team (excluding interns) came to have lunch together. Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook), who became sensitive to Yun Seo\'s (Yoo In-na) kiss scene, gets angry at Yeon Joon-gyu (Oh Jeong-se) and leaves. Joon-gyu then mentions why everyone at the table is single and talks about the need for office couples in the company. At that moment, lawyers Choi Yoon-hyuk (Sim Hyeong-tak) and Dan Moon-hee (Park Gyeong-hye) admit to being in a public relationship.'),(5012398,'<Jinsim-i dada(진심이 닿다)>In the final episode 16 of the drama \'Love Hurts\', the cast and crew of Yoo In-na\'s character Oh Yoon-seo had a wrap party at this barbecue restaurant.'),(5012399,'<Touching Sincerity(진심이 닿다)>Manager Gong Hyeok-jun (Oh Yi-sik) picks up Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) in a car here in episode 3.'),(5012400,'<Touching Sincerity(진심이 닿다)>In \"Touching Sincerity,\" Kwon Jung-rok (played by Lee Dong-wook) visits this place. In episode 14, he receives a phone call from Kim Se-won (played by Lee Sang-woo) saying that there is someone he wants to meet. Upon arrival, Jung-rok discovers his boss Yoon Jun-gyu (played by Oh Jung-se). The two are awkward due to their different opinions, but Se-won insists on resolving their differences and ultimately leaves the two alone. Jun-gyu begins to express his feelings about the situation, stating that he did not want to see himself crumble like he did 5 years ago when he was accused of manipulating his law firm. However, Jun-gyu says, \"Let\'s go together. Let\'s overcome this together no matter how difficult it may be.\" Eventually, the two reconcile.'),(5012401,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>The place where Kim Se-won (Lee Sang-woo) and Yeo-eum (Son Sung-yoon) ate during their college days in episode 12, and where they come back to eat again.'),(5012402,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>This is the place where Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) meets the witness in episode 5, on the 3rd floor.'),(5012403,'<Touching Heart(진심이 닿다)>Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) come to this cafe. In episode 10, they gift each other necklaces and earrings from the Stonehenge Silhouette Collection for their date.'),(5012404,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>After coming late to work for the 5th time, Kwon Jungrok (Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoonseo (Yoo In-na) have dinner together. On the way to the restaurant, Jungrok asks Yoonseo if she likes him. In episode 14, Jungrok and Yoonseo meet at a potato soup restaurant and have a conversation across the street. He reveals that he knows why they broke up and suggests starting over. Although he had held onto his position, Jungrok couldn\'t bear his feelings for her any longer. Finally, he confesses his love to Yoonseo and they share a kiss.'),(5012405,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 2, Kwon Jung-rok (played by Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoon-seo (played by Yoo In-na) have dinner and walk to this cafe alley. He tells her that he will give her the opportunity to officially become his secretary, and a happy Yoon-seo starts chasing after him. This scene briefly appears in the opening credits of the show.'),(5012406,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) and Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) have a conversation at this location in episode 5.'),(5012408,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In the drama, \"Touch Your Heart,\" the antagonist Lee Kang-joon, played by Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na), arrives at this airport to return to Korea from the 9th episode.'),(5012409,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 11, Kwon Jung-rok (Lee Dong-wook) brought Oh Yoon-seo (Yoo In-na) here and promised to protect her no matter what happens, they went on a date.'),(5012410,'<Touch Your Heart(진심이 닿다)>In episode 3, Oh Yoon Seo (played by Yoo In Na) and Kwon Jung Rok (played by Lee Dong Wook) successfully finish a trial and take a walk here. Jung Rok\'s heart flutters at Yoon Seo\'s praise, and when her scarf flies off in the wind, he wraps it around her neck. Both of them return to this place in episode 5, when Jung Rok comes to defend another case.'),(5012411,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>In the drama \"Jealousy Incarnate,\" Gong Hyojin and Ko Gyungpyo visited this restaurant.'),(5012412,'<The Goddess of Revenge(질투의 화신)>In episode 18, Lee Hwa-shin (Jo Jung-suk) has a meal with his mother here.'),(5012413,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>Jo Jung-suk visited a baby goods store in Jealousy Incarnate'),(5012414,'<Drama(질투의 화신)>The park where Gong Hyo-jin filmed the weather forecast scene in \"Jealousy Incarnate\"'),(5012415,'<The Goddess\' jealousy(질투의 화신)>This is where the Cosmos flower festival is held, and where Pyonari (Gong Hyo-jin) received instructions to film the weather forecast in the 13th episode. Despite not being able to participate in the announcer test casting, Hwasin (Jo Jung-suk) takes Narri to SBC broadcasting station by helicopter to ensure she arrives on time.'),(5012416,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>In episode 2, Go Jung-won (Go Kyung-pyo) asks Cha Bi-seo (Park Sung-hoon) to call Pyo Na-ri (Gong Hyo-jin) to complain about the inaccurate weather forecast. When the secretary asks for the reason, Jung-won simply responds, \"Just because.\"'),(5012417,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>In episode 24, Pyo Na-ri (Gong Hyo-jin) and Lee Hwa-shin (Cho Jung-seok) got married here. The couple chose the Topaz Wedding Hall on the 2nd floor.'),(5012418,'<TV show \"The Jealousy Incarnate\"(질투의 화신)>Gong Hyo-jin and Jo Jung-seok\'s restaurant featured in the TV show \"The Jealousy Incarnate\"'),(5012419,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>This is the location of luxury brand/shop HERA, owned by L Group with director Go Jung-won (Jo Kyeong-pyo). In episode 9, this building is where Pyo Na-ri (Gong Hyo-jin) and Lee Hwa-shin (Jo Jung-suk) share their first kiss, observed by Go Jung-seok (Jo Jung-seok).'),(5012420,'<The Penthouse(질투의 화신)>This hotel is part of L Group, where Joo Dan-tae (played by Uhm Ki-joon), the youngest heir of the empire, goes for morning swimming. The hotel staff follow him, demanding his autograph and his approval. The hotel elevator is also shown in the broadcast.'),(5012421,'<The Secret of Jealousy(질투의 화신)>A portable cart where people who work in the SBC Building gather to drink after work, with SBS Prism Tower facing northeast of this park.'),(5012422,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>Gong Hyo-jin and Jo Jung-suk worked at the broadcasting station in Jealousy Incarnate.'),(5012423,'<The Legend of the Blue Sea(질투의 화신)>In episode 20, close friends Heo Joon-jae (Lee Min-ho) and Shim Cheong (Jun Ji-hyun) have a heated argument.'),(5012424,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>In the final episode of the 7th season, Pyo Na Ri (Gong Hyo Jin), Lee Hwa Shin (Jo Jung Suk), and Ko Jung Won (Go Kyung Pyo) are having a meal.'),(5012425,'<The Great Doctor(질투의 화신)>The story revolves around a hospital where Eun-sang (played by Cho Jung-seok) receives treatment and where his brother dies.'),(5012426,'<The Legend of the Blue Sea(질투의 화신)>In episode 6, Joon (played by Sung Dong-il) goes to the arrival hall to pick up Kim (played by Park Bo-gum) and Sim (played by Jo Jung-suk).'),(5012427,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>A cafe visited by Jo Jung-suk and Go Kyung-pyo in Jealousy Incarnate'),(5012428,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>Jealousy Incarnate featuring Jo Jung-suk and Ko Gyung-pyo visiting a theme park'),(5012429,'<Jealousy Incarnate(질투의 화신)>You can see Pyo Na-ri (Gong Hyo-jin) feeding birds in episode 11.'),(5012430,'<Drama(질투의 화신)>In the drama \"The Fiery Priest\", starring Kim Nam-gil and Kim Sung-kyun, they visited the tidal flat.'),(5012431,'<Lover of Jinx(징크스의 연인)>In the final episode 16, Jung Hyuntae (Lee Hoon) appears in court where Jin Sed is acquitted.'),(5012432,'<Lover of Jinx(징크스의 연인)>It appears as the exterior of Eunsung Capital.'),(5012433,'<The Lover of Jinx(징크스의 연인)>In the drama \"The Legend of the Blue Sea\", the main character Dam Ryung (Lee Min-ho) meets the mother who forces Seo Min-joon (Ji Doo-hun) to marry at this location.'),(5012434,'<Jinx\'s Lover(징크스의 연인)>Gong Su-kwang (played by Nine9) meets Isulbi (Seo Ju-hyun/Girls\' Generation\'s Seohyun) and Sun Min-jun (Ki Do-hoon) after telling Seo Dong-shik (Choi Jung-woo) that he won\'t fall for his tricks. He looks down at a cafe lost in thought from this staircase.'),(5012435,'<Jinx\'s Lover(징크스의 연인)>In episode 9, Seon Dong-sik (Choi Jung-woo) invites everyone to the rooftop of this restaurant at night and persuades Gong Su-gwang (Nine Nine) to work together to profit using the power of Seo Ju-hyun/Seo Hyun from Girls\' Generation. Su-gwang senses a plot by an old friend and leaves.'),(5012436,'<Zzan Idol(짠내 아이돌)>In episode 1, Hwiyeon (Park Minhyuk/Rocky of Astro) sells clothes here at night to make a living, but runs away when the seller realizes who he is.'),(5012437,'<Good Witch\'s Romance(착한마녀전)>In episode 14, Son Woo-jin (Ryu Su-young) borrows this restaurant to propose to Cha Seon-hee disguised as her sister Cha Do-hee (Lee Da-hae). Seon-hee is confused and rejects this proposal.'),(5012438,'<The Good Witch Exhibition(착한마녀전)>The wedding between Song Woo-jin (played by Ryu Soo-young) and Cha Do-hee (played by Lee Da-hae) takes place here in episode 20. The ending where Do-hee gets arrested occurs here.'),(5012439,'<Good Witch Mart(착한마녀전)>The home of twin mom Imun-suk (Yang Geum-seok)'),(5012440,'<Good Witch Exhibition(착한마녀전)>This building appears as the headquarters of \'Donghae Airlines\' in episode 1 of the drama.'),(5012441,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>During the 22nd episode of this drama, when Woohan went on a business trip to this company. On the way back from the lighthouse along a small road leading to Hyunsu Bridge, Woohan confesses his feelings to Eunseong and she kisses him before running away.'),(5012442,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>A fake bus stop where Sunwoo Hwan (Lee Seung-gi) waits in episode 16'),(5012443,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>Goeun (Han Hyo-joo) comes here in episode 19 after learning that her mother betrayed her for money.'),(5012444,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>In the drama, to support Jun-se who had a conflict with his father in episode 15, Go Eun-seong (Han Hyo-joo) and Jun-se (Bae Soo-bin) visit the Koi bridge [Koi bridge in Lake Park] in the park in the afternoon. They come back here in the evening and Jun-se tells Eun-seong that he wants to be her man, not just her \'oppa\'.'),(5012445,'<Bright Heritage(찬란한 유산)> In this place, there is a scene where Jang Seok-ja (Ban Hyo-jeong) asks questions to Goeun with her family.'),(5012446,'<Shining Legacy(찬란한 유산)>In episode 4, one of Kim Hyun-woo (played by Moon Chae-won)\'s diary forecasts is in front of this department store.'),(5012447,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>In episode 9 of Brilliant Heritage, after Yoo Seung-mi (played by Moon Chae-won) fights with her mother, Sun Woo-hwan (played by Lee Seung-gi) comforts her.'),(5012448,'<Brilliant Legacy(찬란한 유산)>In episode 4, Yoo Seung-mi (Moon Chae-won) is studying, while Sun Woo-hwan (Lee Seung-gi) gives her a ride on his motorcycle.'),(5012449,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>In episode 2, Go Eun-seong (played by Han Hyo-joo) wants to end her and her brother Go Eun-woo\'s (played by Yeon Jun-seok) lives by jumping off this wall together. She returns to this place in episode 12, thinking about her missing brother all this time.'),(5012450,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>The meeting of Seon Woo-hwan (Lee Seung-gi) and Go Eun-sung (Han Hyo-joo), Eun-sung has already decided to leave for the United States and today is their farewell.'),(5012451,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>In episodes 3 and 4, it appears as the house where Ko Eun-seong (Han Hyo-joo) lives. Here, she embraces Seonu Hwan\'s (Lee Seung-gi) grandmother, Jang Seok-ja (Ban Hyo-jung), who has fallen unconscious. In some episodes, Eun-seong moves to Hwan\'s mansion, but in episode 20, she returns here after being chased away.'),(5012452,'<Brilliant Heritage(찬란한 유산)>Go Eun-sung (Han Hyo-joo) decides to sell street food to make time to search for her younger sibling in episodes 3 and 4. There, she meets Sunwoo Hwan\'s (Lee Seung-gi) grandmother, Jang Seok-ja (Bae Hyo-jung), for the first time.'),(5012453,'<Tuna and Dolphin(참치와돌고래)>In Tuna and Dolphin, it is revealed that Joowoojin (played by Jung Geonju) has arrived. Afterward, Hanyura (played by Park Yuyoon) arrives and confronts Woojin outside Moon\'s Wine and Brunch.'),(5012454,'<Tuna and Dolphin(참치와돌고래)>Kang Hyeon-ho (Park Gyu-young) eagerly awaits the arrival of Jo Woo-jin (Jung Geon-ju)'),(5012455,'<Tuna and Dolphin(참치와돌고래)>Han Yura (Yoon Bak) arrives and meets Jung Geonju (Jung Geonju) outside the cafe. She warns him not to beat Kang Hyeonho (Park Gyu-young) to be the first to arrive for Jung Geonju (Jung Geonju).'),(5012456,'<Tuna and Dolphin(참치와돌고래)>In the drama, Park Yoon and Park Kyu-young came here for a date.'),(5012457,'<Find! Tasty TV(찾아라!맛있는TV)>Find! Tasty TV Episode 683 Spicy Galbi Jjim Restaurant'),(5012458,'<Find! Delicious TV(찾아라!맛있는TV)> Find! Delicious TV Episode 507 - Royal Noodles/ Oyster Noodles'),(5012459,'<Find! Delicious TV(찾아라!맛있는TV)>Find Delicious TV Episode 594, Pork Bulgogi Baekban'),(5012460,'<Find! Delicious TV(찾아라!맛있는TV)>Find! Delicious TV Episode 676 Steak/Budae Jjigae'),(5012461,'<Find! Tasty TV(찾아라!맛있는TV)>Find! Tasty TV Episode 694 \'M\'s Dootang/Spicy Do Mi Tempura\''),(5012462,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>In episode 13, Han Tae-hwa (Shin Hyun-joon) leaves this station, and the sick Han Jung-seo (Choi Ji-woo) and Cha Song-ju (Kwon Sang-woo) follow him.'),(5012463,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>In the drama Stairway to Heaven, Cha Song-ju (actor Baek Sung-hyun) and young Han-yeong depart for the United States from this airport in episode 2. Jeong-seo (actress Park Shin-hye) bids him farewell and arrives just in time to confess her love to him, presenting him with a necklace.'),(5012464,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>This amusement park appeared as the meeting place of Cha Song-joo (Kwon Sang-woo) and Han Jung-seo (Choi Ji-woo) in a drama. In episode 1, young Song-joo (Baek Sung-hyun) and Jung-seo (Park Shin-hye) meet here before leaving for the United States, and in episode 12, the two return as adults. After being engaged to Han Yu-ri (Kim Tae-hee), he asks her to become his closest friend, in other words, his lover.'),(5012465,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>This hotel is brought to life by Cha Song-joo (played by Kwon Sang-woo) as a family business in the drama \"Stairway to Heaven\".'),(5012466,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>After their farewell, Cha Song-joo (Kwon Sang-woo) and Han Jung-seo (Choi Ji-woo) run towards each other again, only to meet under the elevator at this station.'),(5012467,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>In episode 12 of Stairway to Heaven, Cha Song-joo (Kwon Sang-woo) suggests to Han Jung-seo (Choi Ji-woo) to be friends after their reunion at the airport, and offers to give her a ride to the station. She initially refuses, but he follows her and arrives at the station, where he wipes the rain off her face and pats her with a handkerchief.'),(5012468,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>In this mansion, adult Cha Song-joo (Kwon Sang-woo) lives. In episode 12, Han Tae-hwa (Shin Hyun-joon) comes to confront him about his engagement to Han Yu-ri (Kim Tae-hee).'),(5012469,'<Stairway to Heaven(천국의 계단)>In episodes 13-14 of Stairway to Heaven, Han Tae-hwa (Shin Hyun-joon) and Han Jung-seo (Choi Ji-woo) arrive at this station. Cha Song-ju (Kwon Sang-woo) waits for her at the railway and confesses his love to her.'),(5012470,'<Heaven\'s Tears(천국의 눈물)>In episode 19, Yoon Cha-young (Hong Ah-reum) and Jin Hyun-woong (In Gyo-jin) came together for a wedding dress fitting.'),(5012471,'<A Thousand Dollar Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>The pond was depicted in a painting by the young man who requested the mural on the building. It was painted because it was a place loved by the father of a missing painter.'),(5012472,'<One Won Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>In the first episode, Cheon Jihun (played by Namkoong Min) and Baek Mari (played by Kim Ji-eun) are seen greeting each other outside the building before entering the trial they are representing, appearing in the courtroom.'),(5012473,'<The Advocate of Ten Thousand Won(천원짜리 변호사)>In the drama \"Eleventh Mom,\" Cheon Ji-hoon (played by Namkoong Min) actually lectures here when he goes undercover.'),(5012474,'<Cheonwon Lawyers(천원짜리 변호사)>In Episode 2 of \"Hundreds of Whites\" (Kim Ji-eun), she comes here to shop with her mother.'),(5012475,'<Cheonwon Attorney(천원짜리 변호사)>In this episode, Cheon Ji-hoon (Namgoong Min) proposed to Lee Joo-young (Lee Chung-ah) at this restaurant.'),(5012476,'<Lawyer Cheonjihoon\'s Office(천원짜리 변호사)>Cheon Won Legal Office'),(5012477,'<Cheonjihoon Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>Cheonjihoon Lawyer\'s store where he takes on clients by exchanging a 1,000 won ice cream as legal fee for the little clients.'),(5012478,'<One Thousand Won Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>In episode 11, Cheon Ji-hoon (Namgoong Min) crosses this park and is guided by Baek Mari (Kim Ji-eun) towards the fan building.'),(5012479,'<The 1,000-won Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>Cheon Ji-hoon (Nam Goong Min) debates with prosecutor Na Ye-jin (Gong Hyo-jin) at this university\'s Sangsang Hall. Afterward, Lee Joo-young (Lee Chung-ah) appears and contemplates investigating her father on the rooftop terrace of this building at night.'),(5012480,'<One Dollar Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>In episode 1, Cheon Ji-hoon (Namgoong Min) drives over this bridge.'),(5012481,'<One-won Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>Cheon Ji-hoon (Namgoong Min) meets a client at this bridge in episode 1 who wants to end their life.'),(5012482,'<Lawyer with a Thousand Won(천원짜리 변호사)>In episode 1, Cheon Ji-hoon (played by Namgoong Min) stops by the intersection of this street on his way to First Cleaners.'),(5012483,'<One-thousand-won Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>A place where a one-thousand-won lawyer went to help a suspect who was wrongly arrested as a pickpocket with a previous criminal record.'),(5012484,'<Cheonwon Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)> Main workplace of Park Jin Woo, Office Manager in the Cheonjihoon Lawyer Team'),(5012485,'<The 1,000 won lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>In episode 1 of \"Muzang\" (starring Park Jin-woo), he discovers Cheon Ji-hoon (played by Nam Gun-min) in the park, deeply lost in thought. Muzang tells Ji-hoon that they need to go somewhere and hints that he has gained a new client.'),(5012486,'<Thousand Won Lawyer(천원짜리 변호사)>The place where the lawyer of a thousand won, hundred won, and office manager tilted the glass.'),(5012487,'<Cheonil\'s Promise(천일의 약속)>In episode 18, Lee Seo-yeon (Su Ae) celebrates her birthday party here.'),(5012488,'<Queen Cheol In(철인왕후)>Known as the main palace of Queen Cheol In.'),(5012489,'<Empress Cheolin(철인왕후)>It appears as part of the palace of Empress Cheolin.'),(5012490,'<Jumong(철인왕후)>Kim So-yong (Shin Hye-sun) and Cheoljong (Kim Jeong-hyun) have a moment where their hearts flutter as they drink tea here and Cheoljong protects himself from intruders with a spinning kick.'),(5012491,'<Iron Empress(철인왕후)>In episode 20, Jang Bong-hwan (Choi Jin-hyuk) wakes up in a plant-like human form, escapes from the hospital, and eventually exits through exit 1 of this station.'),(5012492,'<Queen Cheolin(철인왕후)>In episode 1, Jang Bong-hwan (Choi Jin-hyuk) conducts an interview in this suite room.'),(5012493,'<Chul doo Queen(철인왕후)>When Jang Bong-hwi arrived at Cheol-in Queen, his first mission was to fill the lake with water, which he thinks is the gateway to returning to the present. In episodes 5-6, he jumps into the lake and tries to come back but is rescued by Lee Won-beom (Kim Jung-hyun).'),(5012494,'<First Love(첫사랑)>In episode 23, Seong Chan-hyuk (played by Choi Soo-jong) and Lee Seung-yeon (played by Lee Hyo-kyung) visited this park for a date.'),(5012495,'<\"Because This Is My First First Love\"(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In the last episode, Hansong-i (Chae Yeon) and Dohyun (Jung Jin-young) decide to visit Gangneung together.'),(5012496,'<First Love is for the First Time(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 9, Do Hyun goes on a trip with his girlfriend Ryu Se Hyun (Hong Ji Yoon). The first kiss between Do Hyun and Song Yi at the pool is only seen by Tae Oh.'),(5012497,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 12 (Season 2, 4) of \"My First First Love,\" Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon) and Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) arrive at this bus terminal (\'Jeonju Intercity Bus Terminal\') from Seoul. On their way back, Seo Do-hyun (Jung Jin-young) appears at the bus terminal with Song-i to return to Seoul.'),(5012498,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)> In episode 2 of My First First Love, this convenience store is where Seo Do-hyun (Jung Jin-young) is working part-time. In episode 5, Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) challenges Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) to a fierce basketball game and then goes to find him with tteokbokki.'),(5012499,'<First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 10, Choi Hoon (Kang Tae Oh) and Oh Ga Rin (Choi Ri) narrowly escape Ga Rin\'s family staff and run across this footbridge. While catching their breath, Hoon confesses to Ga Rin that he was the one who anonymously helped her by letting her know his whereabouts.'),(5012500,'<\"First Love vs. First Time\"(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 6, actor Choi Hoon (Kang Tae-oh) visits this building to sign a contract and appears as a replacement actor for the talent company \'Act Musical Company\'.'),(5012501,'<First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 3, Choi Hun (Kang Tae-oh) performs at this cafe-restaurant as an extra in a drama and brings Ogarin (Choi Ri) along to help her earn some money as well.'),(5012502,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 6, Yoon Tae-o (Jisoo) comes here with Ryu Se-hyun (Hong Ji-yoon) to buy books. Sehyun shows Tae-o a photo book published by her father and shares one of the pearls of wisdom from it.'),(5012503,'<First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 5, Do Hyun (Jung Jin-young) bought churros from the food truck in front of this building\'s stand for Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon).'),(5012504,'<Love at First Song(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episodes 4, 5, and 7, Hansong-I (Jeong Chaeyeon) passes by these two stores on her way home.'),(5012505,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon) walks down this street after being rejected by Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) for walking to school together in Episode 4. Tae-oh zooms past her on his scooter, and she watches him leave as if she can\'t believe it.'),(5012506,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 3, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) and Seo Do-hyeon (Jung Jin-young) ride a fruit tart together for Ryu Se-hyun (Hong Ji-yoon). While waiting, they talk about Han Song-i (Jeong Chaeyeon), and Tae-oh mentions that if Han Song-i starts dating, he hopes someone will quickly date her so she won\'t rely on him anymore.'),(5012507,'<First Love Again(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 7, Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon) and Seo Do-hyeon (Jung Jin-young) walk down this street after enjoying a fun drawing activity as part of their date.'),(5012508,'<Because It\'s My First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 9, Seo Do-hyun (Jung Jin-young) brings Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) to this record store. And when she listens to the record, he kisses her.'),(5012509,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 13, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) and Seo Do-hyeon (Jung Jin-young) shared their stories with each other in this tunnel.'),(5012510,'<My First Love Only Came to Me Once(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 6, Choi Hoon (Kang Tae-oh) and Oh Ga-rin (Choi Ri) walk in this park. In episode 9, Seo Do-hyun (Jung Jin-young) and Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) come out to the park stairs to drink and chat. Tae-oh suggests talking more about Do-hyun and Song-i based on \'over 20 years of friendship\', but Do-hyun politely declines, saying \"Love is about getting to know a person.\"'),(5012511,'<Because It\'s My First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>After Yoon Tae-oh (Ji soo) saves Han Song-yi (Jeong Chae-yeon) from being harassed by a senior, the two head to a cafe to have drinks in Episode 9.'),(5012512,'<Love at First Sight(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>Some parts of this university are shown as the place where Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo), Do Hyeon (Jung Jin-young), and Han Song-yi (Jeong Chae-yeon) attend.'),(5012513,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In Episode 4 of My First First Love, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) chases after Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon).'),(5012514,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 2, Hansong-i (Jung Chae-yeon) crosses this bridge feeling tough and lonely.'),(5012515,'<First Love is a First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>First Love is a First Love was used in several scenes. In Season 1 Episode 3, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) finds out that Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon) is going through a difficult time and asks for help without telling her. In Season 1 Episode 6, Tae-oh and Song-i sit on the school playground slide, eating ice cream and talking.'),(5012516,'<First Love Ever(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>Han Song-yi (played by Jung Chae-yeon) is surprised by Yoon Tae-oh (played by Ji Soo) returning from Jeju Island after spending time with his mother in episode 15.'),(5012517,'<First Love at First Kiss(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 1, Seo Dohyun (Jung Jinyoung) and Yoon Taeoh (Jisoo) meet at this restaurant\'s \'Fantastic Rooftop\' terrace.'),(5012518,'<First Love: Do You Know How to Pout?(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 6, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) and Ryu Se-hyun (Hong Ji-yoon) decide to go on a date and ride their scooters across this bridge to take each other home.'),(5012519,'<\"Because It\'s My First Love\"(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 2, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) had to stop in front of the railroad tracks on this street because of a passing train on his way home.'),(5012520,'<First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 15, Seo Dohyun (Jung Jinyoung) comes here with his father (Park Sooyoung) to drink and have a heartfelt conversation.'),(5012521,'<First Love (Because It\'s My First Love)(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>This is a restaurant where Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) lives. Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) works part-time (refer to episodes 1, 2, 5) and Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) looks for her in episode 2.'),(5012522,'<First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) and Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) ride Tae-oh\'s scooter to school in episode 1, passing by the Boseong Girls\' High School entrance bus stop on this street. They briefly appear again in episode 15, where Tae-oh and Song-yi meet right next to the staircase.'),(5012523,'<Because It\'s My First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>The tea house Han Song-i (played by Jeong Chae-yeon) appears as her house (built by her father) and she gets kicked out in episode 1.'),(5012524,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 11, Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon) visits this flower shop and asks the owner if he has recently seen her mother.'),(5012525,'<First Love is for the First Time(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 7 of the project meeting, Hansongyi (Jeong Chaeyeon) comes here with her fellow students.'),(5012526,'<First Love: Because It\'s The First(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>After riding a long scooter in episode 6, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) and Seo Do-hyun (Jinyoung) stopped by here to chat.'),(5012527,'<Because It\'s My First Time(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>As seen in episode 1, Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) and Han Song-i (Jung Chae-yeon) both attended this school. In episode 3, Tae-oh refuses to be dropped off at Ryu Se-hyun\'s (Hong Ji-yoon) house and gets off here.'),(5012528,'<First Love At First Sight(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>During their 9th date at \"First Love At First Sight,\" they stopped in front of a food truck across from H&M and bought egg bread.'),(5012529,'<My first first love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 16, Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) and Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) take a walk here after finishing their late-night shopping.'),(5012530,'<First Love is a First Time(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 9, Seo Do-hyun (Jung Jin-young) and Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) come to date.'),(5012531,'<Because It\'s My First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 2, the hotel where Oh Gah Rin\'s (Choi Ri) mother stays appears.'),(5012532,'<Because It\'s My First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 1, Oh Ga-rin (Choi Ri) arrives at this place and avoids two bodyguards sent by her mother to where Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) is located.'),(5012533,'<My First First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon), Seo Do-hyun (Jung Jin-young), Yoon Tae-oh (Ji Soo) arrive at this bus terminal in Jeonju in episodes 12 (Season 2, 4) of My First First Love.'),(5012534,'<First Love(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>In episode 12, Hansong-i (played by Jung Chaeyeon) visits the cathedral to talk to her mother after seeing her with someone else.'),(5012535,'<First Love For the First Time(첫사랑은 처음이라서)>Yoon Tae-oh (Jisoo) and Han Song-yi (Jung Chae-yeon) arrive in Jeonju and walk along this street in episode 12.'),(5012536,'<Cheongdam-dong Alice(청담동 앨리스)>In episode 16, Han Se-kyeong (Moon Geun-young) passes by this department store.'),(5012537,'<Cheongdam-dong Alice(청담동 앨리스)>Han Se-kyung (Moon Geun-young) passes through this subway station\'s exit 7 in the final episode 16.'),(5012538,'<Cheongdam-dong Alice(청담동 앨리스)> This building appears as the headquarters of luxury brand Artemis run by Cha Seung-jo in Cheongdam-dong Alice. In the final 16th episode, Han Se-kyung (Moon Geun-young) comes for an interview.'),(5012539,'<Cheongdam-dong Alice(청담동 앨리스)>In episode 8 of Cheongdam-dong Alice, Han Se-kyung (played by Moon Geun-young) hides in this hot spring facility.'),(5012540,'<Chungdamdong Alice(청담동 앨리스)>In episode 16 of the drama \"The Last Empress,\" Seo Yoonju (played by So Yi-hyun) and Tommy Hong (played by Kim Ji-seok) coincidentally meet at the entrance of this shopping mall.'),(5012541,'<Youth(청춘)>In \"Youth 3,\" Chae-hee (played by Hwang Soo-jung) and Hyun-woo (played by Jang Dong-gun) pass by this record store in the afternoon, walking together up to the crosswalk in front of the record store (which no longer exists).'),(5012542,'<Youth(청춘)> In episode 1, Chaehui (played by Hwang Soo-jung) who returned from the United States works at this gallery. Here, Hyunwoo (played by Jang Dong-gun) who has been separated from her for many years, first discovers her. They promise to meet at the gallery in the evening, but Hyunwoo arrives late. In episode 2, he looks for Chaehui who is with her fiancé.'),(5012543,'<Youth(청춘)>He approaches her in youth and tells her she has to go home. She insists on staying and tells him to leave her alone. He goes home. But when he turns back, he sees Woonyoung being harassed by two men and informs them that he is her boyfriend.'),(5012544,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 2, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) remembers how fashion designer Charlie Jung (Lee Seung-joon) brought him to this club and confessed his feelings to him.'),(5012545,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) and Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) come to this park for an evening date. In episode 6, they share their first kiss in front of the piano at this park.'),(5012546,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>The garden at this location is where the character Sa Hye-jun (played by Park Bo-gum) appeared when filming a drama at Herb Village. Make-up stylist and girlfriend Jung Ha (played by Park Sodam) arrives on set with her close friend Hye-hyo (played by Byun Woo-seok), and they discuss how Hye-jun can avoid certain scenes in between takes.'),(5012547,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In the drama \"Youth Record,\" episode 2, Sahyejun (Park Bo-gum) attends a Milan fashion show that actually takes place at this location.'),(5012548,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>AnJungHa (Park So-dam) and Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) came here to ride in episode 8.'),(5012549,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In the drama \"Youth Record,\" Sa Hae-jun (Park Bo-gum) films at this set in episode 10.'),(5012550,'<Record of Youth(청춘기록)>In episode 3 of Record of Youth, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) and An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) meet at the Starfield Library at this location. Hye-jun revisits the place in episodes 7 and 8 to study for his role.'),(5012551,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>Sa Hye-jun (played by Park Bo-gum) is interviewing at this hotel to promote his new movie \'The First Human\' in Episode 12.'),(5012552,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In the drama, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) and An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) pass by this store at night.'),(5012553,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 14, Ahn Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) and Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) pass by this \'store\' and stop in front of it while talking about \'couple culture.\' She thinks that healthy couples can avoid conflicts at all costs and grow together.'),(5012554,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 2, An Jung-ha (played by Park So-dam) gave free makeup advice on this street for her video blog.'),(5012555,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>Actor Park Doha (Kim Geonwoo) and his manager Lee Taesoo (Lee Changhoon) meet with a PD and a writer (Kim Rosa) at this restaurant.'),(5012556,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 4, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) and An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) meet at this building in the afternoon.'),(5012557,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 4, when Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) drunkenly returns home, Ahn Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) cries in disappointment at the south entrance of this tunnel.'),(5012558,'<Cheongchun Record(청춘기록)>This small street is where An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) lives, next to a convenience store. In episodes 1, she is seen walking down the street with her work friend, sharing makeup tips on her video channel and taking selfies. In episodes 5 and 6, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) walks home in the rain despite trying to avoid it outside the convenience store. Hye-jun admits his feelings for Jeong-ha in episode 6, then walks home through a nearby tunnel, promising not to look back to see if Jeong-ha is waiting for him.'),(5012559,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 16, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) was appointed as an honorary ambassador for social welfare at this hotel\'s convention center.'),(5012560,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In the drama, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) and his grandfather conduct training for senior models at this park.'),(5012561,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 5, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum), An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam), and Won Hae-hyo (Byun Woo-seok) decide to eat jjajangmyeon with Hye-jun\'s manager, Lee Min-jae (Shin Dong-mi). Hye-jun boasts about his parking skills and gets into a heated argument with Jeong-ha, who is sitting in the passenger seat, while Min-jae tries to calm them down.'),(5012562,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 12, Kim Jinwoo (Kwon Soo Hyun) and Won Haena (Jo Yoo Jung) meet at this part of the park and talk about the pros and cons of dating and marriage, as well as the real and imaginary worlds.'),(5012563,'<Record of Youth(청춘기록)>In the drama \"Record of Youth\", An Jeong-ha\'s (Park So-dam) bus crosses this bridge.'),(5012564,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>After hearing the news that Hyejun was cast in the Drama Gateway, Hae-hyo (Byun Woo-seok) and Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum), close friends who parted ways halfway across this bridge in Episode 8.'),(5012565,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)> Sa Hae-jun (Park Bo-gum) makes frequent appearances at the neighborhood convenience store on his commute. You can see him in episodes 1, 2, and 3.'),(5012566,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In the final episode 16, Sa Hyun (played by Park Bo Gum) drives An Jung Ha (played by Park So Dam) to this empty parking lot, needing answers for their breakup and attempting to reunite once again. Hyun, who has already achieved a lot in his career, felt their timing was off since she was still striving for her business to succeed. Despite Hyun confessing his love and pleading with her, Jung Ha only reminisces about the beautiful times they spent together and pushes him away.'),(5012567,'<Cheongchun-girok(청춘기록)>In episode 14, Sa Hye-jun (played by Park Bo-gum) is depicted talking to his wealthy friend Won Hae-hyo (played by Byeon Woo-seok) about his life. In episode 16, Hye-jun goes back to the rooftop, looks out at Hannam-dong below, realizes he has achieved his dream, and finally enlists in the military.'),(5012568,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 1, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) tricks his friend Kim Jin-woo (Kwon Soo-hyun) into going for an evening jog. As they pass by this building in the neighborhood, they run into Won Hae-hyo (Byun Woo-seok).'),(5012569,'<Cheongchun Girok(청춘기록)>It is the place where Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) lives.'),(5012570,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 1, Sahyejun (Park Bo-gum), Kim Jin-woo (Kwon Soo-hyun), and Won Hae-hyo (Byun Woo-seok) spend time at this park.'),(5012571,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 2, after dinner, Sahaejun (Park Bo Gum) walks along this street.'),(5012572,'<Cheongchun Log(청춘기록)>In episode 1 of Record of Youth, Sa Hye-jun (played by Park Bo-gum) takes a bus that heads towards this street until it changes to 20-20 Sowol-ro.'),(5012573,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>This is where Hye-jun (played by Park Bo-gum) works part-time and first appears in episodes 1 and 6. Hye-jun is so famous that many female customers come to see the attractive part-timer.'),(5012574,'<Youth Records(청춘기록)>In the 1-2 episodes, the \'Ommejeong Fashion Show\', where Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) and Kim Jin-woo (Kwon Soo-hyun) appear as models, unfolds here. It is also where An Jeong-ha (Park So-dam) first meets Hye-jun, whom she has a crush on, as a makeup artist.'),(5012575,'<Cheongchun Record(청춘기록)>In episode 5, the Won family visits here to celebrate Won Hae-na (played by Cho Yoo-jung) for passing the law school entrance exam.'),(5012576,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In the last episode 16, Suh Hye-joon (Park Bo-gum) is filming a romantic drama called \'Love Comes with Rain\'.'),(5012577,'<Youth Records(청춘기록)>In episode 3, Sahyejun (Park Bo Gum) and An Jungha (Park So Dam) pass this place. They share the same umbrella and playfully bicker with each other.'),(5012578,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 3, Kim Jin-woo (Kwon Soo-hyun) and Won Hae-na (Jo Yoo-jung) come to this restaurant for a dinner date.'),(5012579,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>In episode 2, Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) and his new manager Lee Min-jae (Shin Dong-mi) return from their trip to Milan and arrive at the airport.'),(5012580,'<Youth Record(청춘기록)>Sa Hye-jun (Park Bo-gum) is filming a drama at this set in episode 9.'),(5012581,'<Cheongchun Shidae(청춘시대)>It is shown regularly (from episode 2). It depicts Hwayoung, a financially comfortable student, driving comfortably, passing by her roommate and fellow student Jinmyeong (Han Ye Ri) when she walks home or works part-time. However, Hwayoung does not stop her car to give her friend a ride.'),(5012582,'<Cheongchun Sidae(청춘시대)>Restaurant where Han Ye-ri worked in Cheongchun Sidae Season 1'),(5012583,'<Cheongchun Sidae(청춘시대)> Park Hye Su and Shin Hyun Soo went to a bar in Cheongchun Sidae 1'),(5012584,'<Cheongchun Shidae(청춘시대)>In the drama Cheongchun Shidae 1, Han Seung-yeon and Ji Il-joo visited this cafe.'),(5012585,'<Cheongchun Sidae(청춘시대)>Yonsei University where Han Ye-ri attended in Cheongchun Sidae Season 1.'),(5012586,'<Age of Youth 2(청춘시대 2)>Kang Yi-na (played by Ryu Hwa-young) comes here in episode 2 to jog and exercise in the morning.'),(5012587,'<Cheongchun Shidae 2(청춘시대 2)>The ossuary featured in Cheongchun Shidae 2'),(5012588,'<Cheongchun Age 2(청춘시대 2)>The museum where the final episode of Cheongchun Age 2 was filmed.'),(5012589,'<Age of Youth 2(청춘시대 2)>This restaurant is featured in the drama with Park Jaewan (Yoon Park) working as a chef and Yoon Jinmyeong (Han Yeri) working as a part-time waitress.'),(5012590,'<Cheer Up 2(청춘시대 2)>In episode 3, Kwon Ho-chang (Lee Yoo-jin) saves Jung Ye-eun (Han Seung-yeon) from her old high school friends and brings her to the Mapo Tourist Information Center.'),(5012591,'<Cheer Up 2(청춘시대 2)> Introducing Seo Jang-hoon (Kim Min-seok) to meet Joeun (Choi Ah-ra) and An Ye-ji (Shin Se-hwi) in episode 5.'),(5012592,'<Cheerful Age 2(청춘시대 2)>In episode 3, Song Ji-won (played by Park Eun-bin) goes on