Ja-seong) comes here to find her.'),(5012628,'<Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episode 21 (out of 11 episodes in total), Ki Dae-joo (played by Ku Ja-seong) goes on a camping fishing trip and Veronica Park (played by Kim Jae-kyung) surprises him by joining to win his heart.'),(5012629,'<Chomyeon Saranghabnida(초면에 사랑합니다)>In the first episode (full episode 1), Do Min-ik (played by Kim Young-kwang) misunderstands Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo), his secretary, as someone else due to her request. He insists on participating in the company\'s athletic event at this facility, but what Gal-hee truly wanted was a permanent contract. Instead, she gets fired right after the incident.'),(5012631,'<Chomyeon Saranghamnida(초면에 사랑합니다)>The exterior of this restaurant is the restaurant where Veronica Park (played by Kim Jaekyung) is located, and in episode 15 (out of a total of 8 episodes), Goryeo (Kuja) and Ji-eun are having dinner.'),(5012632,'<First Love(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episode 1, Gae-joo (played by Gu Ja-sung) gets invited by his colleague Do Min-ik\'s uncle, Shim Hae-yong (played by Kim Min-sang), to have dinner here. Ha-yeong explains that when putting fish head on Gae-joo\'s plate, once he tastes it, he will never eat the tail again. In episode 13 (7th episode), Ha-yong and Dae-woo come back again.'),(5012633,'<Falling in love at first sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>In the 14th episode (out of 7 total episodes), Do Min-ik (Kim Young-kwang) and Jung Gal-hee (Jin Ki-joo) walk down this street when they seek shelter near a tractor at the end of the road during a sudden rain.'),(5012634,'<Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>This restaurant appears in episode 8 as the restaurant where Veronica Park (played by Kim Jae-kyung) and Ki Dae-ju (played by Koo Ja-sung) have dinner, with Veronica saying that things won\'t get better than this.'),(5012635,'<Love at first sight(초면에 사랑합니다)> Jang Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo) dines alone at this restaurant after being fired.'),(5012636,'<Chomyeon Loves You(초면에 사랑합니다)>When Do Min-ik (Kim Young-kwang) comes to Seven Eleven, he looks directly at this bus stop. He recalls the time he spent with Jung Gal-hee (Jin Ki-joo) in episode 17.'),(5012637,'<First Encounter Love(초면에 사랑합니다)>In the drama, Do Min-ik (Kim Young-kwang) and Jung Gal-hee (Jin Ki-joo) make an appearance at the \'Happy 24\' convenience store and in episode 15 (out of a total of 8 episodes), Min-ik\'s wish is for Gal-hee to make coffee for him during their 12-hour romance at this convenience store. In episode 17 (out of a total of 9 episodes), a heartbroken Min-ik returns to the date they had.'),(5012638,'<Chomyunesaranghabnida(초면에 사랑합니다)>This building is the headquarters of T&T Mobile operated by Kim Young Kwang and his secretary Jin Ki Joo. The rooftop terrace on the concert hall floor of this building is a regular meeting place for Min Ik and his close friend Gu Ja Sung.'),(5012639,'<Encounter Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episode 13 (total of 7 episodes), Kim Young-kwang\'s character, Do Min-ik, rushes to this park in the afternoon to raise his blood pressure.'),(5012640,'<Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>It is a secret hideout that Do Min-Ik (played by Kim Young-kwang) met his best friend, Kae Doo-jun (played by Go Jae-sung), since childhood. As seen in episode 3, they spend time at this club.'),(5012641,'<The Lovers in the First Encounter(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episode 16 (out of 8 episodes total), characters Domineek (played by Kim Young-kwang) and Jung Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo) share a kiss on the rooftop of this restaurant.'),(5012642,'<Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episode 11, Gidaeju (Gu Jasung) requests to meet Veronica Park (Kim Jaekyung) at this park and asks for a proxy signature for the upcoming T&T Mobile shareholders\' meeting.'),(5012643,'<Falling in Love at First Kiss(초면에 사랑합니다)>After being fired in Episode 4 (out of a total of 2 episodes), Jeong Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo) takes a day off to enjoy life and stroll around Seoul.'),(5012644,'<I Fell in Love at First Kiss(초면에 사랑합니다)>In order to congratulate their younger brother Jung Nam-hee\'s (Kim Ji-min) theater stage, Jung Gal-hee (Jin Ki-joo) and her brother Jung Joong-hee (Seo Dong-won) decide to buy flowers at this store. In episode 28 (out of a total of 14 episodes), Do Min-ik (Kim Young-kwang) watches them from afar, filled with jealousy.'),(5012645,'<I Love You in the First Meeting(초면에 사랑합니다)>T&T Secretaries have lunch here, chatting and spending time together. They meet here in episodes 5 and 9. In episode 13, Domineek (Kim Young-kwang) and Jung Gal-hee (Jin Ki-joo) coincidentally meet here and later she rides a bicycle.'),(5012646,'< Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>During the dinner date with Dominic (played by Kim Young-kwang), who disguised himself as Veronica in Episode 15 (total 8 episodes), Jung Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo) asks Dominic if he wants to commit adultery.'),(5012647,'<Chomyun Saranghamnida(초면에 사랑합니다)>In the TV drama \"Chomyun Saranghamnida\", Kim Young-kwang, playing the character Do Min-ik, gets out of the car at this park in episode 6 and leaves his driver behind to rush to meet his date at Kingdom Hotel for dinner.'),(5012648,'<First Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>The appearance of this hospital appears as Sangmo Hospital where Kim Young-gwang plays a doctor uncle Gu Seok-chan (Kim Byung-chun) receives treatment.'),(5012649,'<Chomyeon-saranghamnida(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episode 17 (9 episodes in total), Jung Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo) climbs the stairs leading to this house on her way home.'),(5012650,'<Love at First Sight(초면에 사랑합니다)>In episodes 10-12, the major shareholder of TNT Mobile, Do Min-ik (played by Kim Young-kwang), votes in a shareholder meeting in this room. Veronica Park (played by Kim Jae-kyung) attends. Min-ik drags Jung Gal-hee (played by Jin Ki-joo) to the voting booth and they vote together.'),(5012651,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>In \'Love Forecast,\' Joo Sang-soon (Yoon Kye-sang) and Kim Hyun-woo (Ha Ji-won) meet again for the first time as adults at this place.'),(5012652,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>In episode 16, Moon Cha-young (played by Ha Ji-won) comes to this church to pray. Lee Kang (played by Yoon Kye-sang) watches over her from a distance.'),(5012653,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>This building is where twin brothers Mun Cha-young (Ha Ji-won) and Mun Chi-se participate in the Greek police station in episodes 2 and onwards. It is where Tae-hyun (Min Jin-woong) is supposed to meet.'),(5012654,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>Appears as \'Gosung Hospital\' run by the Lee family. It is where Lee Gang (played by Yoon Kye-sang) and Lee Joon (played by Jang Seung-jo) work, and Moon Cha-young (played by Ha Ji-won) receives treatment.'),(5012655,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>In episode 3, Yi Kang (Yoon Kye-sang) joins his close friend Kwon Min-seong (Yu Te) at the \'Spy & Party Room\' bar.'),(5012656,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>The Real Live video of the bell ringing to welcome 2013 was released in the first episode.'),(5012657,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>In the drama \"The Master\'s Sun,\" Jungdori Beach Park is where Joo Joong-won (So Ji-sub) waits for Tae Gong-shil (Gong Hyo-jin) and falls asleep on a bench. When he comes to find her, she is still asleep. He covers her with his jacket and leans on her shoulder for 4 hours until she wakes up.'),(5012658,'<Chocolate(초콜릿)>In this beach, Moon Cha-young (played by Ha Ji-won) tells Lee Gang (played by Yoon Kye-sang) a \'long story\' about her first love in episode 14.'),(5012659,'<The Bachelor\'s Vegetable Store(총각네 야채가게)>Jin Jin-sim (played by Wang Ji-hye) and Han Tae-yang (played by Ji Chang-wook) meet for a date in this park in the final episode 24.'),(5012660,'<Prime Minister and I(총리와 나)>In episode 15, Nam Dajeong (Im YoonA) makes a promise to Kwon Yul (Lee Beomsoo) to meet him at this building. However, he actually finds his wife, Park Nayoung (Jung Aeyeon), waiting for him there.'),(5012661,'<Prime Minister and I(총리와 나)>In episode 4, Kang Dami (played by Mindohee) and her friends Yoon Seong-hyun (played by Lyeoun) and Lee Ha-rim (played by Jin Ye-ju) visited this cafe to write their college entrance resumes.'),(5012662,'<\"Prime Minister and I\"(총리와 나)>In episode 15, Na Jung (played by Yoona) and Kwon Yul (played by Lee Beom-soo) walk along this street. During their date, she asks him what would happen if they were to break up.'),(5012663,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 16, there is a scene where Hyunsoo (Yoon Jeongil) confronts his mother (Lee Han-na) about the reason for being at Kang-Soo\'s (Go Kyung-pyo) house.'),(5012664,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>After facing major difficulties threatening the company\'s livelihood in Episode 16, Choi Kang-soo (Go Kyung-pyo) returns to his hometown to find comfort. Lee Dan-ah (Chae Soo-bin) comes to convince him to return to Seoul, and his mother (Lee Hang-na) also secretly tries to visit him after hearing about his situation.'),(5012665,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 4, Kang Soo (Ko Kyung-pyo) meets Gong Ji (Kim Ki-doo) and his subordinates outside the mart. Gong Ji invites Kang Soo to dinner at Hanyang Seolleongtang to welcome him. However, Kang Soo informs him that Hanyang has temporarily closed its doors. He then delivers the news about the accident of the owner\'s grandson, Hyun Soo (Yoon Jung-il).'),(5012666,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>It was the background of Oh Jin-kyu (played by Kim Sun-ho) in episode 4.'),(5012667,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 12, they appeared at \'Gildong Station\' (actual station on line 5), where the Strongest Delivery Team including Choigang-su (Go Kyung-pyo) and Lee Dan-ah (Chae Soo-bin) distributed flyers to promote their new delivery service.'),(5012668,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>This restaurant appears as one of the branches of \'Jeong Family Seolleongtang,\' the archenemy restaurant of the protagonist Ko Kang-su (played by Go Kyung-pyo), in the drama. It is a chain run by the mother of Lee Ji-yoon (played by Ko Won-hee), and Oh Jin-gyu (played by Kim Sun-ho) works as a branch manager from episode 6 but quits in episode 11.'),(5012669,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 5, the strongest deliveryman Choigangsu (Go Kyung-pyo) and the deliverymen walk down the street to find out about Hyunsu\'s hit work.'),(5012670,'<The Best Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 12, the Best Deliveryman Team visited this place while doing a team-building retreat in Maehyang-ri, the hometown of Min Chan (played by Heo Ji-won).'),(5012671,'<\"The Strongest Deliveryman\"(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 12, the delivery team rode an MT to Maehyang-ri and headed towards Maehyang-ri.'),(5012672,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 3, Oh Jin-gyu (played by Kim Sun-ho) and Lee Ji-yoon (played by Go Won-hee) have a company dinner here.'),(5012673,'<Strong Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>O Jin-kyu (played by Kim Sun-ho) This is the headquarters of his father\'s company. In episode 2, Jin-kyu is severely beaten by his father in the office and is thrown out of the company building.'),(5012674,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>This is the headquarters of the Chinese restaurant \'Sungguk\', owned by the neighborhood delivery man Baek Gonggi (Kim Gidoo). The show depicts a showdown between the strongest water delivery man and the strongest first delivery man in the first and second episodes.'),(5012675,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>This building is where Idan (played by Chae Soo-bin) stayed. She lived on the rooftop with her roommate Choi Yeon-ji (played by Nam Ji-hyun). In episodes 12 and 13, there is a scene where Lee Ji-yoon (played by Ko Won-hee) reluctantly moves down to the 3rd floor with Oh Jin-kyu (played by Kim Sun-ho).'),(5012676,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>This place used to be a flower shop where Seongjae (played by Kim Kyung-nam) picked flowers to expand his customer base for delivery in Episode 16. In response to a florist\'s request to receive deliveries with a more friendly face, he gave a peculiar smile from this place.'),(5012677,'<TV Show(최강 배달꾼)>This is where the strongest deliveryman Cha Kang-soo (played by Ko Kyung-pyo) and a mysterious woman, Lee Dan-ah (played by Chae Soo-bin), work.'),(5012678,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 8, Gangsoo (Go Kyung-pyo) and Dana (Chae Soo-bin) finish their movie date and are walking on the sidewalk perpendicular to this street.'),(5012679,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In the second episode, he jumps off this bridge to commit suicide and wants to follow his father\'s \'final command\'. While still blaming himself, Dana (played by Cha Soo-bin) passes by and starts persuading him, but he slips and they both end up falling into the Han River. And through a flashback, we find out that Dana was once in the exact same place as Jinkyu.'),(5012680,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In the final episode 16, Dana (Chae Soo-bin) enters this university in the epilogue. She comes out of the student council building and Kang-soo (Go Kyung-pyo) waits for her there.'),(5012681,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>During a police chase, Oh Jin-gyu (Kim Sun-ho) drives, in Episode 5 he is with Lee Dan-ah (Chae Soo-bin). In the latter half of Episode 5, you can see Dan-ah distributing takeout leaflets under this bridge.'),(5012682,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 1, when Oh Jin-gyu (Kim Seon-ho) is driving on Banpo Bridge, buildings appear in the background.'),(5012683,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 11, he decides to stop seeing the Jung family. He falls into Chairman Jung Hye-ran\'s (played by Kim Hye-ri) scheme and suffers.'),(5012684,'<Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>O Jin-gyu (played by Kim Sun-ho) attempts suicide by jumping off the Gwangjin Bridge, and Dan-ah (played by Chae Soo-bin) saves him and takes him to a convenience store next to the Jamsil Bridge.'),(5012685,'<The Uncanny Encounter(최강 배달꾼)>Choi Kang-soo (played by Go Kyung-pyo) met all his friends he made while delivering in episodes 4 and 5, asking them to help him find the culprit of the car racing here.'),(5012686,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In the drama, \"The Strongest Deliveryman,\" Cha Kang-soo (Go Kyung-pyo) takes the intoxicated Lee Dan-ah (Chae Soo-bin) home from the bar in episode 7.'),(5012687,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>This is the shop of the mother of the strongest water deliveryman, Go Kyung-pyo. He came here in episode 11 to visit a good friend (who he later finds out is his step-brother).'),(5012688,'<The Strongest Deliveryman(최강 배달꾼)>In episode 7, the strongest deliveryman, Choigangsu (Go Kyung-pyo), was imprisoned here.'),(5012689,'<The Best Lee Soon Shin(최고다 이순신)>In episode 2, Lee Hyesin (played by Son Tae Young) meets her friends here right after returning from the United States.'),(5012690,'<The Best Lee Soon-shin(최고다 이순신)>Shin Joon-ho (played by Jo Jung-suk) warns Baek Geu-rin (played by Bae Geu-rin) to sign a contract with a specific agency at this cafe in episode 3. She believes he still has feelings for her and does not trust him.'),(5012691,'<The Best, Admiral Yi Sun-sin(최고다 이순신)>In episode 21, Shin Jun-ho (played by Jo Jung-suk) grabs Lee Ji-eun (played by Lee Ji-eun) in front of this store. In episode 23, Seo Jin-wook (played by Jung Woo) and Lee Hye-shin (played by Son Tae-young) finally introduce themselves to her as they pass by this place at night.'),(5012692,'<The Best Wedding(최고의 결혼)>In Episode 1, Cha Kiyoung (played by Park Siyeon) appears on CKTV\'s \'News\' where young pedestrians are being interviewed about marriage.'),(5012694,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>Can be seen in episodes 7, 9, and 12. In episode 9, Jenny (played by Lee Hee-jin) discovers Lee Seung-gi (cameo appearance by Lee Seung-gi) and there is a scene where the two of them are wearing the same scarf.'),(5012695,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>Doko Jin (Cha Seung-won) tries to capture Goo Ae-jung (Gong Hyo-jin) and tests her heart rate with a kiss. However, Ae-jung goes on stage with Yoon Pil-joo (Yoon Kye-sang) and is celebrated as a new couple with him, making Doko Jin\'s efforts futile. Just before that, Kang Se-ri (Yoo In-na) confesses her love to Pil-joo to stop him, but to no avail.'),(5012696,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>The exterior of this hotel appears as the place where Dok Go-jin (Cha Seung-won) and Goo Ae-jung (Gong Hyo-jin) were together. Their marriage takes place in episode 16.'),(5012697,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>The award ceremony where actor Dokgo Jin (Cha Seung Won) from the movie \'Fighter\' was nominated for will take place at this location. Goo Ae Jung (Gong Hyo Jin)\'s former manager, Jong Man Sik (Jung Man Shik), interferes to prevent Dokgo Jin from winning the child actor award, and when Dokgo Jin finds out, he physically retaliates.'),(5012698,'<Best Love(최고의 사랑)>In episode 15, she went to her clinic to buy medicinal herbs.'),(5012699,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>This is the house where Ae-jung (Gong Hyo-jin) lives. You can see it in episodes 10, 11, and 13.'),(5012700,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>In this location, Gu Ae-jung (Gong Hyo-jin) and Yoon Pil-joo (Yoon Kye-sang) share a heartfelt story in episode 7.'),(5012701,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>In one episode, Gu Ae-jung (Gong Hyo-jin) is filming at this park, and her final challenge is to ride a roller coaster and eat a bowl of ramen to stay.'),(5012702,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>In episode 5, Dokgo Jin (Cha Seung Won) confesses his love to Goo Ae Jung (Gong Hyo Jin) under the cherry blossoms in this park\'s \'scenic spot\' (excellent scenic spot).'),(5012703,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>President Moon (Choi Hwa-jung) invites Dokgo Jin (Cha Seung-won) and Gu Ae-jung (Gong Hyo-jin) to dinner. In episode 7, they come to this restaurant to resolve their conflict, but when she steps out of the private room where she was supposed to have dinner, Dokgo Jin and Gu Ae-jung start arguing again about their music contract.'),(5012704,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>Appears on episode 15 on MBS broadcasting company.'),(5012705,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>In the first episode, Dokgo Jin (Cha Seung-won) crosses this bridge in a van and receives higher ratings for his movie \"The Figurine\" than the drama he watches on the van\'s screen with lead actor Kim Joon-seong (Kim Nam-gil).'),(5012706,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>It appears as Yoon Pil-joo\'s (played by Yoon Kye-sang) clinic. You can see it in episodes 1, 2, 9, and 13.'),(5012707,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>The scene where Dokgo Jin (Cha Seung-won) is nominated for his movie \'Peter\' in the 10th episode of \'The Greatest Love\'. Introducing the \'Korean Film Awards\' held at this location along with actual footage.'),(5012708,'<Best Love(최고의 사랑)>In episode 16, the two of them have a heartwarming conversation here, and he soon informs her that he will be leaving to study abroad.'),(5012709,'<Best Love(최고의 사랑)>This is a place operated by Jennie (Lee Hee-jin) in Best Love. For example, you can see her being visited by Kang Se-ri (Yoo In-na) in the scene from episode 8.'),(5012710,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>In episode 13, Yoon Pil-joo (Yoon Kye-sang) comes to meet Han Mi-na (Bae Seul-ki) from the former girl group National Treasure Girls.'),(5012711,'<The Greatest Love(최고의 사랑)>Doko Jin (Cha Seung-won) receives treatment at this hospital. In episode 2, he stays here to receive treatment for a \'traffic accident\', but it is actually an opportunity to withdraw a movie offer. In episode 3, he undergoes an electrocardiogram at this hospital suspecting abnormalities in his heart.'),(5012712,'<The Best Ending(최고의 엔딩)>In episode 1, Gomin-chae (Choi Hee-jin) departs abroad for a year.'),(5012713,'<The Best Ending(최고의 엔딩)>Choi Ung (Jung Gun Joo) breaks up with Kimin Chae (Choi Hee Jin) on this street in episode 1.'),(5012714,'<The Best Divorce(최고의 이혼)>In episode 16, Kang Hye-ru (Bae Doo-na) and Jo Seok-moo (Cha Tae-hyun) walk down this street and feel emotions again.'),(5012715,'<The Best Divorce(최고의 이혼)>Kang Hwiru (played by Bae Doona) lives in this attic room with her friend Kang Maru (played by Kim Hyejoon), who is her younger sister.'),(5012716,'<The Greatest Divorce(최고의 이혼)>In the drama \"The Greatest Divorce,\" Jo Seok-moo (played by Cha Tae-hyun) crosses this bridge to meet a client for work.'),(5012717,'<The Best Hit(최고의 한방)>In episode 11, Lee Se-young (Yoon Shi-yoon) distributes leaflets dressed as an animal near exit 3 of the broadcasting station to work part-time. She later asks Yoo Hyun-jae (Yoon Shi-yoon) for help and partially pays off his debt.'),(5012718,'<The Best Hit(최고의 한방)>In episode 8, Yoo Hyun-jae (Yoon Shi-yoon) hears one of his songs playing in the bathroom and spots Lee Ji-hoon (Kim Min-jae) here.'),(5012719,'<The Best Hit(최고의 한방)>It is a famous scene from episode 3 where Yoo Hyun-jae (Yoon Si-yoon) time travels and is the only one who truly understands.'),(5012720,'<The Best Hit(최고의 한방)>In episode 25, Yoo Hyun-jae (Yoon Si-yoon) takes Choi Woo-seung (Lee Se-young) and her former best friend to this restaurant. Hyun-jae tricks her into believing that it is his ex-girlfriend\'s treat, but he and Woo-seok leave the bill for her after finishing their meal.'),(5012721,'<The Best Hit(최고의 한방)>In episode 7, Lee Gwang-jae (Cha Tae-hyun) crosses this bridge with his father Lee Soon-tae (Lee Deok-hwa) and two stars from his entertainment agency.'),(5012722,'<Best Hanbang(최고의 한방)>This is a place that appeared in the scene of the end of episode 16 in the 1990s.'),(5012723,'<Best Hit(최고의 한방)>In episode 4, Yoo Hyun-jae (Yoon Shi-yoon), who arrived in 2017, sleeps in his car in this park.'),(5012724,'<The Best Hit(최고의 한방)>In episode 4, Yoo Hyun-jae (played by Yoon Shi-yoon) accepts a time travel back to 2017 and briefly sits down for a moment.'),(5012725,'<Chuno(추노)>In episode 7 of Chuno, Song Tae-ha (played by Oh Ji-ho) brings the injured Kim Hye-won/Wolnyeon (played by Lee Da-hae) to this place.'),(5012726,'<Chuno(추노)>In episode 4, Kim Hye-won (Lee Da-hae) comes to this temple to honor the deceased. Her lover Lee Dae-gil (Jang Hyuk) and Song Tae-ha (Oh Ji-ho) come to rescue her from two men trying to kidnap her the next morning.'),(5012727,'<Chuno(추노)>Long Kkodo/Yonggoda (Cheongjanggun) and Ingdaei/Yonggol Dae (Yoon Dong-hwan) meet to play archery games. They share stories in episode 13.'),(5012728,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>In episode 13, Yoo Seok-ok (Choi Kang-hee) walks past this cafe holding a new umbrella. Meanwhile, her husband Kim Ho-cheol (Yoon Hee-seok) is sitting at this cafe with a young woman, but Seok-ok is satisfied with the umbrella and does not notice them.'),(5012729,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)> Detective Ha Wan-seung (played by Kwon Sang-woo) and Yoo Seol-ok (played by Choi Kang-hee) walk into this shop right before passing the restaurant Kuisong, after a failed proposal in the episode.'),(5012730,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>In episode 1, Detectives Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) and Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) pass by Boonis Paks Baekhyundong branch right before a failed proposal at this cafe. During this time, both of them want to hold hands but it doesn\'t happen.'),(5012731,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>In episode 7, Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) and Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) visit the ancestral home of the serial killer\'s victim.'),(5012732,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>In episode 7, the focus was on Hah Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) and Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) searching for the home of the serial killer\'s victim.'),(5012733,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>In episode 16, Hwaan Seung (played by Kwon Sang-woo) is working out.'),(5012734,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>It appears as the restaurant of Kim Kyung-mi (Kim Hyun-sook). Her closest friend Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) works part-time here.'),(5012735,'<The Queen of Deduction(추리의 여왕)>Appears in episode 13 as a senior center. A new case involving 7 divisions begins when one woman is poisoned, and it is ultimately resolved by Yoo Seok-ok (Choi Kang-hee) in episode 14.'),(5012736,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>This place appears in the drama as \'Seodong Police Station\'. It is one of the main filming locations where the characters mainly appear.'),(5012737,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>Yoo Seol-ok (played by Choi Kang-hee) marries a conman in this wedding hall disguised as \'Queens Wedding House\' to track him down in episode 1. This later becomes known as the \'marriage fraud case\' and leads Seol-ok to become an honorary police officer.'),(5012738,'<Queen Cheo Ri(추리의 여왕)>In episode 14, Yoo Seok-ok (Choi Kang-hee) and Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) walk down this street in front of Deokseong Middle School in traditional Korean attire.'),(5012739,'<Cruel Story of Office Romance(추리의 여왕)>This is where the kidnapper brought Ye Soe-ok\'s mother in episode 8. She thinks she\'s on a romantic date. When Ye Soe-ok finds out about this, she faints and is eventually rescued by Ha Wan-seung who was following her.'),(5012740,'<Queen of Mystery(추리의 여왕)>In episodes 6 and 7, Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) and Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) visit this place to find the home where the serial killer\'s victims were.'),(5012741,'<Queen of Mystery 2(추리의 여왕 2)>In episodes 5-6, detective Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) is faced with a case involving street vendor Yu Seol-ok (Choi Gang-hee) and tow truck driver Park Ki-beom (Dong Ha) who are based on this street.'),(5012742,'<Queen of Mystery 2(추리의 여왕 2)>When trying to solve the arson case in Episode 2, Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) and detective Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) imagine a arsonist walking past this restaurant before Seol-ok can point Wan-seung as another strong suspect, and in another imagined scene, they both also see him passing by this place.'),(5012743,'<Queen of Mystery 2(추리의 여왕 2)>In episode 13 of Queen of Mystery 2, Detective Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) asks passersby about the pervert case in this park.'),(5012744,'<Queen of Mystery 2(추리의 여왕 2)>In the 2nd season, detective Ha Wan-seung (Kwon Sang-woo) and amateur detective Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) attempt to prevent a potential arson incident during a children\'s theater performance at this location. However, they meet Chief Kye Sung-woo (Oh Min-suk) and Detective Yook Seung-hwa (Hong Ki-joon) who have received a tip about catching an arsonist at this place.'),(5012745,'<Queen of Mystery 2(추리의 여왕 2)>In Queen of Mystery 2 Episode 2, Yoo Seol-ok (Choi Kang-hee) helps a staff member at this café put out a small fire in the building while enjoying dessert. She quickly investigates and confirms it was an arson case. The next day, profiler Woo Sung-ha (Park Byung-eun) arrives just in time to see Seol-ok arriving.'),(5012746,'<Chulsapyo(출사표)>After vomiting on the subway in Episode 8, Guseola (Im Jin-ah) discovers a pharmacy after finishing a local representative dinner. It is the 3rd exit of this subway station marked as \'Jeongui Station\'. And decided to go there for some relief.'),(5012747,'<TV Show(출사표)>In episode 4, after eating alone excessively at Sangsu Station, Guseura (Nana) decides to stop by this pharmacy (\'Ribbon Pharmacy\') on her way down the subway. There, she runs into Seo Gongmyeong (Park Seonghoon) who came to get a prescription for chronic gastritis.'),(5012748,'<Public Post(출사표)>In episode 21 (total 11 episodes), Guseula meets Yun Hee-soo.'),(5012749,'<TV series(출사표)>In episode 19 (out of 10 episodes in total) of \"Chulsapyo,\" Guseira (Im Jin-ah/Nana of After School) and Seo Gong-myung (Park Sung-hoon) come to \"Saryangseowon.\" To meet Elder Sarangdong (Choi Jong-ryul), Sera sent several letters opposing the name change of Sarangdong to persuade her.'),(5012750,'<News report(출사표)>At Seoul City Club, Jo Maeng-deok (guide) and Won So-jeong (Bae Hae-soon) met here to discuss the \'Smart One City\' project in episode 10.'),(5012751,'<Reality(출사표)>In episode 14, Gu Sera (Im Jin-ah/Nana from After School) and Seo Gong-myeong\'s (Park Seong-hoon) fathers meet here to share stories about their children.'),(5012752,'<Chulsaepyo(출사표)>In the 5th episode, Young Goosera (played by Kim Ha-yeon) leaves home and walks in the rain to look for Seo Gongmyung (played by Seo Yoon-hyuk). Their father, Gu Youngtae (played by Ahn Kil kang), and Cho Maengduk (played by Ahn Nae-sang) also come here to look for the kids.'),(5012753,'<Sootable(출사표)>In episode 11, Gusehla (Im Jin-ah/Nana from After School) and Seo Gong-myeong (Park Seong-hun) visit the neighborhood representative houses at 503 and 127.'),(5012754,'<Press release(출사표)>The apartment where the character Gu Sera (played by Nana) lives appears.'),(5012755,'<Press release(출사표)>In the drama \"Penthouse 3\", Kim Sam-sook (played by Jang Hye-jin), the mother of Go Sara (played by Lim Jin-ah/Nana of After School), campaigns on these stairs for her daughter\'s election.'),(5012756,'<출사표(출사표)>In Episode 11, Kwon Woo-young (Kim Mi-soo) and Kim Min-jae (Han Jun-woo) meet outside the Gubei Council building and head to this cafe to join the Ma Won Credit Union.'),(5012757,'<출사표(출사표)>In episodes 1 and 2, there is a scene where Koo Sera (played by After School\'s Im Jin-ah/Nana) speaks freely in front of office workers as a local district representative candidate at night. In episode 4, there is a scene of her working in the office.'),(5012758,'<출사표(출사표)>In episode 4, Sera (Nana) says something unexpected to Seo Gong-myeong (Park Sung-hoon) while watching children crossing the street as young drivers. Here, she learns that Ma Won-gu may be in debt, unable to pay salaries to employees or city council members. Towards the end of the episode\'s epilogue, Gong-myeong tries to explain to Sera how important decisions are made in the council, reminding her that his sole goal after taking office was to make a lot of money.'),(5012759,'<Poster(출사표)>In episodes 2, Yeong-gu Sera (Kim Ha-yeon) and Seo Gong-myeong (Seo Yoon-hyuk) share twin ice candies outside the Moanipop store.'),(5012760,'<Brochure(출사표)>Gusella (Im Jin-ah meets Seo Gong-myeong. In episode 28, Park Jeong-rae grandmother (Kang Ae-sim) thinks.)'),(5012761,'<Photography Release Form(출사표)>This building is a manga book store that appears first as the hideout of Kusera (Lim Jin-ah/Nana from After School), a record store, and a bar operated by Jang Han-bi (Shin Do-hyun), one of Kusera\'s close friends.'),(5012762,'<출사표(출사표)>In Episode 3, Gusera (Nana) from Epilogue is seen sitting at this bus stop. Seogongmyeong, who came to see her (Park Sunghun), falls asleep on her shoulder as she is drunk. In Episode 7, Gongmyeong returns to this bus stop and calls Sera this time.'),(5012763,'<Chulsaepyo(출사표)>In episode 2, Kusera (Im Jin-ah / After School Nana) is campaigning in front of this cafe with the support of her close friend Jang Han-bi (Shin Do-hyun).'),(5012764,'<Photoshoot(출사표)> In episode 2 (out of 1 episode in total), Guseola (After School\'s Im Jin-ah/Nana) ruthlessly defeats Kim Jarong (the best) in the arcade game right in front of this stationery store. When the boy complains about the unyielding adult, Sara argues that children need to experience society\'s difficulties. In episode 9 (5 episodes in total), a scene reappears where Sara discusses the ordinance bill on nurturing secret neighbor agents to protect children who may be subject to abuse.'),(5012765,'<Chulsaepyo(출사표)>Chulsaepyo is a fictional central district of Ma Wonji, as depicted in 3회 where Guseul (After School\'s Im Jin-ah/Nana) was seen making excuses to the residents of this street before knowing she was elected. In episode 10, Sera and her current secretary Seo Gongmyeong (Park Seong-hoon) come here to verify the residents living on this street to further confirm the petition linked to \"Smart One\".'),(5012766,'<Exit Ticket(출사표)>Subongnam-ro 24-gil is a fictional street that frequently appears in the drama where Koo Sera (played by Lim Jin-a) walks. In episode 22 (or 11), there is a scene depicting Sera reconciling with Seo Gong-myeong (played by Park Sung-hoon) after the Cold War. In episode 2, there is also a scene where Kwon Woo-young (played by Kim Mi-soo) rushes down the street pushing a baby carriage to meet a group opposing the construction project outside the elementary school.'),(5012767,'<Chulsa Ticket(출사표)>In episodes 6 and 16 of the drama \"The Good Detective,\" Guse Ra (Im Jin-ah) is seen exercising in a strange position on this overpass as Seo Gong-myung (Park Sung-hoon) passes by. In the final 16th episode, inspired by a campaign poster that reused a slogan, Kwon Woo-young (Kim Mi-soo) decides to run for office and runs along this overpass.'),(5012768,'<Cheolsapyo(출사표)>In episode 6, Yoon Hee-soo (Yoo Da-in), who visits a neighborhood study room for children, asks Seo Gong-myeong (Park Sung-hoon) why he entered politics.'),(5012769,'<Chusa Ticket(출사표)>In episode 6 (out of a total of 3 episodes), Koo Sera (Im Jin-ah) spends her last moments at this bus stop. Following her, Seo Gong-myeong (Park Sung-hoon), who was the manager of the voting booth, informs her of the rules after the election campaign and organizes her. After shaking hands, she heads toward the connecting overpass overwhelmed.'),(5012770,'<screenshot(출사표)>In episode 5, Guse La (Im Jin-a) walks on this overpass lost in deep thoughts after meeting Son Eun-shil (Park Mi-hyun).'),(5012771,'<Susahtyo(출사표)>In the 5th episode of the drama (total 3 episodes), Kim Samsuk (Jang Hye-in) and Gusera (Im Jin-a) are joined by their mothers on the campaign trail and cross this rainbow bridge with Jang Han-bi (Shin Do-hyun).'),(5012772,'<Photoshoot(출사표)>In episode 8, Guseul (Im Jin-ah/After School Nana) takes turns working in front of this hotel waiting for the client.'),(5012773,'<Outing Receipt(출사표)>Gusera (Im Jin-ah) and Seo Gong-myeong (Park Sung-hoon) are regular customers at this restaurant featured in episodes 4, 6, 7, and 9. In episode 10, Sera and Gongmyeong come to discuss the campaign to change the name of the Love Dong while having a meal.'),(5012775,'<Chulsapyo(출사표)>In episode 4, Gusehara (After School\'s Im Jin-ah/Nana) stands up at this bus stop to wait for a bus while waiting for a welcoming party for new colleagues and discovers Seo Gong-myeong (Park Sung-hoon) passing by.'),(5012776,'<Cheolsapyo(출사표)>In episode 15, Gusera (Nana) passes by a pedestrian protection shelter on her way home after surviving the vote. She discovers her father (Ahn Gil-kang) waiting at the exit, wearing a pair of slippers for her tired feet. It is also the place where she first met the former National Assembly candidate Son Eun-sil (Park Mi-hyun) three years ago.'),(5012777,'<Chulsa Po(출사표)>In episode 1, there is a scene where Guseura (Im Jin-ah/Nana from Afterschool) insults her boyfriend Kim Min-jae (Han Jun-woo) for getting a job as a secretary at Mawan District Office Service Center. In episode 3, Sera and Se Gong-myeong (Park Sung-hoon) come to this cafe to apologize to a woman who witnessed Sera getting fired.'),(5012778,'<Drama(치얼업)>In episode 8, Jin Sunho (played by Kim Hyunjin) recalls a memory of traveling to this place with his parents and witnessing his father taking his mother and another boy away.'),(5012779,'<K-drama(치얼업)>In \"Cheer Up,\" Do Hae Yi (Han Ji Hyun) and Park Jung Woo (Bae In Hyuk) join the Yeonhee cheerleading team by taking a train and an MT. As they walk to their accommodation along the tracks passing through this station, he shows her his star constellation, and when Jin Seon Ho (Kim Hyun Jin) comes to pick them up, she applies ointment to her wounds.'),(5012780,'<Chill Up(치얼업)>In episode 11, Park Jung-woo (played by Bae In-hyuk) suggests to Do Hae-yi (played by Han Ji-hyun) to spend time at this library.'),(5012781,'<Cheer Up(치얼업)>Scene where the worried Park Jung-woo (Bae In-hyuk) finally finds Ha-eui (Han Ji-hyun) and joins Jin Seon-ho (Kim Hyun-jin) who has been looking for her in episodes 2, after Ha-eui (Han Ji-hyun) breaks up with her boyfriend and wanders in episodes 6-7.'),(5012782,'<ChieLop(치얼업)>This is 