ind Geumja(친절한 금자씨)>A family-friendly archaeological site from Kind Geumja'),(5012806,'<Kind Goldfish(친절한 금자씨)>In the movie, the goldfish went to the aquarium he visited during high school days'),(5012807,'<Friendly Gumzacci(친절한 금자씨)>A ramen restaurant frequented by Park Chan-wook, featured on Wednesday Food Talk.'),(5012808,'<Friendly Geumja Sisters(친절한 금자씨)>Director Park Chan-wook\'s favorite Japanese Kaiseki restaurant'),(5012809,'<Kind-hearted Guemja-ssi(친절한 금자씨)>Famous filming location for Kind-hearted Guemja-ssi and Infinite Challenge'),(5012810,'<Kairos(카이로스)>In episode 1, the desolate Kang Hyeon-chae (Nam Gyu-ri) is standing on the bridge. When Kim Seo-jin (Shin Sung-rok) calls her, she apologizes and says they can\'t continue like this. Later, So Jin collapses on the bridge with police officers looking for his wife.'),(5012811,'<Kyros(카이로스)>It unfolds with Kim Seo-jin (Shin Sung-rok) taking his daughter Kim Dabin (Shim Hye-yeon) in Episode 1. Eventually disappears.'),(5012812,'<Kairos(카이로스)>Kim Seo-jin (Shin Sung-rok) meets Yu Se-il (Shin Go) with Seo Do-kyun (Ahn Bo-hyun). He says it\'s time to take over Taejong Group in episode 6.'),(5012813,'<Woman Pulling a Carrier(캐리어를 끄는 여자)>In episode 13, Park Hye-joo (Jeon Hye-bin) meets Jo Ye-ryeong (Yoon Ji-min) at the gallery\'s cafe and suggests some changes to the agenda for the shareholders\' meeting.'),(5012814,'<The Woman Who Bears the Carrier(캐리어를 끄는 여자)>This is where Cha Geum-joo (played by Choi Ji-woo) works as a judicial assistant on a regular basis.'),(5012815,'<The Woman Who Pulls the Suitcase(캐리어를 끄는 여자)>In episode 13, Park Hye-joo (played by former Sang Hyun) crouches down after taking off her lawyer badge and moves to where Jang Hyun-sung, the CEO of a company, throws her into a street alley for herself when passing through two IFCs in her car.'),(5012816,'<Carrying a Carrier Woman(캐리어를 끄는 여자)>In episode 13, Cha Geum-joo (Choi Ji-woo) meets Yoo Tae-ho and suddenly Kang Pro (Park Byeong-eun) approaches them.'),(5012817,'<Camping Club(캠핑클럽)>The place where a fan meeting was held as a special event for the Camping Club'),(5012818,'<Camping Club(캠핑클럽)>A roller skating rink where the members of Finkle showed off their skills'),(5012819,'<Camping Club(캠핑클럽)>Café and pub where you can come in your training clothes and eat pizza'),(5012820,'<Camping Club(캠핑클럽)>Campground located in Uljin, the 3rd permanent site of the camping club'),(5012821,'<Camping Club(캠핑클럽)>Camping site located in Jinan, the first anchorage of the camping club.'),(5012822,'<Do you want a cup of coffee?(커피 한잔 할까요?)>Featured as \'2nd Generation Café\' operated by Park Seok (Park Ho-san). It is also where Kang Go-bi (Ong Seong-wu) starts working as a barista in episode 2.'),(5012823,'<Would you like to grab a cup of coffee?(커피 한잔 할까요?)>In episode 3 and onwards, Seongmin (played by Lee Gyu-hyung) becomes a customer of \'Two Coffee\' and explains this street while passing by Hollys Coffee and Esmart Uijeongbu branch.'),(5012824,'<Would you like to have a cup of coffee?(커피 한잔 할까요?)>In episode 4, Kim Joo-hee (played by Seo Young-hee) meets her ex-husband at this cafe.'),(5012825,'<Would you like to have a cup of coffee?(커피 한잔 할까요?)>When Kang Gobi (Yoo Ah In) starts working at this cafe, Park Seok (Park Ho San) invites Kim Ju Hee (Seo Young Hee) for a lunch date.'),(5012826,'<Would you like to have a cup of coffee?(커피 한잔 할까요?)>In episode 6, Kisunho (SF9 Dawon) races through this park passing by the pond rest area.'),(5012827,'<Café Prince 1st Branch(커피프린스 1호점)>This is where Choi Han-gyeol (Gong Yoo) meets his cousin Choi Han-seong (Lee Seon-kyun) for dinner after returning from the USA in episode 1, and where Go Eun-chan (Yoon Eun-hye) works part-time.'),(5012828,'<Coffee Prince 1st Store(커피프린스 1호점)>In the drama Coffee Prince, Go Eun-chan (Yoon Eun-hye) and Choi Han-gyul (Gong Yoo) cross this bridge in a convertible in episode 2.'),(5012829,'<Coffee Prince 1st Branch(커피프린스 1호점)>1 episode where Go Eun Cha