ict visits this restaurant to make his next plan.'),(5012846,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>In episode 11, Baek Soo-young (played by Yoo In-young) and Oh Se-gi (played by Ha Jun) meet and have drinks at this bar.'),(5012847,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>In episode 11, Baek Soo-young (Yoo In-young) and Oh Se-gi (Ha Joon) meet at this bar and have a drink.'),(5012848,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>Cafe \'Eunee\' is featured, a place where secretary Lee Shin-ah (Kim Tae-hee) stops by in the morning to enjoy fresh coffee for her boss, CEO Noh Go-jin (Ji Jin-hee) at GOTOP.'),(5012849,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>In episode 7, Ee Shin-a (Krystal) calls a taxi in front of the Volvo exhibition hall on this street after working late at No Go-jin\'s (Kim Jae-wook) house and saying she will buy cola.'),(5012850,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>In episode 9, when Lee Shin-ah (Jung Soo-jung) dines at FestIVA restaurant with No Go-jin (Kim Jae-wook), they remember the date they had on this street with Baek Soo-young (Yoo In-young).'),(5012851,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>The drama depicted a scene where Baek Sooyoung (Yoo In-young) invited No Gojin (Kim Jae-wook) and Lee Sina (Krystal Jung) to have dinner at this restaurant.'),(5012852,'<Krazy Love(크레이지 러브)>One of the bars that appeared in episode 12 of Crazy Love, where Nogojin (Kim Jae-wook) discovered Baek Soo-young (Yoo In-young) drunk.'),(5012853,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>Meeting of Baek Sooyoung (Yoo Inyoung) and Lee Shina (Jung Soojung) in episode 9'),(5012854,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>Kim Raewon (Kim Sunho) first met Hyeonseong, the then-boyfriend of Han Eunsung (Lee Yooyoung).'),(5012855,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>GOTOP Education, operated by Nogojin (Kim Jae-wook)'),(5012856,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>It appears as part of a convention where GOTOP Education holds an admission explanation session in episode 4, and is a place where Lee Shin-ah (Crystal) and Baek Soo-young (Yoo In-young) meet and sit down to chat for a while.'),(5012857,'<Crazy Love(크레이지 러브)>Lee Shin-ah (played by Jung Soo-