 episode 10, Kim Cheol-ho (played by Jung Eun-pyo) is waiting outside the building at the intersection.'),(5012868,'<Cross(크로스)>In episode 10, the police surveillance team led by Chief Jang follows Kim Cheol-ho (Jeong Eun-pyo) out onto this street'),(5012869,'<Cross(크로스)>Most of the main cast members, including Director Goh Jung-hoon (Jo Jae-hyun), Transplant Coordinator Ko Ji-in (Jeon So-min), and Transplant Specialist Lee Joo-hyuk (Kim Ji-han-Jeon), work here.'),(5012870,'<Cross(크로스)>In Episode 16, Kang In-gyu (Go Kyung-pyo) finishes the trial and leaves the courtroom, receiving only a short probation for his first offense.'),(5012871,'<Cross(크로스)>In episode 8 of \"Cross,\" Kang In-kyu (played by Ko Kyung-pyo) hides in this shop to evade Man-sik (played by Jung Do-won) who is chasing after Kim Hyeong-beom (played by Heo Sung-tae).'),(5012872,'<Cross(크로스)>In episodes 8 and 9, Kang In-gyu (played by Ko Kyung-pyo) follows Man-sik (played by Jung Do-won) on this street to find where Kim Hyeong-beom (played by Heo Sung-tae) is hiding.'),(5012873,'<Cross(크로스)>In episode 16, Lee Joo-hyuk (played by Kim Ee-han) drops off Son Yeon-hee (played by Yang Jin-sung) at the terminal.'),(5012874,'<Cross(크로스)>In episode 14, Gang In-gyu (played by Go Kyung-pyo) is undercover behind a lamppost, investigating a restaurant where one of Kim Hyeong-beom\'s (played by Heo Sung-tae) henchmen works.'),(5012875,'<Cross(크로스)>Doctor Kang In-gyu (played by Ko Kyeong-pyo) works at this prison after applying for a job there.'),(5012876,'<Criminal Mind(크리미널 마인드)>This is where Baeksan (Kim Young-chul) and Kang Ki-hyeong (Son Hyeon-joo) meet in episode 8.'),(5012877,'<Criminal Minds(크리미널 마인드)>In episode 5, Kim Joon-hyun (Lee Joon-gi) chases a suspect in biochemical terrorism.'),(5012878,'<Criminal Minds(크리미널 마인드)>This place is where a child abduction took place. In episode 8, the young girl Yuna fell out from under her mother\'s nose, leading the NCI to be involved in the case. In episode 9, Kim Hyu