Go Won-hee) to this place.'),(5013172,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>As you can see in episode 1, it is the fashion house and store background of Seo Idoo (Shin Sung-rok) who lives opposite to Min Jaehui (Ha Jaeseok).'),(5013173,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>Seo Ido (played by Shin Sung-rok) visits to meet Min Ye-rin (played by Ko Won-hee) in episode 18 (total 9 episodes).'),(5013174,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>It is the filming location of the nightclub \"Oblivion\" as the after-party spot in Episode 8 after the end of the 2019 New Wave Fashion Week.'),(5013175,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In Episode 11, a line of customers waiting to buy smartphones unfolds around this building.'),(5013176,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In episode 1, Park Jun-yong (Kim Ki-doo) mentioned that there is a high possibility that Kim Tae stole his perfume while talking on the phone.'),(5013177,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>After her husband\'s divorce lawsuit in Episode 18 (9), Han Jina (Cha Ye-ryeon) encounters Sei-do (Shin Sung-rok) while walking down the stairs of this complex.'),(5013178,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>Seo I-do (Shin Sung-rok), who finds out that Min Ye-rin (Go Won-hee) has the physical appearance and health level of a woman in her 60s in episode 9, brings Min Ye-rin (Go Won-hee) here to exercise.'),(5013179,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In the drama \"Perfume,\" characters Min Ye-rin (Go Won-hee) and Yoon Min-seok (Kim Min-goo) come to this place after having a fake date at Dongdaemun in episode 12 (out of 6 total episodes). Curiously, the scene captures the appearance of passersby taking photos.'),(5013180,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In episode 8 (4th episode), Min Ye-rin (Go Won-hee) and Jin-kyung (Jin Kyung) appear after reserving the entire amusement park.'),(5013181,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In episode 2 (total 1 episode), Seo Yido (Shin Seongrok) woke up for the first time. In episode 19 (total 10 episodes), Ido stays at this hotel again and apologizes to model Sonmiyu (AOA Hyejeong). In episodes 22/23 (total 11/12), an event for Suseong Electronics is held at the hotel\'s banquet hall.'),(5013182,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In episode 18 (main episode 9), Seo Ido (Shin Seong-rok) has a meal with Son Mi.'),(5013183,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>After the news of Yoon Min-seok (Kim Min-goo) and Min Ye-rin\'s (Go Won-hee) relationship was revealed in episode 11 (out of 6 total episodes), Min-seok\'s fans gather at the agency lobby to reassure him.'),(5013184,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>Yoon Min-seok (played by Kim Min-kyu) and Min Ye-rin (played by Ko Won-hee) have a conversation in a car in episode 16.'),(5013185,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>This is where Park Jun-yong (played by Kim Ki-doo) discovers the truth about Min Ye-rin (played by Ko Won-hee) in episode 7.'),(5013186,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>The 2019 New Wave Fashion Week, where all models must participate in a test, will be held here in episode 7.'),(5013187,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In episode 3, Seoido (Sin Sung-rok) and Min Ye-rin (Ko Won-hee) have a meal at this restaurant.'),(5013188,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)> In episodes 4 and 8, Min Ye-rin (Go Won-hee) reminisces about herself as Min Jae-hee, who fell off the spinning horse at this amusement park with young Jin-kyung (Jin-kyung) because she was too heavy.'),(5013189,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>An advertisement shooting featuring models from Yoon Min-seok (Kim Min-gu) and Seo Ido (Shin Seong-rok)\'s agency took place here in episode 9.'),(5013190,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>The 3rd fan meeting of Kim Min-kyu is held here.'),(5013191,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>In episode 2, Park Jun-young (played by Kim Ki-doo) walks along this street and takes Shin Sung-rok (played by Seo Ee-do) home.'),(5013192,'<Perfume(퍼퓸)>This is the hotel room where Seo Do (Shin Sung-rok) stays in episode 12 (total 6 episodes) of the drama.'),(5013193,'<Page Turner(페이지 터너)>In episode 1, Jeong Cha-sik (Jisoo) stops at the upright piano installed in this tunnel with his friends. In episode 2, he brings Yoon Yoo-sul (Kim So-hyun) to request playing the piano. In episode 3, the two practice for a piano duet concert.'),(5013194,'<Pentagon(펜타곤)>Film location for busking and Pentagon Kino'),(5013195,'<Pentagon(펜타곤)>Filming location for \"Pentagon JUST DO IT 20\"'),(5013196,'<Pentagon(펜타곤)>Pentagon JUST DO IT Episode 20 Accommodation'),(5013197,'<Pentagon(펜타곤)>Charity daily cafe at Pentagon to spend a warm end-of-year period'),(5013198,'<Pentagon(펜타곤)>A cafe visited by Sinwon posted on Instagram'),(5013199,'<Pentagon(펜타곤)>Filming location for Wonder K Champion of Calmness, Pentagon episode'),(5013200,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>A dinner spot for Ha Yoon-chul (Yoon Jong-hoon) and Ha Eun-byul (Choi Ye-bin) in Episode 15. Episode 6 shows Oh Yoon-hee (Eugene), Joo Dan-tae (Uhm Ki-joon), and Logan Lee (Park Eun-seok) having a meal at this restaurant to celebrate their joint agreement.'),(5013201,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 6, Chun Seo-jin (Kim So-yeon) meets Haeun Byun (Choi Ye-bin) here to talk about an incident that occurred during the Cheonga Arts Festival.'),(5013202,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 1, Kang Mari (played by Shin Eun-kyung) escapes from her husband Yoo Dong-pil (played by Park Ho-san) at this location and is picked up by Jo Biseo (played by Kim Dong-kyu).'),(5013203,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 15, Oh Yoon-hee (Eugene) asks Cheon Seo-jin (Kim So-yeon) to meet at this restaurant. In episode 21, Joo Dan-tae meets a congressman in the same room.'),(5013204,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 14, Oh Yoon-hee (Eugene) meets Logan Lee (Park Eun-seok) at this bar.'),(5013205,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>Yoon Ji-ho (played by Jung So-min) is an alumni of this university. She is seen at the university main gate in a flashback in episode 4 and in a photo in episode 5.'),(5013206,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>This is where the divorce of Ha Yoon-chul (Yoon Jong-hoon) and Cheon Seo-jin (Kim So-yeon) was confirmed in episode 11.'),(5013207,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>Appears in Kang Mari (Shin Eun-kyung)\'s sauna \"Mari-tang\".'),(5013208,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>Hera Palace, the school attended by the children. In episode 2, Balona (Kim Hyun-soo) appears taking a practical exam with the children of Hera Palace.'),(5013209,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 10, Judantae (played by Um Ki-joon) and Lee Gyu-jin (played by Bong Tae-gyu) are trying to meet their Korean-American investor, Logan Lee, at their hotel.'),(5013210,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 18, Oh Yoon-hee (played by Eugene) meets Shim Su-ryeon (played by Lee Ji-ah) here.'),(5013211,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In the final episode 21, Joo Dan-tae (Uhm Ki Joon) seeks revenge on Logan Lee (Park Eun Seok). Logan Lee was captured by Dan-tae\'s henchmen after seeing the news that Shim Soo Ryeon (Lee Ji Ah) was attacked at Hera Palace and tried to leave the airport.'),(5013212,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>Ju Dantae (Um Ki-joon) meets Yoo In-hee (Yu Jin) at this location to share a kiss.'),(5013213,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 10, Hayoonchul (Yoon Jonghoon) meets Oo Yoonhee (Yoojin) drunk at this restaurant.'),(5013214,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 11, Ha Yun-chul (played by Yoon Jong-hoon) decided to meet his father (played by Jung Sung-mo) here. However, Yun-chul\'s wife, Cheon Seo-jin (Kim So-yeon), also appears to prevent Yun-chul from revealing anything to his father. Afterwards, they have a meal at Nogeumjeong.'),(5013215,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>In episode 20, Logan Lee (played by Park Eun-seok) is waiting at the airport for Sim Soo-ryeon (played by Lee Ji-ah) who is boarding a plane to the United States.'),(5013216,'<Penthouse(펜트하우스)>Part of this building is composed of \'Hera Palace,\' an exclusive apartment complex.'),(5013217,'<Newspaper(펜트하우스 2)>The engagement party of Joodanta (Um Ki-joon) and Cheon Seo-jin (Kim So-yeon) was held at Penthouse 2.'),(5013219,'<Penthouse 2(펜트하우스 2)>It appears as a pension where Nae-gyo (Lee Ji-ah) lives in episode 8.'),(5013220,'<Penthouse 2(펜트하우스 2)>It appears as Kang Mari\'s sauna \'Marilyn\' in the drama.'),(5013221,'<Penthouse 2(펜트하우스 2)>In episode 1, they rent out the penthouse, drink together, and show scenes of resting at the hotel pool the next morning.'),(5013222,'<Penthouse 2(펜트하우스 2)>In Episode 3, Cheon Seo-jin (played 