 buy ice cream at this mart.'),(5013327,'<Balloongum(풍선껌)>This place appears as \'Hoon and Hwan Oriental Clinic\' operated by Park Li-hwan (Lee Dong-wook) in episodes 1, 2, and 4 of the drama.'),(5013328,'<Bubblegum(풍선껌)>In episode 6, Park Ri-hwan (played by Lee Dong-wook) and Kim Haeng-ah (played by Jung Yoo-won) make an appearance. They eat fishcakes at a street vendor right in front of the stairs while going on a date.'),(5013329,'<Bubble Gum(풍선껌)>In episode 6, Park Ri-hwan (Lee Dong-wook) and Kim Haeng-ah (Jung Ryeo-won) are shown having a date and taking a walk on this street.'),(5013330,'<Bubblegum(풍선껌)>In episode 5, Hee-bon (played by Lee Dong-wook) rushes to this hotel, where Park Ri-hwan (played by Lee Dong-wook) brought her in person. Her grandfather, wearing a respiratory mask and lying in bed in a room of this building, is anxious about who brought his daughter down when her mother (played by Park Jun-geum) arrives at the hotel a few minutes later.'),(5013331,'<Bubblegum(풍선껌)>This school appears as the high school of Park Ri-hwan (played by Lee Dong-wook) and Kim Haeng-ah (played by Jung Ryeo-won).'),(5013332,'<Balloon Gum(풍선껌)>Kim Haeng-a (Yeosu-won) who works at this hospital. Comes here to receive treatment in episode 3.'),(5013333,'<Prague Lover(프라하의 연인)>This hotel is operated by Ji Young-woo\'s (Kim Min-joon) father in the drama. In episode 12, Kang Hye-joo (Yoon Se-ah) stays at this hotel, Choi Sang-hyun (Kim Ju-hyuk) brings her here, and Yoon Jae-hee (Jun Do-yeon) has a meeting here.'),(5013334,'<The Lovers of Prague(프라하의 연인)>In episode 17, after canceling their marriage with Ji Young-woo (Kim Min-jun), Choi Sang-hyun (Kim Ju-hyuk) and Yoon Jae-hee (Jeon Do-yeon) come to this bridge underneath.'),(5013335,'<Lovers of Prague(프라하의 연인)>Yoon Jae-hee (Jeon Do-yeon) and Choi Sang-hyun (Kim Joo-hyuk) take a walk.'),(5013336,'<Prague\'s Lovers(프라하의 연인)>In episode 7, Yoon Jae-hee (played by Jeon Do-yeon) suggests meeting Choi Sang-hyun (played by Kim Ju-hyuk) at this park. Initially, she refuses, citing the excuse that she has to work overtime, but eventually gives in and shows up.'),(5013337,'<Lover of Prague(프라하의 연인)>Choi Sang-hyun (played by Kim Ju-hyeok) prepares a proposal for Yoon Jae-hee (played by Jeon Do-yeon) in episode 18.'),(5013338,'<Lover of Prague(프라하의 연인)>In episode 16, Choi Sang-hyun (Kim Joo-hyuk) visits this temple to spend time with Yoon Jae-hee (Jeon Do-yeon) after she retires from the police and he finds her at her favorite fishing spot by the seaside.'),(5013339,'<Producer(프로듀사)>It is the place where Ra Jun Mo (Cha Tae Hyun) and Baek Seung Chan (Kim Soo Hyun) worked for a 1 night 2 day shoot in episodes 7 and 8.'),(5013340,'<Producer(프로듀사)>This is the camping site where Shin Di (IU), who had completed all the challenges given by Baek Seung Chan (Kim Soo Hyun) in episode 5, sleeps in a tent.'),(5013341,'<Producer(프로듀사)>In episode 3, La Joon-mo (Cha Tae-hyun) visits Park Jin-young to talk about Suzy\'s \'1 Night 2 Days\' casting, but he could only communicate with him through a video call.'),(5013342,'<Producer(프로듀사)>Most of the people in the drama \"Producer\" work here and many scenes between Baek Seung-chan (Kim Soo-hyun) and Tak Ye-jin (Gong Hyo-jin) were shot in the parking lot of this place, just like the opening.'),(5013343,'<Producer(프로듀사)>In episode 10, a scene was released where Baek Seung-chan (Kim Soo-hyun), a junior PD, was interviewing in front of the middle section of Jang Mi-won.'),(5013344,'<Produce 101(프로듀스 101)>The campus where 101 idol trainees from Produce Season 1 stayed and trained, conducting shoots while staying here for lodging and practice.'),(5013345,'<Produce 48(프로듀스48)>Produce 48\'s 96 idol trainees stayed and trained at this campus, where they stayed, practiced, and filmed.'),(5013346,'<Promise Nine(프로미스나인)>Promise Nine is an MT accommodation for a trip to Yangyang'),(5013347,'<Promise Nine(프로미스나인)>The place where members of Promise Nine enjoyed glamping'),(5013348,