78,'<Pinocchio(피노키오)>Choi Dal-po (Lee Jong-suk) stops a taxi in front of a sunset cafe. He wants to talk to Choi In-ha\'s (Park Shin-hye) mother and confess his love on the opposite side of the cloud cafe located at the south end of this bridge. In the end, he promises to come back to her as a wolf.'),(5013379,'<Pinocchio(피노키오)>The place where there was a kiss between Ki Ha-myung (Lee Jong-suk) and Choi In-ha (Park Shin-hye) in episode 8.'),(5013380,'<One and Only My Love(하나뿐인 내편)>This is a place where Wang Yi (Jung Eun-woo) from \"One and Only\" comforts Yoon Jin (Yoon Jin-yi) who is dissatisfied with her mother\'s heart and confirms love.'),(5013381,'<One and Only Love(하나뿐인 내편)> Oh Eun-young (Cha Hwa-yeon) regularly meets her friends at this restaurant. For example, in episode 1, she was supposed to meet her friends here (who called her) but completely forgot about it while preparing belated birthday celebrations for her husband. They agree to meet again at this place in episode 5.'),(5013382,'<My Only One(하나뿐인 내편)>In episode 4, Kim Doran (Yoo Ee) lives here with the Kim family.'),(5013383,'<My Only One(하나뿐인 내편)>In episode 16, Kim Miran (Na Hye-mi) and her mother So Yang-ja (Im Ye-jin) escape from loan sharks through the station and catch the train at the last minute.'),(5013384,'<My Only One(하나뿐인 내편)>In episode 5, Kim Doran (played by Kim Yoo-jin, formerly of After School\'s Uee) runs away from her mother (not her biological one) and comes to this park. This place is also where she receives a phone call from her younger sister, Kim Miran (played by Na Hye-mi), informing her that their father, Kim Dong-chul (played by Lee Doo-il), has been hospitalized after an accident.'),(5013385,'<My Only One(하나뿐인 내편)>This building appears as the \'Bom & Food\' company where Wang Dae-ryuk (Lee Chang-woo) and Kim Do-ran (Kim Yoo-jin/Uee, former After School member) work.'),(5013386,'<One and Only Love(하나뿐인 내편)> Wang Daeryuk (Lee Jang Woo) and Kim Doran (Kim Yoojin) crossed this 