on Stars From the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>Baek Seung-ah (Seo Eun-soo) invites Kim Moo-young (Seo In-guk) to meet at this park.'),(5013397,'<One Hundred Million Stars From the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>In episode 3, it depicts Yoo Jin-gook (played by Park Sung-woong) confronting Taksujeong (played by Jang Young). Shortly after, Kim Moo-young (played by Seo In-guk) enters the scene and joins the conversation, and they are seen watching from a distance as they leave to meet Im Yoo-ri (played by Go Min-si) outside the cafe with curiosity.'),(5013398,'<One Hundred Million Stars Falling from the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>It is a place where Jang Woo-sang (Do Sang-woo) proposed.'),(5013399,'<One Hundred Million Stars from the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)> This café appears as a microbrewery where Kim Moo-yeong (Seo In-guk) works. In episode 2, rookie detective Yoo Jin-kang (Jung So-min) and Lee Cheol-rong (Kwon So-hyun) come to drink.'),(5013400,'<One Billion Stars Falling from the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>Seungah\'s (Seo Eun-soo) exhibition opening \'Light and Mud\' will be held at the \'Cultural Center of Korea\'.'),(5013401,'<\"One Hundred Million Stars From the Sky\"(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>In episode 3, Kim Moo-young (played by Seo In-guk) and Yoo Jin-kang (played by Jung So-min) have a date here.'),(5013402,'<One Hundred Million Stars From the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>In episode 13, after meeting at Namsan Tower, Kim Moo-young (Seo In-guk) and Yoo Jin-kang (Jung So-min) are walking in this square.'),(5013403,'<One Hundred Million Stars Falling from the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>An event by ARTS, releasing NJ Group\'s Low Sodium Premium Bacon and Art Brewery\'s Bee Free IPA in Episode 7, takes place here.'),(5013404,'<One Hundred Million Stars From the Sky(하늘에서 내리는 일억개의 별)>This is Jang Seo-ran\'s (Kim Ji-hyun) living room. Kim Moo-young (Seo In-guk) comes here to meet her in episodes 13 and 16.'),(5013405,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episodes 4 and 5, Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) travels here with Ha-baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) and Nam Soo-ri (Park Kyu-sun). While So-ah dreams under a tree, Ha-baek apologizes in advance for playing with her life to test his powers. Later, he witnesses someone tampering with the brakes in the parking lot of Sky Ranch but still drives her car.'),(5013406,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>A vendor model set in a forest garden background in episode 10. In episode 12, the child passes by this place with a regretful heart after buying a doll that fits perfectly in a couple cup.'),(5013407,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Yoon So-ah\'s (Shin Se-kyung) office'),(5013408,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 8, this amusement park is where Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) takes Habaek (Nam Joo-hyuk) in order to fulfill her promise to make him laugh, as a part of her early farewell gift for their trip.'),(5013409,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 12, Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) and Ha Baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) have a meal here.'),(5013410,'<Haebaek\'s Wedding 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Resort operated by Im Ju-hwan, representative of the Descendants of the Sun\''),(5013411,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 10, Ha Baek\'s descendant (Im Joo-hwan) is portrayed drinking alcohol.'),(5013412,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>The facade of this building appears as the exterior of a restaurant where So-ah Yoon (Shin Se-kyung) signs a contract with Ha-baek (Nam Joo-hyuk). Ha-baek witnesses this scene while driving past the restaurant as So-ah and Ha-baek bid each other farewell in front of the restaurant.'),(5013413,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>This park is where Habaek (Nam Joo Hyuk) lands in the human realm in episode 1. After arriving at the park, Habaek attempts to use his sacred power.'),(5013414,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>The scene where Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) meets her friend Jo Yeom-mi (Jo Yeom-mi) appeared. In episode 5, Choi Woo-ri asked about Ahn Bin\'s (Gong Myung) whereabouts. Yoon So-ah discussed returning the diamond ring she gave as a gift.'),(5013415,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 8, Shin Mu-ra (Crystal) and Bi-ryum (Gong Myung) receive a phone call related to their descendant (Im Joo-hwan) here.'),(5013416,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) appears as a resident of Ha Baek (Nam Joo-hyuk)\'s house.'),(5013417,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>This is where the university alumni association is held which Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) attends to find someone. She meets Ha Baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) and becomes her savior.'),(5013418,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 2, Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) hides among the ajummas exercising to avoid Habaek (Nam Joo-hyuk).'),(5013419,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 3, Habaek (Nam Joo-hyuk) and Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) take a walk here. They sit at the western corner of the island and watch a giant outdoor screen before leaving the park through the bridge on the westernmost of the three bridges.'),(5013420,'<The bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 9, Habaek waits for a conversation where the bride (Nam Joo-hyuk) tells him that she will start chasing after their child when leaving the cafe, as she wanted to know why he wanted to cancel the marriage.'),(5013421,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) and Ha-baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) are playing rock-paper-scissors at the bus stop.'),(5013422,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In the drama, Nam Soo-ri (Park Kyu-sun) sees a golden nugget on the facade of this building by the Han River and tries to merge it with the Bride of Habaek (Park Kyu-sun).'),(5013423,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Habaek (Nam Joo-hyuk) and his servant Nam Soo-ri (Park Kyu-ri) cross this bridge by taxi in episode 2 on their way to Yoon So-ah\'s (Shin Se-kyung) house. Habaek, fascinated by driving, orders the taxi driver to let him take the wheel. A scene of the taxi dropping once while crossing the bridge.'),(5013424,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>At this location, Nam Soo Ri (played by Park Gyu Sun) is working to pay for Habaek\'s (played by Nam Joo Hyuk) expenses.'),(5013425,'<The Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Yeouido is where Ha-baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) first encounters the exercise ahjummas in episode 2. In episode 3, Soo-ri (Park Kyu-sun) brings Ha-baek to 63 Square to show him the integrated gold on the façade of 63 Square. It is also where Ha-baek first sees Mu-ra\'s CF.'),(5013426,'<The Bride of Habaek 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>The main character, Habaek (Nam Joo-hyuk), had his first house built by his servant Namsuri (Park Kyu-sun) near the water in this park.'),(5013427,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 16, Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) gains an understanding of this island. Her father, who left her, is now lying dead on the land by the Han River trying to save her. It has become desolate. Shortly after, she returns here with Ha-baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) who apologizes for not helping her and kisses her while transferring his power to her. He desperately needs her help to join the gods\' kingdom in order to become king and warns that he will die without her. Mu-ra (Krystal), Bi-ryum (Gong Myung), and Ju-dong (Yang Dong-geun) can only watch helplessly without power.'),(5013428,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>In episode 1, Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) is seen holding a white chrysanthemum over the railing of the Han River Bridge before jumping into the water below.'),(5013429,'<One Hundred Million Stars Falling from the Sky 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>Haebak (Nam Joo-hyuk) turns back when he first meets the ajummas exercising in episode 2.'),(5013430,'<Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>The scene appears as Ha Baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) tells Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) that he has to leave and they share a kiss.'),(5013431,'<The Bride of the Water God 2017(하백의 신부 2017)>This is where Yoon So-ah (Shin Se-kyung) and Ha-baek (Nam Joo-hyuk) went to buy casual clothes in episode 4.'),(5013432,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>Kalguksu restaurant recommended by Ha Sungwoon'),(5013433,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>Ha Sungwoon, park visited by BTS Jimin'),(5013434,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>Theme park visited by Ha Sungwoon on Weverse.'),(5013435,'<Hasungwoon(하성운)>Hotpot restaurant visited by Hasungwoon'),(5013436,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>Tteokbokki restaurant recommended by Ha Sungwoon'),(5013437,'<Hasungwoon(하성운)>Hasungwoon\'s recommended salad restaurant visited by Hasungwoon'),(5013438,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>This is the famous tteokbokki restaurant that Ha Sungwoon visited on Simya Idol.'),(5013439,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>Ha Sungwoon, Park Woojin visited an eel specialty restaurant together'),(5013440,'<Hasungwoon(하성운)>Hasungwoon, Ong Seongwoo, and Hwang Minhyun visited this handmade burger restaurant.'),(5013441,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)> Ha Sungwoon visited this food truck after winning 1st place'),(5013442,'<Ha Sungwoon(하성운)>Ha Sungwoon\'s recommended noodle soup restaurant visited on Wanna Travel'),(5013443,'<Hasungwoon(하성운)>Hasungwoon visited this handmade burger restaurant on Wanna Travel'),(5013444,'<Hyde Jekyll, Me(하이드 지킬, 나)>In Episode 3, The Gu Family\'s villa appears. Jang Hana (Han Jimin) goes to find Gu Seojin (Hyun Bin).'),(5013445,'<Hyde Jekyll, Me(하이드 지킬, 나)>In Hyde Jekyll Me Episode 12, a scene was depicted of Gu Seo-jin (Hyun Bin) and Jang Ha-na (Han Ji-min) taking a walk on the Metasequoia tree-lined path in this park.'),(5013446,'<Hyde Jekyll, I(하이드 지킬, 나)>In the last 20 episodes, confesses his heart to Jang Hana (Han Jimin) in this garden.'),(5013447,'<Hyde Jekyll, Me(하이드 지킬, 나)>It appears as the garden of Gu Seo-jin (Hyun Bin) in the drama \"Hyde Jekyll, Me\".'),(5013448,'<Hyde Jekyll, Me(하이드 지킬, 나)>In the drama, character Gu Seo-jin (played by Hyun Bin) operates an amusement park called \'Wonderland,\' where Jang Ha-na (played by Han Ji-min) works as a circus manag