ut buying the building, but they cannot purchase it during the course of the drama. The successful partnership with lawyer Yoon Hee-jae (Ju Ji-hoon) in the final scene hints at what could happen in the future.'),(5013481,'<Hyena(하이에나)>Yoon Hee-jae (played by Ju Ji-hoon) has a drink with Ka Ji-hyuk (played by Jeon Seok-ho) at this bar in episode 1.'),(5013482,'<Hyena(하이에나)>In episode 2, this restaurant appears as \'Sa-i\', where elite lawyer Yoon Hee-jae (Ju Ji-hoon) meets his ex-girlfriend\'s sister, Choi Yeonji (Jeong), who is an heir, for Japanese food. A delicious sashimi leads to the end of their relationship. Meanwhile, Hee-jae\'s former girlfriend, lawyer Jung Geum-ja (Kim Hye-su), whom he doesn\'t know is at the table next to him, plans her next move behind the curtain to poach her conglomerate client. The ongoing conflicts result in Hee-jae becoming single again and no one finishing their expensive lunch.'),(5013483,'<Hyena(하이에나)>In episode 11, Jeong Geum-ja (Kim Hye-soo) and Kevin Jeong (Kim Jae-cheol) have a meal and talk about Gnosis.'),(5013484,'<Hyena(하이에나)>Yoon Hee-jae (played by Ju Ji-hoon) works here. Towards the end of the meeting, Hee-jae is taken aback by seeing his own reflection. He was released after taking the opposite position from Jung Geum-ja (played by Kim Hye-soo) in a custody battle, but he leaves her without asking for an explanation at the courthouse parking lot.'),(5013485,'<Hyena(하이에나)>In episode 10, Yoon Hee-jae (played by Ju Ji-hoon) brings his office team to this Pizza Al Bolo branch for a delicious corn pizza lunch and a Korean inheritance tax briefing.'),(5013486,'<Hyena(하이에나)>In episode 1 of \'White Scandal\', after winning the lawsuit, Gahyeok (played by Jeon Seok-ho) crosses this bridge while listening to Drunken Tiger\'s \"Double Up\" to celebrate victory and returns to the law firm.'),(5013487,'<Hyena(하이에나)>In episode 8, Jung Eun-young (Kim Hye-soo) and Yoon Hee-jae (Ju Ji-hoon) meet at this restaurant.'),(5013488,'<Hyena(하