o (played by Kim Se-jeong) and Hyeon Tae-woon (played by Kim Jung-hyun) came here for a date.'),(5013556,'<School 2017(학교 2017)>La Eun-ho (Kim Se-jeong) and Song Dae-hwi (Jang Dong-yoon) had a conversation on a bench (production prop) on the 10th. In episode 4, they have a conversation in front of this museum.'),(5013557,'<School 2017(학교 2017)>This university is depicted as a Korean university. Ra Eun-ho (played by Kim Se-jeong) wants to attend this university because her crush, Hyun Tae-woon (cameo by Kang Min-kyu), studies here. In episode 1, we see Hyun Tae-woon getting off here for a \'date\', and in episode 3, we see him getting off for an entrance exam.'),(5013558,'<School 2021(학교 2021)>In episode 16, Jin Ji-won (played by Choi Hyeon) and Kim Yo-han (played by Gong Ki-joon) visit this street and take a selfie in front of this house.'),(5013559,'<School 2021(학교 2021)>In episode 16, Jin Ji-won (Jo Yi-hyun) and Kim Yo-han (Gong Ki-jun) are walking through the alleyways on their date.'),(5013560,'<School 2021(학교 2021)>In the final 16th episode, Jin Ji-won (played by Choi Hyeon) and Kim Yo-han (played by Gong Ki-jun) met on this street for a date.'),(5013561,'<School 2021(학교 2021)>In episode 1, Ji Won (played by Joy Hyun) comes to this mini-mart at night to play the claw machine. When she fails to win again and starts kicking the machine, her new school friend, Young Joo (played by Yeo Woo), comes in with his motorcycle to refill the machine. After he leaves, Ji Won discovers a teddy bear sitting on top of the machine.'),(5013562,'<School 2021(학교 2021)>A pathway that appears for the first time in episode 1, leading to \'Nujigi Science High School\'.'),(5013563,'<School 2021(학교 2021)>In this park, Kim Yohan (Gong Gyujin) and Jin Jiwon (Choi Hyun) who saved Jung Youngju (Choo Youngwoo) in the 14th inning, met.'),(5013564,'<School 2021(학교 2021)> In episode 6, former colleagues Lee Kang-hoon (played by Jeon Seok-ho) and Jung Cheol-joo (played by Seo Jae-woo) meet at this cafe.'),(5013565,'<2021 School(학교 2021)>The riverside park appears as the path to Jinsiwon (played by Jo Yi Hyun)\'s house. It first appears in episode 4 as the characters run through the park on their way to Kim Yohan (played by Gong Gyujin)\'s house.'),(5013566,'<I visited once(한 번 다녀왔습니다)>Song Da-hee (played by Lee Cho-hee) and Yoon Jae-seok (played by Lee Sang-yi) sit on the stairs along this castle wall in episode 64 (total 32 episodes). They apologize and reconcile with each other after breaking up. They also shared their first kiss here. Unbeknownst to them, they are unknowingly witnessed by older sister Song Na-hee (played by Lee Min-jung) and older brother Yoon Gyu-jin (played by Lee Sang-yeop).'),(5013567,'<Visited once(한 번 다녀왔습니다)>It is a place where one comes out to apologize for getting drunk the night before in front of his mother and brother Yoon Gyu-jin (Lee Sang-yeob) at his own house.'),(5013568,'<I\'ve Been There Once(한 번 다녀왔습니다)>Song Na-hee (played by Lee Min-jung) and Yoon Gyu-jin (played by Lee Sang-yeob) have an afternoon date on the east side of the park between Donggang Hospital and Taehwa River.'),(5013569,'<One on One(한 사람만)>In episode 6, chaebol boyfriend Gu Ji-pyo (Han Kyu-won) takes Sung Mi-do (Red Velvet\'s Joy) to Praum Restaurant for a date.'),(5013570,'<One person(한 사람만)>Sitting alone here, listening to music on headphones and talking on the phone'),(5013571,'<One Person(한 사람만)>In episode 11, police officer Oh Jin-kyu (played by Jang In-sub) tracks down the car of Seong Mi-do (played by Red Velvet\'s Joy) to this location. He meets Kang Se-yeon (played by Kang Ye-won) during a meeting with divorce lawyer Ji Yoon-seo (played by Lee Young-jin).'),(5013572,'<One Person Only(한 사람만)> Pyo In-sook (Ahn Eun-jin) receives a medical examination blankly and passes through the exit of the building.'),(5013573,'<One Person Only(한 사람만)>In episode 5, Kang Seyeon (Kang Yewon) appears in a flashback scene at this airport.'),(5013574,'<One Person(