he Silla dynasty era.'),(5013964,'<TV show(화랑)>The valley where Park Seo-joon and Go Ara made an appearance'),(5013965,'<Hwarang(화랑)>The Maesol Culture Park, shown in dramas, features towering cliffs.'),(5013966,'<Hwarang(화랑)>The Love Tree that appeared in the drama Hwarang'),(5013967,'<Hwarang(화랑)>A place where Hwarangs used to live'),(5013968,'<Something in the Rain(화양연화)> In episode 9, Han Jae-hyun (Ji Jin-hee) and Yoon Ji-soo (Son Ye-jin) ride a train'),(5013969,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 7, Han Jaehyun (Jinyoung) and Yoon Jisoo (Jeon Sohee) walk through this tunnel, with Jisoo stopping to write a message on one of the pillars. Currently, Jaehyun (Yoo Jitae) and Jisoo (Lee Boyoung) come separately to see the message.'),(5013970,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In the 7th episode of \"Hwayangyeonhwa,\" Yoon Jisoo (played by Lee Bo-young) waits for the last train at the modern version of \'Gangchon Station\' when Han Jaehyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) approaches and asks.'),(5013971,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 11, after Jaehyun is discharged, Jisoo comes back to this place hoping for Jisoo to come here at some point of their breakup.'),(5013972,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 11, Jang Seo Kyung (Park Si Yeon) meets Han Jae Hyun (Yoo Ji Tae) in front of the carousel, where he once again pleads with her not to leave him. This place holds great significance to Seo Kyung as it is the exact place she was abandoned by her mother in her childhood, as seen in previous episodes. In his late 20s, Jae Hyun promises her that she will not be the last person her mother sees if she continues to wander around, bringing her here to overcome her trauma. In episode 12, Ju Young Woo (Lee Tae Sung) takes Yoon Ji Soo (Lee Bo Young) and Lee Young Min (Go Woo Rim) out in the afternoon.'),(5013973,'<Hwayang Yonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 5, Yoon Ji-soo (played by Jeon So-nee) comes to this place alone to watch the 1991 film \'Days of Being Wild\' by Hong Kong actor Leslie Cheung. After the movie ends, she stands at the entrance waiting for the rain to stop when Han Jae-hyun (played by Jin Young) approaches her, claiming that he was also at this theater.'),(5013974,'<When the Camellia Blooms(화양연화)>Yoon Ji-soo (played by Gong Hyo-jin) and Han Jae-hyun (played by Kang Ha-neul) go on a date at Beethoven Park.'),(5013975,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In the drama \"Hwayangyeonhwa,\" Han Jaehyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) visits to talk to his wife Seo Kyung (played by Park Si-yeon) in episode 8.'),(5013976,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>When the college student club \'Nongchonbongsa\' heads to the countryside for rural volunteer work, the building where they gather in the evening to end their day is right here.'),(5013977,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>The funeral of Seonghwajin (Kim Joo-ryung) takes place here.'),(5013978,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 12, Jang Seo-kyung (played by Park Si-yeon) suggests meeting Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) at this cafe. To express her position on her divorce from Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae), she ripped up the divorce papers in front of him.'),(5013979,'<Hwayang-Yeonhwa(화양연화)>This street appears as the Seoul Sinchon street where Han Jaehyun (GOT7\'s Jinyoung) and Yoon Jisoo (Jansoni) often visit during 1, 2, 3.'),(5013980,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 4, Moon Ji-soo (played by Jeon So-nee) and Han Jae-hyun (played by Jin Young) arrived at this beach by a night train.'),(5013981,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) leaves her son\'s school in the first episode and comes to this station, only to realize she missed the last train back to Seoul. As she stands on the snowy platform, Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) joins her, and after exchanging words, she realizes who he is.'),(5013982,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>In the drama Hwayang Yeonhwa 2, Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) and Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) spend a night at this accommodation after missing the last train at the station.'),(5013983,'<When My Love Blooms(화양연화)>The drama is set in a boarding school attended by Han Jun-seo (played by Park Min-su) and Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young)\'s son Lee Young (played by Han Jae-hyun).'),(5013984,'<When the flower blooms(화양연화)>In episode 7, Jang Seo-kyung (played by Park Si-yeon) gets angry outside exit 3. Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) makes her take the subway and climb the stairs. Jae-hyun heads back to the station to find the shoes Seo-kyung lost along the way.'),(5013985,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>This is a office tower of HyungSung where Han Jae Hyun (Yoo Ji Tae) works as a vice president. There is a scene in episodes 1 and 2 where Yoon Ji Soo (Lee Bo Young) joins a labor protest outside the building.'),(5013986,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>He appears in the exterior of the Prosecutor\'s Office summoned to receive a letter of resignation in Episode 6.'),(5013987,'<The Song of the Sirens(화양연화)>In episode 7, Yoon Ji-soo (played by Jeon So-nee) sends off her mother and younger sister to Frankfurt from this place, but hesitates upon learning that her parents plan to match her with the homestay host. After missing her flight, she meets Han Jae-hyun (played by Jin Young) who has come to find her outside the terminal.'),(5013988,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 6, Han Jaehyun (Jinyoung) is on the wanted list and seeks refuge at this temple. His friends Ju Youngwoo (Byunghun) and Seong Hwajin (Han Jiwon) come looking for him. Before leaving, Hwajin hands a calling card to Yoon Jisoo (Jeon Sonyeo) and tells her to call.'),(5013989,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>Yoon Jisoo (Jeon Sony) and Han Jaehyun (Jinyoung) and their friends appear inside \'Yeonhee University\' where they study. In episode 13, Jisoo and Jaehyun meet at the library to study, but Jisoo leaves early because she has a fever.'),(5013990,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>Yoon Ji-soo (Jeon Sonye) and Han Jae-hyun (Jin Young) come to this \'countryside market\' in episode 5. In episode 7, he goes shopping here with his mother (Son Suk).'),(5013991,'<Reply 1988(화양연화)>It is a Catholic cathedral that holds great significance for Yoon Ji-soo (Lee Bo-young) and Han Jae-hyun (Jin Young) in both the 1990s and present day timelines.'),(5013992,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>A restaurant where Joo Young-woo (played by Lee Tae-sung), Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young), and Lee Young-min (played by Ko Woo-rim) have a meal together after spending a day at an amusement park in episode 12.'),(5013993,'<When the Camellia Blooms(화양연화)>In episode 8 of When the Camellia Blooms, Yoon Ji-soo (Gong Hyo-jin) gets off at a pedestrian crossing near the bus stop without knowing that Han Jae-hyun (Kang Ha-neul) is passing by, standing there absentmindedly.'),(5013994,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) starts part-time work at this restaurant in episode 5.'),(5013995,'<When the Camellia Blooms(화양연화)>In episode 9, Yoon Ji-soo (played by Gong Hyo-jin) and Han Jae-hyun (played by Kang Ha-neul) visit this place to have late-night ramen and coffee.'),(5013996,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 9, Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) and Lee Dong-jin (played by Min Sung-wook) meet at this hole-in-the-wall establishment.'),(5013997,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>This place appears as the exterior of \"Yeoni University\" where Yoon Jisoo (from Sony) and Han Jaehyun (Got7\'s Jinyoung) were studying in the 90s.'),(5013998,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>LP bar operated by Jooyoung Woo (Itaeseong). Lee Boyoung comes here to spend time as seen in episodes 1, 2, and 6.'),(5013999,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 11, Suho\'s father Yoon Hyeong-gu (Jang Kwang) and Seokyeong\'s father Jang San (Moon Seong-geun) have a meal together.'),(5014000,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In the drama \"Hwayangyeonhwa\", Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) walks across this bridge after finishing the hearing.'),(5014001,'<The Legend of the Blue Sea(화양연화)>In the drama, Yun Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) takes a bus home that crosses this bridge.'),(5014002,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In the final 16th episode, Ju Young-woo (played by Lee Tae-sung) encounters a pedestrian (played by Nam Gyu-ri) who accidentally spills a drink on his sleeve while walking two dogs.'),(5014003,'<Hwayangyeonhwa (Cinderella and Four Knights)(화양연화)>In episode 1, Han Ji-hyun (Ji-Tae Yoo) drives across this bridge on his way to his son\'s school.'),(5014004,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 13, Hanjaehyun (GOT7\'s Jinyoung) and Yoon Jisoo (formerly of JYP) stroll along this street, with Jisoo reflecting, \"Now I am starting to dream the dreams I couldn\'t have before.\"'),(5014005,'<Hwa Yang Yeon Hwa(화양연화)>In \"Hwa Yang Yeon Hwa\" episode 13, Han Jae-hyun (GOT7\'s Jin-young), Yoon Ji-soo (Jeon Soni), Lee Dong-jin (Eun Hae-sung), Joo Young-woo (Byung-hoon), Sung Hwa-jin (Han Ji-won) start a school here for underprivileged children living in the neighborhood.'),(5014006,'<Hwayangyeonhwa (TV series)(화양연화)>After encountering him protesting at the office formed in the 14th round, Lee Se-hoon (Kim Young-hoon) brings Ms. Kwon (Hong Seok-yeon) to this place to have a meal.'),(5014007,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episodes 2, Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) and Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young), leave the countryside and return to this station.'),(5014008,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In the final episode of episode 16, Haje-hyun (GOT7\'s Jinyoung) first encounters Yun Ji-soo (Jeon Sony) in the alley of this restaurant, where he used to complain about the 90s high school.'),(5014009,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>Yoon Ji-soo (Lee Bo-young) and Han Jae-hyun (Yoo Ji-tae) walk across this bridge in episode 15.'),(5014010,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>Han Jaehyun (GOT7 Park Jinyoung) is walking down the stairs of this building after encountering Yoon Jisoo (formerly Sony). By chance, in a video store. In episode 5, Jaehyun (Yoo Jitae) comes to the current Nirvana Music Mall to buy the guitar that Jisoo promised when she was young.'),(5014011,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>After Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) is indirectly accused of attacking Lee Se-hoon (played by Kim Young-hoon) in the final episode 16, they meet at this cafe.'),(5014012,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>It is a place where Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) and his college friend, Lee Dong-jin (played by Min Sung-wook), have a drinking session in episodes 1 and 5.'),(5014013,'<Hwa Yang Yeon Hwa(화양연화)>In episode 1, Yoon Ji-soo (Lee Bo-young) gets fired from a mart and protests, stating that she doesn\'t want to go to the supermarket. In episode 2, Han Jae-hyun (Yoo Ji-tae) waits for her in what appears to be \'Cross Super\' inside his car.'),(5014014,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>This building is where Yoon Ji-soo (Lee Bo-young) saw a report that Han Jae-hyun (Yoo Ji-tae) is at the Supreme Prosecutor\'s Office in episode 7.'),(5014015,'<Love in the Moonlight(화양연화)>In episode 6, Yoon Ji-soo (Lee Bo-young) and Yang Hye-jung (U-jungwon) have lunch together and walk down this street.'),(5014016,'<When the Camellia Blooms(화양연화)>In episode 12 of When the Camellia Blooms, Yoon Ji-soo (played by Gong Hyo-jin) and Han Jae-hyun (played by Kang Ha-neul) visit this building to see the piano at the piano academy planned by Ji-soo.'),(5014017,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 7, Yoon Ji-soo (Lee Bo-young) rides her bicycle along the palace walls towards Geonchunmun [建春門]. Lost in thought, she suddenly loses control of her bike and falls.'),(5014018,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 12, Jang Se-kyung (Park Si-yeon) arrives here with her luggage and helpers.'),(5014019,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>This place appears to be the \'V2 Grand Hotel\' where Yoon Ji-su (Lee Bo-young) is working part-time as a pianist.'),(5014020,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>Inside the hotel West Tower appears as \'V2 Grand Hotel\' where Yoon Ji-soo (played by Lee Bo-young) plays the piano part-time. In episode 4, she receives a job offer to play at a private party, and in episode 5, Jang Se-kyeong (played by Park Si-yeon) tells her that she will fight for her husband Han Jae-hyun (played by Yoo Ji-tae) after suggesting they meet here.'),(5014021,'<Hwayangyeonhwa(화양연화)>It is a restaurant brought by Han Jaehyun (GOT7\'s Jinyoung) in the final episode 16 to celebrate Yoon Jisoo\'s (Lee Boyoung/Jun Soni) 90s birthday.'),(5014022,'<Hwayang Yeonhwa(화양연화)>In episode 2, Han Jaehyun (GOT7\'s Jinyoung) sits on a bench under cherry blossoms and finds the tape dropped by Yoon Jisoo (Jeon So-nee) and listens to it.'),(5014023,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In Episode 11, Ma-wang (Chaseungwon) holds the Olympic torch and stabs a human possessed by a demon with a sword.'),(5014024,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>This garden appears as Son Oh-gong\'s (Lee Seung-gi) home garden from the drama \"Hwayugi\".'),(5014025,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 2 of Hwayugi, Son O-gong (Lee Seung-gi) and Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) come to \'date\' on Christmas Eve.'),(5014026,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>It is the building where Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo)’s real estate company is located.'),(5014027,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>Appearing as the office of Kang Dae-sung (played by Song Jong-ho), a strong presidential candidate in the drama. In episode 19, you can see Kang Dae-sung (Song Jong-ho) and a zombie girl (played by Lee Se-young) having a conversation here.'),(5014028,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In Episode 9, an evil demon moves in this library and tempts children to leave their homes through fairy tales. She approaches them. In Episode 10, Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) and Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) rescue her.'),(5014029,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 5 of Hwayugi, Sun Wukong (Lee Seung-gi) watches a movie with Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo), and they see her being sucked into the movie.'),(5014030,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 6, Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) and General Frost (Sung Hyuk) meet here to plan how to eliminate Samjang/Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) by tonight. Oh-gong ends up making all sorts of excuses that cannot be believed.'),(5014031,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 4 of Hwayugi, Oh Yeon-seo\'s character Jin Sun-mi visits a club called And Tree Meta.'),(5014032,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>PK (Lee Hongki) holds an event here and remarks on how to park after realizing Son Oh Gong\'s (Lee Seunggi) car outside.'),(5014033,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 9 early on, Jin Seon-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) discovers herself walking towards the altar in a bride\'s dress. Her Sun-woo (Cha Seung-won) is already waiting for her, while her Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) is playing the piano. She questions herself whether Oh-gong is really her soulmate or her destined husband, and as she approaches him to help him vanquish the demon, she suddenly gets pushed aside. Seon-mi has the answer, but still dreams of the time when Oh-gong left the wedding venue, looking longingly at the altar and sincerely loving her.'),(5014034,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>This building briefly appears in Episode 2, giving off a feeling as if a superstar show is happening.'),(5014035,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>The T1 Glass Pavilion in this park appears as the headquarters of the above-ground heaven in Hwayugi and makes multiple appearances in the drama.'),(5014036,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In the first episode of Hwayugi, Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) complains to his master after meeting Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) that he cannot understand why he had to wait 25 years.'),(5014037,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In the drama Hwayugi, Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) and Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) come here after driving away demons and evil spirits.'),(5014038,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>There is a demon in episode 6 that cuts off women\'s heads; Jin Sun-mi (Oh Yeon-seo) locks the key lock and tries to unlock it later; Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) joins Sun-mi here to make her nervous and then makes her come back here later.'),(5014039,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 2, a possessed goblin sits in the store. Here, the ghost possesses a young woman and later Son Oh-gong (Lee Seung-gi) visits this store to find the whereabouts of the second goblin ghost.'),(5014040,'<Hwayugi(화유기)>In episode 3, Jin Sunmi (Oh Yeon-seo) visits